rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'It only produces one mana even if the land can produce more than one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The ability can be activated if the opponent has no lands that produce mana, but the effect will not be able to generate any mana.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "This works even if the opponent\'s lands are tapped. It only checks what kinds of mana can be produced, not if the abilities that produce them are usable right now."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Fellwar Stone checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Fellwar Stone, you can tap Fellwar Stone for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Fellwar Stone doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Fellwar Stone can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, take into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there is more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "This spell isn\'t Modal. When it resolves, it will destroy the target if it\'s a creature or an enchantment, even if it changed from one to the other between targeting and resolution."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "This spell isn\'t modal. When it resolves, it will destroy the target if it\'s a creature or an artifact, even if it changed from one to the other between targeting and resolution."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-02-01\', \'text\': \'In the Two-Headed Giant format, you still only have to pay once per creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': "Unless some effect explicitly says otherwise, a creature that can\'t attack you can still attack a planeswalker you control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "At the time the ability resolves, you\'ll get to play the card if you declared three different creatures as attackers at any point in the turn. A creature declared as an attacker in two different attack phases counts only once. A creature that entered the battlefield attacking (such as a token created by Militia\'s Pride) doesn\'t count because you never attacked with it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \' Any player who has controlled a permanent with a hideaway ability since a card was exiled with it may look at that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'"Hideaway N" means "When this permanent enters the battlefield, look at the top N cards of your library. Exile one of them face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. The exiled card gains \\\'The player who controls the permanent that exiled this card may look at this card in the exile zone.\\\'"\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Hideaway now causes you to put the rest of the cards on the bottom of your library in a random order instead of any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Previously, permanents with hideaway entered the battlefield tapped. This ability has been removed from the definition of hideaway. Older cards have received errata to have an additional paragraph that reads "[This permanent] enters the battlefield tapped," and they now have hideaway 4.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Exotic Orchard checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Exotic Orchard, you can tap Exotic Orchard for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Exotic Orchard doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Lands that produce mana based only on what other lands "could produce" won\\\'t help each other unless some other land allows one of them to actually produce some type of mana. For example, if you control an Exotic Orchard and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, none of those lands would produce mana if their mana abilities were activated. On the other hand, if you control a Forest and an Exotic Orchard, and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, then each of those lands can be tapped to produce {G}. Your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G} because you control a Forest. Your Exotic Orchard and your opponent\\\'s Reflecting Pool can each produce {G} because your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Exotic Orchard can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, Exotic Orchard takes into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there are more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Martial Coup checks the number you chose for X, not the amount of mana you actually spent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "No one can cast spells or activate abilities between the time the Soldier tokens are put onto the battlefield and the time all other creatures are destroyed. For example, you can\'t sacrifice one of those Soldier tokens to regenerate a Skeletal Kathari."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "You do what the spell says in order. If X is 5 or more, you\'ll put the Soldier tokens onto the battlefield, then you\'ll destroy all other creatures."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', "[{'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'The value of X is determined as Chain Reaction resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If you choose to find only one basic land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "As Elspeth Tirel\'s last ability resolves, each permanent that isn\'t a token, a land, or Elspeth Tirel herself is destroyed."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Contagion Clasp\'s first ability is mandatory. If you\'re the only player who controls a creature, you must target one of them."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "Whenever you proliferate" triggers even if you chose no permanents or players while doing so.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a permanent ever has both +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it at the same time, they\'re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a player or permanent has more than one kind of counter on it, and you choose for it to get additional counters, it must get one of each kind of counter it already has. You can\'t have it get just one kind of counter it already has and not the others."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it\'s too late for anyone to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can choose any player who has a counter, including opponents. You can\'t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since "any number" includes zero, you don\\\'t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don\\\'t have to choose any players at all.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'A player who has ten or more poison counters loses the game. This is a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'Damage from a source with infect affects planeswalkers normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'Damage from a source with infect is damage in all respects. If the source with infect also has lifelink, damage dealt by that source also causes its controller to gain that much life. Damage from a source with infect can be prevented or redirected. Abilities that trigger on damage being dealt will trigger if a source with infect deals damage, if appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If Grafted Exoskeleton\'s last ability triggers, but you don\'t control the permanent it became unattached from at the time that ability resolves (perhaps because another player has somehow gained control of it), you won\'t be able to sacrifice it."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If damage from a source with infect that would be dealt to a player is prevented, that player doesn\'t get poison counters. If damage from a source with infect that would be dealt to a creature is prevented, that creature doesn\'t get -1/-1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "In addition to the effect of its equip ability, Grafted Exoskeleton becomes unattached from the creature it\'s equipping if a spell or ability (such as Fulgent Distraction) causes it to become unattached, if Grafted Exoskeleton leaves the battlefield, if the equipped creature ceases to be a creature, or if Grafted Exoskeleton ceases to be an Equipment. (It also becomes unattached if the equipped creature leaves the battlefield, but the triggered ability won\'t do anything in that case.)"}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Infect\'s effect applies to any damage, not just combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "The -1/-1 counters remain on the creature indefinitely. They\'re not removed if the creature regenerates or the turn ends."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'A player who has ten or more poison counters loses the game. This is a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'Damage from a source with infect affects planeswalkers normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'Damage from a source with infect is damage in all respects. If the source with infect also has lifelink, damage dealt by that source also causes its controller to gain that much life. Damage from a source with infect can be prevented or redirected. Abilities that trigger on damage being dealt will trigger if a source with infect deals damage, if appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If Ichor Rats\'s last ability causes each player to have ten poison counters, the game is a draw."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If damage from a source with infect that would be dealt to a player is prevented, that player doesn\'t get poison counters. If damage from a source with infect that would be dealt to a creature is prevented, that creature doesn\'t get -1/-1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Infect\'s effect applies to any damage, not just combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "The -1/-1 counters remain on the creature indefinitely. They\'re not removed if the creature regenerates or the turn ends."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'A player who has ten or more poison counters loses the game. This is a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'Damage from a source with infect affects planeswalkers normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'Damage from a source with infect is damage in all respects. If the source with infect also has lifelink, damage dealt by that source also causes its controller to gain that much life. Damage from a source with infect can be prevented or redirected. Abilities that trigger on damage being dealt will trigger if a source with infect deals damage, if appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If damage from a source with infect that would be dealt to a player is prevented, that player doesn\'t get poison counters. If damage from a source with infect that would be dealt to a creature is prevented, that creature doesn\'t get -1/-1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Infect\'s effect applies to any damage, not just combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "The -1/-1 counters remain on the creature indefinitely. They\'re not removed if the creature regenerates or the turn ends."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'Whenever Ichorclaw Myr becomes blocked, its last ability triggers just once, no matter how many creatures it became blocked by. It will get just +2/+2.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'A player who has ten or more poison counters loses the game. This is a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'Damage from a source with infect affects planeswalkers normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'Damage from a source with infect is damage in all respects. If the source with infect also has lifelink, damage dealt by that source also causes its controller to gain that much life. Damage from a source with infect can be prevented or redirected. Abilities that trigger on damage being dealt will trigger if a source with infect deals damage, if appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If damage from a source with infect that would be dealt to a player is prevented, that player doesn\'t get poison counters. If damage from a source with infect that would be dealt to a creature is prevented, that creature doesn\'t get -1/-1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Infect\'s effect applies to any damage, not just combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "The -1/-1 counters remain on the creature indefinitely. They\'re not removed if the creature regenerates or the turn ends."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Any triggered abilities that trigger because a creature was destroyed won\'t be put onto the stack until after Phyrexian Rebirth finishes resolving. This means the Horror creature token can be targeted by those abilities, if applicable."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If a creature regenerates or has indestructible, it won\'t be counted when determining the value of X."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If this spell doesn\'t resolve, none of its effects occur. In particular, it will go to the graveyard rather than to its owner\'s library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'A card with Phyrexian mana symbols in its mana cost is each color that appears in that mana cost, regardless of how that cost may have been paid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'As you cast a spell or activate an activated ability with one or more Phyrexian mana symbols in its cost, you choose how to pay for each Phyrexian mana symbol at the same time you would choose modes or choose a value for X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If you\'re at 1 life or less, you can\'t pay 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Phyrexian mana is not a new color. Players can\'t add Phyrexian mana to their mana pools."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'To calculate the mana value of a card with Phyrexian mana symbols in its cost, count each Phyrexian mana symbol as 1.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'A card with Phyrexian mana symbols in its mana cost is each color that appears in that mana cost, regardless of how that cost may have been paid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'As you cast a spell or activate an activated ability with one or more Phyrexian mana symbols in its cost, you choose how to pay for each Phyrexian mana symbol at the same time you would choose modes or choose a value for X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'If a player attacks with more than one creature, that player chooses how to pay each cost individually. For example, if you attack with two creatures, you may pay {W} for one cost and 2 life for the other.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If you control Norn\'s Annex, your opponents can choose not to attack with a creature with an ability that says it must attack."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If you\'re at 1 life or less, you can\'t pay 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Multiple Norn\'s Annexes controlled by the same player will each impose a cost to attack. Players choose how they pay each cost individually. For example, if a creature you control is attacking a player who controls two Norn\'s Annexes, you may pay {W} for one cost and 2 life for the other."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Phyrexian mana is not a new color. Players can\'t add Phyrexian mana to their mana pools."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'The controller of each creature attacking you or a planeswalker you control pays either {W} or 2 life as attackers are being declared.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'To calculate the mana value of a card with Phyrexian mana symbols in its cost, count each Phyrexian mana symbol as 1.\'}]', "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If there are no artifacts on the battlefield when Viridian Corrupter enters the battlefield, its enters-the-battlefield does nothing. Viridian Corrupter will simply enter the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The enters-the-battlefield ability is not optional. You must target an artifact you control if there are no other artifacts on the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-05-01\', \'text\': "The creature that entered the battlefield will also get +1/+1 until end of turn if it\'s still on the battlefield when the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "A creature token that\'s a copy of a nontoken creature is still a token. It will get +1/+1, but the original nontoken creature will not."}]', "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'You choose the mode as you cast the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If this land enters the battlefield and you control no other lands, its ability will force you to return it to your hand.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'If the permanent is still a legal target but is not destroyed (perhaps because it regenerated or has indestructible), its controller still gets the Beast token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Beast Within tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. No player creates a Beast token. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does create a Beast token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'If you choose the second mode, permanents that come under your control later in the turn will not have indestructible.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Planeswalkers with indestructible will still have loyalty counters removed from them as they are dealt damage. If planeswalker with indestructible has no loyalty counters, it will still be put into its owner\'s graveyard, as the rule that does this doesn\'t destroy the planeswalker."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Even though these lands have basic land types, they are not basic lands because "basic" doesn\\\'t appear on their type line. Notably, controlling two or more of them won\\\'t allow others to enter the battlefield untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'However, because these cards have basic land types, effects that specify a basic land type without also specifying that the land be basic can affect them. For example, a spell or ability that reads "Destroy target Forest" can target Canopy Vista, while one that reads "Destroy target basic Forest" cannot.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If one of these lands enters the battlefield at the same time as any number of basic lands, those other lands are not counted when determining if this land enters the battlefield tapped or untapped.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If a spell with a converge ability is copied, no mana was spent to cast the copy, so the number of colors of mana spent to cast the spell will be zero. The number of colors spent to cast the original spell is not copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If there are any alternative or additional costs to cast a spell with a converge ability, the mana spent to pay those costs will count. For example, if an effect makes sorcery spells cost {1} more to cast, you could pay {W}{U}{B}{R} to cast Radiant Flames and deal 4 damage to each creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell with converge without spending any mana to cast it (perhaps because an effect allowed you to cast it without paying its mana cost), then the number of colors spent to cast it will be zero.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'The maximum number of colors of mana you can spend to cast a spell is five. Colorless is not a color. Note that the cost of a spell with converge may limit how many colors of mana you can spend.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Unless a spell or ability allows you to, you can\'t choose to pay more mana for a spell with a converge ability just to spend more colors of mana. Likewise, if a spell or ability reduces the amount of mana it costs you to cast a spell with converge, you can\'t ignore that cost reduction in order to spend more colors of mana."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If a Forest or Plains is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as Fortified Village, you may reveal the other land to have Fortified Village enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put Fortified Village onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Lands don\'t have a subtype just because they can produce mana of the corresponding color. Fortified Village itself is neither a Forest nor a Plains, even though it produces green and white mana, so you can\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land. For example, you could reveal Prairie Stream from the Battle for Zendikar set to satisfy the ability of Fortified Village."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "Additional costs don\'t affect a spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'Effects that reduce the cost of spells reduce the total cost, including any escalate costs added.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'If an effect allows you to cast a spell that has escalate without paying its mana cost, you pay escalate costs for that spell if you choose more than one mode.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "If one target of an escalate spell becomes illegal, the other targets will still be affected. If all of the targets become illegal, the spell won\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "If two of the chosen modes of an escalate spell target a creature, you may choose the same creature for each mode\'s target, or choose different creatures. The same is true if the chosen modes target a player (or opponent)."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'If you choose the first and third modes, and destroying the creature ends an "exile until" effect (such as that of Lunarch Inquisitors), the creature will return to the battlefield before you put +1/+1 counters on creatures. The same is true if you choose the second and third modes and destroying the enchantment ends such an effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped creature you control to pay the escalate cost, including one you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose any one mode multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "You choose all of your modes at once. You can\'t wait to perform one mode\'s actions and then decide to choose more modes."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Creatures that enter the battlefield attacking were never declared as attackers, so they won\'t count toward melee\'s effect. Similarly, if a creature with melee enters the battlefield attacking, melee won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter how many creatures you attacked a player with, only that you attacked a player with at least one creature. For example, if you attack one player with Wings of the Guard and another player with five creatures, Wings of the Guard will get +2/+2 until end of turn."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Melee will trigger if the creature with melee attacks a planeswalker. However, the effect counts only opponents (and not planeswalkers) that you attacked with a creature when determining the bonus.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You determine the size of the bonus as the melee ability resolves. Count each opponent that you attacked with one or more creatures. It doesn\'t matter if the attacking creatures are still attacking or even if they are still on the battlefield. It also doesn\'t matter if the opponent you attacked is still in the game."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Creatures destroyed this way count toward the life gained even if they\'re put into a zone other than a graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Creatures with indestructible aren\'t destroyed this way."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can choose to find one basic land card with Myriad Landscape\'s last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Apply power bonuses from counters the creature enters the battlefield with and continuous effects such as that of Valiant Knight before checking to see if Mentor of the Meek\'s ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Mentor of the Meek\'s ability checks the power of the other creature only as it enters the battlefield. If that creature\'s power is 2 or less, the ability will trigger. Once the ability triggers, raising that creature\'s power above 2 won\'t affect that ability. Similarly, reducing the creature\'s power to 2 or less after it enters the battlefield won\'t cause the ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "While resolving the triggered ability of Mentor of the Meek, you can\'t pay {1} multiple times to draw more than one card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control your commander as the lieutenant ability resolves, you won\'t get its effect."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If you have multiple commanders, you need to control only one for the lieutenant effect to happen.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'The lieutenant effect happens only once each combat, even if you somehow control multiple commanders (perhaps because you have two commanders with a partner ability from the Battlebond™ set).\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "The second part of Heroic Reinforcements\'s effect affects only creatures you control at the time it\'s applied, including the tokens created by the first part of its effect. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t get +1/+1 or gain haste."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Lands you control won\'t lose any other abilities they had. They also won\'t gain or lose any land types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'If the creature with mentor leaves the battlefield with mentor on the stack, use its power as that creature last existed on the battlefield to determine whether the target creature has less power.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If the target creature\'s power is no longer less than the attacking creature\'s power as the ability resolves, mentor doesn\'t add a +1/+1 counter. For example, if two 3/3 creatures with mentor attack and both mentor triggers target the same 2/2 creature, the first to resolve puts a +1/+1 counter on it and the second does nothing."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If the token can\'t attack for any reason (such as becoming tapped), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Mentor compares the power of the creature with mentor with that of the target creature at two different times: once as the triggered ability is put onto the stack, and once as the triggered ability resolves. If you wish to raise a creature\'s power so its mentor ability can target a bigger creature, the last chance you have to do so is during the beginning of combat step."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Generous Gift tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. No player creates an Elephant. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does create an Elephant."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': \'If Moldervine Reclamation leaves the battlefield at the same time that one or more creatures you control die, its ability triggers for each of those creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If a creature you control dies at the same time that your life total becomes 0 or less, you lose the game before Moldervine Reclamation\'s ability can save you."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "You can activate Idol of Oblivion\'s first ability even if the token you\'ve created was created before Idol of Oblivion entered the battlefield or if the token has left the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "Each token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "Each token gains haste after it has been created. If something copies one of these tokens, the copy won\'t have haste, and you won\'t exile it at the beginning of the next end step."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If one of the two target creatures become illegal, you create one token that\'s a copy of the one that\'s still a legal target. You don\'t create two tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If the copied creature is a token, the token that\'s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is copying something else (for example, if Volrath, the Shapestealer is having its own shape stolen by Hate Mirage), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Although the common lands have basic land types, they aren\'t basic lands."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once the common lands (such as Mystic Sanctuary) enter the battlefield tapped, there\'s no way to untap them with a spell or ability to make their last ability trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "As long as Silverwing Squadron is on the battlefield, its ability will count itself, so it\'ll be at least 1/1."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, opponents who have left the game aren\'t counted by Silverwing Squadron\'s triggered ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Silverwing Squadron\'s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to creatures may become lethal if Harmonious Archon enters or leaves the battlefield during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Effects that modify a creature\'s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Festive Funeral, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Harmonious Archon overwrites all previous effects that set a creature\'s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Harmonious Archon enters the battlefield will overwrite this effect."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect causes a noncreature permanent to become a creature and sets its power and toughness as it does so, that creature will have that power and toughness; it won\'t be 3/3. Notably, crewing a Vehicle does not set its power and toughness, so a Vehicle will be a 3/3 creature once crewed."}]', "[{'date': '2019-10-04', 'text': 'The equipped creature has vigilance even if Mace of the Valiant has no charge counters on it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Any target opponents that are no longer legal targets by the time Call the Coppercoats resolves won\'t have their creatures counted when determining how many tokens you create."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability allows you to cast a strive spell without paying its mana cost, you must pay the additional cost for any targets beyond the first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If this spell is copied and the effect that copies the spell allows a player to choose new targets for the copy, the number of targets can\'t be changed. The player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, the player can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The mana value of a strive spell doesn\'t change no matter how many targets it has."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets each spell with a strive ability has and what those targets are as you cast it. It\'s legal to cast such a spell with no targets, although this is rarely a good idea. You can\'t choose the same target more than once for a single strive spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter whose commander you control. Any one will do. If you have two commanders, you just need to control one of them."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Once you begin casting this spell, players can\'t take any other actions until you\'re done casting it. Notably, they can\'t try to remove the commander you control to make you pay its cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target card is an illegal target when the ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No +1/+1 counter will be put on Scavenging Ooze and you won\'t gain life. Notably, this means that if you activate Scavenging Ooze\'s ability multiple times targeting the same creature card, only the first instance of the ability to resolve will have any effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "As the last ability resolves, you can tap untapped Myr you control even if Myr Battlesphere is no longer on the battlefield by then. If that has happened, Myr Battlesphere won\'t be able to get the +X/+0 bonus, but it will still deal X damage to the appropriate player or planeswalker."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped Myr you control as the last ability resolves, not just the Myr tokens you created with the first ability. This includes Myr that haven\'t been under your control since your most recent turn began."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You choose the value for X as the last ability resolves. You can\'t choose a value for X that\'s greater than the number of untapped Myr you control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "A landfall ability doesn\'t trigger if a permanent already on the battlefield becomes a land."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Felidar Retreat\'s second mode affects only creatures you control at the time the ability resolves, including creatures you control but that for some reason didn\'t get a +1/+1 counter. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain vigilance or get a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Attaching an Equipment with its enters-the-battlefield triggered ability isn\'t the same as using its equip ability. You don\'t pay mana for the attachment, and if the Equipment enters at a time you couldn\'t cast a sorcery, you can still attach it to a creature you control."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'If the target creature becomes an illegal target, the Equipment remains on the battlefield unattached.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Path of Ancestry\'s last ability produces two mana (most likely due to Mana Reflection), spending those two mana to cast creature spells that share a creature type with your commander will cause two abilities to trigger. Each of those abilities will cause you to scry 1. You won\'t scry 2. This is true whether you spend the mana on one creature spell or two."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you cast your commander with mana from Path of Ancestry, and your commander hasn\'t somehow lost all of its creature types while on the stack, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander has no creature types, it can\'t share a creature type with any spell that you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If you have two commanders, the last ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities. When you spend that mana on a creature spell that shares a creature type with either of your commanders, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Your commander\'s creature types are checked immediately after you cast a creature spell spending mana from Path of Ancestry\'s last ability. They aren\'t set before the game begins, and they may not be the same types your commander had when you activated that ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If combat damage dealt to the monarch causes that player to lose the game, the triggered ability that causes the controller of the attacking creature to become the monarch doesn\'t resolve. In most cases, the controller of the attacking creature will still become the monarch as it is likely their turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the monarch leaves the game during another player\'s turn, that player becomes the monarch. If the monarch leaves the game during their turn, the next player in turn order becomes the monarch."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward. As a player becomes the monarch, the current monarch (if any) ceases being the monarch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'There are two inherent triggered abilities associated with being the monarch. These triggered abilities have no source and are controlled by the player who was the monarch at the time the abilities triggered. The full texts of these abilities are "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'However, if Prava leaves the battlefield, its bonus immediately stops applying. Nonlethal damage dealt to creature tokens you control may become lethal if Prava leaves the battlefield during your turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The bonus provided by Prava\'s first ability will still be in effect when damage is removed during the cleanup step."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Path to Exile tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. The creature\'s controller won\'t search for a basic land card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "The controller of the exiled creature isn\'t required to search their library for a basic land. If that player doesn\'t, the player won\'t shuffle their library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'You can tap any untapped white creatures you control to pay for Battle Screech’s flashback cost, even ones you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "You can choose to add either {B} or {G} for each permanent destroyed. You aren\'t limited to one color."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If a land card with an appropriate subtype is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as one of these lands, you may reveal the other land to have the "Snarl" enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect instructs you to put one of these lands onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' The "Snarl" itself doesn\\\'t have any land subtypes. You can\\\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': " You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If a land card with an appropriate subtype is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as one of these lands, you may reveal the other land to have the "Snarl" enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put one of these lands onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'The "Snarl" itself doesn\\\'t have any land subtypes. You can\\\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': "Although the draws are not optional, if an opponent doesn\'t draw a card, perhaps because a replacement effect replaced the draw with another effect, that player is not counted when determining how many cards you draw."}, {\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': \'If an opponent drew more than one card this way due to a replacement effect, you still draw only one card for that player.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "You can sacrifice any Goblin you control to activate Siege-Gang Commander\'s activated ability, including Siege-Gang Commander itself."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Creatures may still attack planeswalkers you control without their controller paying a cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Use the power of the creature from when it was last on the battlefield to determine how much life is gained.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "A player with ten or more poison counters loses the game. This is a state-based action and doesn\'t use the stack. In other words, it happens immediately and players can\'t respond to it, just like a player losing the game due to having 0 or less life."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "After Glissa\'s Retriever has become blocked by a creature with power 3 or greater, reducing the blocking creature\'s power won\'t cause Glissa\'s Retriever to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'Any other effects of that damage, such as life gain from lifelink, still apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Conversely, replacement effects that apply to the number of counters put on a player can modify the counters placed this way. For example, Vorinclex, Monstrous Raider\'s last two abilities can apply to counters placed this way."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'Damage dealt by a creature with toxic grants the same number of counters regardless of how much damage is dealt. Notably, if a replacement effect modifies the damage in some way (such as that of Gratuitous Violence), the number of counters given remains unchanged.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'If a creature with toxic deals combat damage to a creature or planeswalker, or if it deals noncombat damage, toxic has no effect and no player gets poison counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of toxic are cumulative. For example, if a creature has toxic 2 and gains toxic 1 due to another effect, combat damage that creature deals to a player will cause that player to get 3 poison counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Toxic doesn\'t change the amount of combat damage a creature deals. For example, if a 2/2 creature with toxic 1 deals combat damage to a player, that creature will deal 2 damage. The results of that damage are the player loses 2 life and gets a poison counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for Glissa\\\'s Retriever\\\'s last ability at the time it triggers. Instead, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you exile it. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "A player with ten or more poison counters loses the game. This is a state-based action and doesn\'t use the stack. In other words, it happens immediately and players can\'t respond to it, just like a player losing the game due to having 0 or less life."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'Any other effects of that damage, such as life gain from lifelink, still apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Conversely, replacement effects that apply to the number of counters put on a player can modify the counters placed this way. For example, Vorinclex, Monstrous Raider\'s last two abilities can apply to counters placed this way."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'Damage dealt by a creature with toxic grants the same number of counters regardless of how much damage is dealt. Notably, if a replacement effect modifies the damage in some way (such as that of Gratuitous Violence), the number of counters given remains unchanged.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'If a creature with toxic deals combat damage to a creature or planeswalker, or if it deals noncombat damage, toxic has no effect and no player gets poison counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'If you leave the game, the cards remain exiled face down indefinitely. No player may look at them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Ixhel doesn\'t change when you can cast an exiled card. For example, if you exile a creature card without flash, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of toxic are cumulative. For example, if a creature has toxic 2 and gains toxic 1 due to another effect, combat damage that creature deals to a player will cause that player to get 3 poison counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Toxic doesn\'t change the amount of combat damage a creature deals. For example, if a 2/2 creature with toxic 1 deals combat damage to a player, that creature will deal 2 damage. The results of that damage are the player loses 2 life and gets a poison counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "You may look at and cast the exiled cards (and spend mana as though it were mana of any color to do so) even if Ixhel leaves the battlefield. If another player gains control of Ixhel, that player can\'t look at or cast the cards, and you still can."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "You pay the costs for an exiled card if you cast it. You may pay any alternative costs the card has rather than the card\'s mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "A player with ten or more poison counters loses the game. This is a state-based action and doesn\'t use the stack. In other words, it happens immediately and players can\'t respond to it, just like a player losing the game due to having 0 or less life."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'Any other effects of that damage, such as life gain from lifelink, still apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Conversely, replacement effects that apply to the number of counters put on a player can modify the counters placed this way. For example, Vorinclex, Monstrous Raider\'s last two abilities can apply to counters placed this way."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'Damage dealt by a creature with toxic grants the same number of counters regardless of how much damage is dealt. Notably, if a replacement effect modifies the damage in some way (such as that of Gratuitous Violence), the number of counters given remains unchanged.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'If a creature with toxic deals combat damage to a creature or planeswalker, or if it deals noncombat damage, toxic has no effect and no player gets poison counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of toxic are cumulative. For example, if a creature has toxic 2 and gains toxic 1 due to another effect, combat damage that creature deals to a player will cause that player to get 3 poison counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'The bonus Vishgraz receives due to its last ability may cause it to survive combat damage in some cases. For example, if an attacking Vishgraz is blocked by a 3/3 and another creature with toxic 1 is attacking at the same time and is unblocked, Vishgraz with deal 3 damage, receive 3 damage, and get +1/+1 at exactly the same time. The end result is that it will stay alive and be a 4/4 creature with 3 damage marked on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Toxic doesn\'t change the amount of combat damage a creature deals. For example, if a 2/2 creature with toxic 1 deals combat damage to a player, that creature will deal 2 damage. The results of that damage are the player loses 2 life and gets a poison counter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Neyali\'s effect doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled card. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'The card Neyali exiles is exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'The effect allowing you to cast the exiled card if you attacked with a token continues to apply even if Neyali leaves the battlefield or another player gains control of it. It also continues to apply during later turns—as long as you attacked with a token during those later turns.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "The second ability of Neyali, Suns\' Vanguard triggers for each player you are attacking with one or more tokens. It does not trigger if you are attacking a planeswalker a player controls, but not that player."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "You can cast the exiled card if the token that attacked is still in combat, if it\'s left combat, if it\'s left the battlefield, or even if combat is over."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Creatures that enter the battlefield attacking were never declared as attackers, so they won\'t count toward melee\'s effect. Similarly, if a creature with melee enters the battlefield attacking, melee won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter how many creatures you attacked a player with, only that you attacked a player with at least one creature. For example, if you attack one player with Skyhunter Strike Force and another player with five creatures, Skyhunter Strike Force will get +2/+2 until end of turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'Melee will trigger if the creature with melee attacks a planeswalker. However, the effect counts only opponents (and not planeswalkers) that you attacked with a creature when determining the bonus.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "You determine the size of the bonus as the melee ability resolves. Count each opponent that you attacked with one or more creatures. It doesn\'t matter if the attacking creatures are still attacking or even if they are still on the battlefield. It also doesn\'t matter if the opponent you attacked is still in the game."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Roar of Resistance\'s last ability triggers whenever any creatures attack, not just whenever creatures you control attack."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Tapping a Rebel you control is part of the cost to activate the last ability of Otharri, Suns\' Glory while it is in the graveyard. Once a player has begun to activate the ability, other players may not respond by removing that Rebel from the battlefield to prevent it from being tapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "The amount a creature\'s power and toughness are reduced is determined only once, at the time Phyresis Outbreak resolves. It won\'t change if that creature\'s controller later gets more poison counters or if another player takes control of it later in the same turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "You choose which Equipment to attach to each token, then attach those Equipment all at once. You can\'t move the same Equipment around to each of the tokens as the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'The first token that Wurmquake creates as it resolves is created and enters the battlefield before the rest of them, then you create a number of tokens equal to the number of opponents with three of more poison counters and they enter the battlefield at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to spend more mana to cast Wurmquake than you\'re asked to just to make a bigger Wurm. In most cases, it\'s a 6/6 Phyrexian Wurm the first time, and a 10/10 Phyrexian Wurm when you cast Wurmquake with flashback. However, if there are any additional costs to cast it, the mana spent to pay those costs counts."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', "[{'date': '2023-02-04', 'text': 'A player is poisoned if that player has one or more poison counters.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "Whenever you proliferate" triggers even if you chose no permanents or players while doing so.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a permanent ever has both +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it at the same time, they\'re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a player or permanent has more than one kind of counter on it, and you choose for it to get additional counters, it must get one of each kind of counter it already has. You can\'t have it get just one kind of counter it already has and not the others."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it\'s too late for anyone to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can choose any player who has a counter, including opponents. You can\'t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since "any number" includes zero, you don\\\'t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don\\\'t have to choose any players at all.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'An attacking or blocking creature that phases out is removed from combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'Any continuous effects with a "for as long as" duration, such as that of Mind Flayer, ignore phased-out objects. If ignoring those objects causes the effect\\\'s conditions to no longer be met, the duration will expire.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "As a permanent is phased out, Auras and Equipment attached to it also phase out at the same time. Those Auras and Equipment will phase in at the same time that permanent does, and they\'ll phase in still attached to that permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'Choices made for permanents as they entered the battlefield are remembered when they phase in.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Permanents phase back in during their controller\'s untap step, immediately before that player untaps their permanents. Creatures that phase in this way are able to attack and pay a cost of {T} during that turn. If a permanent had counters on it when it phased out, it will have those counters when it phases back in."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Phased out permanents are treated as though they don\'t exist. They can\'t be the target of spells or abilities, their static abilities have no effect on the game, their triggered abilities can\'t trigger, they can\'t attack or block, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'Phasing out doesn\\\'t cause permanents to leave or re-enter the battlefield, so no "leaves the battlefield" or "enters the battlefield" abilities will trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any "as [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[this creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the chosen creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If the copied creature is a token, the new token that\'s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created that token."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is copying something else, then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If you cast the spell by paying its entwine cost, the tokens don\'t enter the battlefield at the same time. The token that\'s a copy of the artifact creature enters the battlefield first, followed by the token that\'s a copy of the nonartifact creature. Then any abilities that triggered due to either of them entering the battlefield are put on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that permanent is copying something else or it is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, and so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If you wish to cast the card, you do so as part of the resolution of Synthesis Pod\'s ability. You can\'t wait to cast it later. Timing rules based on a card\'s type are ignored."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "The spell you exiled as part of the cost to activate Synthesis Pod\'s ability will remain in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "To activate Synthesis Pod\'s ability, you must exile a spell you control on the stack (the only place spells exist)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'If the Germ token is destroyed, the Equipment remains on the battlefield as with any other Equipment.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'If the living weapon trigger causes two Germs to be created (due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), the Equipment becomes attached to one of them. The other will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter where your commander is (or commanders are, if you have more than one because of the partner ability or similar). The bonus will be calculated using your commander\'s current characteristics. (Mana value typically doesn\'t change, but your commander may become a copy of something else.)"}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'Like other Equipment, each Equipment with living weapon has an equip cost. You can pay this cost to attach an Equipment to another creature you control. Once the Germ token is no longer equipped, it will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'The Germ token enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature and the Equipment becomes attached to it before state-based actions would cause the token to die. Abilities that trigger as the token enters the battlefield see that a 0/0 creature entered the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'If the Rebel is destroyed, the Equipment stays on the battlefield. Similarly, you may pay its equip cost to move it from the Rebel token to another creature you control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'If the ability causes two Rebel tokens to be created (due to an effect such as that of Mondrak, Glory Dominus), the Equipment becomes attached to only one of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If you attack with multiple creatures equipped with Hexplate Wallbreakers in one combat phase (or one creature equipped with multiple Hexplate Wallbreakers), you\'ll have that many additional combat phases, but your attacking creatures are untapped only during the current combat phase."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Once the equipped creature attacks and the triggered ability resolves, you get an additional combat phase even if the equipped creature doesn\'t survive the first combat phase."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'The Rebel enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature, then the Equipment becomes attached to it. Abilities that trigger when a creature enters the battlefield see that a 2/2 creature entered the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "There\'s no main phase between your combat phases, so you\'ll have no opportunity to cast spells or activate abilities that could only be activated any time you could cast a sorcery. For example, you won\'t be able to cast another creature or activate Hexplate Wallbreaker\'s equip ability between combats."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Untapping an attacking creature doesn\'t remove it from combat."}]', "[{'date': '2023-02-04', 'text': 'If the Rebel is destroyed, the Equipment stays on the battlefield. Similarly, you may pay its equip cost to move it from the Rebel token to another creature you control.'}, {'date': '2023-02-04', 'text': 'If the ability causes two Rebel tokens to be created (due to an effect such as that of Mondrak, Glory Dominus), the Equipment becomes attached to only one of them.'}, {'date': '2023-02-04', 'text': 'The Rebel enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature, then the Equipment becomes attached to it. Abilities that trigger when a creature enters the battlefield see that a 2/2 creature entered the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'If the artifact creature already has sunburst (or if you control multiple copies of Lux Artillery), each instance of sunburst works separately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Lux Artillery\'s last ability will check if there are thirty or more counters among artifacts and creatures you control as your end step begins. If there aren\'t, the ability won\'t trigger at all. If there are, the ability will check again as it tries to resolve. If the number of counters among artifacts and creatures you control has fallen below thirty, the ability won\'t do anything."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Because convoke isn\'t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for convoke."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Tapping a multicolored creature using convoke will pay for {1} or one mana of your choice of any of that creature\'s colors."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Tapping an untapped creature that\'s attacking or blocking to convoke a spell won\'t cause that creature to stop attacking or blocking."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If Assemble the Legion isn\'t on the battlefield when its ability resolves, use the number of muster counters it had when it was last on the battlefield to determine how many Soldier tokens to create."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Aasfressender Schlamm\', \'text\': \'{G}: Schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte war, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Aasfressenden Schlamm und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': \'In der Natur wird kein Knochen und kein Fleischfetzen je verschwendet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605968&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1ca774a-33b3-4a0e-b23b-349095d16fe7\', \'multiverseId\': 605968}, \'multiverseid\': 605968}, {\'name\': \'Cieno carroñero\', \'text\': \'{G}: Exilia la carta objetivo de un cementerio. Si era una carta de criatura, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Cieno carroñero y gana 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno\', \'flavor\': \'En la naturaleza, ni un hueso ni un jirón de carne se desperdician.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb075b81-b90e-4b29-8ad1-ad0f553c64b2\', \'multiverseId\': 606084}, \'multiverseid\': 606084}, {\'name\': \'Limon nécrophage\', \'text\': "{G} : Exilez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière. Si c\'était une carte de créature, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Limon nécrophage et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : limon\', \'flavor\': \'La nature ne gaspille pas un os, pas un bout de chair.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606200&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'284d805a-feac-4713-a7b5-55e33f44bf6e\', \'multiverseId\': 606200}, \'multiverseid\': 606200}, {\'name\': \'Melma Mangiacarogne\', \'text\': \'{G}: Esilia una carta bersaglio da un cimitero. Se era una carta creatura, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Melma Mangiacarogne e guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': \'In natura, non un solo ossicino o pezzo di carne viene sprecato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6be0a94a-8b8d-4ae7-aa20-edc6ec8ca5c2\', \'multiverseId\': 606316}, \'multiverseid\': 606316}, {\'name\': \'漁る軟泥\', \'text\': \'{G}：墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、漁る軟泥の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置き、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': \'自然では、骨の一本、肉の一切れとて無駄にはならない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08477f9b-e67e-4274-9ed1-0161e422c364\', \'multiverseId\': 606432}, \'multiverseid\': 606432}, {\'name\': \'Lodo Necrófago\', \'text\': \'{G}: Exile o card alvo de um cemitério. Se era um card de criatura, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Lodo Necrófago e ganhe 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lodo\', \'flavor\': \'Na natureza, nem um único osso ou pedaço de carne é desperdiçado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b3f9625-41f5-4343-a154-040e0b8353ed\', \'multiverseId\': 606548}, \'multiverseid\': 606548}]', "[{'name': 'Abgelegene Steppe', 'text': 'Die Abgelegene Steppe kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}.\\nUmwandlung {W} ({W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606019&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2bb981bd-80f0-4384-b4da-8539fc4c568f', 'multiverseId': 606019}, 'multiverseid': 606019}, {'name': 'Estepa aislada', 'text': 'La Estepa aislada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}.\\nCiclo {W}. ({W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606135&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25bba0c4-5e28-4e72-8b71-586ee1cb3089', 'multiverseId': 606135}, 'multiverseid': 606135}, {'name': 'Steppes retirées', 'text': 'Les Steppes retirées arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}.\\nRecyclage {W} ({W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606251&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd70fa7e4-c7e7-4569-9e2c-829cd5f9d14d', 'multiverseId': 606251}, 'multiverseid': 606251}, {'name': 'Steppa Isolata', 'text': 'La Steppa Isolata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}.\\nCiclo {W} ({W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606367&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76a9dfa4-bcf1-45cb-b7ec-acb1bb2964ca', 'multiverseId': 606367}, 'multiverseid': 606367}, {'name': '隔離されたステップ', 'text': '隔離されたステップはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}を加える。\\nサイクリング{W}（{W}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606483&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd55bb61f-d458-41eb-ba15-e472d45ea32a', 'multiverseId': 606483}, 'multiverseid': 606483}, {'name': 'Estepe Remota', 'text': 'Estepe Remota entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}.\\nReciclar {W} ({W}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606599&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be544705-1db1-43c3-97b6-163d8b9b7233', 'multiverseId': 606599}, 'multiverseid': 606599}]", '[{\'name\': \'Abgott der Vergessenheit\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du in diesem Zug einen Spielstein erzeugt hast.\\n{8}, {T}, opfere den Abgott der Vergessenheit: Erzeuge einen 10/10 farblosen Eldrazi-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Erwache, Großartiger, und säubere die Welt von unseren Feinden!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605990&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5a1c07b-b021-4b23-ad98-e855594ae300\', \'multiverseId\': 605990}, \'multiverseid\': 605990}, {\'name\': \'Ídolo del olvido\', \'text\': \'{T}: Roba una carta. Activa esto solo si creaste una ficha este turno.\\n{8}, {T}, sacrificar el Ídolo del olvido: Crea una ficha de criatura Eldrazi incolora 10/10.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Álzate, ser inmenso, y libra al mundo de nuestros enemigos!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a1c6b99-31de-48c4-a839-43eca3f5750a\', \'multiverseId\': 606106}, \'multiverseid\': 606106}, {\'name\': "Idole de l\'oubli", \'text\': "{T} : Piochez une carte. N\'activez cette capacité que si vous avez créé un jeton ce tour-ci.\\n{8}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Idole de l\'oubli : Créez un jeton de créature 10/10 incolore Eldrazi.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Lève-toi, glorieux élu, et purifie le monde de nos ennemis ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606222&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8345012d-3c92-4f01-a40c-bc9053e1f097\', \'multiverseId\': 606222}, \'multiverseid\': 606222}, {\'name\': "Idolo dell\'Oblio", \'text\': "{T}: Pesca una carta. Attiva solo se hai creato una pedina in questo turno.\\n{8}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Idolo dell\'Oblio: Crea una pedina creatura Eldrazi 10/10 incolore.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Risvegliati, essere supremo, e purifica il mondo dai nostri nemici!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e00858a4-9ee7-4266-8cda-e76fc3d1f6bf\', \'multiverseId\': 606338}, \'multiverseid\': 606338}, {\'name\': \'忘却の偶像\', \'text\': \'{T}：カード１枚を引く。このターンにあなたがトークンを生成していなければ起動できない。\\n{8}, {T}, 忘却の偶像を生け贄に捧げる：無色の10/10のエルドラージ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「偉大なるものよ、立ち上がり、そして我らの敵たるこの世界を浄化したまえ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec712788-0ecf-4988-a12b-b553eae2103b\', \'multiverseId\': 606454}, \'multiverseid\': 606454}, {\'name\': \'Ídolo do Oblívio\', \'text\': \'{T}: Compre um card. Ative somente se você tiver criado uma ficha neste turno.\\n{8}, {T}, sacrifique Ídolo do Oblívio: Crie uma ficha de criatura Eldrazi incolor 10/10.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Erga-se, ó grandioso, e purifique nosso mundo dos inimigos!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c82a8a34-f38d-484c-a16b-855a66788378\', \'multiverseId\': 606570}, \'multiverseid\': 606570}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adriana, Hauptmann der Stadtwache\', \'text\': \'Tumult (Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, erhält sie bis zum Ende des Zuges +1/+1 für jeden Gegner, den du in diesem Kampf angegriffen hast.)\\nAndere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Tumult. (Hat eine Kreatur mehrfach Tumult, wird jedes Vorkommen einzeln ausgelöst.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605970&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e507c36-599f-4f8c-ba91-a2a030bd89a6\', \'multiverseId\': 605970}, \'multiverseid\': 605970}, {\'name\': \'Adriana, capitana de la guardia\', \'text\': \'Reyerta. (Siempre que esta criatura ataque, obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno por cada oponente al que atacaste este combate.)\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de reyerta. (Si una criatura tiene varias copias de reyerta, cada una se dispara por separado.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8278280-c936-48ec-8ed0-687f28e37560\', \'multiverseId\': 606086}, \'multiverseid\': 606086}, {\'name\': \'Adriana, capitaine de la garde\', \'text\': "Mêlée (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, elle gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque adversaire que vous avez attaqué pendant ce combat.)\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez ont la mêlée. (Si une créature a plusieurs occurrences de mêlée, chacune d\'elles se déclenche séparément.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606202&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8207ca76-71c1-443a-bb4f-8837db0a1378\', \'multiverseId\': 606202}, \'multiverseid\': 606202}, {\'name\': \'Adriana, Capitana della Guardia\', \'text\': \'Mischia (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni avversario che hai attaccato in questo combattimento.)\\nLe altre creature che controlli hanno mischia. (Se una creatura ha più istanze di mischia, ognuna si innesca separatamente.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fb257bc-2a2f-47cc-b20c-526456a05540\', \'multiverseId\': 606318}, \'multiverseid\': 606318}, {\'name\': \'護衛隊長、アドリアナ\', \'text\': \'会戦（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これはこの戦闘であなたが攻撃した対戦相手１人につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは会戦を持つ。（クリーチャー１体に複数の会戦があるなら、それぞれ別個に誘発する。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47cc4ff9-d331-4b25-8810-faf2361fff99\', \'multiverseId\': 606434}, \'multiverseid\': 606434}, {\'name\': \'Adriana, Capitã da Guarda\', \'text\': \'Embate (Toda vez que esta criatura ataca, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno para cada oponente que você atacou neste combate.)\\nAs outras criaturas que você controla têm embate. (Se uma criatura tem ocorrências múltiplas de embate, cada uma é desencadeada separadamente.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35ac3daf-3b7b-4fd6-b8fe-f38cb7b70ae5\', \'multiverseId\': 606550}, \'multiverseid\': 606550}]', "[{'name': 'Angriffstrupp der Himmeljäger', 'text': 'Fliegend, Tumult\\nLeutnant — Solange du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, haben andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Tumult.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Katze, Ritter', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605527&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'acd32931-585c-4e9a-9dcd-76e5e070a04e', 'multiverseId': 605527}, 'multiverseid': 605527}, {'name': 'Force de frappe chasseciel', 'text': 'Vol, Mêlée\\nLieutenant — Tant que vous contrôlez votre commandant, les autres créatures que vous contrôlez ont la mêlée.', 'type': 'Créature : chat et chevalier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605539&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '843c5f36-c174-494f-a5a3-8172e8b26ed8', 'multiverseId': 605539}, 'multiverseid': 605539}, {'name': '空狩人の打撃部隊', 'text': '飛行、会戦\\n副官 ― あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしているかぎり、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは会戦を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猫・騎士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605551&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42bbe58d-835f-47c4-b32e-6ef57740710f', 'multiverseId': 605551}, 'multiverseid': 605551}, {'name': '空猎特攻队', 'text': '飞行，乱斗\\n副官～只要你操控你的指挥官，由你操控的其他生物便具有乱斗异能。', 'type': '生物 ～猫／骑士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605563&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98d6d4e9-90ab-496a-92e9-a228dd7276b1', 'multiverseId': 605563}, 'multiverseid': 605563}]", '[{\'name\': \'Angriffstrupp der Himmeljäger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nTumult (Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, erhält sie bis zum Ende des Zuges +1/+1 für jeden Gegner, den du in diesem Kampf angegriffen hast.)\\nLeutnant — Solange du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, haben andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Tumult.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605459&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eed0d04c-d082-4642-8a11-91ccd62ea1ea\', \'multiverseId\': 605459}, \'multiverseid\': 605459}, {\'name\': \'Fuerza de choque cazacielos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nReyerta. (Siempre que esta criatura ataque, obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno por cada oponente al que atacaste este combate.)\\nTeniente — Mientras controles a tu comandante, las otras criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de reyerta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d06b1880-807d-4bae-83ab-76dd8ff7715e\', \'multiverseId\': 605467}, \'multiverseid\': 605467}, {\'name\': \'Force de frappe chasseciel\', \'text\': "Vol\\nMêlée (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, elle gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque adversaire que vous avez attaqué pendant ce combat.)\\nLieutenant — Tant que vous contrôlez votre commandant, les autres créatures que vous contrôlez ont la mêlée.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605475&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'797844ae-25cd-4dc3-98d2-8e3536ff7446\', \'multiverseId\': 605475}, \'multiverseid\': 605475}, {\'name\': "Squadra d\'Assalto Solcacielo", \'text\': \'Volare\\nMischia (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni avversario che hai attaccato in questo combattimento.)\\nTenente — Fintanto che controlli il tuo comandante, le altre creature che controlli hanno mischia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e185ba7a-7e4b-45f4-b580-5c02b6316e0a\', \'multiverseId\': 605483}, \'multiverseid\': 605483}, {\'name\': \'空狩人の打撃部隊\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n会戦（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これはこの戦闘であなたが攻撃した対戦相手１人につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\\n副官 ― あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしているかぎり、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは会戦を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f901bbed-8091-452d-90e1-15d12f7de756\', \'multiverseId\': 605491}, \'multiverseid\': 605491}, {\'name\': \'Força-tarefa dos Caçadores Celestes\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nEmbate (Toda vez que esta criatura ataca, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno para cada oponente que você atacou neste combate.)\\nTenente — Enquanto você controlar seu comandante, as outras criaturas que você controla terão embate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9de8b420-27fb-4271-bce6-03c010edf607\', \'multiverseId\': 605499}, \'multiverseid\': 605499}, {\'name\': \'空猎特攻队\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n乱斗（每当此生物攻击时，本次战斗中每有一位受你攻击的对手，此生物便得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\\n副官～只要你操控你的指挥官，由你操控的其他生物便具有乱斗异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'919aedbe-152c-42be-9c40-73be9c9a8efb\', \'multiverseId\': 605507}, \'multiverseid\': 605507}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anlockung durch Aas\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge zwei 1/1 grüne Phyrexianer-Insekt-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Infizieren. (Sie fügen Schaden in Form von -1/-1-Marken für Kreaturen und von Giftmarken für Spieler zu.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die natürliche Ordnung existiert nicht mehr.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605962&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fe44488-67f6-475c-acb7-60b7447db257\', \'multiverseId\': 605962}, \'multiverseid\': 605962}, {\'name\': \'Invocación carroñera\', \'text\': \'Crea dos fichas de criatura Insecto Pirexiano verdes 1/1 con la habilidad de infectar. (Hacen daño a las criaturas en forma de contadores -1/-1 y a los jugadores en forma de contadores de veneno.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El orden natural está desordenado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'288d5c75-519f-4c7c-abb1-6eb7d26a3477\', \'multiverseId\': 606078}, \'multiverseid\': 606078}, {\'name\': \'Appel aux charognards\', \'text\': "Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 verte Phyrexian et Insecte avec l\'infection. (Ils infligent des blessures aux créatures sous la forme de marqueurs -1/-1 et aux joueurs sous la forme de marqueurs « poison ».)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "L\'ordre de la nature est en désordre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606194&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63906d2d-c245-4343-a1c0-94789f2f5c36\', \'multiverseId\': 606194}, \'multiverseid\': 606194}, {\'name\': \'Richiamo delle Carogne\', \'text\': \'Crea due pedine creatura Insetto Phyrexiano 1/1 verdi con infettare. (Infliggono danno alle creature sotto forma di segnalini -1/-1 e ai giocatori sotto forma di segnalini veleno.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "L\'ordine naturale è in disordine.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb896adc-041a-461a-a6f0-3cd66ba570d8\', \'multiverseId\': 606310}, \'multiverseid\': 606310}, {\'name\': \'屍肉の呼び声\', \'text\': \'感染を持つ緑の１/１のファイレクシアン・昆虫・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。（それらはクリーチャーに－１/－１カウンターの形でダメージを与え、プレイヤーに毒カウンターの形でダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'自然の秩序は無秩序だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dacee76f-626f-415c-ab47-a54853ca6fa7\', \'multiverseId\': 606426}, \'multiverseid\': 606426}, {\'name\': \'Chamado da Carniça\', \'text\': \'Crie duas fichas de criatura Phyrexiano Inseto verde 1/1 com infectar. (Elas causam dano a criaturas na forma de marcadores -1/-1 e a jogadores na forma de marcadores de veneno.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A ordem natural está fora de ordem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0af85497-750f-479a-a702-6d7dc6ad9c08\', \'multiverseId\': 606542}, \'multiverseid\': 606542}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkanes Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Am Anfang war es nur ein Wassertropfen. Der Zauberspiegel ließ es zu viel mehr kristallisieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605981&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d2b00b4-1499-41c2-a13e-ece8ed5e9c41\', \'multiverseId\': 605981}, \'multiverseid\': 605981}, {\'name\': \'Sello arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Comenzó como una simple gota de agua, pero el Espejo Mágico hizo que cristalizara en algo mucho más poderoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7645f68-9574-42f7-94e0-1390f1973556\', \'multiverseId\': 606097}, \'multiverseid\': 606097}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'ésotérisme", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'était au départ qu\'une simple goutte d\'eau que le Miroir magique cristallisa en quelque chose d\'autre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606213&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40f61f8b-5c70-4b08-a9de-283105fc1ac5\', \'multiverseId\': 606213}, \'multiverseid\': 606213}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Arcano\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Al principio era una semplice goccia d\'acqua. Lo Specchio Magico la cristallizzò in qualcosa di molto più grande.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64245636-dcf1-497b-aa4a-30466e308f28\', \'multiverseId\': 606329}, \'multiverseid\': 606329}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の印鑑\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'初めはほんの一滴だが、魔法の鏡がそれ以上のものを形にする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40b4d1f6-eb7a-4cb1-9d81-56da571d2308\', \'multiverseId\': 606445}, \'multiverseid\': 606445}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': "Começou como uma simples gota d\'água. O Espelho Mágico a cristalizou em algo muito maior.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d6df3c0-c870-401d-ae3b-9e0cc045f5e5\', \'multiverseId\': 606561}, \'multiverseid\': 606561}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufgepfropftes Exoskelett\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und hat Infizieren. (Sie fügt Schaden in Form von -1/-1-Marken für Kreaturen und von Giftmarken für Spieler zu.)\\nImmer wenn das Aufgepfropfte Exoskelett von einer bleibenden Karte gelöst wird, opfere die bleibende Karte.\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605988&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8969c36b-bf90-4cd7-af08-e27cbef7b636\', \'multiverseId\': 605988}, \'multiverseid\': 605988}, {\'name\': \'Exoesqueleto injertado\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene la habilidad de infectar. (Hace daño a las criaturas en forma de contadores -1/-1 y a los jugadores en forma de contadores de veneno.)\\nSiempre que el Exoesqueleto injertado sea desanexado de un permanente, sacrifica ese permanente.\\nEquipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64333679-3fca-4a76-bb39-55882d2c7db4\', \'multiverseId\': 606104}, \'multiverseid\': 606104}, {\'name\': \'Exosquelette greffé\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +2/+2 et a l\'infection. (Elle inflige des blessures aux créatures sous la forme de marqueurs -1/-1 et aux joueurs sous la forme de marqueurs « poison ».)\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Exosquelette greffé devient détaché d\'un permanent, sacrifiez ce permanent.\\nÉquipement {2}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606220&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9c84aeb-1117-4897-b48a-f2757506d94a\', \'multiverseId\': 606220}, \'multiverseid\': 606220}, {\'name\': \'Esoscheletro Innestato\', \'text\': "La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+2 e ha infettare. (Questa creatura infligge danno alle creature sotto forma di segnalini -1/-1 e ai giocatori sotto forma di segnalini veleno.)\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Esoscheletro Innestato viene tolto da un permanente, sacrifica quel permanente.\\nEquipaggiare {2}", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a275257-a263-4371-a6b7-dc4cd9664fb4\', \'multiverseId\': 606336}, \'multiverseid\': 606336}, {\'name\': \'生体融合外骨格\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け感染を持つ。（それはクリーチャーに－１/－１カウンターの形で、プレイヤーに毒カウンターの形でダメージを与える。）\\n生体融合外骨格がパーマネントからはずれた状態になるたび、そのパーマネントを生け贄に捧げる。\\n装備{2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92ebfc48-6a0c-4a4a-8974-44ff8d169cf0\', \'multiverseId\': 606452}, \'multiverseid\': 606452}, {\'name\': \'Exosqueleto Enxertado\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+2 e tem infectar. (Ela causa dano a criaturas na forma de marcadores -1/-1 e a jogadores na forma de marcadores de veneno.)\\nToda vez que Exosqueleto Enxertado for solto de uma permanente, sacrifique aquela permanente.\\nEquipar {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69ce9690-905b-46d6-9109-3d1332b20808\', \'multiverseId\': 606568}, \'multiverseid\': 606568}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufmarsch der Legion\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments legst du eine Musterungsmarke auf den Aufmarsch der Legion. Erzeuge dann für jede Musterungsmarke auf dem Aufmarsch der Legion einen 1/1 roten und weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein mit Eile.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605971&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2eac0b16-ee45-4be8-98b5-6aea41ad03cc\', \'multiverseId\': 605971}, \'multiverseid\': 605971}, {\'name\': \'Reunir a la Legión\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon un contador de reunión sobre Reunir a la Legión. Luego crea una ficha de criatura Soldado roja y blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de prisa por cada contador de reunión sobre Reunir a la Legión.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e02ee0e7-6c43-45bb-a1ed-04cf9e187967\', \'multiverseId\': 606087}, \'multiverseid\': 606087}, {\'name\': \'Rassemblez la légion !\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, mettez un marqueur « rassemblement » sur Rassemblez la légion . Créez ensuite un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge et blanche Soldat avec la célérité pour chaque marqueur « rassemblement » sur Rassemblez la légion .\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606203&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4366f1c4-64ab-4780-ad13-2d684cf450fc\', \'multiverseId\': 606203}, \'multiverseid\': 606203}, {\'name\': \'Radunare la Legione\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti un segnalino adunata su Radunare la Legione. Poi crea una pedina creatura Soldato 1/1 bianca e rossa con rapidità per ogni segnalino adunata su Radunare la Legione.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'922bd98e-5a1d-4251-a997-9f8b2fbaf2a1\', \'multiverseId\': 606319}, \'multiverseid\': 606319}, {\'name\': \'軍勢の集結\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、軍勢の集結の上に召集カウンター１個を置く。その後、軍勢の集結の上にある召集カウンター１個につき１体の、速攻を持つ赤白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'707cc73f-b264-40fd-a049-1078a63d59ca\', \'multiverseId\': 606435}, \'multiverseid\': 606435}, {\'name\': \'Reunir a Legião\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, coloque um marcador de reunião em Reunir a Legião. Depois, crie uma ficha de criatura Soldado vermelha e branca 1/1 com ímpeto para cada marcador de reunião em Reunir a Legião.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feaa6637-7ad1-444d-97eb-4070ebcddaa5\', \'multiverseId\': 606551}, \'multiverseid\': 606551}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auseinanderreißen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Auseinanderreißen fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Aus der Geschichte gerissen. Aus der Erinnerung gerissen. Aus der Wirklichkeit gerissen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605980&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a98b7670-b43f-4122-8c89-f59a216efb5e\', \'multiverseId\': 605980}, \'multiverseid\': 605980}, {\'name\': \'Liquidar\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Liquidar hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\\n• Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Erradicado de la historia. De la memoria. De la realidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'302e79c1-daf9-4342-ab7b-fbadc7adb9d0\', \'multiverseId\': 606096}, \'multiverseid\': 606096}, {\'name\': \'Dilacérer\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Dilacérer inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker.\\n• Détruisez une cible, artefact ou enchantement.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Arraché à l\'histoire. Arraché à la mémoire. Arraché à la réalité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606212&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84b1da7b-ca27-48d9-9a46-d1025d415026\', \'multiverseId\': 606212}, \'multiverseid\': 606212}, {\'name\': \'Squarciare\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Squarciare infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\\n• Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Strappato dalla storia. Strappato dalla memoria. Strappato dalla realtà.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53a1743f-8eb9-429c-8bc4-856a3c7b113a\', \'multiverseId\': 606328}, \'multiverseid\': 606328}, {\'name\': \'引き裂き\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を対象とする。引き裂きはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\n• アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'歴史から裂かれた。記憶から裂かれた。現実から裂かれた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4ae5473-7604-45b2-a4e5-23f66185d854\', \'multiverseId\': 606444}, \'multiverseid\': 606444}, {\'name\': \'Fender\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Fender causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo.\\n• Destrua o artefato ou o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Rasgado da história. Rasgado da memória. Rasgado da realidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8386d3cd-427f-4646-9a95-2125072aed20\', \'multiverseId\': 606560}, \'multiverseid\': 606560}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgestoßener Drachenmeister\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls du sechs oder mehr Länder kontrollierst, erzeuge einen 5/5 roten Drache-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Welt wird von ihren rechtmäßigen Herrschern regiert werden und nicht von diesen widerlichen Kreaturen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605954&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f902d8bf-2e18-4153-8d83-e2ce59e9ff40\', \'multiverseId\': 605954}, \'multiverseid\': 605954}, {\'name\': \'Paria maestro de dragones\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si controlas seis o más tierras, crea una ficha de criatura Dragón roja 5/5 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Este mundo será gobernado por sus legítimos soberanos, no por esos farsantes espantosos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ed01835-269e-4b5a-84d7-71f584d90af6\', \'multiverseId\': 606070}, \'multiverseid\': 606070}, {\'name\': \'Proscrite maître-dragon\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, si vous contrôlez au moins six terrains, créez un jeton de créature 5/5 rouge Dragon avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Ce monde sera dirigé par ses souverains légitimes, pas par ces imposteurs monstrueux. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606186&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f6c9b0a-babd-465f-8a78-b0695000e10a\', \'multiverseId\': 606186}, \'multiverseid\': 606186}, {\'name\': \'Dragoniere Reietto\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se controlli sei o più terre, crea una pedina creatura Drago 5/5 rossa con volare.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo mondo sarà governato dai suoi legittimi sovrani, non da questi ripugnanti usurpatori."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59adf6b7-13f1-42fe-8d3c-62c77c4018df\', \'multiverseId\': 606302}, \'multiverseid\': 606302}, {\'name\': \'竜使いののけ者\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたが６つ以上の土地をコントロールしている場合、飛行を持つ赤の５/５のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「この世界は、あの醜悪な詐称者どもにではなく、正当なる支配者に統治されるであろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d557748-9649-4822-812b-3b0bf26e02e1\', \'multiverseId\': 606418}, \'multiverseid\': 606418}, {\'name\': \'Pária Mestre de Dragões\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, se você controlar seis ou mais terrenos, crie uma ficha de criatura Dragão vermelha 5/5 com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Este mundo será governado por seus legítimos soberanos, e não por esses impostores horrendos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4d0814e-992b-4784-9517-bfe084101051\', \'multiverseId\': 606534}, \'multiverseid\': 606534}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausmerzungsritual\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre jede bleibende Karte mit Manabetrag 2 oder weniger, die kein Land ist. Erzeuge {B} oder {G} für jede auf diese Weise zerstörte bleibende Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Deine eigene Zerbrechlichkeit ist dein Untergang. Ich mache sie nur offenbar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605973&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d956020-1d83-4220-863f-5fac8e611b6f\', \'multiverseId\': 605973}, \'multiverseid\': 605973}, {\'name\': \'Ritual de eliminación\', \'text\': \'Destruye cada permanente que no sea tierra con valor de maná de 2 o menos. Agrega {B} o {G} por cada permanente destruido de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu debilidad es tu perdición. Yo solo la expongo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25ad23b8-2947-4546-a1e5-6adb0825ea3f\', \'multiverseId\': 606089}, \'multiverseid\': 606089}, {\'name\': \'Rituel sacrificiel\', \'text\': \'Détruisez chaque permanent non-terrain ayant une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 2. Ajoutez {B} ou {G} pour chaque permanent détruit de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Ta propre fragilité est ta faiblesse. Je ne fais que l\'exposer. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606205&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c744cc5-a823-41ec-9ffa-f0f70552098e\', \'multiverseId\': 606205}, \'multiverseid\': 606205}, {\'name\': \'Rituale di Distruzione\', \'text\': \'Distruggi ogni permanente non terra con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 2. Aggiungi {B} o {G} per ogni permanente distrutto in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"La tua fragilità è la tua rovina. Io mi limito a rivelarla."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f25b4000-bea4-4744-85da-87b19e476b3b\', \'multiverseId\': 606321}, \'multiverseid\': 606321}, {\'name\': \'選別の儀式\', \'text\': \'マナ総量が２以下であり土地でないすべてのパーマネントを破壊する。これにより破壊されたパーマネント１つにつき、{B}か{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたは自分自身の弱点で破滅したのよ。私はそれを利用しただけ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dad258c7-4853-4b31-873c-e6cc766707ad\', \'multiverseId\': 606437}, \'multiverseid\': 606437}, {\'name\': \'Ritual da Ceifa\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as permanentes não de terreno com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 2. Adicione {B} ou {G} para cada permanente destruída desta forma.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Sua própria fragilidade é sua desgraça. Eu apenas a exponho."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc0e70b5-658b-4584-a704-326d8ee7f427\', \'multiverseId\': 606553}, \'multiverseid\': 606553}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausräuchern\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen. Du erhältst für jede auf diese Weise zerstörte Kreatur 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ghirapurs Gremlin-Population stellt eine Gefahr für die Infrastruktur des Messeplatzes dar. Gefahren müssen eliminiert werden."\\n—Sram, leitender Konstrukteur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605925&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4021da5-048f-4ca0-a28b-0e6f8b615613\', \'multiverseId\': 605925}, \'multiverseid\': 605925}, {\'name\': \'Fumigar\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas. Ganas 1 vida por cada criatura destruida de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"La población de gremlins de Ghirapur supone una amenaza para la infraestructura de la feria. Y las amenazas deben ser erradicadas".\\n—Sram, edificador experto\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bac9e6d-8870-4d0b-b655-5beaf22036fd\', \'multiverseId\': 606041}, \'multiverseid\': 606041}, {\'name\': \'Fumigation\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures. Vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque créature détruite de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« La population de gremlins de Ghirapur menace les infrastructures de la foire. Et les menaces doivent être éliminées. »\\n—Sram, chef édificateur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606157&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a531a89-f532-4890-a3c0-807bb691e6eb\', \'multiverseId\': 606157}, \'multiverseid\': 606157}, {\'name\': \'Fumigare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature. Guadagni 1 punto vita per ogni creatura distrutta in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"La popolazione di gremlin di Ghirapur costituisce un fattore di rischio per le infrastrutture della Fiera. Ogni rischio deve essere eliminato."\\n—Sram, edificatore capo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caae92b8-db13-4b07-8b8c-87e501fa6d52\', \'multiverseId\': 606273}, \'multiverseid\': 606273}, {\'name\': \'燻蒸\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。あなたは、これにより破壊されたクリーチャー１体につき１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ギラプールのグレムリン個体数は博覧会場の基盤に対する脅威となる。脅威は取り除くべきだ。」\\n――上級建設官、スラム\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18a4add6-0696-416e-9890-26543cc12114\', \'multiverseId\': 606389}, \'multiverseid\': 606389}, {\'name\': \'Fumigar\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas. Você ganha 1 ponto de vida para cada criatura destruída dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"A população de gremlins de Ghirapur representa uma ameaça à infraestrutura do parque da Feira. As ameaças devem ser eliminadas."\\n— Sram, edificador sênior\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8e84458-94ab-4242-9385-b91e752a1e45\', \'multiverseId\': 606505}, \'multiverseid\': 606505}]', '[{\'name\': \'Befehlsturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Nähere dich meinem Turm auf Knien oder verlasse ihn als Asche im Wind."\\n—Gadwick der Alte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606007&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7831fddc-ba48-43ea-b579-c6f1b11dd1f1\', \'multiverseId\': 606007}, \'multiverseid\': 606007}, {\'name\': \'Torre de mando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"O hincas la rodilla frente a mi torre o te alejarás de ella como cenizas en el viento".\\n—Gadwick, el Marchito\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'617eb46d-e96f-49c9-a11d-6e57503ada92\', \'multiverseId\': 606123}, \'multiverseid\': 606123}, {\'name\': \'Tour de commandement\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Approchez de ma tour un genou à terre, ou quittez-la en cendres au gré du vent. »\\n—Gadwick, le Brisquard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606239&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a04888b-17c5-49db-b25f-4153236b365b\', \'multiverseId\': 606239}, \'multiverseid\': 606239}, {\'name\': \'Torre di Comando\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Avvicinati in ginocchio alla mia torre o la abbandonerai come cenere al vento."\\n—Gadwick, il Rugoso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55e960b0-c600-45cd-a779-b0bca1b11ec8\', \'multiverseId\': 606355}, \'multiverseid\': 606355}, {\'name\': \'統率の塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「この塔に近付くものはひざまずくがよい。さもなければ灰になり、風に乗って去ることになる。」\\n――老いたる者、ガドウィック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c3f0bb2-175c-41a3-b9e8-5c623017823c\', \'multiverseId\': 606471}, \'multiverseid\': 606471}, {\'name\': \'Torre de Comando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Ou você dobra os joelhos perante minha torre ou vai embora como cinzas levadas pelo vento."\\n— Gadwick, o Enrugado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d940f96-1bf7-4088-a0de-2e88b76777a1\', \'multiverseId\': 606587}, \'multiverseid\': 606587}]', "[{'name': 'Befestigtes Dorf', 'text': 'Sowie das Befestigte Dorf ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Wald- oder Ebene-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt das Befestigte Dorf getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606010&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c06cabe8-0798-49f0-9aa0-19dec9dd675a', 'multiverseId': 606010}, 'multiverseid': 606010}, {'name': 'Aldea fortificada', 'text': 'En cuanto la Aldea fortificada entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Bosque o Llanura de tu mano. Si no lo haces, la Aldea fortificada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {W}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606126&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b9c93f9-d7b9-42b7-a2a9-0f195d524add', 'multiverseId': 606126}, 'multiverseid': 606126}, {'name': 'Village fortifié', 'text': 'Au moment où le Village fortifié arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de forêt ou de plaine de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Village fortifié arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606242&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5384bc8-8dbf-470d-8db9-62b4512e4ca1', 'multiverseId': 606242}, 'multiverseid': 606242}, {'name': 'Villaggio Fortificato', 'text': 'Mentre il Villaggio Fortificato entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Foresta o Pianura dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, il Villaggio Fortificato entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606358&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1086f61-9ade-4279-b84b-ee7fe20e97c1', 'multiverseId': 606358}, 'multiverseid': 606358}, {'name': '要塞化した村', 'text': '要塞化した村が戦場に出るに際し、あなたの手札にあり森や平地であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、要塞化した村はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606474&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '93c19644-43b7-4e0c-93b1-55e5a845deec', 'multiverseId': 606474}, 'multiverseid': 606474}, {'name': 'Aldeia Fortificada', 'text': 'Conforme Aldeia Fortificada entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Floresta ou Planície de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Aldeia Fortificada entrará no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606590&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f8e1d14-9221-4001-a8fe-7ba0a97b0f87', 'multiverseId': 606590}, 'multiverseid': 606590}]", '[{\'name\': \'Beispielloses Manöver\', \'text\': \'Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Hauptmann, Eure Einheiten sind die Speerspitze. Sie können sich keine Fehler erlauben."\\n—Jirina Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605924&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a7b5073-02a9-40de-a227-e385414eb254\', \'multiverseId\': 605924}, \'multiverseid\': 605924}, {\'name\': \'Maniobra sin igual\', \'text\': \'Si controlas un comandante, puedes lanzar este hechizo sin pagar su coste de maná.\\nLas criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Capitán, sus unidades son la punta de nuestra lanza. El fracaso no tiene cabida".\\n—Jirina Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbaf73b9-db36-46e5-b49c-9f5463a34406\', \'multiverseId\': 606040}, \'multiverseid\': 606040}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre irréprochable\', \'text\': "Si vous contrôlez un commandant, vous pouvez lancer ce sort sans payer son coût de mana.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Capitaine, vos unités sont notre fer de lance. Vous n\'avez pas droit à l\'erreur. »\\n—Jirina Koudro", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606156&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee77af09-4e37-44b8-b345-91d198d27ec1\', \'multiverseId\': 606156}, \'multiverseid\': 606156}, {\'name\': \'Manovra Impeccabile\', \'text\': \'Se controlli un comandante, puoi lanciare questa magia senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\\nLe creature che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Capitano, le sue unità sono la punta della nostra lancia. Non c\\\'è spazio per il fallimento."\\n—Jerina Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7f48427-aba9-4af5-b7b7-ca5894dafdfe\', \'multiverseId\': 606272}, \'multiverseid\': 606272}, {\'name\': \'完璧な策略\', \'text\': \'あなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、この呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\nターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「隊長、あなたの部隊は私たちの槍の穂先よ。失敗の余地はないわ。」\\n――ジリーナ・クードロ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be4114da-13cb-46d6-9280-07d0787ff07d\', \'multiverseId\': 606388}, \'multiverseid\': 606388}, {\'name\': \'Manobra Impecável\', \'text\': \'Se você controla um comandante, você pode conjurar esta mágica sem pagar seu custo de mana.\\nAs criaturas que você controla ganham indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Capitão, suas unidades são a ponta de nossas lanças. Não há margem para o fracasso."\\n— Jirrina Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a55ca4ac-deea-4497-b3ea-79d6970b8980\', \'multiverseId\': 606504}, \'multiverseid\': 606504}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerungstrupp-Kommandant\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Belagerungstrupp-Kommandant ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge drei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\n{1}{R}, opfere einen Goblin: Der Belagerungstrupp-Kommandant fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'„Achtung … äh … Feuer!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605959&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b80d221e-e17d-45d2-bcee-363bc9ee6d9a\', \'multiverseId\': 605959}, \'multiverseid\': 605959}, {\'name\': \'Comandante de sitiadores\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Comandante de sitiadores entre al campo de batalla, crea tres fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.\\n{1}{R}, sacrificar un Trasgo: El Comandante de sitiadores hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"Preparados..., eeeh..., ¡fuego!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'547c61a8-ba4b-4140-a9a9-9c0aa5523ad3\', \'multiverseId\': 606075}, \'multiverseid\': 606075}, {\'name\': \'Commandant des assiégeants\', \'text\': "Quand le Commandant des assiégeants arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez trois jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\\n{1}{R}, sacrifiez un gobelin : Le Commandant des assiégeants inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin\', \'flavor\': \'« Prêts ? Euh... Feu ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606191&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e89e201-8a22-4483-9620-15403537b6b0\', \'multiverseId\': 606191}, \'multiverseid\': 606191}, {\'name\': \'Capo della Squadra di Assedio\', \'text\': \'Quando il Capo della Squadra di Assedio entra nel campo di battaglia, crea tre pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\\n{1}{R}, Sacrifica un Goblin: Il Capo della Squadra di Assedio infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Pronti... Ehm... Fuoco!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eae43003-787d-476d-a2fb-1c978148546a\', \'multiverseId\': 606307}, \'multiverseid\': 606307}, {\'name\': \'包囲攻撃の司令官\', \'text\': \'包囲攻撃の司令官が戦場に出たとき、赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークン３体を生成する。\\n{1}{R}, ゴブリン１体を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。包囲攻撃の司令官はそれに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン\', \'flavor\': \'「ヨーイ……えーと……撃て！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30e51dbc-7c26-4d81-87ba-cc4ddbde75be\', \'multiverseId\': 606423}, \'multiverseid\': 606423}, {\'name\': \'Comandante do Grupo de Cerco\', \'text\': \'Quando Comandante do Grupo de Cerco entrar no campo de batalha, crie três fichas de criatura Goblin vermelha 1/1.\\n{1}{R}, sacrifique um Goblin: Comandante do Grupo de Cerco causa 2 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Preparar... hã... fogo!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'799716bc-403e-4957-bcd8-bc66f8e6721e\', \'multiverseId\': 606539}, \'multiverseid\': 606539}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blätterdach-Panorama\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.)\\nDas Blätterdach-Panorama kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wald, Ebene\', \'flavor\': \'Der Kontinent Murasa liegt unter einem dichten Blätterdach verborgen, die Vegetation so verwachsen, dass seine Einwohner niemals den Boden erblicken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606004&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1376b729-3168-445a-bfff-5d8f7cf24351\', \'multiverseId\': 606004}, \'multiverseid\': 606004}, {\'name\': \'Panorámica de la enramada\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {G} o {W}.)\\nLa Panorámica de la enramada entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Bosque llanura\', \'flavor\': \'El continente de Murasa se oculta bajo una espesa capa de vegetación. Las enormes ramas que lo cubren están tan enredadas que algunos de sus habitantes jamás llegan a ver el suelo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'411fca02-0596-4fcf-834f-00e09a3b8aa9\', \'multiverseId\': 606120}, \'multiverseid\': 606120}, {\'name\': \'Vue de la canopée\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.)\\nLa Vue de la canopée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : forêt et plaine\', \'flavor\': "Le continent de Murasa est protégé par une épaisse couche de végétation, dont les énormes branches s\'enchevêtrent si étroitement que certains habitants ne voient jamais le sol.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606236&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dac494fd-6128-4c0d-ba22-db1ca8dab374\', \'multiverseId\': 606236}, \'multiverseid\': 606236}, {\'name\': \'Panorama di Fronde\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.)\\nIl Panorama di Fronde entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Foresta Pianura\', \'flavor\': \'Il continente di Murasa giace sotto una coltre di fitta vegetazione, dagli enormi rami aggrovigliati così strettamente che alcuni dei suoi abitanti non vedono mai il suolo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cae5aaf9-b1ec-45fa-8948-38692c4d6d66\', \'multiverseId\': 606352}, \'multiverseid\': 606352}, {\'name\': \'梢の眺望\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、梢の眺望はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 森・平地\', \'flavor\': \'ムラーサ大陸は密生する植生に覆われている。巨大な木々の曲がりくねった枝が稠密に重なっており、ここに住む人々の中には、地面を見たことのない者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4c85846-5ac8-49c2-b132-29dde39028d3\', \'multiverseId\': 606468}, \'multiverseid\': 606468}, {\'name\': \'Vista do Dossel\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}.)\\nVista do Dossel entra no campo de batalha virada, a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Floresta Planície\', \'flavor\': \'O continente de Murasa fica sob um manto de densa vegetação, seus galhos enormes tão densamente emaranhados que alguns habitantes jamais veem o chão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c461b899-9a1c-41eb-baf2-bfdf657a3c9d\', \'multiverseId\': 606584}, \'multiverseid\': 606584}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bojukamoor\', \'text\': \'Das Bojukamoor kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Bojukamoor ins Spiel kommt, schicke den Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606001&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc310fe2-cd55-4386-843f-9fbc86030e98\', \'multiverseId\': 606001}, \'multiverseid\': 606001}, {\'name\': \'Ciénaga de Bojuka\', \'text\': \'La Ciénaga de Bojuka entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Ciénaga de Bojuka entre al campo de batalla, exilia el cementerio del jugador objetivo.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea060f09-335a-4528-95e4-0d1c01618058\', \'multiverseId\': 606117}, \'multiverseid\': 606117}, {\'name\': \'Marécage de Bojuka\', \'text\': "Le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez le cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606233&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'788a5f0b-c01d-4d98-81cd-5078351d9bfd\', \'multiverseId\': 606233}, \'multiverseid\': 606233}, {\'name\': \'Acquitrino di Bojuka\', \'text\': "L\'Acquitrino di Bojuka entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquitrino di Bojuka entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia il cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33b68c04-c4f5-44ff-ac73-f937f09c7b32\', \'multiverseId\': 606349}, \'multiverseid\': 606349}, {\'name\': \'ボジューカの沼\', \'text\': \'ボジューカの沼はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nボジューカの沼が戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地を追放する。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40c2430d-164c-4bef-ba2b-b22bb6471080\', \'multiverseId\': 606465}, \'multiverseid\': 606465}, {\'name\': \'Pântano de Bojuka\', \'text\': \'Pântano de Bojuka entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Pântano de Bojuka entrar no campo de batalha, exile o cemitério do jogador alvo.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39428006-31ab-4f91-929e-6256f49f3f12\', \'multiverseId\': 606581}, \'multiverseid\': 606581}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boros-Amulett\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Das Boros-Amulett fügt einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605972&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c95ea304-6930-48b6-b512-d8f3666b3464\', \'multiverseId\': 605972}, \'multiverseid\': 605972}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto boros\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• El Amuleto boros hace 4 puntos de daño al jugador o planeswalker objetivo.\\n• Los permanentes que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\n• La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d747d63f-5efe-48ec-b2bb-87a40703ae1c\', \'multiverseId\': 606088}, \'multiverseid\': 606088}, {\'name\': \'Charme de Boros\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Le Charme de Boros inflige 4 blessures à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker.\\n• Les permanents que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Une créature ciblée acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606204&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c5c55bd-641f-4101-b51c-18c051b5bf69\', \'multiverseId\': 606204}, \'multiverseid\': 606204}, {\'name\': \'Talismano Boros\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Il Talismano Boros infligge 4 danni a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\\n• I permanenti che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Una creatura bersaglio ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0be0dfc0-eeb5-4b51-a8eb-62ed0dee88a4\', \'multiverseId\': 606320}, \'multiverseid\': 606320}, {\'name\': \'ボロスの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• プレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを対象とする。ボロスの魔除けはそれに４点のダメージを与える。\\n• ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのパーマネントは破壊不能を得る。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ce5c4fe-8f26-4deb-a697-ab57fecdded8\', \'multiverseId\': 606436}, \'multiverseid\': 606436}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto Boros\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Amuleto Boros causa 4 pontos de dano ao jogador ou planeswalker alvo.\\n• As permanentes que você controla ganham indestrutível até o final do turno.\\n• A criatura alvo ganha golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35568863-3ff2-4abe-9452-68851512e664\', \'multiverseId\': 606552}, \'multiverseid\': 606552}]', "[{'name': 'Boros-Garnison', 'text': 'Die Boros-Garnison kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Boros-Garnison ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606002&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '885b2f03-d881-4433-a676-541b368d4cec', 'multiverseId': 606002}, 'multiverseid': 606002}, {'name': 'Fuerte boros', 'text': 'El Fuerte boros entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Fuerte boros entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606118&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9a730b7-eb95-426e-a643-167a9214b2f5', 'multiverseId': 606118}, 'multiverseid': 606118}, {'name': 'Garnison de Boros', 'text': 'La Garnison de Boros arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Garnison de Boros arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606234&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8170533-4aa4-4ecc-8f28-faf287f78812', 'multiverseId': 606234}, 'multiverseid': 606234}, {'name': 'Presidio Boros', 'text': 'Il Presidio Boros entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Presidio Boros entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606350&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '93c9817e-1b59-4084-b11c-6d806096f0ea', 'multiverseId': 606350}, 'multiverseid': 606350}, {'name': 'ボロスの駐屯地', 'text': 'ボロスの駐屯地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nボロスの駐屯地が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{R}{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606466&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09673261-8146-4c81-8e69-ad4f57882e4a', 'multiverseId': 606466}, 'multiverseid': 606466}, {'name': 'Guarnição Boros', 'text': 'Guarnição Boros entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Guarnição Boros entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606582&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cec4d846-0c1b-46ee-b9c6-7f33f4f8e354', 'multiverseId': 606582}, 'multiverseid': 606582}]", '[{\'name\': \'Boros-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Hattest du schon einmal ein Boros-Petschaft in der Hand? Man wundert sich, dass es bei seiner Größe so schwer sein kann — ein Gewicht von Stolz und Stärke."\\n—Agrus Kos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605982&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98236ccf-f5f9-438a-bb76-8bc554d1f5ee\', \'multiverseId\': 605982}, \'multiverseid\': 605982}, {\'name\': \'Sello boros\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Has sostenido alguna vez un sello boros? Tiene un peso que no se corresponde con su tamaño: el peso de la fuerza y el orgullo".\\n—Agrus Kos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e441b0ce-313e-43f6-8503-62892e5b7820\', \'multiverseId\': 606098}, \'multiverseid\': 606098}, {\'name\': \'Cachet de Boros\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Avez-vous déjà eu en main le cachet de Boros ? Il est bien plus lourd qu\'on pourrait le croire — il a le pesant de la force et de la fierté. »\\n—Agrus Kos", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606214&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb0f42f8-a97b-40af-aba6-2716cd0c24f9\', \'multiverseId\': 606214}, \'multiverseid\': 606214}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Boros\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Hai mai tenuto in mano un sigillo Boros? Il suo peso stupisce in rapporto alle dimensioni: è il peso della forza e dell\\\'orgoglio."\\n—Agrus Kos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33bbab1f-a1c4-4abf-ba62-e43acd43b60b\', \'multiverseId\': 606330}, \'multiverseid\': 606330}, {\'name\': \'ボロスの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{R}{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「ボロスの印鑑を手にしたことがあるか？その重さは見た目以上だ。力と誇りの重みなのだ。」\\n――アグルス・コス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c6bb609-630d-4b95-a76f-a9b3f1a85698\', \'multiverseId\': 606446}, \'multiverseid\': 606446}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Boros\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Você já segurou um sinete Boros? Seu peso não corresponde ao seu tamanho, é o peso da força e do orgulho."\\n— Agrus Kos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6626a640-674a-4867-99c9-829bbfd69086\', \'multiverseId\': 606562}, \'multiverseid\': 606562}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chiss-Goria, Tyrannin der Schmelze\', \'text\': \'Affinität zu Artefakten (Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, {1} weniger.)\\nFliegend, Eile\\nImmer wenn Chiss-Goria, Tyrannin der Schmelze, angreift, schicke die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. In diesem Zug kannst du davon einen Artefaktzauber wirken. Falls du dies tust, hat er Affinität zu Artefakten.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605463&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'974cb362-f690-4d92-b8bd-a37fb3985bab\', \'multiverseId\': 605463}, \'multiverseid\': 605463}, {\'name\': \'Chiss-Goria, tirana de la forja\', \'text\': \'Afinidad por artefactos. (Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada artefacto que controlas.)\\nVuela, prisa.\\nSiempre que Chiss-Goria, tirana de la forja ataque, exilia las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes lanzar un hechizo de artefacto de entre ellas este turno. Si lo haces, tiene la habilidad de afinidad por artefactos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26bc627d-d28a-45b8-a0f7-40784d85955d\', \'multiverseId\': 605471}, \'multiverseid\': 605471}, {\'name\': \'Chiss-Goria, tyran de la forge\', \'text\': "Affinité pour les artefacts (Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez.)\\nVol, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que Chiss-Goria, tyran de la forge attaque, exilez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez lancer un sort d\'artefact parmi elles ce tour-ci. Si vous faites ainsi, elle a l\'affinité pour les artefacts.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605479&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcefb903-46e0-4ce3-9223-29b9d4a15a80\', \'multiverseId\': 605479}, \'multiverseid\': 605479}, {\'name\': \'Chiss-Goria, Tiranna della Forgia\', \'text\': \'Affinità con gli artefatti (Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni artefatto che controlli.)\\nVolare, rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta Chiss-Goria, Tiranna della Forgia attacca, esilia le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi lanciare una magia artefatto scelta tra esse in questo turno. Se lo fai, ha affinità con gli artefatti.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44d7fe4b-332f-4b9e-a427-595c0b0ca278\', \'multiverseId\': 605487}, \'multiverseid\': 605487}, {\'name\': \'溶鉱炉の暴君、チス＝ゴリア\', \'text\': \'親和（アーティファクト）（この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき{1}少なくなる。）\\n飛行、速攻\\n溶鉱炉の暴君、チス＝ゴリアが攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード５枚を追放する。このターン、あなたはその中からアーティファクト・呪文１つを唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、それは親和（アーティファクト）を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43e64a20-e045-4eaa-8a76-d4cb5970c825\', \'multiverseId\': 605495}, \'multiverseid\': 605495}, {\'name\': \'Chiss-Goria, Tirana da Forja\', \'text\': \'Afinidade por artefatos (Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada artefato que você controla.)\\nVoar, ímpeto\\nToda vez que Chiss-Goria, Tirana da Forja, atacar, exile os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode conjurar uma mágica de artefato dentre eles neste turno. Se fizer isso, ela terá afinidade por artefatos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e972ad76-c60b-455d-80cb-55549a77acf5\', \'multiverseId\': 605503}, \'multiverseid\': 605503}, {\'name\': \'熔炉暴君齐歌利\', \'text\': \'神器共鸣（你每操控一个神器，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。）\\n飞行，敏捷\\n每当熔炉暴君齐歌利攻击时，放逐你牌库顶的五张牌。本回合中，你可以从其中施放一个神器咒语。若你如此作，则它具有神器共鸣异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7b62600-2c0d-4dc9-9ef4-19b9beb467c5\', \'multiverseId\': 605511}, \'multiverseid\': 605511}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chiss-Goria, Tyrannin der Schmelze\', \'text\': \'Affinität zu Artefakten\\nFliegend, Eile\\nImmer wenn Chiss-Goria, Tyrannin der Schmelze, angreift, schicke die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. In diesem Zug kannst du davon einen Artefaktzauber wirken. Falls du dies tust, hat er Affinität zu Artefakten.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605531&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1358716-1d56-4a0d-97f4-bebdc13461c9\', \'multiverseId\': 605531}, \'multiverseid\': 605531}, {\'name\': \'Chiss-Goria, tyran de la forge\', \'text\': "Affinité pour les artefacts\\nVol, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que Chiss-Goria, tyran de la forge attaque, exilez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez lancer un sort d\'artefact parmi elles ce tour-ci. Si vous faites ainsi, elle a l\'affinité pour les artefacts.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605543&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16141c1b-4f93-41a5-88f1-c7dc76b5cfa8\', \'multiverseId\': 605543}, \'multiverseid\': 605543}, {\'name\': \'溶鉱炉の暴君、チス＝ゴリア\', \'text\': \'親和（アーティファクト）\\n飛行、速攻\\n溶鉱炉の暴君、チス＝ゴリアが攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード５枚を追放する。このターン、あなたはその中からアーティファクト・呪文１つを唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、それは親和（アーティファクト）を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c78bf1a7-7186-441f-8a90-449d66bb9df2\', \'multiverseId\': 605555}, \'multiverseid\': 605555}, {\'name\': \'熔炉暴君齐歌利\', \'text\': \'神器共鸣\\n飞行，敏捷\\n每当熔炉暴君齐歌利攻击时，放逐你牌库顶的五张牌。本回合中，你可以从其中施放一个神器咒语。若你如此作，则它具有神器共鸣异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4bba3da-a795-4684-89d0-09be921f7e69\', \'multiverseId\': 605567}, \'multiverseid\': 605567}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromatische Laterne\', \'text\': \'Länder, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Nach Gildentradition kann jeder Fleck mehrfarbigen Lichts auf Kopfsteinpflaster als neutraler Boden dienen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605983&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9ff1567-398b-482d-b2f4-9e00669e6642\', \'multiverseId\': 605983}, \'multiverseid\': 605983}, {\'name\': \'Linterna cromática\', \'text\': \'Las tierras que controlas tienen "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Por tradición gremial, cualquier cerco de luz multicolor que haya sobre los adoquines puede usarse como terreno neutral.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a318641-6f53-4664-b81f-4c3eb0c7c250\', \'multiverseId\': 606099}, \'multiverseid\': 606099}, {\'name\': \'Lanterne chromatique\', \'text\': \'Les terrains que vous contrôlez ont : « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Selon la tradition de la guilde, toute flaque de lumière multicolore sur les pavés peut faire office de terrain neutre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606215&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f4926e9-0daf-4e91-99a0-4ba653481430\', \'multiverseId\': 606215}, \'multiverseid\': 606215}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromatica\', \'text\': \'Le terre che controlli hanno "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'La tradizione delle gilde vuole che qualsiasi macchia di luce multicolore sul selciato possa fungere da territorio neutrale.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9c4e500-9440-4993-a125-01e407f3fe16\', \'multiverseId\': 606331}, \'multiverseid\': 606331}, {\'name\': \'彩色の灯籠\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地は「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ギルドの伝統により、多色の光が落ちる石畳は中立地域とされる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb4f6036-ba0e-4061-a17b-8cf77aeb580b\', \'multiverseId\': 606447}, \'multiverseid\': 606447}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromática\', \'text\': \'Os terrenos que você controla têm: "{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Pela tradição da guilda, qualquer facho de luz multicolorida no paralelepípedo pode servir como território neutro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ef866f3-8a63-44fd-b6a9-580b7ad117a1\', \'multiverseId\': 606563}, \'multiverseid\': 606563}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dankbare Erscheinung\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn die Dankbare Erscheinung einem Spieler oder Planeswalker Kampfschaden zufügt, führe Wucherung durch. (Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern und gib ihnen dann von jeder Sorte Marke, die dort bereits liegt, eine weitere Marke.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605929&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e7cea05-3be9-471f-954e-8e74e8d590a8\', \'multiverseId\': 605929}, \'multiverseid\': 605929}, {\'name\': \'Aparición agradecida\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que la Aparición agradecida haga daño de combate a un jugador o planeswalker, prolifera. (Elige cualquier cantidad de permanentes y/o jugadores, luego pon sobre cada uno un contador de cada tipo que ya tenga.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83dfb097-56cb-460a-96c7-cbe66025b2cf\', \'multiverseId\': 606045}, \'multiverseid\': 606045}, {\'name\': \'Apparition reconnaissante\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Apparition reconnaissante inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur ou à un planeswalker, proliférez. (Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents et/ou de joueurs, puis donnez-leur à chacun un autre marqueur de chaque sorte déjà présente.)", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606161&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5c1e1c9-5492-402b-b9dc-f42433ab583d\', \'multiverseId\': 606161}, \'multiverseid\': 606161}, {\'name\': \'Apparizione Riconoscente\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Apparizione Riconoscente infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore o a un planeswalker, prolifera. (Scegli un qualsiasi numero di permanenti e/o giocatori, poi metti su ognuno un altro segnalino di ogni tipo già presente.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b12751a2-5352-4571-8c36-ebe3f1272a36\', \'multiverseId\': 606277}, \'multiverseid\': 606277}, {\'name\': \'奉謝の亡霊\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n奉謝の亡霊がプレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、増殖を行う。（望む数のパーマネントやプレイヤーを選び、すでにそこにあるカウンター１種類につき、そのカウンターをもう１個与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'678599db-ab6a-422c-9438-792f6955c90d\', \'multiverseId\': 606393}, \'multiverseid\': 606393}, {\'name\': \'Aparição Grata\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Aparição Grata causar dano de combate a um jogador ou planeswalker, prolifere. (Escolha qualquer número de permanentes e/ou jogadores. Em seguida, dê a cada um deles outro marcador de cada tipo que eles já tenham.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38dcb16d-48a8-489b-a45e-bcbb2284ae4c\', \'multiverseId\': 606509}, \'multiverseid\': 606509}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die innere Bestie\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Ihr Beherrscher erzeugt einen 3/3 grünen Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Tötet die Schwachen, damit sie die Starken nicht auf ihre Stufe hinunterziehen können. Das ist wahres Mitgefühl."\\n—Benzir, Erzdruide des Macht-Tempels\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605960&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd3eb223-1796-4a7e-aa03-c3f8e9dd60b0\', \'multiverseId\': 605960}, \'multiverseid\': 605960}, {\'name\': \'La bestia interior\', \'text\': \'Destruye el permanente objetivo. Su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Maten a los débiles para que no arrastren a los fuertes a su nivel. Eso es verdadera compasión".\\n—Benzir, archidruida del Templo del Poder\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1735b0be-3593-4d8b-a6d2-6a30912fc70c\', \'multiverseId\': 606076}, \'multiverseid\': 606076}, {\'name\': \'Réveiller la bête\', \'text\': \'Détruisez un permanent ciblé. Son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Bête.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Tuer les faibles pour éviter qu\'ils n\'entraînent les plus forts dans leur chute. C\'est ça, la véritable compassion. »\\n—Benzir, archidruide du Temple de la Prépotence", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606192&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd68248d-c5d3-423d-ae41-9805dced737f\', \'multiverseId\': 606192}, \'multiverseid\': 606192}, {\'name\': \'Bestia Interiore\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un permanente bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea una pedina creatura Bestia 3/3 verde.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Uccidere i deboli così che non possano trascinare i forti al loro livello. Questa è la vera compassione."\\n—Benzir, arcidruido del Tempio Possente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cff134d-3b25-471b-b0e7-6df84fecd630\', \'multiverseId\': 606308}, \'multiverseid\': 606308}, {\'name\': \'内にいる獣\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは緑の３/３のビースト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「弱き者を殺せ。強き者をその域に落とさせぬために。これぞ真の慈悲だ。」\\n――力の寺院の大ドルイド、ベンジア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb6296b6-f053-4e3f-afc0-7df35af82a91\', \'multiverseId\': 606424}, \'multiverseid\': 606424}, {\'name\': \'Fera Interior\', \'text\': \'Destrua a permanente alvo. Seu controlador cria uma ficha de criatura Besta verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Matar os fracos para que eles não possam arrastar os fortes para o seu nível. Essa é a verdadeira compaixão."\\n— Benzir, arqueodruida do Templo do Poder\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ad1df86-ab66-4a6b-ac70-939e5ef92248\', \'multiverseId\': 606540}, \'multiverseid\': 606540}]', "[{'name': 'Elesh Norns Annex', 'text': '({W/P} kann entweder mit {W} oder 2 Lebenspunkten bezahlt werden.)\\nKreaturen können weder dich noch Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {W/P} für jede der Kreaturen.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605939&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e31c6565-00a7-444f-aacd-253e3024a1b0', 'multiverseId': 605939}, 'multiverseid': 605939}, {'name': 'Anexo de Norn', 'text': '({W/P} puede pagarse con {W} o 2 vidas.)\\nLas criaturas no pueden atacarte a ti o a planeswalkers que controlas a menos que su controlador pague {W/P} por cada una de esas criaturas.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606055&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa7d5d5c-d841-4021-871a-1b8499b1d04f', 'multiverseId': 606055}, 'multiverseid': 606055}, {'name': 'Annexe de Norn', 'text': '({W/P} peut être payé au choix avec {W} ou 2 points de vie.)\\nLes créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer ou attaquer des planeswalkers que vous contrôlez à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {W/P} pour chacune de ces créatures.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606171&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e03bb99-8c29-4db2-b400-f8663b9d50f2', 'multiverseId': 606171}, 'multiverseid': 606171}, {'name': 'Annessione di Norn', 'text': '({W/P} può essere pagato con {W} o con 2 punti vita.)\\nLe creature non possono attaccare te o i planeswalker che controlli a meno che il loro controllore non paghi {W/P} per ognuna di quelle creature.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606287&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '046c3d2a-9c42-47b6-9d08-fed450af37b6', 'multiverseId': 606287}, 'multiverseid': 606287}, {'name': 'ノーンの別館', 'text': '（{W/P}は{W}でも２点のライフでも支払うことができる。）\\nプレイヤーは、あなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃する、自分がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき{W/P}を支払わないかぎり、攻撃できない。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606403&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2113d921-5565-4e13-941b-7b793ad410d4', 'multiverseId': 606403}, 'multiverseid': 606403}, {'name': 'Anexo de Norn', 'text': '({W/P} pode ser pago com {W} ou 2 pontos de vida.)\\nAs criaturas não podem atacar você nem planeswalkers que você controla, a menos que seu controlador pague {W/P} para cada uma daquelas criaturas.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606519&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fccee7e7-eecb-41b1-bea4-bd4df575c155', 'multiverseId': 606519}, 'multiverseid': 606519}]", '[{\'name\': \'Elesh Norns Chormeister\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Erstschlag\\nImmer wenn ein Kommandeur, den du kontrollierst, ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, führe Wucherung durch. (Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern und gib ihnen dann von jeder Sorte Marke, die dort bereits liegt, eine weitere Marke.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605706&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c50e7581-c599-47ba-b46e-60aee75af05e\', \'multiverseId\': 605706}, \'multiverseid\': 605706}, {\'name\': \'Director de coro de Norn\', \'text\': \'Vuela, daña primero.\\nSiempre que un comandante que controlas entre al campo de batalla o ataque, prolifera. (Elige cualquier cantidad de permanentes y/o jugadores, luego pon sobre cada uno un contador de cada tipo que ya tenga.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel pirexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59d371de-cf6a-4df4-a92b-8cc25d9f6366\', \'multiverseId\': 605722}, \'multiverseid\': 605722}, {\'name\': \'Maître de chapelle de Norn\', \'text\': "Vol, initiative\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un commandant que vous contrôlez arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, proliférez. (Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents et/ou de joueurs, puis donnez-leur à chacun un autre marqueur de chaque sorte déjà présente.)", \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605738&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78b06d82-efb9-47eb-a19c-7d1f5e3b65f3\', \'multiverseId\': 605738}, \'multiverseid\': 605738}, {\'name\': \'Maestro del Coro di Norn\', \'text\': \'Volare, attacco improvviso\\nOgniqualvolta un comandante che controlli entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, prolifera. (Scegli un qualsiasi numero di permanenti e/o giocatori, poi metti su ognuno un altro segnalino di ogni tipo già presente.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59f3fcfb-9f3c-4b0d-800c-0855e68f2b28\', \'multiverseId\': 605754}, \'multiverseid\': 605754}, {\'name\': \'ノーンの聖歌隊長\', \'text\': \'飛行、先制攻撃\\nあなたがコントロールしている統率者１体が戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、増殖を行う。（望む数のパーマネントやプレイヤーを選び、すでにそこにあるカウンター１種類につき、そのカウンターをもう１個与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bc04e5e-1610-459f-a8bf-131619373e79\', \'multiverseId\': 605770}, \'multiverseid\': 605770}, {\'name\': \'Mestre do Coro de Norn\', \'text\': \'Voar, iniciativa\\nToda vez que um comandante que você controla entrar no campo de batalha ou atacar, prolifere. (Escolha qualquer número de permanentes e/ou jogadores. Em seguida, dê a cada um deles outro marcador de cada tipo que eles já tenham.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Phyrexiano Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef0e3450-e40d-43f5-81c3-3639389f1e04\', \'multiverseId\': 605786}, \'multiverseid\': 605786}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elesh Norns Chormeister\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Erstschlag\\nImmer wenn ein Kommandeur, den du kontrollierst, ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, führe Wucherung durch.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605594&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a8750a2-8417-4b3f-9190-bd1af1e251c4\', \'multiverseId\': 605594}, \'multiverseid\': 605594}, {\'name\': \'Maître de chapelle de Norn\', \'text\': "Vol, initiative\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un commandant que vous contrôlez arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, proliférez.", \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605610&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b84c19ba-4eca-4a04-8280-4f60f0ae86aa\', \'multiverseId\': 605610}, \'multiverseid\': 605610}, {\'name\': \'ノーンの聖歌隊長\', \'text\': \'飛行、先制攻撃\\nあなたがコントロールしている統率者１体が戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、増殖を行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91f9559e-c7e3-4e06-b887-79183bbfa5a5\', \'multiverseId\': 605626}, \'multiverseid\': 605626}, {\'name\': \'艾蕾侬的合颂领\', \'text\': \'飞行，先攻\\n每当一个由你操控的指挥官进战场或攻击时，增殖。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～非瑞人／天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cac9c69f-0a4b-4b1d-b4d4-71e1c4b65001\', \'multiverseId\': 605642}, \'multiverseid\': 605642}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elesh Norns Dekret\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, dir Kampfschaden zufügen, erhält jener Gegner eine Giftmarke.\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler angreift und falls ein oder mehrere Spieler, die angegriffen werden, vergiftet sind, zieht der angreifende Spieler eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605595&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c776192b-246f-40c8-b9f0-2ad7d105724f\', \'multiverseId\': 605595}, \'multiverseid\': 605595}, {\'name\': \'Décret de Norn\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle vous inflige des blessures de combat, cet adversaire gagne un marqueur « poison ».\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur attaque, si au moins un joueur qui est attaqué est empoisonné, le joueur attaquant pioche une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605611&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7409d2bc-40a8-4b31-a234-f87b19ba099d\', \'multiverseId\': 605611}, \'multiverseid\': 605611}, {\'name\': \'ノーンの命令\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーがあなたに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、その対戦相手は毒カウンター１個を得る。\\nプレイヤー１人が攻撃するたび、攻撃されている１人以上のプレイヤーが毒を受けている場合、その攻撃プレイヤーはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35919908-a6a8-4529-a110-5d8593c23edb\', \'multiverseId\': 605627}, \'multiverseid\': 605627}, {\'name\': \'艾蕾侬的裁决\', \'text\': \'每当由对手操控的一个或数个生物对你造成战斗伤害时，该对手得到一个中毒指示物。\\n每当任一牌手攻击时，若受攻击的牌手有一位或多位已中毒，则该攻击牌手抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e973aeae-d079-40fd-ab9d-e16efc195801\', \'multiverseId\': 605643}, \'multiverseid\': 605643}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elesh Norns Dekret\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, dir Kampfschaden zufügen, erhält jener Gegner eine Giftmarke.\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler angreift und falls ein oder mehrere Spieler, die angegriffen werden, vergiftet sind, zieht der angreifende Spieler eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605707&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc14746d-9a33-40a0-a7be-90354be03528\', \'multiverseId\': 605707}, \'multiverseid\': 605707}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de Norn\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una o más criaturas que controla un oponente te hagan daño de combate, ese oponente obtiene un contador de veneno.\\nSiempre que un jugador ataque, si uno o más de los jugadores que están siendo atacados están envenenados, el jugador atacante roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29adbce3-40af-4402-9576-1b75458761a8\', \'multiverseId\': 605723}, \'multiverseid\': 605723}, {\'name\': \'Décret de Norn\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle vous inflige des blessures de combat, cet adversaire gagne un marqueur « poison ».\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur attaque, si au moins un joueur qui est attaqué est empoisonné, le joueur attaquant pioche une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605739&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb49b8b6-a36d-4947-a28b-55243880dd83\', \'multiverseId\': 605739}, \'multiverseid\': 605739}, {\'name\': \'Decreto di Norn\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una o più creature controllate da un avversario ti infliggono danno da combattimento, quell\'avversario ottiene un segnalino veleno.\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore attacca, se uno o più giocatori attaccati sono avvelenati, il giocatore attaccante pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59edb1c8-80e9-4fef-9c89-85649ddc7975\', \'multiverseId\': 605755}, \'multiverseid\': 605755}, {\'name\': \'ノーンの命令\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーがあなたに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、その対戦相手は毒カウンター１個を得る。\\nプレイヤー１人が攻撃するたび、攻撃されている１人以上のプレイヤーが毒を受けている場合、その攻撃プレイヤーはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'848fe401-a83d-498c-8955-009d001c2088\', \'multiverseId\': 605771}, \'multiverseid\': 605771}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de Norn\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma ou mais criaturas que um oponente controla causarem dano de combate a você, aquele oponente receberá um marcador de veneno.\\nToda vez que um jogador atacar, se um ou mais jogadores que estão sendo atacados estiverem envenenados, o jogador atacante comprará um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4204efa4-1770-4edc-896e-62fd65714e50\', \'multiverseId\': 605787}, \'multiverseid\': 605787}]', "[{'name': 'Elspeth Tirel', 'text': '+2: Du erhältst für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n−2: Erzeuge drei 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\n−5: Zerstöre alle anderen bleibenden Karten außer Ländern und Spielsteinen.', 'type': 'Legendärer Planeswalker — Elspeth', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605920&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2836da4-ab4b-4f45-bc94-cbaa4fbcaf87', 'multiverseId': 605920}, 'multiverseid': 605920}, {'name': 'Elspeth Tirel', 'text': '+2: Ganas 1 vida por cada criatura que controlas.\\n−2: Crea tres fichas de criatura Soldado blancas 1/1.\\n−5: Destruye todos los otros permanentes excepto tierras y fichas.', 'type': 'Planeswalker legendario — Elspeth', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606036&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30617f0d-f6fd-4b39-83ff-3ffc719e1fb9', 'multiverseId': 606036}, 'multiverseid': 606036}, {'name': 'Elspeth Tirel', 'text': '+2: Vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\n-2: Créez trois jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat.\\n-5: Détruisez tous les autres permanents excepté les terrains et les jetons.', 'type': 'Planeswalker légendaire : Elspeth', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606152&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '167e3197-38f5-4c38-b518-937b0c86d2a5', 'multiverseId': 606152}, 'multiverseid': 606152}, {'name': 'Elspeth Tirel', 'text': '+2: Guadagni 1 punto vita per ogni creatura che controlli.\\n−2: Crea tre pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche.\\n−5: Distruggi tutti gli altri permanenti tranne le terre e le pedine.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Leggendario — Elspeth', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606268&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b07b2897-4b4b-419a-9c0a-f1e9fc4ed525', 'multiverseId': 606268}, 'multiverseid': 606268}, {'name': 'エルズペス・ティレル', 'text': '+2：あなたは、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき１点のライフを得る。\\n−2：白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークン３体を生成する。\\n-5：土地でもトークンでもこれでもないすべてのパーマネントを破壊する。', 'type': '伝説のプレインズウォーカー — エルズペス', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606384&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cfc92040-b033-4a96-b329-3c7804efdd62', 'multiverseId': 606384}, 'multiverseid': 606384}, {'name': 'Elspeth Tirel', 'text': '+2: Você ganha 1 ponto de vida para cada criatura que você controla.\\n−2: Crie três fichas de criatura Soldado branca 1/1.\\n−5: Destrua todas as outras permanentes, exceto terrenos e fichas.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Lendário — Elspeth', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606500&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c17b168d-baff-4a14-b5f0-3104c293a119', 'multiverseId': 606500}, 'multiverseid': 606500}]", '[{\'name\': \'Emerias Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du einen 1/1 weißen Vogel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit erzeugen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Erde erbebt, wird es im Himmel voll.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605921&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b8ee018-ad95-4c57-bc26-8bbf62611055\', \'multiverseId\': 605921}, \'multiverseid\': 605921}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de Emeria\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes crear una ficha de criatura Ave blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando la tierra tiembla, el cielo desborda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8336211e-b1a4-496c-b207-cb24bec4a2fd\', \'multiverseId\': 606037}, \'multiverseid\': 606037}, {\'name\': "Ange d\'Éméria", \'text\': "Vol\\nToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez créer un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Oiseau avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': \'Quand la terre tremble, le ciel déborde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606153&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'919eae39-162a-490a-a301-37111c3935c1\', \'multiverseId\': 606153}, \'multiverseid\': 606153}, {\'name\': \'Angelo di Emeria\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi creare una pedina creatura Uccello 1/1 bianca con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando la terra freme, il cielo straripa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f664eedb-5bba-48f3-aa78-4d13e635fd45\', \'multiverseId\': 606269}, \'multiverseid\': 606269}, {\'name\': \'エメリアの天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは飛行を持つ白の１/１の鳥・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'地が震えるとき、空は溢れ返る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cb2a9a5-0a79-4736-a467-2b22f8070895\', \'multiverseId\': 606385}, \'multiverseid\': 606385}, {\'name\': \'Anjo de Emeria\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode criar uma ficha de criatura Ave branca 1/1 com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando a terra estremece, o céu transborda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e655110f-e024-4b3d-9747-05ea828b417a\', \'multiverseId\': 606501}, \'multiverseid\': 606501}]', "[{'name': 'Erhabenes Scheinbild', 'text': 'Wenn das Erhabene Scheinbild ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\\nWenn das Erhabene Scheinbild stirbt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605997&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ee88a1a-2526-4283-aca8-1d41489725b7', 'multiverseId': 605997}, 'multiverseid': 605997}, {'name': 'Simulacro solemne', 'text': 'Cuando el Simulacro solemne entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, poner esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar.\\nCuando el Simulacro solemne muera, puedes robar una carta.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Gólem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606113&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'acc64b61-6ec7-4885-84b7-5899576392ff', 'multiverseId': 606113}, 'multiverseid': 606113}, {'name': 'Simulacre solennel', 'text': 'Quand le Simulacre solennel arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher une carte de terrain de base dans votre bibliothèque, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.\\nQuand le Simulacre solennel meurt, vous pouvez piocher une carte.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606229&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a957178-4110-4626-98c3-38c36517851b', 'multiverseId': 606229}, 'multiverseid': 606229}, {'name': 'Simulacro Solenne', 'text': 'Quando il Simulacro Solenne entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare.\\nQuando il Simulacro Solenne muore, puoi pescare una carta.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606345&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ba2f943-8dd0-4e0d-9311-518439bb22c6', 'multiverseId': 606345}, 'multiverseid': 606345}, {'name': '真面目な身代わり', 'text': '真面目な身代わりが戦場に出たとき、「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n真面目な身代わりが死亡したとき、カード１枚を引いてもよい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606461&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '049858b7-f59f-4e7b-8692-dbd63131b5f3', 'multiverseId': 606461}, 'multiverseid': 606461}, {'name': 'Simulacro Solene', 'text': 'Quando Simulacro Solene entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhar.\\nQuando Simulacro Solene morre, você pode comprar um card.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606577&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5125af51-8067-469d-8508-b6254d573c1c', 'multiverseId': 606577}, 'multiverseid': 606577}]", '[{\'name\': \'Erinnerungsmaske\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du zwei Karten ziehen. Falls du dies tust, wirf eine Karte ab.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605992&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'173fc4ce-d940-4e99-b613-dc9e37e049d5\', \'multiverseId\': 605992}, \'multiverseid\': 605992}, {\'name\': \'Máscara de la memoria\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura equipada haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes robar dos cartas. Si lo haces, descarta una carta.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d995dad9-04df-45b2-a442-d5ed301bd143\', \'multiverseId\': 606108}, \'multiverseid\': 606108}, {\'name\': \'Masque de la mémoire\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez piocher deux cartes. Si vous faites ainsi, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nÉquipement {1}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606224&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7832e00-2cbf-48da-8798-9ba513982fb6\', \'multiverseId\': 606224}, \'multiverseid\': 606224}, {\'name\': \'Maschera della Memoria\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi pescare due carte. Se lo fai, scarta una carta.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db13f3ed-c8c7-46e5-a159-f55c88d46b28\', \'multiverseId\': 606340}, \'multiverseid\': 606340}, {\'name\': \'記憶の仮面\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはカード２枚を引いてもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を捨てる。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'502f8073-53b4-43d1-a4d2-1f33acdea4c9\', \'multiverseId\': 606456}, \'multiverseid\': 606456}, {\'name\': \'Máscara da Memória\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que a criatura equipada causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode comprar dois cards. Se fizer isso, descarte um card.\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6df4aba-6291-481e-bf28-0b65ff188786\', \'multiverseId\': 606572}, \'multiverseid\': 606572}]', '[{\'name\': \'Exotischer Obstgarten\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Das war ein seltsamer Morgen. Als wir aufwachten, hatten sich unsere Bäume verwandelt. Wir wussten nicht, ob wir sie gießen oder polieren sollten."\\n—Pulan, Hainpfleger aus Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606008&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daebca25-2843-4090-a917-add0db9cb029\', \'multiverseId\': 606008}, \'multiverseid\': 606008}, {\'name\': \'Huerto exótico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color que pueda producir una tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Fue una mañana extraña. Cuando despertamos, encontramos nuestros árboles transformados. No sabíamos si regarlos o lustrarlos".\\n—Pulan, jardinero de Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46c1e99a-94ef-4fd5-bced-b4bea12796f3\', \'multiverseId\': 606124}, \'multiverseid\': 606124}, {\'name\': \'Verger exotique\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix qu\'un terrain qu\'un adversaire contrôle pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« C\'était une étrange matinée. Quand nous nous sommes réveillés, nos arbres avaient été transformés. Nous ne savions plus si nous devions les arroser ou les polir. »\\n—Pulan, arboriste de Bant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606240&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77e84ad8-674d-42f5-8e26-4cdea940c30a\', \'multiverseId\': 606240}, \'multiverseid\': 606240}, {\'name\': \'Frutteto Esotico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore che una terra controllata da un avversario potrebbe produrre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Era una strana mattina. Quando ci siamo svegliati, abbiamo trovato i nostri alberi completamente trasformati. Non sapevamo più se innaffiarli o lucidarli."\\n—Pulan, agricoltore di Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'520ea60a-8979-4f6c-83a7-c5f9759b3b98\', \'multiverseId\': 606356}, \'multiverseid\': 606356}, {\'name\': \'風変わりな果樹園\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手がコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「変な朝だったよ。起きたら、俺らの樹が変わっちまってたんだ。水やったらいいのか磨いたらいいのかわかんなくってな。」\\n――バントの果樹園主、プーラン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d56cb0b8-61be-4f8a-a474-7e49b6f48368\', \'multiverseId\': 606472}, \'multiverseid\': 606472}, {\'name\': \'Pomar Exótico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor que um terreno controlado por um oponente possa gerar.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Foi uma manhã estranha. Quando acordamos, encontramos nossas árvores transformadas. Não sabíamos se deveriam ser regadas ou polidas."\\n— Pulan, pomareiro de Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1f2b2cb-4b2c-4172-8575-31028c574b7a\', \'multiverseId\': 606588}, \'multiverseid\': 606588}]', '[{\'name\': \'Felidar-Zuflucht\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Katze-Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n• Lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke. Die Kreaturen erhalten Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605922&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14c4b9d3-9303-4850-9eb6-7c642bafda57\', \'multiverseId\': 605922}, \'multiverseid\': 605922}, {\'name\': \'Refugio de felidares\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, elige uno:\\n• Crea una ficha de criatura Bestia Felino blanca 2/2.\\n• Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas. Esas criaturas ganan la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'258d7a2f-13fc-4a7c-81d4-83ce50d843c8\', \'multiverseId\': 606038}, \'multiverseid\': 606038}, {\'name\': \'Refuge félidar\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Chat et Bête.\\n• Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez. Ces créatures acquièrent la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606154&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6760fbc4-98e5-479b-825a-0b378bb5bc69\', \'multiverseId\': 606154}, \'multiverseid\': 606154}, {\'name\': \'Rifugio dei Felidar\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, scegli uno —\\n• Crea una pedina creatura Bestia Felino 2/2 bianca.\\n• Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli. Quelle creature hanno cautela fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c55a7d90-a197-430c-abd9-673ae423a6e3\', \'multiverseId\': 606270}, \'multiverseid\': 606270}, {\'name\': \'フェリダーの撤退\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・白の２/２の猫・ビースト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n・あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上に、それぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それらのクリーチャーは警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'108d5690-48a2-4331-a32e-f0d5fb407586\', \'multiverseId\': 606386}, \'multiverseid\': 606386}, {\'name\': \'Refúgio dos Felidares\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, escolha um —\\n• Crie uma ficha de criatura Felino Besta branca 2/2.\\n• Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla. Aquelas criaturas ganham vigilância até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f62b367-27a7-45b9-83ed-f7322ff21e7f\', \'multiverseId\': 606502}, \'multiverseid\': 606502}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fellwarstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Was besitzt du, das ich nicht erlangen kann?"\\n—Mairsil der Täuscher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605986&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc2569ac-a9b2-40d9-ac96-3e185626f78f\', \'multiverseId\': 605986}, \'multiverseid\': 605986}, {\'name\': \'Piedra de Fellwar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color que pueda producir una tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué tienes que yo no pueda obtener?".\\n—Mairsil, el Usurpador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b04526d0-a5fc-4af3-ac70-6d6e9d9ba52b\', \'multiverseId\': 606102}, \'multiverseid\': 606102}, {\'name\': \'Pierre de Guermont\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix qu\'un terrain qu\'un adversaire contrôle pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'avez-vous que je ne puisse obtenir ? »\\n—Mairsil, le prétendant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606218&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6341611-e713-4b9a-8aef-0be80a11f366\', \'multiverseId\': 606218}, \'multiverseid\': 606218}, {\'name\': \'Pietra Fellwar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore che una terra controllata da un avversario potrebbe produrre.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Cos\\\'hai tu che io non posso ottenere?"\\n—Mairsil, il Pretendente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8edffc0-4d3e-4552-9043-3cf0d6c0f783\', \'multiverseId\': 606334}, \'multiverseid\': 606334}, {\'name\': \'友なる石\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手がコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「お前は、私が手に入れられない何を持っているのだ？」\\n――偽善者、メアシル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb261d87-d042-4e7c-a712-3a8761130274\', \'multiverseId\': 606450}, \'multiverseid\': 606450}, {\'name\': \'A Pedra Fellwar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor que um terreno controlado por um oponente possa gerar.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"O que você tem que eu não possa obter?"\\n— Mairsil, o Impostor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d1fa9a0-3b05-4f5f-af5e-954fd165406d\', \'multiverseId\': 606566}, \'multiverseid\': 606566}]', '[{\'name\': \'Festung der Monstertöter\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{R}{W}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+0, Wachsamkeit und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ihr Hof ist zu jeder Stunde des Tages beleuchtet, damit die Nacht niemals in ihren Mauern Einzug hält.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606021&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd1c9900-e17e-4e90-bb01-9fdab43bbc00\', \'multiverseId\': 606021}, \'multiverseid\': 606021}, {\'name\': \'Fortaleza de asesinos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{R}{W}, {T}: La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+0 y gana las habilidades de vigilancia y prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Sus patios están iluminados en todo momento para que nunca caiga la noche entre sus muros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cad93196-5049-4b26-9767-529acc5af9b0\', \'multiverseId\': 606137}, \'multiverseid\': 606137}, {\'name\': \'Forteresse des tueurs\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{R}{W}, {T} : Une créature ciblée gagne +2/+0 et acquiert la vigilance et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Ses cours intérieures sont éclairées à toute heure, de façon que la nuit ne tombe jamais entre ses murs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606253&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e30a96bf-7e84-44bd-9c50-1112a9629dcf\', \'multiverseId\': 606253}, \'multiverseid\': 606253}, {\'name\': \'Fortezza degli Assassini\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{R}{W}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+0 e ha cautela e rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'I suoi cortili sono illuminati a ogni ora del giorno, affinché la notte non possa mai penetrare le sue mura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07ac379a-dc46-4928-9383-893c40193adc\', \'multiverseId\': 606369}, \'multiverseid\': 606369}, {\'name\': \'処刑者の要塞\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{R}{W}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受け警戒と速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'壁の隙間にすら夜を忍び込ませまいと、その庭は常に灯りに照らされている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c05384e0-660f-4992-b321-e1431ace02c8\', \'multiverseId\': 606485}, \'multiverseid\': 606485}, {\'name\': \'Fortaleza dos Matadores\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{R}{W}, {T}: A criatura alvo recebe +2/+0 e ganha vigilância e ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Seus pátios estão sempre iluminados para que a noite jamais penetre suas muralhas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57a989a0-bd6a-4687-aec1-3daed71d2e19\', \'multiverseId\': 606601}, \'multiverseid\': 606601}]', '[{\'name\': \'Finale des Ruhms\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge X 2/2 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Wachsamkeit. Falls X gleich 10 oder mehr ist, erzeuge außerdem X 4/4 weiße Engel-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit und Wachsamkeit.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Der Himmel über der Zitadelle brodelte dunkel und unheilvoll. Dann kamen die Engel und mit ihnen das Licht der Hoffnung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605923&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d388d800-d5f6-4d2d-a496-2bed615b704e\', \'multiverseId\': 605923}, \'multiverseid\': 605923}, {\'name\': \'Final de gloria\', \'text\': \'Crea X fichas de criatura Soldado blancas 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia. Si X es 10 o más, crea también X fichas de criatura Ángel blancas 4/4 con las habilidades de volar y vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El cielo hervía sobre la ciudadela, entre la oscuridad y el desaliento, cuando los ángeles trajeron el alba.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eb0da7b-6644-4212-b1f7-4900946317c6\', \'multiverseId\': 606039}, \'multiverseid\': 606039}, {\'name\': \'Summum de la gloire\', \'text\': \'Créez X jetons de créature 2/2 blanche Soldat avec la vigilance. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 10, créez aussi X jetons de créature 4/4 blanche Ange avec le vol et la vigilance.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Le ciel pesait sur la citadelle, sombre et funeste. Puis, les anges firent percer l\'aube.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606155&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7c66105-129e-41af-9574-dddea80e7eec\', \'multiverseId\': 606155}, \'multiverseid\': 606155}, {\'name\': \'Finale di Gloria\', \'text\': \'Crea X pedine creatura Soldato 2/2 bianche con cautela. Se X è pari o superiore a 10, crea anche X pedine creatura Angelo 4/4 bianche con volare e cautela.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Il cielo ribollì sulla cittadella, oscuro e sinistro. Poi gli angeli portarono l\'alba.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4680e25a-71b5-48fc-b602-a29e1fdcc13b\', \'multiverseId\': 606271}, \'multiverseid\': 606271}, {\'name\': \'栄光の終焉\', \'text\': \'警戒を持つ白の２/２の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘが10以上であるなら、飛行と警戒を持つ白の４/４の天使・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体も生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'城塞の上空では恐怖と暗黒が最高潮に達した。すると、天使たちが夜明けを運んできた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7b0077b-10cb-444f-a953-f8dd76213965\', \'multiverseId\': 606387}, \'multiverseid\': 606387}, {\'name\': \'Final de Glória\', \'text\': \'Crie X fichas de criatura Soldado branca 2/2 com vigilância. Se X for igual ou superior a 10, crie também X fichas de criatura Anjo branca 4/4 com voar e vigilância.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O céu ferveu sobre a cidadela, escuro e atroz. E então os anjos trouxeram a aurora.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66a576ed-cce0-4306-addb-f49e5ae3c734\', \'multiverseId\': 606503}, \'multiverseid\': 606503}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fäulnismamba\', \'text\': \'Infizieren (Diese Kreatur fügt Schaden in Form von -1/-1-Marken für Kreaturen und von Giftmarken für Spieler zu.)\\n{1}{G}: Regeneriere die Fäulnismamba. (Das nächste Mal, dass diese Kreatur zerstört würde, tappe sie stattdessen, entferne sie aus dem Kampf und heile allen auf ihr vermerkten Schaden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Ophis\', \'flavor\': \'In ihrem Gift pulsiert der Hass Phyrexias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605961&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a13cafbe-0d6c-48b0-bfb2-d45ef2cec73a\', \'multiverseId\': 605961}, \'multiverseid\': 605961}, {\'name\': \'Mamba de ruina\', \'text\': \'Infectar. (Esta criatura hace daño a las criaturas en forma de contadores -1/-1 y a los jugadores en forma de contadores de veneno.)\\n{1}{G}: Regenera la Mamba de ruina. (La próxima vez que esta criatura fuese a ser destruida, en vez de eso, gírala, remuévela del combate y cura todo el daño que haya recibido.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Víbora pirexiano\', \'flavor\': \'Su veneno lleva el odio de Pirexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0796deed-c4cb-40ce-a2da-dcb7c290ae04\', \'multiverseId\': 606077}, \'multiverseid\': 606077}, {\'name\': \'Mamba du fléau\', \'text\': \'Infection (Cette créature inflige des blessures aux créatures sous la forme de marqueurs -1/-1 et aux joueurs sous la forme de marqueurs « poison ».)\\n{1}{G} : Régénérez le Mamba du fléau. (La prochaine fois que cette créature devrait être détruite, à la place, engagez-la, retirez-la du combat et retirez-lui toutes ses blessures.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et serpent\', \'flavor\': \'Son venin brûle avec la haine de Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606193&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81ce0d12-c614-4d59-82a1-bb09bb00f4ac\', \'multiverseId\': 606193}, \'multiverseid\': 606193}, {\'name\': \'Mamba Avvizzente\', \'text\': \'Infettare (Questa creatura infligge danno alle creature sotto forma di segnalini -1/-1 e ai giocatori sotto forma di segnalini veleno.)\\n{1}{G}: Rigenera il Mamba Avvizzente. (La prossima volta che questa creatura sta per essere distrutta, invece TAPpala, rimuovila dal combattimento e cura tutti i suoi danni.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Serpente Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': "Il suo veleno gronda dell\'odio di Phyrexia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51902809-1c66-4964-a5e7-beacc56f18a3\', \'multiverseId\': 606309}, \'multiverseid\': 606309}, {\'name\': \'荒廃のマンバ\', \'text\': \'感染（このクリーチャーはダメージを、クリーチャーには－１/－１カウンターの形で、プレイヤーには毒カウンターの形で与える。）\\n{1}{G}：荒廃のマンバを再生する。（このクリーチャーが次に破壊されるなら、代わりに、これをタップし、戦闘から取り除き、これが負っているすべてのダメージを回復する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・蛇\', \'flavor\': \'その毒からはファイレクシアの憎悪が滴る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b1e1b7d-5f72-4337-93d4-59a08b5d5f38\', \'multiverseId\': 606425}, \'multiverseid\': 606425}, {\'name\': \'Mamba Assoladora\', \'text\': \'Infectar (Esta criatura causa dano a criaturas na forma de marcadores -1/-1 e a jogadores na forma de marcadores de veneno.)\\n{1}{G}: Regenere Mamba Assoladora. (Na próxima vez em que esta criatura seria destruída, em vez disso, vire-a, remova-a do combate e cure todo o dano marcado nela.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Phyrexiano Cobra\', \'flavor\': \'De seu veneno goteja o ódio de Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5057e450-04d1-4601-a212-acd9d3e8ef51\', \'multiverseId\': 606541}, \'multiverseid\': 606541}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gebrüll des Widerstands\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenspielsteine, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen angreifen, kannst du {1}{R} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erhalten Kreaturen, die deine Gegner und/oder Planeswalker, die sie kontrollieren, angreifen, +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605601&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'822e3d72-3230-423c-9f97-2c3af9c36d62\', \'multiverseId\': 605601}, \'multiverseid\': 605601}, {\'name\': \'Rugissement de résistance\', \'text\': "Les jetons de créature que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature attaque, vous pouvez payer {1}{R}. Si vous faites ainsi, les créatures qui attaquent vos adversaires et/ou les planeswalkers qu\'ils contrôlent gagnent +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605617&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf6fbca0-cf96-4770-81e5-9b74fff5d684\', \'multiverseId\': 605617}, \'multiverseid\': 605617}, {\'name\': \'抵抗の咆哮\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャー・トークンは速攻を持つ。\\n１体以上のクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、あなたは{1}{R}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、ターン終了時まで、対戦相手や対戦相手がコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃しているすべてのクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c36ff8d2-4114-44b4-9f37-dce63e7f7cec\', \'multiverseId\': 605633}, \'multiverseid\': 605633}, {\'name\': \'反抗咆哮\', \'text\': \'由你操控的衍生生物具有敏捷异能。\\n每当一个或数个生物攻击时，你可以支付{1}{R}。若你如此作，正向你对手和／或由其操控之鹏洛客进行攻击的生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9194b914-2580-4cc9-b63a-f39df4f14c2e\', \'multiverseId\': 605649}, \'multiverseid\': 605649}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gebrüll des Widerstands\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenspielsteine, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen angreifen, kannst du {1}{R} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erhalten Kreaturen, die deine Gegner und/oder Planeswalker, die sie kontrollieren, angreifen, +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605713&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a880073-edba-4ac8-83ab-ecbe687d6bfc\', \'multiverseId\': 605713}, \'multiverseid\': 605713}, {\'name\': \'Grito de resistencia\', \'text\': \'Las fichas de criatura que controlas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas ataquen, puedes pagar {1}{R}. Si lo haces, las criaturas que atacan a tus oponentes y/o a los planeswalkers que controlan obtienen +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cee2f0ac-3c4a-4d8c-9c2e-8726c1e4ab28\', \'multiverseId\': 605729}, \'multiverseid\': 605729}, {\'name\': \'Rugissement de résistance\', \'text\': "Les jetons de créature que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature attaque, vous pouvez payer {1}{R}. Si vous faites ainsi, les créatures qui attaquent vos adversaires et/ou les planeswalkers qu\'ils contrôlent gagnent +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605745&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f92970cd-8f39-4948-ab73-caa6b8b5e8d0\', \'multiverseId\': 605745}, \'multiverseid\': 605745}, {\'name\': \'Ruggito di Resistenza\', \'text\': \'Le pedine creatura che controlli hanno rapidità.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature attaccano, puoi pagare {1}{R}. Se lo fai, le creature che attaccano i tuoi avversari e/o i planeswalker controllati dai tuoi avversari prendono +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9373be07-e061-48a1-aee6-9200458e0a55\', \'multiverseId\': 605761}, \'multiverseid\': 605761}, {\'name\': \'抵抗の咆哮\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャー・トークンは速攻を持つ。\\n１体以上のクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、あなたは{1}{R}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、ターン終了時まで、対戦相手や対戦相手がコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃しているすべてのクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bfd0aa6-b4c2-4c7e-affa-1bade5d45125\', \'multiverseId\': 605777}, \'multiverseid\': 605777}, {\'name\': \'Rugido de Resistência\', \'text\': \'As fichas de criatura que você controla têm ímpeto.\\nToda vez que uma ou mais criaturas atacam, você pode pagar {1}{R}. Se fizer isso, as criaturas atacando seus oponentes e/ou os planeswalkers que eles controlam receberão +2/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ed8de55-cf84-441c-af81-b5bcc9f0cc5d\', \'multiverseId\': 605793}, \'multiverseid\': 605793}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere den Gedankenstein: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Was ist Mana anderes als Möglichkeit, eine Idee, der noch nicht Gestalt gegeben wurde?"\\n—Jhoira, Meisterbastlerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605993&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'292c5d9f-faae-4a2b-a6d0-c598b2dfb61f\', \'multiverseId\': 605993}, \'multiverseid\': 605993}, {\'name\': \'Piedra mental\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar la Piedra mental: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué es el maná sino una posibilidad, una idea a la que todavía no se ha dado forma?".\\n—Jhoira, maestra artífice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7022acb-1b5c-419f-b7ba-49cf266d84c3\', \'multiverseId\': 606109}, \'multiverseid\': 606109}, {\'name\': "Pierre de l\'esprit", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez la Pierre de l\'esprit : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'est-ce que le mana sinon une possibilité, une idée qui n\'a pas encore pris forme ? »\\n—Djoïra, maîtresse artificière", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606225&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61d1116f-953b-4515-a496-fe1dbc99dc9d\', \'multiverseId\': 606225}, \'multiverseid\': 606225}, {\'name\': \'Pietra della Mente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica la Pietra della Mente: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Cos\\\'è il mana se non una possibilità, un\\\'idea che ancora non ha preso forma?"\\n—Jhoira, maestra artefice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3ab25e9-ce77-4202-bfaf-7c42f8cdc257\', \'multiverseId\': 606341}, \'multiverseid\': 606341}, {\'name\': \'精神石\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, 精神石を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「マナはまだ形を成していない発想よ。それが可能性でなければ何だというの？」\\n――練達の工匠、ジョイラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d5e6b6c-d389-4f7a-a205-8bbaa40f556c\', \'multiverseId\': 606457}, \'multiverseid\': 606457}, {\'name\': \'Pedra da Mente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique Pedra da Mente: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"O que é o mana senão o possível, uma ideia à qual ainda não se deu forma?"\\n— Jhoira, mestre artífice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61d2638a-7b2b-4799-8f1e-0a904fd33d2f\', \'multiverseId\': 606573}, \'multiverseid\': 606573}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geschäft abschließen\', \'text\': \'Jeder Gegner zieht eine Karte. Dann ziehst du für jeden Gegner, der auf diese Weise eine Karte gezogen hat, eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Gib deine selbstsüchtigen Ambitionen auf und werde eins mit der fleischlichen Singularität."\\n—Elesh Norn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605919&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2eff4d0-4e9b-4ecc-9a35-dcd3c54993bd\', \'multiverseId\': 605919}, \'multiverseid\': 605919}, {\'name\': \'Cerrar el trato\', \'text\': \'Cada oponente roba una carta y luego robas una carta por cada oponente que robó una carta de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Deja tus ambiciones egoístas y sé uno con la Singularidad de la Carne".\\n—Elesh Norn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aac2a6e2-da84-443f-9664-9c61e030dab8\', \'multiverseId\': 606035}, \'multiverseid\': 606035}, {\'name\': \'Conclure un accord\', \'text\': \'Chaque adversaire pioche une carte, puis vous piochez une carte pour chaque adversaire qui a pioché une carte de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Abandonnez vos ambitions égoïstes et fusionnez avec la Singularité de la Chair. »\\n—Elesh Norn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606151&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a4ae3a8-a2a0-44ae-9408-848f93ddd493\', \'multiverseId\': 606151}, \'multiverseid\': 606151}, {\'name\': \'Stringere un Accordo\', \'text\': \'Ogni avversario pesca una carta, poi tu peschi una carta per ogni avversario che ha pescato una carta in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Abbandona le tue egoistiche ambizioni e unisciti alla Singolarità della Carne."\\n—Elesh Norn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'777c8a13-2a8f-41db-a5bd-f73a84e9a52b\', \'multiverseId\': 606267}, \'multiverseid\': 606267}, {\'name\': \'取り引き\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手はそれぞれカード１枚を引く。その後、あなたはこれによりカードを引いた対戦相手１人につき１枚のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「利己的な野望は棄てよ。そして肉体のシンギュラリティとひとつになるのだ。」\\n――エリシュ・ノーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dfa4147-9978-482f-97e0-75cb5e74f0ba\', \'multiverseId\': 606383}, \'multiverseid\': 606383}, {\'name\': \'Fazer um Acordo\', \'text\': \'Cada oponente compra um card, depois você compra um card para cada oponente que comprou um card dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Abandone suas ambições egoístas e una-se à Singularidade da Carne."\\n— Elesh Norn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f77b6147-000a-4b5a-bfb8-89645c8cc3d5\', \'multiverseId\': 606499}, \'multiverseid\': 606499}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gespenstisches Gefängnis\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen können dich nicht angreifen, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {2} für jede Kreatur, die er kontrolliert und die dich angreift.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Obwohl die Körper der Geister ätherisch waren, lernte Agnur bald, dass ihre Klingen ziemlich hart und scharf wie Rasiermesser waren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605927&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a3addc1-f6b3-4b8f-bebe-3920e55de3e0\', \'multiverseId\': 605927}, \'multiverseid\': 605927}, {\'name\': \'Prisión fantasmagórica\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas no pueden atacarte a menos que su controlador pague {2} por cada criatura que controla que te está atacando.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque los cuerpos de los espíritus eran etéreos, Agnur pronto cayó en la cuenta de que sus espadas eran muy sólidas... y afiladas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'908b9b91-cf79-414b-a518-ac95e4333c0b\', \'multiverseId\': 606043}, \'multiverseid\': 606043}, {\'name\': \'Prison fantomale\', \'text\': "Les créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {2} pour chaque créature qu\'il contrôle qui vous attaque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Les esprits avaient beau avoir un corps éthéré, Agnur découvrit bien assez tôt que leurs lames étaient bien matérielles, et bien aiguisées.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606159&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39a07c2e-038b-4d9a-8273-c1e825dcc6df\', \'multiverseId\': 606159}, \'multiverseid\': 606159}, {\'name\': \'Prigione Spettrale\', \'text\': \'Le creature non possono attaccarti a meno che il loro controllore non paghi {2} per ogni creatura che controlla che ti sta attaccando.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Anche se i corpi degli spiriti erano eterei, Agnur scoprì presto che le loro lame erano piuttosto solide... e affilate.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc921b36-f940-4ba3-a8c2-a6510cdec41f\', \'multiverseId\': 606275}, \'multiverseid\': 606275}, {\'name\': \'亡霊の牢獄\', \'text\': \'プレイヤーは、自分がコントロールしていてあなたを攻撃するクリーチャー１体につき{2}を支払わないかぎり、攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'その霊体は空気のようだったが、アグナーは程なくしてその剣が非常に硬く、そして非常に鋭いことを知った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5c79a93-f543-4872-bb95-be83fe2f6226\', \'multiverseId\': 606391}, \'multiverseid\': 606391}, {\'name\': \'Prisão Fantasmagórica\', \'text\': \'As criaturas não podem atacá-lo, a menos que seu controlador pague {2} para cada criatura que controla que está atacando você.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Embora os corpos dos espíritos fossem etéreos, Agnur descobriu rapidamente que suas lâminas eram bem sólidas. E igualmente afiadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b1b27cf-c484-4cb3-ac7b-c75175e15b75\', \'multiverseId\': 606507}, \'multiverseid\': 606507}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geths Ruf\', \'text\': \'Bringe bis zu eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nVerdorben — Bringe für jeden Gegner, der drei oder mehr Giftmarken hat, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bis zu eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus dessen Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605597&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94db5692-6862-4a87-b6ef-8a8cb6ab5c85\', \'multiverseId\': 605597}, \'multiverseid\': 605597}, {\'name\': \'Recrutement de Geth\', \'text\': "Renvoyez jusqu\'à une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière sur le champ de bataille.\\nCorrompu — Pour chaque adversaire qui a au moins trois marqueurs « poison » au moment où vous lancez ce sort, mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, jusqu\'à une carte de créature ciblée depuis le cimetière de ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605613&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'867b336e-aa42-4090-81ff-4aee3c3db01a\', \'multiverseId\': 605613}, \'multiverseid\': 605613}, {\'name\': \'ゲスの召喚\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード最大１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。\\n堕落 — この呪文を唱えるに際して３個以上の毒カウンターを持っている各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード最大１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cff3acd-d498-452b-aa47-18b629d004b0\', \'multiverseId\': 605629}, \'multiverseid\': 605629}, {\'name\': \'盖司的召唤\', \'text\': \'将至多一张目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n腐化～为每位于你施放此咒语时具有三个或更多中毒指示物的对手各进行以下流程～将至多一张目标生物牌在你的操控下从该牌手的坟墓场放进战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86e842c2-f4d8-4354-b6d6-e451626890ae\', \'multiverseId\': 605645}, \'multiverseid\': 605645}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geths Ruf\', \'text\': \'Bringe bis zu eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nVerdorben — Bringe für jeden Gegner, der drei oder mehr Giftmarken hat, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bis zu eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus dessen Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605709&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fd03329-7662-4082-9faa-a572f2c9f89b\', \'multiverseId\': 605709}, \'multiverseid\': 605709}, {\'name\': \'Invocaciones de Geth\', \'text\': \'Regresa hasta una carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\nCorrupto — Por cada oponente que tenga tres o más contadores de veneno en cuanto lances este hechizo, pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control hasta una carta de criatura objetivo del cementerio de ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11322c86-a8f2-4283-9484-10ff6217d6a7\', \'multiverseId\': 605725}, \'multiverseid\': 605725}, {\'name\': \'Recrutement de Geth\', \'text\': "Renvoyez jusqu\'à une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière sur le champ de bataille.\\nCorrompu — Pour chaque adversaire qui a au moins trois marqueurs « poison » au moment où vous lancez ce sort, mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, jusqu\'à une carte de créature ciblée depuis le cimetière de ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605741&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'688e32a9-89ef-4742-9603-ec131a060738\', \'multiverseId\': 605741}, \'multiverseid\': 605741}, {\'name\': \'Evocazioni di Geth\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia fino a una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\nCorrotto — Per ogni avversario che ha tre o più segnalini veleno mentre lanci questa magia, metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo fino a una carta creatura bersaglio dal cimitero di quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7db9618-ed5f-4505-a5a3-95ff0e5ddb2d\', \'multiverseId\': 605757}, \'multiverseid\': 605757}, {\'name\': \'ゲスの召喚\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード最大１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。\\n堕落 — この呪文を唱えるに際して３個以上の毒カウンターを持っている各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード最大１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81f5fe0f-f7ad-4876-92a0-a485393f4255\', \'multiverseId\': 605773}, \'multiverseid\': 605773}, {\'name\': \'Invocações de Geth\', \'text\': \'Devolva até um card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\\nCorrompido — Para cada oponente que tenha três ou mais marcadores de veneno quando você conjurar esta mágica, coloque até um card de criatura alvo do cemitério daquele jogador no campo de batalha sob seu controle.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68f8db55-9208-4cef-b9f5-aa44e360581f\', \'multiverseId\': 605789}, \'multiverseid\': 605789}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glimmerlinse\', \'text\': \'Für Mirrodin (Wenn diese Ausrüstung ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 2/2 roten Rebell-Kreaturenspielstein und lege sie dann an ihn an.)\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur und mindestens eine andere Kreatur angreifen, ziehe eine Karte.\\nAusrüsten {1}{W}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605704&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f3a14d9-ea79-4088-bb6b-036be5f15138\', \'multiverseId\': 605704}, \'multiverseid\': 605704}, {\'name\': \'Lente brillante\', \'text\': \'¡Por Mirrodin (Cuando este Equipo entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Rebelde roja 2/2 y luego anéxalo a ella.)\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada y al menos otra criatura ataquen, roba una carta.\\nEquipar {1}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee01f4d7-bb44-430c-8df3-10aa94c49b4a\', \'multiverseId\': 605720}, \'multiverseid\': 605720}, {\'name\': \'Lentille de lueur\', \'text\': \'Pour Mirrodin (Quand cet équipement arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 rouge Rebelle, puis attachez-lui cet équipement.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée et au moins une autre créature attaquent, piochez une carte.\\nÉquipement {1}{W}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605736&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'500d4c4f-391f-4da2-947d-003db36b98ca\', \'multiverseId\': 605736}, \'multiverseid\': 605736}, {\'name\': \'Lente Scintillante\', \'text\': "Per Mirrodin (Quando questo Equipaggiamento entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Ribelle 2/2 rossa, poi assegnalo ad essa.)\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata e almeno un\'altra creatura attaccano, pesca una carta.\\nEquipaggiare {1}{W}", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0d63f9a-3c92-4a44-ad37-f2819acbd3f7\', \'multiverseId\': 605752}, \'multiverseid\': 605752}, {\'name\': \'微光レンズ\', \'text\': \'ミラディンのために！（この装備品が戦場に出たとき、赤の２/２のレベル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成し、その後、これをそれにつける。）\\n装備しているクリーチャーと、それでない１体以上のクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、カード１枚を引く。\\n装備{1}{W}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57301072-c1d7-4db7-8432-a7fd4590a8a9\', \'multiverseId\': 605768}, \'multiverseid\': 605768}, {\'name\': \'Lente da Cintilação\', \'text\': \'Por Mirrodin (Quando este Equipamento entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Rebelde vermelha 2/2 e anexe-o a ela.)\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada e pelo menos uma outra criatura atacarem, compre um card.\\nEquipar {1}{W}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e2f5430-0478-40ac-ba2f-406860db6caf\', \'multiverseId\': 605784}, \'multiverseid\': 605784}]', "[{'name': 'Glimmerlinse', 'text': 'Für Mirrodin\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur und mindestens eine andere Kreatur angreifen, ziehe eine Karte.\\nAusrüsten {1}{W}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605592&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5834a8fe-d9c3-40c0-9011-b5ffa9564f87', 'multiverseId': 605592}, 'multiverseid': 605592}, {'name': 'Lentille de lueur', 'text': 'Pour Mirrodin\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée et au moins une autre créature attaquent, piochez une carte.\\nÉquipement {1}{W}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605608&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62fd4e6b-bf0b-4cac-913c-80209bf17cf2', 'multiverseId': 605608}, 'multiverseid': 605608}, {'name': '微光レンズ', 'text': 'ミラディンのために！\\n装備しているクリーチャーと、それでない１体以上のクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、カード１枚を引く。\\n装備{1}{W}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605624&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d09727b-d1f2-477d-a99e-9d9fd0a56bca', 'multiverseId': 605624}, 'multiverseid': 605624}, {'name': '烁光镜', 'text': '秘罗万岁！\\n每当佩带此武具的生物与至少另一个生物攻击时，抓一张牌。\\n佩带{1}{W}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605640&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a15a8a2-8bfa-466b-a27a-a94630f87bb4', 'multiverseId': 605640}, 'multiverseid': 605640}]", '[{\'name\': \'Glissas Bergungsbestie\', \'text\': \'Eile, Toxisch 3 (Spieler, denen von dieser Kreatur Kampfschaden zugefügt wird, erhalten außerdem drei Giftmarken.)\\nGlissas Bergungsbestie kann von Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger nicht geblockt werden.\\nVerdorben — Wenn Glissas Bergungsbestie stirbt, schicke sie ins Exil. Wenn du dies tust, bringe bis zu X Karten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Gegnern ist, die drei oder mehr Giftmarken haben.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605716&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff77cd58-b0f0-4b2c-8549-7e112431702c\', \'multiverseId\': 605716}, \'multiverseid\': 605716}, {\'name\': \'Recolector de Glissa\', \'text\': \'Prisa, tóxico 3. (Los jugadores que reciben daño de combate de esta criatura también obtienen tres contadores de veneno.)\\nEl Recolector de Glissa no puede ser bloqueado por criaturas con fuerza de 2 o menos.\\nCorrupto — Cuando el Recolector de Glissa muera, exílialo. Cuando lo hagas, regresa hasta X cartas objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano, donde X es la cantidad de oponentes que tienen tres o más contadores de veneno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia pirexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e72ea60e-440c-46e0-aaaa-6c65849f4fdc\', \'multiverseId\': 605732}, \'multiverseid\': 605732}, {\'name\': \'Récupérateur de Glissa\', \'text\': "Célérité, toxique 3 (Les joueurs qui subissent des blessures de combat de cette créature gagnent aussi trois marqueurs « poison ».)\\nLe Récupérateur de Glissa ne peut pas être bloqué par les créatures de force inférieure ou égale à 2.\\nCorrompu — Quand le Récupérateur de Glissa meurt, exilez-le. Quand vous faites ainsi, renvoyez dans votre main jusqu\'à X cartes ciblées depuis votre cimetière, X étant le nombre d\'adversaires qui ont au moins trois marqueurs « poison ».", \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605748&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d42e9831-0413-4704-bf79-c7e9315b5e7b\', \'multiverseId\': 605748}, \'multiverseid\': 605748}, {\'name\': \'Recuperatore di Glissa\', \'text\': \'Rapidità, tossico 3 (I giocatori a cui viene inflitto danno da combattimento da questa creatura ottengono anche tre segnalini veleno.)\\nIl Recuperatore di Glissa non può essere bloccato da creature con forza pari o inferiore a 2.\\nCorrotto — Quando il Recuperatore di Glissa muore, esilialo. Quando lo fai, riprendi in mano fino a X carte bersaglio dal tuo cimitero, dove X è il numero di avversari che hanno tre o più segnalini veleno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb90a010-1601-4122-bb7a-aa13f55889e5\', \'multiverseId\': 605764}, \'multiverseid\': 605764}, {\'name\': \'グリッサの回収者\', \'text\': \'速攻、毒性３（このクリーチャーから戦闘ダメージを受けたプレイヤーは追加で毒カウンター３個を得る。）\\nグリッサの回収者はパワーが２以下のクリーチャーにはブロックされない。\\n堕落 — グリッサの回収者が死亡したとき、これを追放する。そうしたとき、あなたの墓地にあるカード最大Ｘ枚を対象とする。それらをあなたの手札に戻す。Ｘは３個以上の毒カウンターを持つ対戦相手の人数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a169b78e-49ac-4de5-9b9d-5d0f035b886a\', \'multiverseId\': 605780}, \'multiverseid\': 605780}, {\'name\': \'Buscador de Glissa\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto, tóxico 3 (Os jogadores que sofrem dano de combate dessa criatura também recebem três marcadores de veneno.)\\nBuscador de Glissa não pode ser bloqueado por criaturas com poder igual ou inferior a 2.\\nCorrompido — Quando Buscador de Glissa morrer, exile-o. Quando fizer isso, devolva até X cards alvo do seu cemitério à sua mão, sendo X o número de oponentes que tiverem três ou mais marcadores de veneno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Phyrexiano Besta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63c44e33-ec9b-46e0-8e20-b5e046724054\', \'multiverseId\': 605796}, \'multiverseid\': 605796}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glissas Bergungsbestie\', \'text\': \'Eile, Toxisch 3\\nGlissas Bergungsbestie kann von Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger nicht geblockt werden.\\nVerdorben — Wenn Glissas Bergungsbestie stirbt, schicke sie ins Exil. Wenn du dies tust, bringe bis zu X Karten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Gegnern ist, die drei oder mehr Giftmarken haben.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605604&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'042b7548-201f-4b16-b703-0cacca4ecc30\', \'multiverseId\': 605604}, \'multiverseid\': 605604}, {\'name\': \'Récupérateur de Glissa\', \'text\': "Célérité, toxique 3\\nLe Récupérateur de Glissa ne peut pas être bloqué par les créatures de force inférieure ou égale à 2.\\nCorrompu — Quand le Récupérateur de Glissa meurt, exilez-le. Quand vous faites ainsi, renvoyez dans votre main jusqu\'à X cartes ciblées depuis votre cimetière, X étant le nombre d\'adversaires qui ont au moins trois marqueurs « poison ».", \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605620&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78e65693-8e93-49e6-9f1c-a35c91640af8\', \'multiverseId\': 605620}, \'multiverseid\': 605620}, {\'name\': \'グリッサの回収者\', \'text\': \'速攻、毒性３\\nグリッサの回収者はパワーが２以下のクリーチャーにはブロックされない。\\n堕落 — グリッサの回収者が死亡したとき、これを追放する。そうしたとき、あなたの墓地にあるカード最大Ｘ枚を対象とする。それらをあなたの手札に戻す。Ｘは３個以上の毒カウンターを持つ対戦相手の人数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25ee2175-a301-43d8-be93-272b29487256\', \'multiverseId\': 605636}, \'multiverseid\': 605636}, {\'name\': \'格莉莎的回收兽\', \'text\': \'敏捷，下毒3\\n格莉莎的回收兽不能被力量等于或小于2的生物阻挡。\\n腐化～当格莉莎的回收兽死去时，将它放逐。当你如此作时，将至多X张目标牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上，X为具有三个或更多中毒指示物的对手数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～非瑞人／野兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2d8f454-9b67-4e83-8641-8a20c4d4b0de\', \'multiverseId\': 605652}, \'multiverseid\': 605652}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glitzernde Sphäre\', \'text\': \'Die Glitzernde Sphäre kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Glitzernde Sphäre ins Spiel kommt, führe Wucherung durch.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\nVerdorben — {T}: Erzeuge drei Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls ein Gegner drei oder mehr Giftmarken hat.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605606&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91678d96-195e-4be7-b588-f7910c6f7f15\', \'multiverseId\': 605606}, \'multiverseid\': 605606}, {\'name\': \'Sphère luisante\', \'text\': "La Sphère luisante arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Sphère luisante arrive sur le champ de bataille, proliférez.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\nCorrompu — {T} : Ajoutez trois manas d\'une seule couleur de votre choix. N\'activez que si un adversaire a au moins trois marqueurs « poison ».", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605622&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fba437d0-41ab-47ef-8c0c-e53da827cd2b\', \'multiverseId\': 605622}, \'multiverseid\': 605622}, {\'name\': \'ぎらつく宝球\', \'text\': \'ぎらつく宝球はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nぎらつく宝球が戦場に出たとき、増殖を行う。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n堕落 — {T}：好きな色１色のマナ３点を加える。対戦相手１人が３個以上の毒カウンターを持っていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d39753c-1def-46c0-ac61-363928a519d3\', \'multiverseId\': 605638}, \'multiverseid\': 605638}, {\'name\': \'烁油法球\', \'text\': \'烁油法球须横置进战场。\\n当烁油法球进场时，增殖。\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n腐化～{T}：加三点任意颜色的单色法术力。只能于某对手具有三个或更多中毒指示物时起动。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3750e75e-caf4-4924-b1ae-743e10fb6cb8\', \'multiverseId\': 605654}, \'multiverseid\': 605654}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glitzernde Sphäre\', \'text\': \'Die Glitzernde Sphäre kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Glitzernde Sphäre ins Spiel kommt, führe Wucherung durch.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\nVerdorben — {T}: Erzeuge drei Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls ein Gegner drei oder mehr Giftmarken hat.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605718&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'369db8de-620a-4793-82a4-c8af63822171\', \'multiverseId\': 605718}, \'multiverseid\': 605718}, {\'name\': \'Esfera iridiscente\', \'text\': \'La Esfera iridiscente entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Esfera iridiscente entre al campo de batalla, prolifera.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\nCorrupto — {T}: Agrega tres manás de un color cualquiera. Activa esto solo si un oponente tiene tres o más contadores de veneno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc6203bf-df65-466a-a39a-b96bec7eb395\', \'multiverseId\': 605734}, \'multiverseid\': 605734}, {\'name\': \'Sphère luisante\', \'text\': "La Sphère luisante arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Sphère luisante arrive sur le champ de bataille, proliférez.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\nCorrompu — {T} : Ajoutez trois manas d\'une seule couleur de votre choix. N\'activez que si un adversaire a au moins trois marqueurs « poison ».", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605750&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b07b418-db82-42c4-ad08-54f6bbdf83a6\', \'multiverseId\': 605750}, \'multiverseid\': 605750}, {\'name\': \'Sfera Scintillante\', \'text\': \'La Sfera Scintillante entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Sfera Scintillante entra nel campo di battaglia, prolifera.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\nCorrotto — {T}: Aggiungi tre mana di un qualsiasi colore. Attiva solo se un avversario ha tre o più segnalini veleno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af9a8981-6eb6-4d48-9eb1-719b1c0bd0fe\', \'multiverseId\': 605766}, \'multiverseid\': 605766}, {\'name\': \'ぎらつく宝球\', \'text\': \'ぎらつく宝球はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nぎらつく宝球が戦場に出たとき、増殖を行う。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n堕落 — {T}：好きな色１色のマナ３点を加える。対戦相手１人が３個以上の毒カウンターを持っていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7be8f022-83be-49c5-a209-3816d672ee8b\', \'multiverseId\': 605782}, \'multiverseid\': 605782}, {\'name\': \'Esfera Brilhante\', \'text\': \'Esfera Brilhante entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Esfera Brilhante entrar no campo de batalha, prolifere.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\\nCorrompido — {T}: Adicione três manas de uma cor à sua escolha. Ative apenas se um oponente tiver três ou mais marcadores de veneno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed936ba6-149d-49fe-88c0-cf4b3f7feae9\', \'multiverseId\': 605798}, \'multiverseid\': 605798}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gnadenlose Vertreibung\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Schicke alle Artefakte ins Exil.\\n• Schicke alle Kreaturen ins Exil.\\n• Schicke alle Verzauberungen ins Exil.\\n• Schicke alle Planeswalker ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605976&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fffc1f0-001a-47d8-a5b0-b8005b6ee68e\', \'multiverseId\': 605976}, \'multiverseid\': 605976}, {\'name\': \'Destierro despiadado\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Exilia todos los artefactos.\\n• Exilia todas las criaturas.\\n• Exilia todos los encantamientos.\\n• Exilia todos los planeswalkers.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a126177c-03a9-4046-b691-e8172f201eff\', \'multiverseId\': 606092}, \'multiverseid\': 606092}, {\'name\': \'Expulsion impitoyable\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Exilez tous les artefacts.\\n• Exilez toutes les créatures.\\n• Exilez tous les enchantements.\\n• Exilez tous les planeswalkers.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606208&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbe457ad-9a21-4df6-917e-1da04a42ba7e\', \'multiverseId\': 606208}, \'multiverseid\': 606208}, {\'name\': \'Sfratto Inesorabile\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Esilia tutti gli artefatti.\\n• Esilia tutte le creature.\\n• Esilia tutti gli incantesimi.\\n• Esilia tutti i planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e4f68b0-c9b3-427d-9ca0-0903539f174c\', \'multiverseId\': 606324}, \'multiverseid\': 606324}, {\'name\': \'無慈悲な追い立て\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・すべてのアーティファクトを追放する。\\n・すべてのクリーチャーを追放する。\\n・すべてのエンチャントを追放する。\\n・すべてのプレインズウォーカーを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'963c1a45-edae-4fa2-a792-924b6895aa11\', \'multiverseId\': 606440}, \'multiverseid\': 606440}, {\'name\': \'Evicção Impiedosa\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Exile todos os artefatos.\\n• Exile todas as criaturas.\\n• Exile todos os encantamentos.\\n• Exile todos os planeswalkers.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dbec1b4-f083-4c76-9517-199794076ec2\', \'multiverseId\': 606556}, \'multiverseid\': 606556}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goldnacht-Kommandant\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein gemeinsamer Glaube und viele Hände brachten den Sieg."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605928&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92a9f9cb-1f40-4a3d-9f8c-c1dd9c45e44a\', \'multiverseId\': 605928}, \'multiverseid\': 605928}, {\'name\': \'Comandante de la Noche Dorada\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Una sola fe, pero muchas posibilidades de vencer".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'773fc8a3-074c-42db-af12-73aba6006ab4\', \'multiverseId\': 606044}, \'multiverseid\': 606044}, {\'name\': "Commandant d\'Ornuit", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Une foi unique, mais une victoire partagée. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606160&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f06675b-c7e4-46ee-a7b5-84a0daa39922\', \'multiverseId\': 606160}, \'multiverseid\': 606160}, {\'name\': \'Comandante della Notte Dorata\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Una sola fede, ma molte mani a contribuire alla vittoria."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c2b97b8-91a0-473f-839b-1cd065bb7483\', \'multiverseId\': 606276}, \'multiverseid\': 606276}, {\'name\': \'黄金夜の指揮官\', \'text\': \'これでないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「勝利の裏には一つの信仰、そして大勢の力がある。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58f91d60-3dab-43c9-b810-8d00ac45a965\', \'multiverseId\': 606392}, \'multiverseid\': 606392}, {\'name\': \'Comandante dos Noite Dourada\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outra criatura entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, as criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma fé, mas muitas mãos na vitória."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c357063-5ccf-4abe-8ce0-61e6acae016d\', \'multiverseId\': 606508}, \'multiverseid\': 606508}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goldwehr-Gambit\', \'text\': \'Affinität zu Ausrüstungen (Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Ausrüstung, die du kontrollierst, {1} weniger.)\\nErzeuge fünf 2/2 rote Rebell-Kreaturenspielsteine. Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Für jeden der Spielsteine kannst du eine Ausrüstung, die du kontrollierst, an ihn anlegen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Auf Neyalis Befehl gingen sie in Stellung. Auf Otharris Signal schlugen sie zu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605711&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b96630e-082e-4418-bf54-be051c338108\', \'multiverseId\': 605711}, \'multiverseid\': 605711}, {\'name\': \'Táctica de los Guardaoro\', \'text\': \'Afinidad por equipos. (Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada Equipo que controlas.)\\nCrea cinco fichas de criatura Rebelde rojas 2/2. Ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno. Por cada una de esas fichas, puedes anexarle un Equipo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando Neyali dio la orden, se pusieron en posición y, cuando Otharri hizo la señal, atacaron.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a2e6dec-8157-49e2-8bef-4651a75fa753\', \'multiverseId\': 605727}, \'multiverseid\': 605727}, {\'name\': \'Pari des gardorés\', \'text\': "Affinité pour les équipements (Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque équipement que vous contrôlez.)\\nCréez cinq jetons de créature 2/2 rouge Rebelle. Ils acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Pour chacun de ces jetons, vous pouvez lui attacher un équipement que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Au commandement de Neyali, ils prirent position. Au signal d\'Otharri, ils frappèrent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605743&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99ff314a-1c2a-4b1c-9f58-05398d0761b0\', \'multiverseId\': 605743}, \'multiverseid\': 605743}, {\'name\': \'Mossa dei Custodi Aurei\', \'text\': \'Affinità con gli Equipaggiamenti (Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni Equipaggiamento che controlli.)\\nCrea cinque pedine creatura Ribelle 2/2 rosse. Hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno. Puoi assegnare un Equipaggiamento che controlli a ognuna di quelle pedine.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'A un ordine di Neyali, presero posizione. Al segnale di Otharri, attaccarono.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f3cf1c2-a8af-40b9-b7bb-fe29a5d7f180\', \'multiverseId\': 605759}, \'multiverseid\': 605759}, {\'name\': \'黄金守護の計略\', \'text\': \'親和（装備品）（この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールしている装備品１つにつき{1}少なくなる。）\\n赤の２/２のレベル・クリーチャー・トークン５体を生成する。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。それらの各トークンにそれぞれ、あなたがコントロールしている装備品１つをつけてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ネヤリの命令で配置につき、オターリの合図で攻撃を繰り出す。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24d3558d-623c-412f-ab10-1bf4579acd31\', \'multiverseId\': 605775}, \'multiverseid\': 605775}, {\'name\': \'Gambito dos Guardiões Dourados\', \'text\': \'Afinidade por Equipamento (Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada Equipamento que você controla.)\\nCrie cinco fichas de criatura Rebelde vermelha 2/2. Elas ganham ímpeto até o final do turno. Para cada uma dessas fichas, você pode anexar um Equipamento que você controle a cada.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Sob o comando de Neyali, eles se posicionaram. Ao sinal de Otharri, eles atacaram.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da1726bd-9c73-41b8-a928-588c3d27dddc\', \'multiverseId\': 605791}, \'multiverseid\': 605791}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goldwehr-Gambit\', \'text\': \'Affinität zu Ausrüstungen\\nErzeuge fünf 2/2 rote Rebell-Kreaturenspielsteine. Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Für jeden der Spielsteine kannst du eine Ausrüstung, die du kontrollierst, an ihn anlegen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605599&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25ce036d-5cf1-4bfc-aa89-9f4ff19c2392\', \'multiverseId\': 605599}, \'multiverseid\': 605599}, {\'name\': \'Pari des gardorés\', \'text\': "Affinité pour les équipements\\nCréez cinq jetons de créature 2/2 rouge Rebelle. Ils acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Pour chacun de ces jetons, vous pouvez lui attacher un équipement que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605615&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37f949b5-6c2c-45d3-9998-8f1de4312658\', \'multiverseId\': 605615}, \'multiverseid\': 605615}, {\'name\': \'黄金守護の計略\', \'text\': \'親和（装備品）\\n赤の２/２のレベル・クリーチャー・トークン５体を生成する。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。それらの各トークンにそれぞれ、あなたがコントロールしている装備品１つをつけてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65773eac-187a-4e14-bf9a-4e3e0e63c424\', \'multiverseId\': 605631}, \'multiverseid\': 605631}, {\'name\': \'金坚卫的计策\', \'text\': \'武具共鸣\\n派出五个2/2红色反抗军衍生生物。它们获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。为每个这类衍生物各进行以下流程～你可以将一个由你操控的武具贴附于其上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'238ad135-ef21-4bf4-bfe0-9c75c63dad65\', \'multiverseId\': 605647}, \'multiverseid\': 605647}]', "[{'name': 'Golgari-Petschaft', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Ob das Siegel eine stolze Wächterin des Naturkreislaufs darstellt oder jemanden, die ihre Seele der Dunkelheit im Ausgleich für ewiges Leben verkauft hat, hängt von der Sichtweise des Betrachters ab.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605987&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1293a62-5728-4921-86fc-0894e5b9c72d', 'multiverseId': 605987}, 'multiverseid': 605987}, {'name': 'Sello golgari', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Agrega {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Dependiendo de tu punto de vista, el sello representa a un orgulloso guardián del ciclo natural o a alguien que ha vendido su alma a la oscuridad a cambio de vida eterna.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606103&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc549a46-2357-4295-bd9c-553d59e417a5', 'multiverseId': 606103}, 'multiverseid': 606103}, {'name': 'Cachet de Golgari', 'text': '{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': 'Selon les avis, le sceau représente une fière gardienne du cycle naturel ou celle qui a vendu son âme aux ténèbres en échange de la vie éternelle.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606219&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fdbdb58a-7e3c-47ba-98e8-67c4e37804df', 'multiverseId': 606219}, 'multiverseid': 606219}, {'name': 'Sigillo Golgari', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': 'A seconda dei punti di vista, il sigillo rappresenta un fiero guardiano del ciclo naturale o uno che ha venduto la propria anima alle tenebre in cambio della vita eterna.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606335&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e62a8ba4-0a26-439a-89af-f66d71cead6f', 'multiverseId': 606335}, 'multiverseid': 606335}, {'name': 'ゴルガリの印鑑', 'text': '{1}, {T}：{B}{G}を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '見るものの視点により、その印章が示すものは、自然の巡りを護る名誉ある守護者にも、永遠の生命のために魂を闇に売り渡した者にもなる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606451&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c3e4dc3-5f74-4426-89e6-c740af982ef2', 'multiverseId': 606451}, 'multiverseid': 606451}, {'name': 'Sinete Golgari', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Adicione {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': 'Dependendo do seu ponto de vista, o selo representa uma guardiã orgulhosa do ciclo natural ou alguém que vendeu sua alma à escuridão em troca de vida eterna.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606567&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed38b423-8b12-41ec-aeb9-aecb276809b8', 'multiverseId': 606567}, 'multiverseid': 606567}]", "[{'name': 'Großzügiges Geschenk', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Ihr Beherrscher erzeugt einen 3/3 grünen Elefant-Kreaturenspielstein.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Die besten Geschenke können unmöglich weiterverschenkt werden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605926&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb5d6c0c-decc-4bf6-8c29-d0782bee7bb0', 'multiverseId': 605926}, 'multiverseid': 605926}, {'name': 'Regalo paquidérmico', 'text': 'Destruye el permanente objetivo. Su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Elefante verde 3/3.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Los mejores regalos son los que no pueden volverse a ofrecer a nadie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606042&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eeeac52d-441a-4043-80c6-43591ec3066a', 'multiverseId': 606042}, 'multiverseid': 606042}, {'name': 'Cadeau généreux', 'text': 'Détruisez un permanent ciblé. Son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Éléphant.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Les meilleurs cadeaux sont impossibles à rétrocéder.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606158&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '728778d7-d7da-4981-85d9-69bd69b4ec66', 'multiverseId': 606158}, 'multiverseid': 606158}, {'name': 'Dono Abbondante', 'text': 'Distruggi un permanente bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea una pedina creatura Elefante 3/3 verde.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'I regali migliori sono impossibili da riciclare.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606274&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dbc7cc2a-c553-48eb-a48c-d2bf9c1176be', 'multiverseId': 606274}, 'multiverseid': 606274}, {'name': '過大な贈り物', 'text': 'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは緑の３/３の象・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '最高の贈り物は他人に渡せない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606390&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b8bc682-8aff-4b57-8708-911af4195d14', 'multiverseId': 606390}, 'multiverseid': 606390}, {'name': 'Presente Generoso', 'text': 'Destrua a permanente alvo. Seu controlador cria uma ficha de criatura Elefante verde 3/3.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Os melhores presentes são dados apenas uma vez.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606506&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6e660d4-98b6-4651-8d0c-f7acd4e264b8', 'multiverseId': 606506}, 'multiverseid': 606506}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hammer der Himmelsfestungen\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Hammer der Himmelsfestungen ins Spiel kommt, lege ihn an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst.\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und hat Flugfähigkeit und Erstschlag.\\nAusrüsten {2}{W}{W}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605936&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad576fac-32b7-423b-9c6d-80c30f94074b\', \'multiverseId\': 605936}, \'multiverseid\': 605936}, {\'name\': \'Maza de las aerorruinas\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Maza de las aerorruinas entre al campo de batalla, anéxala a la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene las habilidades de volar y dañar primero.\\nEquipar {2}{W}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84034789-845f-4a64-ba98-e4d5bd24e774\', \'multiverseId\': 606052}, \'multiverseid\': 606052}, {\'name\': \'Maillet des forts célestes\', \'text\': "Quand le Maillet des forts célestes arrive sur le champ de bataille, attachez-le à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nLa créature équipée gagne +2/+2 et a le vol et l\'initiative.\\nÉquipement {2}{W}{W}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606168&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f105991-6d47-4b9d-9da3-3990bc659887\', \'multiverseId\': 606168}, \'multiverseid\': 606168}, {\'name\': \'Maglio delle Enclave Celesti\', \'text\': \'Quando il Maglio delle Enclave Celesti entra nel campo di battaglia, assegnalo a una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\nLa creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+2 e ha volare e attacco improvviso.\\nEquipaggiare {2}{W}{W}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c981f6c4-ac72-4e17-a12b-1639397cabac\', \'multiverseId\': 606284}, \'multiverseid\': 606284}, {\'name\': \'スカイクレイブの大鎚\', \'text\': \'スカイクレイブの大鎚が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け飛行と先制攻撃を持つ。\\n装備{2}{W}{W}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c637a90d-75ae-4c59-8285-07d22e5458cc\', \'multiverseId\': 606400}, \'multiverseid\': 606400}, {\'name\': \'Malho dos Enclaves Celestes\', \'text\': \'Quando Malho dos Enclaves Celestes entrar no campo de batalha, anexe-o à criatura alvo que você controla.\\nA criatura equipada recebe +2/+2 e tem voar e iniciativa.\\nEquipar {2}{W}{W}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b7bcab3-df3d-454f-9a4c-b2c71f339be7\', \'multiverseId\': 606516}, \'multiverseid\': 606516}]', '[{\'name\': \'Harmonischer Archon\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nNicht-Archon-Kreaturen haben Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 3/3.\\nWenn der Harmonische Archon ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Mensch-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': \'Erster unter Gleichen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605930&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e147960-eac2-4ed5-b74f-7e76e455aade\', \'multiverseId\': 605930}, \'multiverseid\': 605930}, {\'name\': \'Arconte armonioso\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLas criaturas que no sean Arconte tienen una fuerza y resistencia base de 3/3.\\nCuando el Arconte armonioso entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura Humano blancas 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'El primero entre los iguales.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e5deb62-a458-480a-acdb-9c7463f90f5b\', \'multiverseId\': 606046}, \'multiverseid\': 606046}, {\'name\': \'Archonte harmonieux\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLes créatures non-Archonte ont une force et une endurance de base de 3/3.\\nQuand l\'Archonte harmonieux arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Humain.", \'type\': \'Créature : archonte\', \'flavor\': \'Premier parmi ses pairs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606162&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0857310-8a06-48a4-98c9-322a19dc7831\', \'multiverseId\': 606162}, \'multiverseid\': 606162}, {\'name\': \'Arconte Armonioso\', \'text\': "Volare\\nLe creature non Arconte hanno forza e costituzione base 3/3.\\nQuando l\'Arconte Armonioso entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura Umano 1/1 bianche.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'Primo tra i suoi pari.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13be4fc8-97e4-4508-b582-21395b1064ef\', \'multiverseId\': 606278}, \'multiverseid\': 606278}, {\'name\': \'調和のアルコン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n執政官でないすべてのクリーチャーは基本のパワーとタフネスが３/３になる。\\n調和のアルコンが戦場に出たとき、白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 執政官\', \'flavor\': \'全ての上に立つもの。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12bbad4b-f072-4a65-8664-9efd69c346b0\', \'multiverseId\': 606394}, \'multiverseid\': 606394}, {\'name\': \'Arconte Harmonioso\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAs criaturas não Arconte têm poder e resistência básicos 3/3.\\nQuando Arconte Harmonioso entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura Humano branca 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'O primeiro entre iguais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e3d398e-d451-4ae8-bb85-bd090f073716\', \'multiverseId\': 606510}, \'multiverseid\': 606510}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hasserfüllte Trugbilder\', \'text\': \'Bestimme bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst. Erzeuge für jede der Kreaturen einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie jener Kreatur ist. Die Spielsteine erhalten Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Jede Monstrosität, die es nicht vermag, ihn zu töten, vergrößert sein beschworenes Arsenal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605955&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bda763d9-6963-49a9-9a28-01a8daa88e4a\', \'multiverseId\': 605955}, \'multiverseid\': 605955}, {\'name\': \'Espejismo de odio\', \'text\': \'Elige hasta dos criaturas objetivo que no controlas. Por cada una de esas criaturas, crea una ficha que es una copia de esa criatura. Esas fichas ganan la habilidad de prisa. Exílialas al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Cada monstruosidad que no lo mata expande el arsenal que invoca.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab493539-7d5c-4999-a112-50a849ca90d2\', \'multiverseId\': 606071}, \'multiverseid\': 606071}, {\'name\': \'Mirage de haine\', \'text\': "Choisissez jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées que vous ne contrôlez pas. Pour chacune de ces créatures, créez un jeton qui est une copie de cette créature. Ces jetons acquièrent la célérité. Exilez-les au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les monstruosités qui échouent à le tuer étoffent son armée de conjurés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606187&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0e2a54b-8afc-4042-94cb-edf57e2ab710\', \'multiverseId\': 606187}, \'multiverseid\': 606187}, {\'name\': "Miraggio d\'Odio", \'text\': "Scegli fino a due creature bersaglio che non controlli. Per ognuna di quelle creature, crea una pedina che è una copia di quella creatura. Quelle pedine hanno rapidità. Esiliale all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni mostruosità che non riesce a ucciderlo estende il suo arsenale di evocazioni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db7c2731-6ca3-4b1c-b27f-672af6a486a4\', \'multiverseId\': 606303}, \'multiverseid\': 606303}, {\'name\': \'憎悪の蜃気楼\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。それらのクリーチャー１体につき、そのクリーチャーのコピーであるトークン１体を生成する。それらのトークンは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'怪物が彼を殺し損ねるたび、彼のこさえる武器が増える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4612d34-39e7-4e78-a58c-195e3ed6253c\', \'multiverseId\': 606419}, \'multiverseid\': 606419}, {\'name\': \'Miragem de Ódio\', \'text\': \'Escolha até duas criaturas alvo que você não controla. Para cada uma daquelas criaturas, crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia daquela criatura. Aquelas fichas ganham ímpeto. Exile-as no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Cada monstruosidade que fracassa em matá-lo expande seu arsenal conjurado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4838c25b-6d1b-45e8-a6db-0ef0619324bd\', \'multiverseId\': 606535}, \'multiverseid\': 606535}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heroische Verstärkung\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine. Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 und Eile.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Schmerzenschreie wurden schnell von Kampfgebrüll abgelöst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605974&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'430f3e33-a488-40d4-8f53-279e46dada99\', \'multiverseId\': 605974}, \'multiverseid\': 605974}, {\'name\': \'Refuerzos heroicos\', \'text\': \'Crea dos fichas de criatura Soldado blancas 1/1. Hasta el final del turno, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y ganan la habilidad de prisa.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los gritos de angustia se convirtieron enseguida en rugidos de acción.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'077be621-2161-41d1-ac76-2cc789c0b5e0\', \'multiverseId\': 606090}, \'multiverseid\': 606090}, {\'name\': \'Renforts héroïques\', \'text\': "Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et acquièrent la célérité.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les hurlements d\'angoisse encouragèrent rapidement les cris d\'action.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606206&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d69bcba-0c0b-446e-b487-2a3810b311a5\', \'multiverseId\': 606206}, \'multiverseid\': 606206}, {\'name\': \'Rinforzi Eroici\', \'text\': \'Crea due pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche. Fino alla fine del turno, le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno rapidità.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Le urla di agonia presto si trasformarono in grida di incitamento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7018536-daea-4383-8136-1d6cec2d22ba\', \'multiverseId\': 606322}, \'multiverseid\': 606322}, {\'name\': \'英雄的援軍\', \'text\': \'白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け、速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'苦痛の叫びはたちまち行動の声を駆り立てた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c5eeae0-8350-4197-ab59-89aca5e28c52\', \'multiverseId\': 606438}, \'multiverseid\': 606438}, {\'name\': \'Reforços Heroicos\', \'text\': \'Crie duas fichas de criatura Soldado branca 1/1. Até o final do turno, as criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 e ganham ímpeto.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os gritos de angústia rapidamente instigaram brados de ação.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'813702b2-55ce-49be-899b-df0fd1bc0b6e\', \'multiverseId\': 606554}, \'multiverseid\': 606554}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hexplatten-Mauerbrecher\', \'text\': \'Für Mirrodin (Wenn diese Ausrüstung ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 2/2 roten Rebell-Kreaturenspielstein und lege sie dann an ihn an.)\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+2.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift und falls es die erste Kampfphase des Zuges ist, enttappe jede angreifende Kreatur. Nach dieser Phase gibt es eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.\\nAusrüsten {3}{R}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605712&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b758278-745b-4910-94d5-3118c26e15eb\', \'multiverseId\': 605712}, \'multiverseid\': 605712}, {\'name\': \'Rompemuros hexarmado\', \'text\': \'¡Por Mirrodin (Cuando este Equipo entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Rebelde roja 2/2 y luego anéxalo a ella.)\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +2/+2.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada ataque, si es la primera fase de combate del turno, endereza cada criatura atacante. Después de esta fase, hay una fase de combate adicional.\\nEquipar {3}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e9ba9ea-e162-4b8b-b281-116dd3865107\', \'multiverseId\': 605728}, \'multiverseid\': 605728}, {\'name\': "Brisemur d\'hexaplaques", \'text\': "Pour Mirrodin (Quand cet équipement arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 rouge Rebelle, puis attachez-lui cet équipement.)\\nLa créature équipée gagne +2/+2.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, si c\'est la première phase de combat du tour, dégagez chaque créature attaquante. Cette phase est suivie d\'une phase de combat supplémentaire.\\nÉquipement {3}{R}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605744&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'199ee4e8-f51c-4419-a793-890aecca0afc\', \'multiverseId\': 605744}, \'multiverseid\': 605744}, {\'name\': \'Sfondamuri delle Esapiastre\', \'text\': "Per Mirrodin (Quando questo Equipaggiamento entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Ribelle 2/2 rossa, poi assegnalo ad essa.)\\nLa creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+2.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca, se è la prima fase di combattimento del turno, STAPpa ogni creatura attaccante. Dopo questa fase, c\'è una fase di combattimento addizionale.\\nEquipaggiare {3}{R}", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f479954-08bb-4b00-befb-937b64bccd7b\', \'multiverseId\': 605760}, \'multiverseid\': 605760}, {\'name\': \'呪い板の壁壊し\', \'text\': \'ミラディンのために！（この装備品が戦場に出たとき、赤の２/２のレベル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成し、その後、これをそれにつける。）\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、それがそのターンの１つ目の戦闘フェイズである場合、各攻撃クリーチャーをそれぞれアンタップする。このフェイズに続いて、追加の戦闘フェイズ１つを加える。\\n装備{3}{R}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'754a5d14-af58-48b2-835b-3e8db2d1ef44\', \'multiverseId\': 605776}, \'multiverseid\': 605776}, {\'name\': \'Quebra-paredes de Hexaplaca\', \'text\': \'Por Mirrodin (Quando este Equipamento entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Rebelde vermelha 2/2 e anexe-o a ela.)\\nA criatura equipada recebe +2/+2.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada atacar, se for a primeira fase de combate do turno, desvire cada criatura atacante. Depois dessa fase, há uma fase de combate adicional.\\nEquipar {3}{R}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ec60430-19e5-4735-9315-80010d543a28\', \'multiverseId\': 605792}, \'multiverseid\': 605792}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hexplatten-Mauerbrecher\', \'text\': \'Für Mirrodin\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+2.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift und falls es die erste Kampfphase des Zuges ist, enttappe jede angreifende Kreatur. Nach dieser Phase gibt es eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.\\nAusrüsten {3}{R}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605600&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a885aba3-2b55-4159-a022-135547b817d6\', \'multiverseId\': 605600}, \'multiverseid\': 605600}, {\'name\': "Brisemur d\'hexaplaques", \'text\': "Pour Mirrodin\\nLa créature équipée gagne +2/+2.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, si c\'est la première phase de combat du tour, dégagez chaque créature attaquante. Cette phase est suivie d\'une phase de combat supplémentaire.\\nÉquipement {3}{R}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605616&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8102da4-dbc7-4771-97e2-60d8c56aac4b\', \'multiverseId\': 605616}, \'multiverseid\': 605616}, {\'name\': \'呪い板の壁壊し\', \'text\': \'ミラディンのために！\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、それがそのターンの１つ目の戦闘フェイズである場合、各攻撃クリーチャーをそれぞれアンタップする。このフェイズに続いて、追加の戦闘フェイズ１つを加える。\\n装備{3}{R}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'967b55d2-ba5c-4878-84a5-bd4ca6ab931a\', \'multiverseId\': 605632}, \'multiverseid\': 605632}, {\'name\': \'六角板破墙槌\', \'text\': \'秘罗万岁！\\n佩带此武具的生物得+2/+2。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，若当前是本回合的首个战斗阶段，则重置所有进行攻击的生物。在此阶段后，额外多出一个战斗阶段。\\n佩带{3}{R}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e694eb0-0fec-43ef-a683-eed61e16732f\', \'multiverseId\': 605648}, \'multiverseid\': 605648}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hof der Anmut\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Hof der Anmut ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erzeugst du einen 1/1 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit. Falls du der Monarch bist, erzeugst du stattdessen einen 4/4 weißen Engel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Ein rechtmäßiger Herrscher sorgt für ein gesegnetes Reich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605918&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c17315e-2dfb-4323-9fde-c5973ff3b571\', \'multiverseId\': 605918}, \'multiverseid\': 605918}, {\'name\': \'Corte de la gracia\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Corte de la gracia entre al campo de batalla, te conviertes en el monarca.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, crea una ficha de criatura Espíritu blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar. Si eres el monarca, en vez de eso, crea una ficha de criatura Ángel blanca 4/4 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Un soberano justo es una bendición para su reino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbb7f0d1-7eb0-4b12-8bba-f29de56cc672\', \'multiverseId\': 606034}, \'multiverseid\': 606034}, {\'name\': \'Cour de la Grâce\', \'text\': \'Quand la Cour de la Grâce arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous devenez le monarque.\\nAu début de votre entretien, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol. Si vous êtes le monarque, créez un jeton de créature 4/4 blanche Ange avec le vol à la place.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Un souverain vertueux engendre un royaume béni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606150&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f27f188-1778-468d-8c7c-e7db01e527ee\', \'multiverseId\': 606150}, \'multiverseid\': 606150}, {\'name\': \'Corte della Grazia\', \'text\': "Quando la Corte della Grazia entra nel campo di battaglia, diventi il monarca.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, crea una pedina creatura Spirito 1/1 bianca con volare. Se sei il monarca, crea invece una pedina creatura Angelo 4/4 bianca con volare.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Un sovrano giusto è la benedizione di un regno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'021bfac0-b627-4fff-a1a2-3c87272373d4\', \'multiverseId\': 606266}, \'multiverseid\': 606266}, {\'name\': \'恩寵の宮廷\', \'text\': \'恩寵の宮廷が戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者になる。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。あなたが統治者であるなら、代わりに、飛行を持つ白の４/４の天使・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'公正な君主は恩寵の国土を生む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'930ebc04-3bec-4070-8cc0-7958b6898eaf\', \'multiverseId\': 606382}, \'multiverseid\': 606382}, {\'name\': \'Corte da Graça\', \'text\': \'Quando Corte da Graça entra no campo de batalha, você se torna o monarca.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, crie uma ficha de criatura Espírito branca 1/1 com voar. Se você for o monarca, em vez disso, crie uma ficha de criatura Anjo branca 4/4 com voar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Um soberano justo faz um reino abençoado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'119eec4c-4c45-4b52-8a3b-4fc16f6090d4\', \'multiverseId\': 606498}, \'multiverseid\': 606498}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hordling-Ansturm\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge drei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Hinterlasse keine Abfälle, auf dass du keine Schädlinge anziehst."\\n—Mardu-Drohung\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605956&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a40325d-2240-4f5e-9a31-0a9dba99f3e1\', \'multiverseId\': 605956}, \'multiverseid\': 605956}, {\'name\': \'Ataque de minihorda\', \'text\': \'Crea tres fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Que no queden restos, no sea que atraigan bichos".\\n—Amenaza mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef18e275-c08e-4af7-829c-dcca67239726\', \'multiverseId\': 606072}, \'multiverseid\': 606072}, {\'name\': \'Surgissement de hordelins\', \'text\': \'Créez trois jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Ne laissez aucun lambeau, vous attireriez les parasites. »\\n—Menace marduenne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606188&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e65340f8-1048-4397-ab3b-904d21d2cff9\', \'multiverseId\': 606188}, \'multiverseid\': 606188}, {\'name\': "Slancio dei Cuccioli dell\'Orda", \'text\': \'Crea tre pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non lasciare resti o attirerai parassiti."\\n—Minaccia Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d47a1b1b-93b8-4a1a-9d11-5e1a2168a41a\', \'multiverseId\': 606304}, \'multiverseid\': 606304}, {\'name\': \'軍族童の突発\', \'text\': \'赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークン３体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「肉片は残すな。害虫を寄せつけることになるかもしれぬ。」\\n――マルドゥの脅し\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd92fa41-ac1f-4422-9412-60e0fffa3a06\', \'multiverseId\': 606420}, \'multiverseid\': 606420}, {\'name\': \'Ataque da Mini-horda\', \'text\': \'Crie três fichas de criatura Goblin vermelha 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Sem resto pra não dar bicho."\\n— Ameaça Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39e66c55-8141-4dbc-9cb8-8c84c5b203f2\', \'multiverseId\': 606536}, \'multiverseid\': 606536}]', "[{'name': 'Hurtigwindhöhen', 'text': 'Refugium 4 (Wenn dieses Land ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege dann den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\\nDie Hurtigwindhöhen kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}.\\n{W}, {T}: Falls du in diesem Zug mit drei oder mehr Kreaturen angegriffen hast, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606030&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7639b50-eb3a-4272-ba7f-24b276f1e501', 'multiverseId': 606030}, 'multiverseid': 606030}, {'name': 'Cumbres viento vigorizante', 'text': 'Esconder 4. (Cuando esta tierra entre al campo de batalla, mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, exilia una boca abajo y luego pon el resto en el fondo en un orden aleatorio.)\\nLas Cumbres viento vigorizante entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}.\\n{W}, {T}: Puedes jugar la carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná si atacaste con tres o más criaturas este turno.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606146&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c3f5e75-1a0f-433b-ae47-1cf4520194a6', 'multiverseId': 606146}, 'multiverseid': 606146}, {'name': 'Hauts de Ventabrupt', 'text': 'Cachette 4 (Quand ce terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, exilez-en une face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)\\nLes Hauts de Ventabrupt arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}.\\n{W}, {T} : Vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana si vous avez attaqué avec au moins trois créatures ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606262&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2bc82e1-db16-45e3-9f60-79a375a7ed6b', 'multiverseId': 606262}, 'multiverseid': 606262}, {'name': 'Alture di Vento Pungente', 'text': 'Nascondiglio 4 (Quando questa terra entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio, esiliane una a faccia in giù, poi metti le altre in fondo in ordine casuale.)\\nLe Alture di Vento Pungente entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}.\\n{W}, {T}: Puoi giocare la carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana se hai attaccato con tre o più creature in questo turno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606378&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb8b94da-e57f-46c0-a17b-6dfcb4629eb3', 'multiverseId': 606378}, 'multiverseid': 606378}, {'name': '風立ての高地', 'text': '秘匿４（この土地が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見て、そのうち１枚を裏向きに追放し、その後、残りを一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\\n風立ての高地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}を加える。\\n{W}, {T}：このターンにあなたが３体以上のクリーチャーで攻撃していたなら、あなたはその追放されているカード１枚をマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606494&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '781ffef6-ea4a-4334-855c-8ed5f9ba8646', 'multiverseId': 606494}, 'multiverseid': 606494}, {'name': 'Cumes dos Ventos Velozes', 'text': 'Refúgio 4 (Quando este terreno entrar no campo de batalha, olhe os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório, exile um com a face voltada para baixo e depois coloque o restante no fundo em ordem aleatória.)\\nCumes dos Ventos Velozes entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}.\\n{W}, {T}: Você pode jogar o card exilado sem pagar seu custo de mana se tiver atacado com três ou mais criaturas neste turno.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606610&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00f931fb-b611-4ab0-bfd2-0d58393932f5', 'multiverseId': 606610}, 'multiverseid': 606610}]", '[{\'name\': \'Infektionsschnalle\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Infektionsschnalle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine -1/-1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n{4}, {T}: Führe Wucherung durch. (Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern und gib ihnen dann von jeder Sorte Marke, die dort bereits liegt, eine weitere Marke.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605985&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6965de9-eb0f-4e90-9794-53fcb04704b6\', \'multiverseId\': 605985}, \'multiverseid\': 605985}, {\'name\': \'Broche de contagio\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Broche de contagio entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador -1/-1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\\n{4}, {T}: Prolifera. (Elige cualquier cantidad de permanentes y/o jugadores, luego pon sobre cada uno un contador de cada tipo que ya tenga.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fc19ba5-cb49-4043-9a9f-7e47b1fcc8ef\', \'multiverseId\': 606101}, \'multiverseid\': 606101}, {\'name\': \'Boucle de contagion\', \'text\': "Quand la Boucle de contagion arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur -1/-1 sur une créature ciblée.\\n{4}, {T} : Proliférez. (Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents et/ou de joueurs, puis donnez-leur à chacun un autre marqueur de chaque sorte déjà présente.)", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606217&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'151c9158-a25b-4045-b80b-fd4db3af4008\', \'multiverseId\': 606217}, \'multiverseid\': 606217}, {\'name\': \'Stretta Contagiosa\', \'text\': \'Quando la Stretta Contagiosa entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino -1/-1 su una creatura bersaglio.\\n{4}, {T}: Prolifera. (Scegli un qualsiasi numero di permanenti e/o giocatori, poi metti su ognuno un altro segnalino di ogni tipo già presente.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5aac8b5-e009-426e-a71a-6c73cbce1829\', \'multiverseId\': 606333}, \'multiverseid\': 606333}, {\'name\': \'伝染病の留め金\', \'text\': \'伝染病の留め金が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に－１/－１カウンター１個を置く。\\n{4},{T}：増殖を行う。（望む数のパーマネントやプレイヤーを選び、その後、すでにそこにあるカウンター１種類につき、そのカウンターもう１個を与える。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8902aa67-da45-491e-8288-43c043a775c3\', \'multiverseId\': 606449}, \'multiverseid\': 606449}, {\'name\': \'Gancho de Contágio\', \'text\': \'Quando Gancho de Contágio entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador -1/-1 na criatura alvo.\\n{4}, {T}: Prolifere. (Escolha qualquer número de permanentes e/ou jogadores. Em seguida, dê a cada um deles outro marcador de cada tipo que eles já tenham.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4610dcbf-e059-473c-9051-f0c00b9b4046\', \'multiverseId\': 606565}, \'multiverseid\': 606565}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ixhel, Spross von Atraxa\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit, Toxisch 2\\nVerdorben — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments schickt jeder Gegner, der drei oder mehr Giftmarken hat, die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek verdeckt ins Exil. Solange die Karten im Exil bleiben, kannst du sie anschauen und sie spielen, und um sie zu wirken, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605533&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'868406d5-7837-4b43-8b7f-c5f4e459ce1b\', \'multiverseId\': 605533}, \'multiverseid\': 605533}, {\'name\': "Ixhel, scion d\'Atraxa", \'text\': "Vol, vigilance, toxique 2\\nCorrompu — Au début de votre étape de fin, chaque adversaire qui a au moins trois marqueurs « poison » exile la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque face cachée. Vous pouvez regarder et jouer ces cartes tant qu\'elles restent exilées, et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour lancer ces sorts.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : phyrexian et ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605545&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eedf2b19-1a1e-4c9f-9ad3-b172521953e2\', \'multiverseId\': 605545}, \'multiverseid\': 605545}, {\'name\': \'アトラクサの後継、イクセル\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒、毒性２\\n堕落 — あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、３個以上の毒カウンターを持つ各対戦相手はそれぞれ、自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を裏向きで追放する。それらのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそれらを見たりプレイしたりしてもよく、それらの呪文を唱えるためにマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'544808c7-6486-48a2-b048-04b2cf8719a9\', \'multiverseId\': 605557}, \'multiverseid\': 605557}, {\'name\': \'亚崔夏赋使伊歇儿\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒，下毒2\\n腐化～在你的结束步骤开始时，每位具有三个或更多中毒指示物的对手各牌面朝下地放逐其牌库顶牌。于这些牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以检视并使用之，且你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来支付施放这些咒语的费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～非瑞人／天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90fbc4ad-f1a1-4edb-b881-c15840fcfe46\', \'multiverseId\': 605569}, \'multiverseid\': 605569}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ixhel, Spross von Atraxa\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit, Toxisch 2\\nVerdorben — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments schickt jeder Gegner, der drei oder mehr Giftmarken hat, die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek verdeckt ins Exil. Solange die Karten im Exil bleiben, kannst du sie anschauen und sie spielen, und um sie zu wirken, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605657&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86c171ab-9065-41ca-9beb-19ad2a77c098\', \'multiverseId\': 605657}, \'multiverseid\': 605657}, {\'name\': \'Ixhel, hija de Atraxa\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia, tóxico 2.\\nCorrupto — Al comienzo de tu paso final, cada oponente que tenga tres o más contadores de veneno exilia la primera carta de su biblioteca boca abajo. Mientras esas cartas permanezcan exiliadas, puedes mirarlas, jugarlas y usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzar esos hechizos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Ángel pirexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34fc622d-d305-4799-9dfc-3fe0e5d3bff9\', \'multiverseId\': 605659}, \'multiverseid\': 605659}, {\'name\': "Ixhel, scion d\'Atraxa", \'text\': "Vol, vigilance, toxique 2\\nCorrompu — Au début de votre étape de fin, chaque adversaire qui a au moins trois marqueurs « poison » exile la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque face cachée. Vous pouvez regarder et jouer ces cartes tant qu\'elles restent exilées, et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour lancer ces sorts.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : phyrexian et ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605661&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61008c2b-900c-4d79-a818-f427298fdcd4\', \'multiverseId\': 605661}, \'multiverseid\': 605661}, {\'name\': \'Ixhel, Erede di Atraxa\', \'text\': "Volare, cautela, tossico 2\\nCorrotto — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, ogni avversario che ha tre o più segnalini veleno esilia la prima carta del proprio grimorio a faccia in giù. Puoi guardare e giocare quelle carte fintanto che rimangono esiliate e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore per lanciare quelle magie.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Angelo Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'927bc0b5-f3f0-4fca-9925-7e16cc5cb550\', \'multiverseId\': 605663}, \'multiverseid\': 605663}, {\'name\': \'アトラクサの後継、イクセル\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒、毒性２\\n堕落 — あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、３個以上の毒カウンターを持つ各対戦相手はそれぞれ、自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を裏向きで追放する。それらのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそれらを見たりプレイしたりしてもよく、それらの呪文を唱えるためにマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0301f55-ac79-4cef-92d1-52a555308e34\', \'multiverseId\': 605665}, \'multiverseid\': 605665}, {\'name\': \'Ixhel, Descendente de Atraxa\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância, tóxico 2\\nCorrompido — No início de sua etapa final, cada oponente que tem três ou mais marcadores de veneno exila o card do topo do próprio grimório com a face voltada para baixo. Você poderá olhar e jogar aqueles cards enquanto eles permanecerem exilados, e poderá gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer cor para conjurar aquelas mágicas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Phyrexiano Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c67dfbb3-5258-40c0-96e9-47a7fc0bb025\', \'multiverseId\': 605667}, \'multiverseid\': 605667}, {\'name\': \'亚崔夏赋使伊歇儿\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒，下毒2\\n腐化～在你的结束步骤开始时，每位具有三个或更多中毒指示物的对手各牌面朝下地放逐其牌库顶牌。于这些牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以检视并使用之，且你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来支付施放这些咒语的费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～非瑞人／天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6027033b-00d7-4f54-8109-9cf82f5ca70f\', \'multiverseId\': 605669}, \'multiverseid\': 605669}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jor Kadeen der Obwalter\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nMetallkunst — Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +3/+0, solange du drei oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Solange in meinen Händen noch ein Schwert ist, gibt es noch Hoffnung für ein wieder gereinigtes Mirrodin."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605975&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca340806-13e3-4c1f-bdf8-3ac7ce98b5d9\', \'multiverseId\': 605975}, \'multiverseid\': 605975}, {\'name\': \'Jor Kadeen, el prevaleciente\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nMetalurgia — Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +3/+0 mientras controles tres o más artefactos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mientras tenga una espada en mi mano, habrá esperanza de un Mirrodin puro".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3eab9ea-92dd-4cf3-9362-6502b460437f\', \'multiverseId\': 606091}, \'multiverseid\': 606091}, {\'name\': \'Jor Kadeen, le Triomphant\', \'text\': \'Initiative\\nArt des métaux — Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +3/+0 tant que vous contrôlez au moins trois artefacts.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Tant que j\'ai encore une lame en main, l\'espoir d\'un Mirrodin purifié perdure. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606207&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'478a8d4f-6d11-457a-beb9-55a05a0b0184\', \'multiverseId\': 606207}, \'multiverseid\': 606207}, {\'name\': \'Jor Kadeen, il Trionfatore\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nMetallurgia — Le creature che controlli prendono +3/+0 fintanto che controlli tre o più artefatti.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Finché impugnerò una lama, ci sarà speranza di vedere di nuovo un Mirrodin puro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ec543b2-f9e4-4043-bd21-a4e9bb0978d4\', \'multiverseId\': 606323}, \'multiverseid\': 606323}, {\'name\': \'覇者、ジョー・カディーン\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n金属術 ― あなたが３つ以上のアーティファクトをコントロールしているかぎり、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋３/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「私の手に剣がある限り、清純なるミラディンを取り戻す希望は残っている。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5915b17b-d9bb-4277-9cb1-39e78106cf4f\', \'multiverseId\': 606439}, \'multiverseid\': 606439}, {\'name\': \'Jor Kadeen, o Prevalente\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nMaestria com metais — As criaturas que você controla receberão +3/+0 enquanto você controlar três ou mais artefatos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Enquanto minha mão empunhar uma espada, haverá esperança de uma Mirrodin pura novamente."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d4f29b0-184e-4d07-865c-d0d7e21424f0\', \'multiverseId\': 606555}, \'multiverseid\': 606555}]', "[{'name': 'Kampfkreischen', 'text': 'Erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Vogel-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nRückblende — Tappe drei ungetappte weiße Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605915&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41cb4c8d-abeb-408e-94d3-57cb2fd8976a', 'multiverseId': 605915}, 'multiverseid': 605915}, {'name': 'Alarido de guerra', 'text': 'Crea dos fichas de criatura Ave blancas 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\nRetrospectiva—Girar tres criaturas blancas enderezadas que controlas. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606031&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '023a6534-4191-46bc-aa2c-c8426225ecbb', 'multiverseId': 606031}, 'multiverseid': 606031}, {'name': 'Piaillement de bataille', 'text': 'Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Oiseau avec le vol.\\nFlashback — Engagez trois créatures blanches dégagées que vous contrôlez. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606147&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d52a757-29ff-4fcd-b211-b7930fa94d17', 'multiverseId': 606147}, 'multiverseid': 606147}, {'name': 'Strillo di Battaglia', 'text': 'Crea due pedine creatura Uccello 1/1 bianche con volare.\\nFlashback—TAPpa tre creature bianche STAPpate che controlli. (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606263&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8645f59f-c414-44bb-92df-b05913622899', 'multiverseId': 606263}, 'multiverseid': 606263}, {'name': '金切るときの声', 'text': '飛行を持つ白の１/１の鳥・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\nフラッシュバック―あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態である白のクリーチャー３体をタップする。（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606379&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d46283e-2d44-43b0-be4c-e5fe2b5afbff', 'multiverseId': 606379}, 'multiverseid': 606379}, {'name': 'Guinchado de Guerra', 'text': 'Crie duas fichas de criatura Ave branca 1/1 com voar.\\nRecapitular — Vire três criaturas brancas desviradas que você controla. (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606495&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1d19563-fd2a-46c8-af98-24f1b672d85b', 'multiverseId': 606495}, 'multiverseid': 606495}]", '[{\'name\': \'Karns Bastion\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Führe Wucherung durch. (Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern und gib ihnen dann von jeder Sorte Marke, die dort bereits liegt, eine weitere Marke.)\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kann hier nicht alle beschützen, aber so viele wie möglich."\\n—Karn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606012&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'761bcb77-48bd-47e0-9129-2d93c059dfc8\', \'multiverseId\': 606012}, \'multiverseid\': 606012}, {\'name\': \'Bastión de Karn\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Prolifera. (Elige cualquier cantidad de permanentes y/o jugadores, luego pon sobre cada uno un contador de cada tipo que ya tenga.)\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"No puedo proteger a todo el mundo, pero protegeré a todos los que pueda".\\n—Karn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52062b48-3f55-4fb6-94e7-2cb0c7a7426c\', \'multiverseId\': 606128}, \'multiverseid\': 606128}, {\'name\': \'Bastion de Karn\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{4}, {T} : Proliférez. (Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents et/ou de joueurs, puis donnez-leur à chacun un autre marqueur de chaque sorte déjà présente.)", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Je ne pourrai pas protéger tout le monde. Mais je ferai tout mon possible. »\\n—Karn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606244&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adc548dc-d50c-447f-88e3-ee75cede1956\', \'multiverseId\': 606244}, \'multiverseid\': 606244}, {\'name\': \'Bastione di Karn\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Prolifera. (Scegli un qualsiasi numero di permanenti e/o giocatori, poi metti su ognuno un altro segnalino di ogni tipo già presente.)\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Non posso difendere tutti qui, ma proteggerò quelli che posso."\\n—Karn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbaf94db-0af1-4e99-99e0-ae3837cf273d\', \'multiverseId\': 606360}, \'multiverseid\': 606360}, {\'name\': \'カーンの拠点\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{4}, {T}：増殖を行う。（望む数のパーマネントやプレイヤーを選び、その後、すでにそこにあるカウンター１種類につき、そのカウンターもう１個を与える。）\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「私はここにいる全員を守ることはできないが、守れる者は守る。」\\n――カーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ddd7bb5-1143-4b44-a670-ad64928b0ac4\', \'multiverseId\': 606476}, \'multiverseid\': 606476}, {\'name\': \'Bastião de Karn\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Prolifere. (Escolha qualquer número de permanentes e/ou jogadores. Em seguida, dê a cada um deles outro marcador de cada tipo que eles já tenham.)\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Não posso proteger todos aqui. Mas protegerei os que puder."\\n— Karn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'593214f9-ba0b-425d-8f6b-51f25ce0490e\', \'multiverseId\': 606592}, \'multiverseid\': 606592}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kasteiung\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Deine Schuld ist getilgt."\\n—Hilgur, Gnadentod der Orzhov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605978&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bd73154-1617-4d6d-a9da-1e8610110fcb\', \'multiverseId\': 605978}, \'multiverseid\': 605978}, {\'name\': \'Mortificar\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu deuda ha sido borrada".\\n—Hilgur, eutanista orzhov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b12b898e-7e1b-4bb8-95bb-871c9852e72e\', \'multiverseId\': 606094}, \'multiverseid\': 606094}, {\'name\': \'Mortification\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une cible, créature ou enchantement.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Votre dette est effacée. »\\n—Hilgur, euthanasiste orzhov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606210&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d12a15ea-68a7-48e2-a875-ddc336b6c947\', \'multiverseId\': 606210}, \'multiverseid\': 606210}, {\'name\': \'Mortificare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il tuo debito è cancellato."\\n—Hilgur, eutanista Orzhov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba70d86f-c2f0-4199-aab9-337a64a18465\', \'multiverseId\': 606326}, \'multiverseid\': 606326}, {\'name\': \'屈辱\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたの債務は帳消しです。」\\n――オルゾフの安死術士、ヒルガー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4809a67d-caec-487b-8ee8-06b72e0b37b9\', \'multiverseId\': 606442}, \'multiverseid\': 606442}, {\'name\': \'Mortificar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura ou o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Suas dívidas estão extintas."\\n— Hilgur, eutanista Orzhov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76f8d9f7-0b46-4b55-8901-9d9190f81225\', \'multiverseId\': 606558}, \'multiverseid\': 606558}]', "[{'name': 'Kembas Banner', 'text': 'Für Mirrodin (Wenn diese Ausrüstung ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 2/2 roten Rebell-Kreaturenspielstein und lege sie dann an ihn an.)\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\\nAusrüsten {2}{W}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605705&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd703040e-3f14-4764-8ee5-5bf4acc516c2', 'multiverseId': 605705}, 'multiverseid': 605705}, {'name': 'Estandarte de Kemba', 'text': '¡Por Mirrodin (Cuando este Equipo entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Rebelde roja 2/2 y luego anéxalo a ella.)\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +1/+1 por cada criatura que controlas.\\nEquipar {2}{W}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605721&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2006084f-069b-41b1-bfbb-9b0f1f63abab', 'multiverseId': 605721}, 'multiverseid': 605721}, {'name': 'Bannière de Kemba', 'text': 'Pour Mirrodin (Quand cet équipement arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 rouge Rebelle, puis attachez-lui cet équipement.)\\nLa créature équipée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\nÉquipement {2}{W}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605737&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92d281fd-b38f-4736-80b0-ccae6f0b880c', 'multiverseId': 605737}, 'multiverseid': 605737}, {'name': 'Vessillo di Kemba', 'text': 'Per Mirrodin (Quando questo Equipaggiamento entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Ribelle 2/2 rossa, poi assegnalo ad essa.)\\nLa creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+1 per ogni creatura che controlli.\\nEquipaggiare {2}{W}', 'type': 'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605753&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b60e55a-97db-455a-99dd-6a103200ddec', 'multiverseId': 605753}, 'multiverseid': 605753}, {'name': 'ケンバの戦旗', 'text': 'ミラディンのために！（この装備品が戦場に出たとき、赤の２/２のレベル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成し、その後、これをそれにつける。）\\n装備しているクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備{2}{W}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605769&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '562598b9-b940-44a3-ab03-24d874cb0351', 'multiverseId': 605769}, 'multiverseid': 605769}, {'name': 'Estandarte de Kemba', 'text': 'Por Mirrodin (Quando este Equipamento entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Rebelde vermelha 2/2 e anexe-o a ela.)\\nA criatura equipada recebe +1/+1 para cada criatura que você controla.\\nEquipar {2}{W}', 'type': 'Artefato — Equipamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605785&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7844b09e-ba8f-4616-a597-d08ef8d6d289', 'multiverseId': 605785}, 'multiverseid': 605785}]", "[{'name': 'Kembas Banner', 'text': 'Für Mirrodin\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\\nAusrüsten {2}{W}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605593&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56313746-2a10-4c05-910d-e366030e3c9a', 'multiverseId': 605593}, 'multiverseid': 605593}, {'name': 'Bannière de Kemba', 'text': 'Pour Mirrodin\\nLa créature équipée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\nÉquipement {2}{W}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605609&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a408422d-5236-49f2-be78-3c7df9827fa9', 'multiverseId': 605609}, 'multiverseid': 605609}, {'name': 'ケンバの戦旗', 'text': 'ミラディンのために！\\n装備しているクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備{2}{W}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605625&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ded163da-6631-415c-9e4d-ed053377fa34', 'multiverseId': 605625}, 'multiverseid': 605625}, {'name': '肯芭的战旗', 'text': '秘罗万岁！\\n你每操控一个生物，佩带此武具的生物便得+1/+1。\\n佩带{2}{W}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605641&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ecf5150e-cb2e-4eff-a3e4-93f39f1e0dae', 'multiverseId': 605641}, 'multiverseid': 605641}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kettenreaktion\', \'text\': \'Die Kettenreaktion fügt jeder Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen im Spiel ist.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir bereiten uns auch auf das Unwahrscheinliche vor, falls mal der Blitz an einem Ort doppelt oder überall gleichzeitig einschlägt."\\n—Nundari, Hauptmann der Miliz von Seetor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605953&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c22cccde-ad31-468b-88d4-07ca71c2f458\', \'multiverseId\': 605953}, \'multiverseid\': 605953}, {\'name\': \'Reacción en cadena\', \'text\': \'La Reacción en cadena hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Entrenamos para lo improbable, como un relámpago cayendo dos veces en el mismo lugar, o cayendo en todos lados al mismo tiempo".\\n—Nundari, capitán de la milicia de Portal Marino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70d3f86c-fa64-4bed-b40f-3312805a026c\', \'multiverseId\': 606069}, \'multiverseid\': 606069}, {\'name\': \'Réaction en chaîne\', \'text\': \'La Réaction en chaîne inflige X blessures à chaque créature, X étant le nombre de créatures sur le champ de bataille.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Nous nous entraînons à confronter l\'improbable, comme la foudre frappant deux fois au même endroit, ou partout à la fois. »\\n—Nundari, capitaine de la milice de Porte des Mers", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606185&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c93bff93-c93a-4aae-b2c5-a6e239a3ba67\', \'multiverseId\': 606185}, \'multiverseid\': 606185}, {\'name\': \'Reazione a Catena\', \'text\': \'La Reazione a Catena infligge X danni a ogni creatura, dove X è il numero di creature sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci addestriamo per affrontare l\\\'improbabile, come un fulmine che colpisca lo stesso luogo due volte od ogni luogo contemporaneamente."\\n—Nundari, capitano di milizia di Portale Marino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a6c9f62-de91-4188-a3dc-135dc1b91e66\', \'multiverseId\': 606301}, \'multiverseid\': 606301}, {\'name\': \'連鎖反応\', \'text\': \'連鎖反応は各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘは戦場にあるクリーチャーの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「我々はありえなさそうなことに対して訓練をしています。雷が同じ場所に二度落ちるとか、そこらじゅうに同時に落ちるとか。」\\n――海門の民兵隊長、ナンダーリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5f161ab-cc73-45db-90a0-526a2441ed69\', \'multiverseId\': 606417}, \'multiverseid\': 606417}, {\'name\': \'Reação em Cadeia\', \'text\': \'Reação em Cadeia causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura, sendo X o número de criaturas no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Nós treinamos para o improvável, como um raio atingir o mesmo lugar duas vezes ou atingir todos os lugares de uma vez só."\\n— Nundari, capitão da milícia de Portão Marinho\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2685925-b25b-4dea-94d2-8878e7f716bf\', \'multiverseId\': 606533}, \'multiverseid\': 606533}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kherburg\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Erzeuge einen 0/1 roten Kobold-Kreaturenspielstein namens Kobolde von Kherburg.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich schwöre, für jeden, den Prossh auffrisst, schlüpfen drei neue aus einem Loch heraus."\\n—Jaya Ballard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606013&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de6d3e8b-aa15-4ff9-86f6-a5c0a08a4b5a\', \'multiverseId\': 606013}, \'multiverseid\': 606013}, {\'name\': \'Fortaleza Kher\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Crea una ficha de criatura Kóbold roja 0/1 llamada Kóbolds de la Fortaleza Kher.\', \'type\': \'Tierra legendaria\', \'flavor\': \'"Te juro que por cada uno que se come Prossh salen tres más de algún agujero".\\n—Jaya Ballard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'475971ae-5e43-41e1-9e90-a15b94a7a5a4\', \'multiverseId\': 606129}, \'multiverseid\': 606129}, {\'name\': \'Castel Kher\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}{R}, {T} : Créez un jeton de créature 0/1 rouge Kobold appelé Kobolds de Castel Kher.\', \'type\': \'Terrain légendaire\', \'flavor\': "« Franchement, à chaque fois que Prossh en dévore un, trois autres sortent d\'un trou. »\\n—Jaya Ballard", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606245&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3a18756-edda-4adc-8c8e-95555e91e955\', \'multiverseId\': 606245}, \'multiverseid\': 606245}, {\'name\': \'Roccaforte di Kher\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Crea una pedina creatura Coboldo 0/1 rossa chiamata Coboldi della Roccaforte di Kher.\', \'type\': \'Terra Leggendaria\', \'flavor\': \'"Giuro che ogni volta che Prossh ne divora uno, ne sbucano altri tre da chissà dove."\\n—Jaya Ballard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7abfb8dd-5815-4579-a1cd-5a72b3b183bb\', \'multiverseId\': 606361}, \'multiverseid\': 606361}, {\'name\': \'カー砦\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}{R}, {T}：「カー砦のコボルド」という名前の赤の０/１のコボルド・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説の土地\', \'flavor\': \'「ほんとよ、プローシュが一匹喰うたびに、どこかの穴からもう三匹出てくるのよ。」\\n――ヤヤ・バラード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1a30a05-808b-4227-831d-6d9ebdbb723c\', \'multiverseId\': 606477}, \'multiverseid\': 606477}, {\'name\': \'Fortaleza de Kher\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Crie uma ficha de criatura Kobold vermelha 0/1 com o nome Kobolds da Fortaleza de Kher.\', \'type\': \'Terreno Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu juro, pra cada um que Prossh devora, de algum buraco saem mais três."\\n— Jaya Ballard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62012d4d-cf05-4dbc-adde-5feb9068e154\', \'multiverseId\': 606593}, \'multiverseid\': 606593}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kluge Tarnung\', \'text\': \'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jeder Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du für {1} oder ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nEine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten deiner Wahl, die keine Länder sind und die du kontrollierst, destabilisieren sich. (Behandle sie und alles, was an sie angelegt ist, bis zum Beginn deines nächsten Zuges, als würde es nicht existieren.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605703&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aeeabb9-56f3-490d-9832-a3b0adb8c875\', \'multiverseId\': 605703}, \'multiverseid\': 605703}, {\'name\': \'Ocultación astuta\', \'text\': \'Convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nCualquier cantidad de permanentes objetivo que no sean tierra que controlas salen de fase. (Trátalos a ellos y a cualquier objeto anexado a ellos como si no existiesen hasta tu próximo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cad9f70-3f4f-4e2d-a10f-60084cb541b3\', \'multiverseId\': 605719}, \'multiverseid\': 605719}, {\'name\': \'Dissimulation astucieuse\', \'text\': "Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nN\'importe quel nombre de permanents non-terrain ciblés que vous contrôlez passent hors phase. (Traitez-les et tout ce qui leur est attaché comme s\'ils n\'existaient pas jusqu\'à votre prochain tour.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605735&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa2421db-1e45-47c2-aa8f-f53cc7a0a3cd\', \'multiverseId\': 605735}, \'multiverseid\': 605735}, {\'name\': \'Occultamento Scaltro\', \'text\': \'Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nUn qualsiasi numero di permanenti non terra bersaglio che controlli scompaiono. (Tratta quei permanenti e qualsiasi permanente ad essi assegnato come se non esistessero fino al tuo prossimo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7571954-eb46-4815-ad85-fccc4240ad03\', \'multiverseId\': 605751}, \'multiverseid\': 605751}, {\'name\': \'巧みな隠蔽\', \'text\': \'召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーはそれぞれ{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていて土地でない望む数のパーマネントを対象とする。それらはフェイズ・アウトする。（あなたの次のターンまで、それらやそれらについているすべてのものは存在しないかのように扱う。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4964f4b7-f2f4-4958-ba11-0ffdfe09c01b\', \'multiverseId\': 605767}, \'multiverseid\': 605767}, {\'name\': \'Ocultação Sagaz\', \'text\': \'Convocar (Suas criaturas podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada criatura que você vira ao conjurar esta mágica paga {1} ou um mana da cor daquela criatura.)\\nQualquer número de permanentes alvo não de terreno que você controla sai de fase. (Trate-as e qualquer coisa anexada a elas como se não existissem até seu próximo turno).\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d373456c-5c6e-49a8-8d48-1a50f7ba12a9\', \'multiverseId\': 605783}, \'multiverseid\': 605783}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kluge Tarnung\', \'text\': \'Einberufen\\nEine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten deiner Wahl, die keine Länder sind und die du kontrollierst, destabilisieren sich.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605591&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70a9f790-d90d-4fec-8291-4e4fcb286352\', \'multiverseId\': 605591}, \'multiverseid\': 605591}, {\'name\': \'Dissimulation astucieuse\', \'text\': "Convocation\\nN\'importe quel nombre de permanents non-terrain ciblés que vous contrôlez passent hors phase.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605607&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63911950-8255-4dc2-a0d9-c1de1cc3cb62\', \'multiverseId\': 605607}, \'multiverseid\': 605607}, {\'name\': \'巧みな隠蔽\', \'text\': \'召集\\nあなたがコントロールしていて土地でない望む数のパーマネントを対象とする。それらはフェイズ・アウトする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d14514e-6a85-4a09-8177-59a9f3e7ab87\', \'multiverseId\': 605623}, \'multiverseid\': 605623}, {\'name\': \'巧妙隐蔽\', \'text\': \'召集\\n任意数量目标由你操控的非地永久物跃离。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d3912b3-bea3-46c3-8b47-e0571ac9369e\', \'multiverseId\': 605639}, \'multiverseid\': 605639}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kontaminations-Pfropfer\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden, Toxisch 1\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem oder mehreren Spielern Kampfschaden zufügen, führe Wucherung durch.\\nVerdorben — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls ein Gegner drei oder mehr Giftmarken hat, ziehe eine Karte. Dann kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605603&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e59f2ab-d6c2-4db4-ab5e-912c4fa2b2e9\', \'multiverseId\': 605603}, \'multiverseid\': 605603}, {\'name\': \'Greffeur de polluants\', \'text\': "Piétinement, toxique 1\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à au moins un joueur, proliférez.\\nCorrompu — Au début de votre étape de fin, si un adversaire a au moins trois marqueurs « poison », piochez une carte, puis vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain de votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605619&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74577a48-7705-4072-b3f4-389e656be8ef\', \'multiverseId\': 605619}, \'multiverseid\': 605619}, {\'name\': \'汚染を継ぐもの\', \'text\': \'トランプル、毒性１\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーが１人以上のプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、増殖を行う。\\n堕落 — あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、対戦相手１人が３個以上の毒カウンターを持っている場合、カード１枚を引き、その後、あなたの手札にある土地・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd87af63-a62b-47eb-b7db-ad35a5bf3746\', \'multiverseId\': 605635}, \'multiverseid\': 605635}, {\'name\': \'污物殖徒\', \'text\': \'践踏，下毒1\\n每当由你操控的一个或数个生物对一位或多位牌手造成战斗伤害时，增殖。\\n腐化～在你的结束步骤开始时，若某对手具有三个或更多中毒指示物，则你抓一张牌，然后你可以将一张地牌从你的手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～非瑞人／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f71d33d9-2449-4500-90cf-50075d062417\', \'multiverseId\': 605651}, \'multiverseid\': 605651}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kontaminations-Pfropfer\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden, Toxisch 1\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem oder mehreren Spielern Kampfschaden zufügen, führe Wucherung durch.\\nVerdorben — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls ein Gegner drei oder mehr Giftmarken hat, ziehe eine Karte. Dann kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605715&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5da20cb9-2694-4336-adb7-2d2710f4f534\', \'multiverseId\': 605715}, \'multiverseid\': 605715}, {\'name\': \'Injertador de contaminantes\', \'text\': \'Arrolla, tóxico 1.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas que controlas hagan daño de combate a uno o más jugadores, prolifera.\\nCorrupto — Al comienzo de tu paso final, si un oponente tiene tres o más contadores de veneno, roba una carta. Luego puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de tierra de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida pirexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ceb27eab-dcf8-486a-a05e-d53e971ac497\', \'multiverseId\': 605731}, \'multiverseid\': 605731}, {\'name\': \'Greffeur de polluants\', \'text\': "Piétinement, toxique 1\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à au moins un joueur, proliférez.\\nCorrompu — Au début de votre étape de fin, si un adversaire a au moins trois marqueurs « poison », piochez une carte, puis vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain de votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605747&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdd6a4bf-43fb-4c94-af7f-3e19449f7923\', \'multiverseId\': 605747}, \'multiverseid\': 605747}, {\'name\': \'Innestatore Contaminante\', \'text\': "Travolgere, tossico 1\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature che controlli infliggono danno da combattimento a uno o più giocatori, prolifera.\\nCorrotto — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se un avversario ha tre o più segnalini veleno, peschi una carta, poi puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta terra dalla tua mano.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5dfc60a-d3d6-47ed-b6d2-ac0348db13e1\', \'multiverseId\': 605763}, \'multiverseid\': 605763}, {\'name\': \'汚染を継ぐもの\', \'text\': \'トランプル、毒性１\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーが１人以上のプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、増殖を行う。\\n堕落 — あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、対戦相手１人が３個以上の毒カウンターを持っている場合、カード１枚を引き、その後、あなたの手札にある土地・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'690cae70-1c9b-4b16-8ee9-486a52c9f0e5\', \'multiverseId\': 605779}, \'multiverseid\': 605779}, {\'name\': \'Enxertador de Contaminantes\', \'text\': \'Atropelar, tóxico 1\\nToda vez que uma ou mais criaturas que você controla causarem dano de combate a um ou mais jogadores, prolifere.\\nCorrompido — No início de sua etapa final, se um oponente tiver três ou mais marcadores de veneno, compre um card, depois você pode colocar um card de terreno da sua mão no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Phyrexiano Druida\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e7ff820-f368-4319-8d5a-d937bcba7e1d\', \'multiverseId\': 605795}, \'multiverseid\': 605795}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kriegsboss der Legion\', \'text\': \'Mentor (Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl, deren Stärke niedriger ist.)\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du einen 1/1 roten Goblin-Kreaturenspielstein. Der Spielstein erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges und greift in diesem Kampf an, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605957&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5831d7a-f9b3-4d7a-b419-f7bcbca43471\', \'multiverseId\': 605957}, \'multiverseid\': 605957}, {\'name\': \'Jefe de guerra de la Legión\', \'text\': \'Mentor. (Siempre que esta criatura ataque, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura atacante objetivo con menor fuerza.)\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, crea una ficha de criatura Trasgo roja 1/1. Esa ficha gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno y ataca este combate si puede.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'502e04f8-61f8-4206-9e89-e3eaa01f8a6c\', \'multiverseId\': 606073}, \'multiverseid\': 606073}, {\'name\': \'Patron de guerre de la Légion\', \'text\': "Mentor (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature attaquante ciblée de force inférieure.)\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin. Ce jeton acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour et attaque pendant ce combat si possible.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606189&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edfcce72-223a-4d09-8cd2-a688474b5837\', \'multiverseId\': 606189}, \'multiverseid\': 606189}, {\'name\': \'Capoguerra della Legione\', \'text\': "Mentore (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura attaccante bersaglio con forza inferiore.)\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, crea una pedina creatura Goblin 1/1 rossa. Quella pedina ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno e attacca in questo combattimento, se può farlo.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ddb9a80-bd8b-4eb6-b60b-279459331eda\', \'multiverseId\': 606305}, \'multiverseid\': 606305}, {\'name\': \'軍勢の戦親分\', \'text\': \'教導（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、パワーがこれよりも小さい攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。ターン終了時まで、そのトークンは速攻を得る。この戦闘で、そのトークンは可能なら攻撃する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bf301fa-4c7e-4c5b-98b5-12a9de1979ff\', \'multiverseId\': 606421}, \'multiverseid\': 606421}, {\'name\': \'Chefe-de-guerra da Legião\', \'text\': \'Mentor (Toda vez que esta criatura atacar, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura atacante alvo com poder inferior.)\\nNo início do combate no seu turno, crie uma ficha de criatura Goblin vermelha 1/1. A ficha ganha ímpeto até o final do turno e ataca neste combate se estiver apta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'294d1369-9d7e-4313-9dac-19f0db956786\', \'multiverseId\': 606537}, \'multiverseid\': 606537}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kriegscoup\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge X 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine. Falls X gleich 5 oder mehr ist, zerstöre alle anderen Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Nationen von Bant legten ihren Krieg bei und vereinigten sich gegen die gemeinsame Bedrohung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605935&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24827dec-49fb-4d72-982a-f39a7fb54d80\', \'multiverseId\': 605935}, \'multiverseid\': 605935}, {\'name\': \'Golpe marcial\', \'text\': \'Crea X fichas de criatura Soldado blancas 1/1. Si X es 5 o más, destruye todas las otras criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Olvidando sus guerras, las naciones de Bant se unieron para enfrentar una amenaza común.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4b73b19-21e1-48c4-9d56-dc38fc208ce0\', \'multiverseId\': 606051}, \'multiverseid\': 606051}, {\'name\': "Coup d\'état militaire", \'text\': \'Créez X jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 5, détruisez toutes les autres créatures.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Oubliant leur guerre, les nations de Bant s\'unirent face à une menace commune.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606167&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6978c450-e80b-4c74-acaf-189dabf48df3\', \'multiverseId\': 606167}, \'multiverseid\': 606167}, {\'name\': \'Colpo Militare\', \'text\': \'Crea X pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche. Se X è pari o superiore a 5, distruggi tutte le altre creature.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Dimenticata la guerra in atto, i popoli di Bant si schierarono fianco a fianco per contrastare la minaccia comune.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abf361f5-0b5a-42a4-b067-cfaf832e8fa6\', \'multiverseId\': 606283}, \'multiverseid\': 606283}, {\'name\': \'軍部政変\', \'text\': \'白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘが５以上であるなら、それらでないすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'バントの国々は自らの戦争を忘れ、共に面した敵に対して一体となった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a06fecdb-dffe-4a96-9f9f-249e0a2e3a66\', \'multiverseId\': 606399}, \'multiverseid\': 606399}, {\'name\': \'Golpe Marcial\', \'text\': \'Crie X fichas de criatura Soldado branca 1/1. Se X for igual ou superior a 5, destrua todas as outras criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Esquecendo-se de sua guerra, as nações de Bant uniram-se para enfrentar uma ameaça comum.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1396adad-216b-4601-b97b-56925fb71bea\', \'multiverseId\': 606515}, \'multiverseid\': 606515}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krosas Waldrand\', \'text\': \'Krosas Waldrand kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere Krosas Waldrand: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald- und einer Ebene-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606014&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d55661de-646b-49fa-9c75-cb5fac85cb11\', \'multiverseId\': 606014}, \'multiverseid\': 606014}, {\'name\': \'Borde de Krosa\', \'text\': \'El Borde de Krosa entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Borde de Krosa: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Bosque y una carta de Llanura, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a35d5ebc-1fff-427b-9001-82d17957f18e\', \'multiverseId\': 606130}, \'multiverseid\': 606130}, {\'name\': \'Orée de la Krosia\', \'text\': "L\'Orée de la Krosia arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Orée de la Krosia : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt et une carte de plaine, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606246&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df3dd45b-ac68-425e-80e3-3d685cae2e9e\', \'multiverseId\': 606246}, \'multiverseid\': 606246}, {\'name\': \'Confine di Krosa\', \'text\': \'Il Confine di Krosa entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Confine di Krosa: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Foresta e una carta Pianura, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'809cfefe-0470-4a5b-81ec-d6605796ed28\', \'multiverseId\': 606362}, \'multiverseid\': 606362}, {\'name\': \'クローサの境界\', \'text\': \'クローサの境界はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, クローサの境界を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから森・カード１枚と平地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e97a482-d9ac-4a8d-9d5f-9a45ac237b2a\', \'multiverseId\': 606478}, \'multiverseid\': 606478}, {\'name\': \'Orla Krosana\', \'text\': \'Orla Krosana entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Orla Krosana: Procure em seu grimório um card de Floresta e um de Planície, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'626ef648-a52c-46ea-b045-69bcd5b274fe\', \'multiverseId\': 606594}, \'multiverseid\': 606594}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kultivieren\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, zeige sie offen vor, bringe eine davon getappt ins Spiel, nimm die andere auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Alle Samen haben eine Verbindung zueinander, die durch die Unendlichkeit hindurch reicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605963&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4a1236b-5220-4b85-bd66-fd3eb45dd7af\', \'multiverseId\': 605963}, \'multiverseid\': 605963}, {\'name\': \'Cultivar\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, muéstralas, pon una de ellas en el campo de batalla girada y la otra en tu mano. Luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Todas las semillas comparten un lazo, llamándose entre ellas a través del infinito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60ab74a3-b074-4a59-b06a-a1ed89f06b0c\', \'multiverseId\': 606079}, \'multiverseid\': 606079}, {\'name\': \'Culture\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, révélez ces cartes, mettez-en une sur le champ de bataille engagée et l\'autre dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Toutes les graines partagent un lien les reliant à travers l\'infini.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606195&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da324e5b-2f0d-46c3-9a6d-b2adb0ac4dd0\', \'multiverseId\': 606195}, \'multiverseid\': 606195}, {\'name\': \'Coltivare\', \'text\': "Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, rivelale, mettine una sul campo di battaglia TAPpata e aggiungi l\'altra alla tua mano, poi rimescola.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Tutti i semi condividono un legame comune, chiamandosi l\'un l\'altro nello spazio infinito.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08af0e83-3c83-4e12-9875-40a21a95cae5\', \'multiverseId\': 606311}, \'multiverseid\': 606311}, {\'name\': \'耕作\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、公開し、そのうち１枚をタップ状態で戦場に、もう１枚をあなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'全ての種には繋がりがあり、互いを無限の彼方から呼び合う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8576fe1f-eae3-4cea-b0b6-b9cb60d3de6a\', \'multiverseId\': 606427}, \'multiverseid\': 606427}, {\'name\': \'Cultivar\', \'text\': \'Procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, revele-os e coloque um deles no campo de batalha virado e o outro na sua mão. Depois, embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Todas as sementes possuem um elo em comum que as une através da eternidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe3e4d1e-f1c6-4049-989e-ebafea867443\', \'multiverseId\': 606543}, \'multiverseid\': 606543}]', "[{'name': 'Laterne des Seelenführers', 'text': 'Wenn die Laterne des Seelenführers ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil.\\n{T}, opfere die Laterne des Seelenführers: Schicke die Friedhöfe aller Gegner ins Exil.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere die Laterne des Seelenführers: Ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605998&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '029ed560-ba88-4196-8b10-11765b384f58', 'multiverseId': 605998}, 'multiverseid': 605998}, {'name': 'Farol guía de almas', 'text': 'Cuando el Farol guía de almas entre al campo de batalla, exilia la carta objetivo de un cementerio.\\n{T}, sacrificar el Farol guía de almas: Exilia el cementerio de cada oponente.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar el Farol guía de almas: Roba una carta.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606114&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58e57c9a-b630-4329-8ee9-6e5838396895', 'multiverseId': 606114}, 'multiverseid': 606114}, {'name': 'Lanterne guide-âmes', 'text': 'Quand la Lanterne guide-âmes arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière.\\n{T}, sacrifiez la Lanterne guide-âmes : Exilez le cimetière de chaque adversaire.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez la Lanterne guide-âmes : Piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606230&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4533bffe-e353-437b-b381-d2b1c179ddc7', 'multiverseId': 606230}, 'multiverseid': 606230}, {'name': 'Lanterna Guidaspiriti', 'text': 'Quando la Lanterna Guidaspiriti entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia una carta bersaglio da un cimitero.\\n{T}, Sacrifica la Lanterna Guidaspiriti: Esilia il cimitero di ogni avversario.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica la Lanterna Guidaspiriti: Pesca una carta.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606346&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '67e1b7dc-a41c-4f48-b5d8-fac11b018ff0', 'multiverseId': 606346}, 'multiverseid': 606346}, {'name': '魂標ランタン', 'text': '魂標ランタンが戦場に出たとき、墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。\\n{T}, 魂標ランタンを生け贄に捧げる：すべての対戦相手の墓地を追放する。\\n{1}, {T}, 魂標ランタンを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606462&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a64e0f0f-66e0-4116-a91f-8754f56d4df6', 'multiverseId': 606462}, 'multiverseid': 606462}, {'name': 'Lanterna Guia-almas', 'text': 'Quando Lanterna Guia-almas entrar no campo de batalha, exile o card alvo de um cemitério.\\n{T}, sacrifique Lanterna Guia-almas: Exile o cemitério de cada oponente.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique Lanterna Guia-almas: Compre um card.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606578&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4d259f3-e622-4d32-93ef-dc0f28b73795', 'multiverseId': 606578}, 'multiverseid': 606578}]", '[{\'name\': \'Leuchtschatten-Knoten\', \'text\': \'Sowie der Leuchtschatten-Knoten ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Ebene- oder Sumpf-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt der Leuchtschatten-Knoten getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ein flackerndes Leuchtfeuer rechtschaffener Verderbtheit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606020&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef9e572e-d0a5-4d9e-97c3-f6d02011cd66\', \'multiverseId\': 606020}, \'multiverseid\': 606020}, {\'name\': \'Maraña sombrabrillante\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Maraña sombrabrillante entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Llanura o de Pantano de tu mano. Si no lo haces, la Maraña sombrabrillante entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Un haz titilante de corrupción justificada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'755de638-4684-4636-a5b6-766f34f9b9fb\', \'multiverseId\': 606136}, \'multiverseid\': 606136}, {\'name\': \'Lacis luminombre\', \'text\': \'Au moment où le Lacis luminombre arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de plaine ou de marais de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Lacis luminombre arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Un flambeau vacillant de juste corruption.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606252&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'831caa6f-a87e-4df2-bfb6-db82c9c72452\', \'multiverseId\': 606252}, \'multiverseid\': 606252}, {\'name\': \'Intreccio Ombraluce\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Intreccio Ombraluce entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Pianura o Palude dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, l\'Intreccio Ombraluce entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Un tremolante faro di virtuosa corruzione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5e4b365-0bcb-4140-b47b-6f74f048089f\', \'multiverseId\': 606368}, \'multiverseid\': 606368}, {\'name\': \'光影の交錯\', \'text\': \'光影の交錯が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり平地や沼であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、光影の交錯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'正しい堕落が瞬く標。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76695c31-42ca-4faf-9388-de2694789d2e\', \'multiverseId\': 606484}, \'multiverseid\': 606484}, {\'name\': \'Liame do Umbrolume\', \'text\': \'Conforme Liame do Umbrolume entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Planície ou Pântano de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Liame do Umbrolume entrará no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Um farol oscilante de corrupção justa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'febc6a32-7aab-43ba-a7c4-67f6446b0164\', \'multiverseId\': 606600}, \'multiverseid\': 606600}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loxodon-Kriegshammer\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+0, hat Lebensverknüpfung und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\nAusrüsten {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Schmied muss seine Waffe mit einem Teil seiner Seele erfüllen — dessen sind die Phyrexianer nicht fähig."\\n—Melira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605991&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e15bab5-551e-48ca-9dec-9e2548c5d8d9\', \'multiverseId\': 605991}, \'multiverseid\': 605991}, {\'name\': \'Martillo de guerra loxodón\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +3/+0 y tiene las habilidades de arrollar y vínculo vital.\\nEquipar {3}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"Un herrero debe imbuir en su arma parte de su alma... Algo de lo que los pirexianos son incapaces".\\n—Melira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'998eda64-1829-4f7e-8ced-81399101ebdc\', \'multiverseId\': 606107}, \'multiverseid\': 606107}, {\'name\': \'Marteau de guerre loxodon\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +3/+0 et a le piétinement et le lien de vie.\\nÉquipement {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "« Un façonneur doit imprégner son arme d\'une partie de son âme — ce dont les Phyrexians sont bien incapables. »\\n—Melira", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606223&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f7ce8ed-dea1-47bb-b32e-4155485bc830\', \'multiverseId\': 606223}, \'multiverseid\': 606223}, {\'name\': \'Martello da Guerra Lossodonte\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +3/+0 e ha travolgere e legame vitale.\\nEquipaggiare {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Un\\\'artefice deve infondere nella sua arma parte della propria anima: un processo impossibile per gli orrori di Phyrexia."\\n—Melira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74f5fb6c-ecf4-4f8b-bef2-49266455b69c\', \'multiverseId\': 606339}, \'multiverseid\': 606339}, {\'name\': \'ロクソドンの戦槌\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋０の修整を受けトランプルと絆魂を持つ。\\n装備{3}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「造り士は武器に自分の魂の一部を埋め込まなくてはならないの。これはファイレクシア人にはできない芸当だけどね。」\\n――メリーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f111dccc-8cd0-4383-a794-63ee78ac74ad\', \'multiverseId\': 606455}, \'multiverseid\': 606455}, {\'name\': \'Martelo de Batalha dos Loxodontes\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +3/+0 e tem atropelar e vínculo com a vida.\\nEquipar {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Um artífice precisa imbuir sua arma com parte da própria alma, algo que os phyrexianos são incapazes de fazer."\\n— Melira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff3495f9-43a7-4053-89b1-672feba88d59\', \'multiverseId\': 606571}, \'multiverseid\': 606571}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loyaler Lehrling\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nLeutnant — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit. Der Spielstein erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Weise Gelehrte hören auf diejenigen, die über Vorstellungskraft verfügen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605958&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1b1eeb1-e0c8-4199-a66a-589000fa68a4\', \'multiverseId\': 605958}, \'multiverseid\': 605958}, {\'name\': \'Aprendiz leal\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nTeniente — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas a tu comandante, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar. Esa ficha gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los que poseen el conocimiento harían bien en escuchar a quienes tienen el don de la imaginación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9f4f2d3-e07a-4280-bbbd-c8070710fd92\', \'multiverseId\': 606074}, \'multiverseid\': 606074}, {\'name\': \'Apprentie loyale\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nLieutenant — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez votre commandant, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol. Ce jeton acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Ceux qui ont des connaissances ont tout intérêt à écouter ceux qui ont de l\'imagination.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606190&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'228e12a7-b3e1-4b3d-8d75-b465a9ef9a58\', \'multiverseId\': 606190}, \'multiverseid\': 606190}, {\'name\': \'Apprendista Fedele\', \'text\': "Rapidità\\nTenente — All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se controlli il tuo comandante, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare. Quella pedina ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': "Chi ha il dono della sapienza è abbastanza saggio da ascoltare chi ha il dono dell\'immaginazione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7cdf6e8-07d9-4b6b-8a60-f70104f6dd1f\', \'multiverseId\': 606306}, \'multiverseid\': 606306}, {\'name\': \'忠実な弟子\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n副官 ― あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしている場合、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。ターン終了時まで、そのトークンは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'知識ある者は賢明にして、創意ある者に耳を傾ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f25cc924-fb88-4264-b096-b7a05bb3d4d0\', \'multiverseId\': 606422}, \'multiverseid\': 606422}, {\'name\': \'Aprendiz Leal\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nTenente — No início do combate no seu turno, se você controlar seu comandante, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Tóptero incolor 1/1 com voar. Aquela ficha ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'Os dotados de inteligência são sábios o bastante para ouvir os dotados de imaginação.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b164884-17ad-4fe4-b4f8-f4229d10d613\', \'multiverseId\': 606538}, \'multiverseid\': 606538}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lux-Artillerie\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Artefaktkreaturenzauber wirkst, erhält er Sonneneruption. (Er kommt für jede unterschiedliche Farbe an Mana, das ausgegeben wurde, um ihn zu wirken, mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.)\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls dreißig oder mehr Marken auf Kreaturen und Artefakten, die du kontrollierst, liegen, fügt die Lux-Artillerie jedem Gegner 10 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605465&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95f2efbb-67cd-410c-b3ab-f75d750193f4\', \'multiverseId\': 605465}, \'multiverseid\': 605465}, {\'name\': \'Artillería de luz\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de criatura artefacto, gana la habilidad de estallido solar. (Entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre él por cada color de maná usado para lanzarlo.)\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, si hay treinta o más contadores entre los artefactos y criaturas que controlas, la Artillería de luz hace 10 puntos de daño a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d901348-322b-40f0-8cbc-40c62c3a3d61\', \'multiverseId\': 605473}, \'multiverseid\': 605473}, {\'name\': \'Artillerie-lux\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature-artefact, il acquiert la solarisation. (Cette carte arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, un marqueur +1/+1 pour chaque couleur de mana dépensée pour la lancer.)\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, s\'il y a au moins trente marqueurs parmi les artefacts et les créatures que vous contrôlez, l\'Artillerie-lux inflige 10 blessures à chaque adversaire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605481&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2017095-8d42-4644-abba-6b7e80e34a21\', \'multiverseId\': 605481}, \'multiverseid\': 605481}, {\'name\': \'Artiglieria Lux\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura artefatto, ha solarizzazione. (Entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 per ogni colore di mana speso per lanciarla.)\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se ci sono trenta o più segnalini tra gli artefatti e le creature che controlli, l\'Artiglieria Lux infligge 10 danni a ogni avversario.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60c6c6e8-110b-4e18-93bb-52bf0daa92dc\', \'multiverseId\': 605489}, \'multiverseid\': 605489}, {\'name\': \'光明の火砲\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクト・クリーチャー・呪文を唱えるたび、それは烈日を得る。（それはこれを唱えるために支払われたマナの色１種類につき１個の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。）\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトやクリーチャーの上に合計30個以上のカウンターが置かれている場合、光明の火砲は各対戦相手にそれぞれ10点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ff4da09-3a0e-4edd-b7b6-73b44357347a\', \'multiverseId\': 605497}, \'multiverseid\': 605497}, {\'name\': \'Artilharia de Lux\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica de criatura artefato, ela ganha facho solar. (Ela entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 para cada cor de mana gasto para conjurá-la.)\\nNo início de sua etapa final, se houver trinta ou mais marcadores entre artefatos e criaturas que você controla, Artilharia de Lux causa 10 pontos de dano a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2ec4a05-060f-4852-956d-c392bd78e47e\', \'multiverseId\': 605505}, \'multiverseid\': 605505}, {\'name\': \'光映炮\', \'text\': \'每当你施放神器生物咒语时，它获得辉映异能。（用过几种颜色的法术力来施放它，其进战场时上面便有几个+1/+1指示物。）\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，若由你操控的神器和生物上总共有三十个或更多个指示物，则光映炮向每位对手各造成10点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bdfe528-b5f8-42e2-909a-893e85783342\', \'multiverseId\': 605513}, \'multiverseid\': 605513}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lux-Artillerie\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Artefaktkreaturenzauber wirkst, erhält er Sonneneruption.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls dreißig oder mehr Marken auf Kreaturen und Artefakten, die du kontrollierst, liegen, fügt die Lux-Artillerie jedem Gegner 10 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605537&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d513e2c0-4b5d-4294-b8f1-6e35e3dc75f9\', \'multiverseId\': 605537}, \'multiverseid\': 605537}, {\'name\': \'Artillerie-lux\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature-artefact, il acquiert la solarisation.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, s\'il y a au moins trente marqueurs parmi les artefacts et les créatures que vous contrôlez, l\'Artillerie-lux inflige 10 blessures à chaque adversaire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605549&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7dbdcf5-6645-47fd-bff5-ae1bff95173f\', \'multiverseId\': 605549}, \'multiverseid\': 605549}, {\'name\': \'光明の火砲\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクト・クリーチャー・呪文を唱えるたび、それは烈日を得る。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトやクリーチャーの上に合計30個以上のカウンターが置かれている場合、光明の火砲は各対戦相手にそれぞれ10点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'929d6f61-e37a-474b-bcae-37866a5239ca\', \'multiverseId\': 605561}, \'multiverseid\': 605561}, {\'name\': \'光映炮\', \'text\': \'每当你施放神器生物咒语时，它获得辉映异能。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，若由你操控的神器和生物上总共有三十个或更多个指示物，则光映炮向每位对手各造成10点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b43dec39-2035-4310-a908-508fb092dc8e\', \'multiverseId\': 605573}, \'multiverseid\': 605573}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mannigfaltige Landschaft\', \'text\': \'Die Mannigfaltige Landschaft kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere die Mannigfaltige Landschaft: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, die einen Landtyp gemeinsam haben, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606015&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'093f2d1b-c94e-476d-a085-00b7d85a6c85\', \'multiverseId\': 606015}, \'multiverseid\': 606015}, {\'name\': \'Paisaje infinito\', \'text\': \'El Paisaje infinito entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Paisaje infinito: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica que compartan un tipo de tierra, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'810ae4e3-98d8-42c9-aa20-f83b9ef2e4de\', \'multiverseId\': 606131}, \'multiverseid\': 606131}, {\'name\': \'Paysage myriadaire\', \'text\': "Le Paysage myriadaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez le Paysage myriadaire : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base qui partagent un type de terrain, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606247&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f2e94d7-b8fe-42f8-b43b-6c2c17762bbc\', \'multiverseId\': 606247}, \'multiverseid\': 606247}, {\'name\': \'Paesaggio delle Miriadi\', \'text\': \'Il Paesaggio delle Miriadi entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Paesaggio delle Miriadi: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base che condividono un tipo di terra, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e845a0c7-9010-49eb-a07f-13803329727d\', \'multiverseId\': 606363}, \'multiverseid\': 606363}, {\'name\': \'無限地帯\', \'text\': \'無限地帯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2},{T},無限地帯を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を共通の土地タイプを持つように選んで探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38247dc0-7bba-4161-87e2-84ae5613cf42\', \'multiverseId\': 606479}, \'multiverseid\': 606479}, {\'name\': \'Paisagem Infinita\', \'text\': \'Paisagem Infinita entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Paisagem Infinita: Procure em seu grimório até dois cards de terreno básico que compartilhem um tipo de terreno, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'988bf033-c3bd-4bf1-8a72-3540f91cc4b1\', \'multiverseId\': 606595}, \'multiverseid\': 606595}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mentor der Sanften\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur mit Stärke 2 oder weniger unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„In diesen Hallen gibt es kein Bestehen oder Scheitern. Deine wahre Prüfung kommt beim nächsten Vollmond."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605937&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23e348da-e9ec-4bef-aaab-4731d0254d3b\', \'multiverseId\': 605937}, \'multiverseid\': 605937}, {\'name\': \'Mentor de los mansos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura con fuerza de 2 o menos entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {1}. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"En estos salones no se aprueba o reprueba. El verdadero examen llega con la primera luna llena".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0ad50cc-42b7-4d92-9cb6-5aedb6e0c336\', \'multiverseId\': 606053}, \'multiverseid\': 606053}, {\'name\': \'Mentor des humbles\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature avec une force inférieure ou égale à 2 arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {1}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Ici il n\'y a pas d\'échec ou de réussite. Votre véritable examen de passage, c\'est la première pleine lune. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606169&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d2198f8-1fd9-46d7-a116-cb84e7f67ae1\', \'multiverseId\': 606169}, \'multiverseid\': 606169}, {\'name\': \'Mentore degli Umili\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura con forza pari o inferiore a 2 entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {1}. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"In queste sale non c\\\'è promosso o bocciato. La vostra vera prova avviene con la prima luna piena."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d73a8f35-924c-4a50-99fe-21d6d1795347\', \'multiverseId\': 606285}, \'multiverseid\': 606285}, {\'name\': \'弱者の師\', \'text\': \'パワーが２以下でありこれでないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{1}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「これらの広間では、成功も失敗もありません。真の試練は最初の満月と共に訪れます。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b4178fb-a36c-41e1-8db1-58b373abd60d\', \'multiverseId\': 606401}, \'multiverseid\': 606401}, {\'name\': \'Mentor dos Humildes\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outra criatura com poder igual ou inferior a 2 entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode pagar {1}. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Nestes salões não há aprovação nem reprovação. Seu verdadeiro teste vem com a primeira lua cheia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b596fb0-c492-4b96-86df-11ca73899c6b\', \'multiverseId\': 606517}, \'multiverseid\': 606517}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mitternächtliches Spuken\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Geist-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Der Weg zurück in die Welt der Lebenden ist unklar und verwirrend. Manche Geister entdecken nie, dass sie ihre eigenen Angehörigen terrorisieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605938&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50ccc1ce-a729-4c0d-a194-2878b9b65ed8\', \'multiverseId\': 605938}, \'multiverseid\': 605938}, {\'name\': \'Aparición de medianoche\', \'text\': \'Crea dos fichas de criatura Espíritu blancas 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El camino de regreso al mundo de los vivos es fangoso y apabullante. Un geist puede no darse cuenta de que está aterrorizando a sus seres amados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b9875b-3f8c-44dc-8145-dfe4f7a7c2a5\', \'multiverseId\': 606054}, \'multiverseid\': 606054}, {\'name\': \'Hantise de minuit\', \'text\': \'Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La voie qui vous ramène dans le monde des vivants est trouble et surprenante. Un geist ne réalise parfois même pas qu\'il terrifie ses proches.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606170&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57f256b3-a08c-4998-aa0a-80f1869be647\', \'multiverseId\': 606170}, \'multiverseid\': 606170}, {\'name\': \'Infestazione di Mezzanotte\', \'text\': \'Crea due pedine creatura Spirito 1/1 bianche con volare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Il sentiero che riporta nel mondo dei viventi è oscuro e sconcertante. Un geist probabilmente non capisce neppure che sta terrorizzando i suoi cari.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6adc8f8-abab-4a91-9090-0e84aaa73f1a\', \'multiverseId\': 606286}, \'multiverseid\': 606286}, {\'name\': \'深夜の出没\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'生者の世界へ戻る道は暗く迷走している。 霊は自分が愛した者にすら恐怖を引き起こすことすらわからないのだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bb9c18c-bc19-4071-84e8-24f12191b4f9\', \'multiverseId\': 606402}, \'multiverseid\': 606402}, {\'name\': \'Assombração da Meia-noite\', \'text\': \'Crie duas fichas de criatura Espírito branca 1/1 com voar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O caminho que conduz de volta ao mundo dos vivos é sombrio e confuso. Um geist pode nem perceber que está aterrorizando aqueles que ama.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27e48f06-f73a-4c5a-a0d6-b500b7e78256\', \'multiverseId\': 606518}, \'multiverseid\': 606518}]', '[{\'name\': \'Moderranken-Renaturierung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu und ziehst eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Helden der Vergangenheit nähren unseren Geist durch ihr Vorbild — und unsere Pflanzen durch ihren Verfall."\\n—Jeddeg, Philosoph der Gräber\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605977&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f7dfe46-0b6f-4ef6-95a5-0b156af904cf\', \'multiverseId\': 605977}, \'multiverseid\': 605977}, {\'name\': \'Recuperación de las parramohosas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas muera, ganas 1 vida y robas una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Los héroes del pasado nutren nuestros espíritus con su ejemplo... y nuestras cosechas con su descomposición".\\n—Jeddeg, filósofo de las tumbas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'670c8042-7e1a-4ccc-af1b-129454352618\', \'multiverseId\': 606093}, \'multiverseid\': 606093}, {\'name\': \'Reboisement de moiselierre\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez meurt, vous gagnez 1 point de vie et vous piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Les héros du passé nourrissent nos esprits de leur exemple... et nos champs par leur décomposition. »\\n—Jeddeg, philosophe des tombes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606209&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eae875c-081a-4507-bcc5-313971518982\', \'multiverseId\': 606209}, \'multiverseid\': 606209}, {\'name\': \'Rivendicazione delle Liane Saprofaghe\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli muore, guadagni 1 punto vita e peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli eroi del passato nutrono i nostri spiriti con il loro esempio... e i nostri campi con la loro decomposizione."\\n—Jeddeg, filosofo sepolcrale\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2775ac61-d7fd-4ded-a042-416c828bdde5\', \'multiverseId\': 606325}, \'multiverseid\': 606325}, {\'name\': \'腐れ蔦の再生\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなたは１点のライフを得て、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「過去の英雄は模範により我々の精神を滋養し、また腐敗により我々の作物を滋養する。」\\n――墓の哲人、ジェデグ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39176793-714b-4c67-831e-8f67bc4ef713\', \'multiverseId\': 606441}, \'multiverseid\': 606441}, {\'name\': \'Recuperação das Gavinhas Bolorentas\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla morre, você ganha 1 ponto de vida e compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Os heróis do passado nutrem nossos espíritos pelo exemplo... e nossas safras pela decomposição."\\n— Jeddeg, filósofo dos túmulos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9d6a671-4e31-405c-a0fb-ccc4df20802a\', \'multiverseId\': 606557}, \'multiverseid\': 606557}]', '[{\'name\': \'Monumentale Korruption\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht X Karten und verliert X Lebenspunkte, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Komisch, ich dachte immer, die Phyrexianer wären ein herzloser Haufen."\\n—Kaya\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605462&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35e29176-a5b9-4f78-b988-55cf13dfb475\', \'multiverseId\': 605462}, \'multiverseid\': 605462}, {\'name\': \'Corrupción monumental\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo roba X cartas y pierde X vidas, donde X es la cantidad de artefactos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Qué curioso, siempre pensé que los pirexianos no tenían corazón".\\n—Kaya\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32f93d8d-56db-46ca-8bff-8e55c8f01ead\', \'multiverseId\': 605470}, \'multiverseid\': 605470}, {\'name\': \'Corruption monumentale\', \'text\': "Un joueur ciblé pioche X cartes et perd X points de vie, X étant le nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Étonnant, dire que je croyais que les Phyrexians étaient sans-cœur. »\\n—Kaya\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605478&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f812c695-0a38-4fb2-9dd7-4ceb96e9d67a\', \'multiverseId\': 605478}, \'multiverseid\': 605478}, {\'name\': \'Corruzione Monumentale\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio pesca X carte e perde X punti vita, dove X è il numero di artefatti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Strano, pensavo che i Phyrexiani fossero dei mostri senza cuore."\\n—Kaya\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'143bb129-214d-4858-a9cd-9351ff9372e3\', \'multiverseId\': 605486}, \'multiverseid\': 605486}, {\'name\': \'碑の堕落\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードＸ枚を引き、Ｘ点のライフを失う。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「へえ、やっぱりファイレクシア人は心無いやつばかりなのね。」\\n――ケイヤ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe83ddbc-c4b0-4e9c-9477-bc99acb79636\', \'multiverseId\': 605494}, \'multiverseid\': 605494}, {\'name\': \'Corrupção Monumental\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo compra X cards e perde X pontos de vida, sendo X o número de artefatos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Engraçado, eu sempre achei que os Phyrexianos eram um bando sem coração."\\n— Kaya\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98ff5959-202b-4552-a8a1-94b19ad92087\', \'multiverseId\': 605502}, \'multiverseid\': 605502}, {\'name\': \'碑志腐化\', \'text\': \'目标牌手抓X张牌且失去X点生命，X为由你操控的神器数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「真有趣，我还以为非瑞克西亚人都没心没肺。」\\n～卡娅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d44315c5-18ca-4060-9e68-93f3ad53719e\', \'multiverseId\': 605510}, \'multiverseid\': 605510}]', '[{\'name\': \'Monumentale Korruption\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht X Karten und verliert X Lebenspunkte, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605530&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc1080f7-9fec-4a76-aa2d-03b9e7974884\', \'multiverseId\': 605530}, \'multiverseid\': 605530}, {\'name\': \'Corruption monumentale\', \'text\': "Un joueur ciblé pioche X cartes et perd X points de vie, X étant le nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605542&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'160f7c7f-0059-461d-96e7-81f02586c96d\', \'multiverseId\': 605542}, \'multiverseid\': 605542}, {\'name\': \'碑の堕落\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードＸ枚を引き、Ｘ点のライフを失う。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38bc72e7-1d7b-42c1-8932-ad199bc2837e\', \'multiverseId\': 605554}, \'multiverseid\': 605554}, {\'name\': \'碑志腐化\', \'text\': \'目标牌手抓X张牌且失去X点生命，X为由你操控的神器数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c45ed8f3-fa33-4804-bbdc-02e73c21f5ed\', \'multiverseId\': 605566}, \'multiverseid\': 605566}]', '[{\'name\': \'Muse des Windgeflüsters\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nKreaturen können dich nicht angreifen, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {2} für jede Kreatur, die dich angreift und die er kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Ihre Stimme ist die der Rache, kalt und unbarmherzig."\\n—Akroma, rächender Engel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605947&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9501a87-5763-49d1-b88b-0337fc27b85b\', \'multiverseId\': 605947}, \'multiverseid\': 605947}, {\'name\': \'Musa nacida del viento\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLas criaturas no pueden atacarte a menos que su controlador pague {2} por cada criatura que controla que te está atacando.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"Su voz es justicia, clara e implacable".\\n—Akroma, vengadora angélica\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f446580-e583-4628-8f7f-eac40bfac757\', \'multiverseId\': 606063}, \'multiverseid\': 606063}, {\'name\': \'Muse née des vents\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLes créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {2} pour chaque créature qu\'il contrôle qui vous attaque.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': \'« Sa voix est celle de la justice, claire et implacable. »\\n—Akroma, vengeresse angélique\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606179&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecf9f26a-a885-470d-8b50-0c4ea7ce38d8\', \'multiverseId\': 606179}, \'multiverseid\': 606179}, {\'name\': \'Musa Eologena\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLe creature non possono attaccarti a meno che il loro controllore non paghi {2} per ogni creatura che controlla che ti sta attaccando.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"La sua voce è la giustizia, chiara e implacabile."\\n—Akroma, vendicatrice angelica\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b71f7c07-3180-4318-ae46-397e3508a72e\', \'multiverseId\': 606295}, \'multiverseid\': 606295}, {\'name\': \'風生まれの詩神\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nプレイヤーは、自分がコントロールしていてあなたを攻撃するクリーチャー１体につき{2}を支払わないかぎり、攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「彼女の声は、正義であり純潔であり冷酷なのだ。」\\n――復讐の天使アクローマ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'034598b0-5289-4c91-8995-43433d2888e6\', \'multiverseId\': 606411}, \'multiverseid\': 606411}, {\'name\': \'Musa Nascida do Vento\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAs criaturas não podem atacá-lo, a menos que seu controlador pague {2} para cada criatura que controla que está atacando você.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'"A voz dela é a justiça, clara e incansável."\\n— Akroma, vingadora angelical\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2684fa6b-a286-41f7-8798-d81d62d590ac\', \'multiverseId\': 606527}, \'multiverseid\': 606527}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mycosynthunhold\', \'text\': \'Der Mycosynthunhold erhält +1/+1 für jede Giftmarke, die deine Gegner haben.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich wünschte, es wäre meine Idee gewesen, aber die Natur schreitet von alleine voran, genau in die richtige Richtung."\\n—Vorinclex, Stimme des Hungers\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605965&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d789245-bb92-4f0d-845c-25a39b4b6d3d\', \'multiverseId\': 605965}, \'multiverseid\': 605965}, {\'name\': \'Demonio de micosintético\', \'text\': \'El Demonio de micosintético obtiene +1/+1 por cada contador de veneno que tienen tus oponentes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror pirexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ojalá pudiera tener el mérito por ello, pero la naturaleza progresa sola, tal como debería".\\n—Vórinclex, la Voz del Ansia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78eec996-a1dc-440e-ac80-c6a15dc168ab\', \'multiverseId\': 606081}, \'multiverseid\': 606081}, {\'name\': \'Fielleux de mycosynthèse\', \'text\': \'Le Fielleux de mycosynthèse gagne +1/+1 pour chaque marqueur « poison » que vos adversaires ont.\', \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et horreur\', \'flavor\': "« J\'aimerais bien m\'en attribuer la création, mais la nature évolue seule, sans intervention aucune. »\\n—Vorinclex, Voix de la Voracité", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606197&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe7a53ed-900c-41b1-96d9-73da99f21820\', \'multiverseId\': 606197}, \'multiverseid\': 606197}, {\'name\': \'Immondo dei Micosinti\', \'text\': "L\'Immondo dei Micosinti prende +1/+1 per ogni segnalino veleno che hanno i tuoi avversari.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"Vorrei potermene attribuire il merito, ma la natura progredisce per suo conto, proprio come dovrebbe."\\n—Vorinclex, Voce della Fame\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02902f81-d2da-442e-ad85-3d12bb9b1540\', \'multiverseId\': 606313}, \'multiverseid\': 606313}, {\'name\': \'マイコシンスの悪鬼\', \'text\': \'マイコシンスの悪鬼は、対戦相手が持っている毒カウンター１個につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・ホラー\', \'flavor\': \'「この功績に名を残したいものだが、自然は自らの手で、あるべき姿のままに物事をすすめるだろう。」\\n――飢餓の声、ヴォリンクレックス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a15818f-945a-4940-8059-028ed867b87a\', \'multiverseId\': 606429}, \'multiverseid\': 606429}, {\'name\': \'Demônio Micossintetizador\', \'text\': \'Demônio Micossintetizador recebe +1/+1 para cada marcador de veneno que seus oponentes têm.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Phyrexiano Horror\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu gostaria de poder ficar com o crédito, mas a natureza progride sozinha, como deve."\\n— Vorinclex, Voz da Fome\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'302b1f19-294a-4f2b-815e-1725e5bc85c5\', \'multiverseId\': 606545}, \'multiverseid\': 606545}]', '[{\'name\': \'Myr-Kampfkugel\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Myr-Kampfkugel ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge vier 1/1 farblose Myr-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine.\\nImmer wenn die Myr-Kampfkugel angreift, kannst du X ungetappte Myr, die du kontrollierst, tappen. Falls du dies tust, erhält die Myr-Kampfkugel +X/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges und fügt dem Spieler oder Planeswalker, den sie angreift, X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Myr, Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605994&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdcb8c5a-36b6-4070-8edb-656e30064c48\', \'multiverseId\': 605994}, \'multiverseid\': 605994}, {\'name\': \'Esfera de batalla myr\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Esfera de batalla myr entre al campo de batalla, crea cuatro fichas de criatura artefacto Myr incoloras 1/1.\\nSiempre que la Esfera de batalla myr ataque, puedes girar X Myr enderezados que controlas. Si lo haces, la Esfera de batalla myr obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno y hace X puntos de daño al jugador o planeswalker al que está atacando.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'952e1b94-95c2-4c17-b935-a8a38b18e311\', \'multiverseId\': 606110}, \'multiverseid\': 606110}, {\'name\': \'Sphère de bataille myr\', \'text\': "Quand la Sphère de bataille myr arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez quatre jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Myr.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Sphère de bataille myr attaque, vous pouvez engager X myrs dégagés que vous contrôlez. Si vous faites ainsi, la Sphère de bataille myr gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour et inflige X blessures au joueur ou au planeswalker qu\'elle attaque.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : myr et construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606226&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3280bc55-4a03-49e2-a79d-2911cb6d4465\', \'multiverseId\': 606226}, \'multiverseid\': 606226}, {\'name\': \'Sfera da Battaglia Myr\', \'text\': \'Quando la Sfera da Battaglia Myr entra nel campo di battaglia, crea quattro pedine creatura artefatto Myr 1/1 incolori.\\nOgniqualvolta la Sfera da Battaglia Myr attacca, puoi TAPpare X Myr STAPpati che controlli. Se lo fai, la Sfera da Battaglia Myr prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno e infligge X danni al giocatore o al planeswalker che sta attaccando.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto Myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5045e696-f81e-496c-b8ee-32df02c3cafc\', \'multiverseId\': 606342}, \'multiverseid\': 606342}, {\'name\': \'マイアの戦闘球\', \'text\': \'マイアの戦闘球が戦場に出たとき、無色の１/１のマイア・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン４体を生成する。\\nマイアの戦闘球が攻撃するたび、あなたはあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態であるマイアＸ体をタップしてもよい。そうしたなら、ターン終了時まで、マイアの戦闘球は＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受け、これが攻撃しているプレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーにＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — マイア・構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a150923d-58ab-4991-8ac9-00e5a4d95d58\', \'multiverseId\': 606458}, \'multiverseid\': 606458}, {\'name\': \'Esfera de Batalha Myr\', \'text\': \'Quando Esfera de Batalha Myr entrar no campo de batalha, crie quatro fichas de criatura artefato Myr incolor 1/1.\\nToda vez que Esfera de Batalha Myr ataca, você pode virar X Myr desvirados que você controla. Se fizer isso, Esfera de Batalha Myr receberá +X/+0 até o final do turno e causará X pontos de dano ao jogador ou planeswalker que ela estiver atacando.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Myr Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66bcb3ef-ae69-4894-8c03-5684016d7e6e\', \'multiverseId\': 606574}, \'multiverseid\': 606574}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nachtgeflüster\', \'text\': \'Du ziehst zwei Karten und verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe Dinge gesehen, die einen Schwächeren in den Wahnsinn treiben würden. Möchtest du, dass ich dir davon erzähle?"\\n—Vraska\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605950&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eddf7a6-ee4f-4fff-a016-821ea7c3ee79\', \'multiverseId\': 605950}, \'multiverseid\': 605950}, {\'name\': \'Susurro nocturno\', \'text\': \'Robas dos cartas y pierdes 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Presencié cosas que sumirían a los débiles en las lágrimas y el delirio más absolutos. ¿Quieres conocerlas?".\\n—Vraska\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3224a10d-351c-4137-b77f-1fc5bff40872\', \'multiverseId\': 606066}, \'multiverseid\': 606066}, {\'name\': \'Chuchotements nocturnes\', \'text\': \'Vous piochez deux cartes et vous perdez 2 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai vu des choses qui auraient fait fondre en larmes un esprit plus impressionnable. Je peux vous les raconter ? »\\n—Vraska", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606182&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2149504c-ae35-404f-8dec-13baf1ad383d\', \'multiverseId\': 606182}, \'multiverseid\': 606182}, {\'name\': \'Sussurri della Notte\', \'text\': \'Peschi due carte e perdi 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho visto cose che avrebbero ridotto una persona più debole a un piagnucolio delirante. Vuoi che te le racconti?"\\n—Vraska\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4bfb4e0-ac2d-4d9a-8fc3-ccfcfd489821\', \'multiverseId\': 606298}, \'multiverseid\': 606298}, {\'name\': \'夜の囁き\', \'text\': \'あなたはカード２枚を引き、２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「私は、心の弱い人間なら狂乱して泣き叫ぶような光景を目の当たりにしてきたのよ。それが何だったのか、聞いてみたい？」\\n――ヴラスカ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06412fdb-e4bc-42ef-a467-f78a582eb35f\', \'multiverseId\': 606414}, \'multiverseid\': 606414}, {\'name\': \'Sussurro da Noite\', \'text\': \'Você compra dois cards e perde 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu vi coisas que reduziriam uma pessoa mais fraca a lágrimas e delírios. Quer que eu fale sobre elas?"\\n— Vraska\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f5b57b4-1d7e-4224-b191-60f2b05c46bb\', \'multiverseId\': 606530}, \'multiverseid\': 606530}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nekroblüten-Knoten\', \'text\': \'Sowie der Nekroblüten-Knoten ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Sumpf- oder Wald-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt der Nekroblüten-Knoten getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ein hungriger Hort gedeihender Fäulnis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606016&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'533a1877-760a-4bee-8198-3c3e7f2a5a05\', \'multiverseId\': 606016}, \'multiverseid\': 606016}, {\'name\': \'Maraña necroflorecida\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Maraña necroflorecida entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Pantano o de Bosque de tu mano. Si no lo haces, la Maraña necroflorecida entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Una guarida hambrienta llena de podredumbre florecida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9764bf6e-f03b-4f5a-8c46-50c90eec40a2\', \'multiverseId\': 606132}, \'multiverseid\': 606132}, {\'name\': \'Lacis nécrofleur\', \'text\': \'Au moment où le Lacis nécrofleur arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de marais ou de forêt de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Lacis nécrofleur arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Un repaire affamé de pourriture florissante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606248&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad7cb86c-12fd-43bd-bc33-c7f992003bc7\', \'multiverseId\': 606248}, \'multiverseid\': 606248}, {\'name\': \'Intreccio Necrogermoglio\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Intreccio Necrogermoglio entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Palude o Foresta dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, l\'Intreccio Necrogermoglio entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Un famelico covo di rigogliosa putrefazione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31f2ba2b-4f39-49d9-8339-f8a6d35e4ec6\', \'multiverseId\': 606364}, \'multiverseid\': 606364}, {\'name\': \'屍花の交錯\', \'text\': \'屍花の交錯が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり沼や森であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、屍花の交錯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'繁る腐れが貪る巣。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'572d08f9-548d-44e0-aacf-879b420d60ea\', \'multiverseId\': 606480}, \'multiverseid\': 606480}, {\'name\': \'Liame da Necroflorescência\', \'text\': \'Conforme Liame da Necroflorescência entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Pântano ou Floresta de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Liame da Necroflorescência entrará no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Um covil faminto de podridão florescente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3f9bd6c-b919-4999-8ccf-c7e9d0766543\', \'multiverseId\': 606596}, \'multiverseid\': 606596}]', '[{\'name\': \'Neyali, Vorhut der Sonnen\', \'text\': \'Angreifende Spielsteine, die du kontrollierst, haben Doppelschlag.\\nImmer wenn ein oder mehrere Spielsteine, die du kontrollierst, einen Spieler angreifen, schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Während eines beliebigen Zuges, in dem du mit einem Spielstein angegriffen hast, kannst du jene Karte spielen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Rebell\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605534&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0878844a-212a-4c89-b2f5-a42ee7ec41dc\', \'multiverseId\': 605534}, \'multiverseid\': 605534}, {\'name\': \'Neyali, avant-garde des soleils\', \'text\': "Les jetons attaquants que vous contrôlez ont la double initiative.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins un jeton que vous contrôlez attaque un joueur, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Pendant chaque tour où vous avez attaqué avec au moins un jeton, vous pouvez jouer cette carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et rebelle\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605546&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ed01e17-7d6c-4088-a1a9-dce3141c306e\', \'multiverseId\': 605546}, \'multiverseid\': 605546}, {\'name\': \'太陽の先兵、ネヤリ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていて攻撃しているすべてのトークンは二段攻撃を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしている１つ以上のトークンがプレイヤー１人を攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。あなたがトークンで攻撃したターンの間、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・レベル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50be91e6-5494-4ec5-921c-00cecb75d766\', \'multiverseId\': 605558}, \'multiverseid\': 605558}, {\'name\': \'五阳先锋奈雅丽\', \'text\': \'由你操控且进行攻击的衍生物具有连击异能。\\n每当由你操控的一个或数个衍生物攻击任一牌手时，放逐你的牌库顶牌。于你以衍生物攻击过的回合中，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／反抗军\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dfdd517-956a-4b2f-89fe-1f15fd544f5d\', \'multiverseId\': 605570}, \'multiverseid\': 605570}]', '[{\'name\': \'Neyali, Vorhut der Sonnen\', \'text\': \'Angreifende Spielsteine, die du kontrollierst, haben Doppelschlag.\\nImmer wenn ein oder mehrere Spielsteine, die du kontrollierst, einen Spieler angreifen, schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Während eines beliebigen Zuges, in dem du mit einem Spielstein angegriffen hast, kannst du jene Karte spielen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Rebell\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605658&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87a52456-9bb9-4c79-b6cd-f42a87247b0c\', \'multiverseId\': 605658}, \'multiverseid\': 605658}, {\'name\': \'Neyali, vanguardia de los soles\', \'text\': \'Las fichas atacantes que controlas tienen la habilidad de dañar dos veces.\\nSiempre que una o más fichas que controlas ataquen a un jugador, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Durante cualquier turno en el que atacaste con una ficha, puedes jugar esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Rebelde humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e04d71e-02a5-4ffb-87c3-218ff4860f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 605660}, \'multiverseid\': 605660}, {\'name\': \'Neyali, avant-garde des soleils\', \'text\': "Les jetons attaquants que vous contrôlez ont la double initiative.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins un jeton que vous contrôlez attaque un joueur, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Pendant chaque tour où vous avez attaqué avec au moins un jeton, vous pouvez jouer cette carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et rebelle\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605662&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c91d92e4-1c23-43db-b118-2c43dd57f14f\', \'multiverseId\': 605662}, \'multiverseid\': 605662}, {\'name\': \'Neyali, Avanguardia dei Soli\', \'text\': \'Le pedine attaccanti che controlli hanno doppio attacco.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più pedine che controlli attaccano un giocatore, esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Durante qualsiasi turno in cui hai attaccato con una pedina, puoi giocare quella carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Ribelle Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd02fbfc-f6ea-418b-9dc6-f367c9ca5d9f\', \'multiverseId\': 605664}, \'multiverseid\': 605664}, {\'name\': \'太陽の先兵、ネヤリ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていて攻撃しているすべてのトークンは二段攻撃を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしている１つ以上のトークンがプレイヤー１人を攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。あなたがトークンで攻撃したターンの間、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・レベル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e47fa63-5c55-4eb6-bf13-02e06600e49f\', \'multiverseId\': 605666}, \'multiverseid\': 605666}, {\'name\': \'Neyali, Vanguarda do Sol\', \'text\': \'As fichas atacantes que você controla têm golpe duplo.\\nToda vez que uma ou mais fichas que você controla atacarem um jogador, exile o card no topo de seu grimório. Durante qualquer turno em que você atacou com uma ficha, você poderá jogar aquele card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Rebelde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea91ff00-21f9-4e3f-a26c-93911126034b\', \'multiverseId\': 605668}, \'multiverseid\': 605668}, {\'name\': \'五阳先锋奈雅丽\', \'text\': \'由你操控且进行攻击的衍生物具有连击异能。\\n每当由你操控的一个或数个衍生物攻击任一牌手时，放逐你的牌库顶牌。于你以衍生物攻击过的回合中，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／反抗军\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d693db8-b048-46ec-865e-4a1e7db6cd62\', \'multiverseId\': 605670}, \'multiverseid\': 605670}]', '[{\'name\': \'Otharri, Ruhm der Sonnen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung, Eile\\nImmer wenn Otharri, Ruhm der Sonnen, angreift, erhältst du eine Erfahrungsmarke. Erzeuge dann für jede Erfahrungsmarke, die du hast, einen getappten und angreifenden 2/2 roten Rebell-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{2}{R}{W}, tappe einen ungetappten Rebellen, den du kontrollierst: Bringe Otharri aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Phoenix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605535&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfea7309-cf40-4024-80f2-6017d571915e\', \'multiverseId\': 605535}, \'multiverseid\': 605535}, {\'name\': \'Otharri, gloire des soleils\', \'text\': "Vol, lien de vie, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Otharri, gloire des soleils attaque, vous gagnez un marqueur « expérience ». Puis créez un jeton de créature 2/2 rouge Rebelle, engagé et attaquant, pour chaque marqueur « expérience » que vous avez.\\n{2}{R}{W}, engagez un rebelle dégagé que vous contrôlez : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, engagé, Otharri depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : phénix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605547&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1aa568c8-de37-4da6-90d2-699ef8328514\', \'multiverseId\': 605547}, \'multiverseid\': 605547}, {\'name\': \'太陽の栄光、オターリ\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂、速攻\\n太陽の栄光、オターリが攻撃するたび、あなたは経験カウンター１個を得る。その後、あなたが持っている経験カウンター１個につき１体の、赤の２/２のレベル・クリーチャー・トークンをタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。\\n{2}{R}{W}, あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態であるレベル１体をタップする：あなたの墓地にある太陽の栄光、オターリをタップ状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — フェニックス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b93b9576-1ccd-448a-9ec3-d7cf3145869c\', \'multiverseId\': 605559}, \'multiverseid\': 605559}, {\'name\': \'五阳荣光欧萨利\', \'text\': \'飞行，系命，敏捷\\n每当五阳荣光欧萨利攻击时，你得到一个经验指示物。然后你每有一个经验指示物，便派出一个2/2红色反抗军衍生生物，其为横置且正进行攻击。\\n{2}{R}{W}，横置一个由你操控且未横置的反抗军：将欧萨利从你的坟墓场横置移回战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～凤凰\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93a218c1-df35-4621-938e-8f1b0d133641\', \'multiverseId\': 605571}, \'multiverseid\': 605571}]', '[{\'name\': \'Otharri, Ruhm der Sonnen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung, Eile\\nImmer wenn Otharri, Ruhm der Sonnen, angreift, erhältst du eine Erfahrungsmarke. Erzeuge dann für jede Erfahrungsmarke, die du hast, einen getappten und angreifenden 2/2 roten Rebell-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{2}{R}{W}, tappe einen ungetappten Rebellen, den du kontrollierst: Bringe Otharri aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Phoenix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605673&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8ad40d4-b0a5-4312-9e12-f3332103db23\', \'multiverseId\': 605673}, \'multiverseid\': 605673}, {\'name\': \'Otharri, gloria de los soles\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vínculo vital, prisa.\\nSiempre que Otharri, gloria de los soles ataque, obtienes un contador de experiencia. Luego crea una ficha de criatura Rebelde roja 2/2 que está girada y atacando por cada contador de experiencia que tengas.\\n{2}{R}{W}, girar un Rebelde enderezado que controlas: Regresa a Otharri de tu cementerio al campo de batalla girado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Fénix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'784f7b09-3a5a-4278-ab9c-a5a84588847d\', \'multiverseId\': 605675}, \'multiverseid\': 605675}, {\'name\': \'Otharri, gloire des soleils\', \'text\': "Vol, lien de vie, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Otharri, gloire des soleils attaque, vous gagnez un marqueur « expérience ». Puis créez un jeton de créature 2/2 rouge Rebelle, engagé et attaquant, pour chaque marqueur « expérience » que vous avez.\\n{2}{R}{W}, engagez un rebelle dégagé que vous contrôlez : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, engagé, Otharri depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : phénix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605677&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1c69f2e-5534-459a-9dee-7b1ea428c6b9\', \'multiverseId\': 605677}, \'multiverseid\': 605677}, {\'name\': \'Otharri, Gloria dei Soli\', \'text\': \'Volare, legame vitale, rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta Otharri, Gloria dei Soli attacca, ottieni un segnalino esperienza. Poi crea una pedina creatura Ribelle 2/2 rossa TAPpata e attaccante per ogni segnalino esperienza che possiedi.\\n{2}{R}{W}, TAPpa un Ribelle STAPpato che controlli: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia Otharri TAPpato dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Fenice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa9d7e6c-88e0-4475-84c0-430cb2e0bba5\', \'multiverseId\': 605679}, \'multiverseid\': 605679}, {\'name\': \'太陽の栄光、オターリ\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂、速攻\\n太陽の栄光、オターリが攻撃するたび、あなたは経験カウンター１個を得る。その後、あなたが持っている経験カウンター１個につき１体の、赤の２/２のレベル・クリーチャー・トークンをタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。\\n{2}{R}{W}, あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態であるレベル１体をタップする：あなたの墓地にある太陽の栄光、オターリをタップ状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — フェニックス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5098f3d0-401b-4dd0-b667-e33ff32563f8\', \'multiverseId\': 605681}, \'multiverseid\': 605681}, {\'name\': \'Otharri, Glória do Sol\', \'text\': \'Voar, vínculo com a vida, ímpeto\\nToda vez que Otharri, Glória do Sol, ataca, você recebe um marcador de experiência. Depois, crie uma ficha de criatura Rebelde vermelha 2/2 virada e atacando para cada marcador de experiência que você tiver.\\n{2}{R}{W}, vire um Rebelde desvirado que você controla: devolva Otharri do seu cemitério para o campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Fênix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d474617-f079-4c77-9a01-9323c86b540a\', \'multiverseId\': 605683}, \'multiverseid\': 605683}, {\'name\': \'五阳荣光欧萨利\', \'text\': \'飞行，系命，敏捷\\n每当五阳荣光欧萨利攻击时，你得到一个经验指示物。然后你每有一个经验指示物，便派出一个2/2红色反抗军衍生生物，其为横置且正进行攻击。\\n{2}{R}{W}，横置一个由你操控且未横置的反抗军：将欧萨利从你的坟墓场横置移回战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～凤凰\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c19f7d4-b602-4733-a1a0-69e2894a85c7\', \'multiverseId\': 605685}, \'multiverseid\': 605685}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pfad der Ahnen\', \'text\': \'Der Pfad der Ahnen kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs. Wenn dieses Mana ausgegeben wird, um einen Kreaturenzauber zu wirken, der einen Kreaturentyp mit deinem Kommandeur gemeinsam hat, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606017&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33dfe5b5-67e4-4d8c-92a5-601f39bf8174\', \'multiverseId\': 606017}, \'multiverseid\': 606017}, {\'name\': \'Senda de los ancestros\', \'text\': \'La Senda de los ancestros entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante. Cuando ese maná se use para lanzar un hechizo de criatura que comparta un tipo de criatura con tu comandante, adivina 1.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afdaccd0-4ab3-4191-82f5-f77ee7319b42\', \'multiverseId\': 606133}, \'multiverseid\': 606133}, {\'name\': "Voie de l\'Ascendance", \'text\': "La Voie de l\'Ascendance arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant. Quand ce mana est dépensé pour lancer un sort de créature qui partage un type de créature avec votre commandant, regard 1.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606249&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c50f82c3-a781-411f-a782-cd9195508c4e\', \'multiverseId\': 606249}, \'multiverseid\': 606249}, {\'name\': \'Sentiero Ancestrale\', \'text\': "Il Sentiero Ancestrale entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante. Quando quel mana viene speso per lanciare una magia creatura che condivide un tipo di creatura con il tuo comandante, profetizza 1.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9155919b-8b4e-4e25-b42a-4479f0b1538e\', \'multiverseId\': 606365}, \'multiverseid\': 606365}, {\'name\': \'祖先の道\', \'text\': \'祖先の道はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。このマナがあなたの統率者と共通のクリーチャー・タイプを持つクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるために支払われたとき、占術１を行う。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0872023e-d0d4-4334-831b-ab5ca7aa9fe4\', \'multiverseId\': 606481}, \'multiverseid\': 606481}, {\'name\': \'Caminho da Ascendência\', \'text\': \'Caminho da Ascendência entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante. Quando aquele mana for gasto para conjurar uma mágica de criatura que compartilhe um tipo de criatura com seu comandante, use vidência 1.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa54bdd2-c806-4a80-8bcd-59a0e38fa6bb\', \'multiverseId\': 606597}, \'multiverseid\': 606597}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phantomgeneral\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenspielsteine, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Nach seinem Tod wurde der General mit gefallenen Soldaten aus über dreißig Feldzügen wiedervereint.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605941&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40c0a03f-60a6-412a-b19a-eed6f9b058c2\', \'multiverseId\': 605941}, \'multiverseid\': 605941}, {\'name\': \'General fantasma\', \'text\': \'Las fichas de criatura que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Tras su muerte, el general se reunió con soldados caídos en más de treinta de sus campañas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6997592c-0122-447e-9759-6b5508e94dd1\', \'multiverseId\': 606057}, \'multiverseid\': 606057}, {\'name\': \'Général fantomatique\', \'text\': \'Les jetons de créature que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Après sa mort, le général retrouva les soldats tombés au champ d\'honneur lors de plus d\'une trentaine de ses campagnes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606173&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25a3e58b-b179-4df0-b859-52f05d93bd99\', \'multiverseId\': 606173}, \'multiverseid\': 606173}, {\'name\': \'Generale Fantasma\', \'text\': \'Le pedine creatura che controlli prendono +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'Dopo la sua morte, il generale si riunì con i caduti di oltre trenta delle sue campagne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01b2c99b-f8ad-4bcb-960b-979d09d5c4a2\', \'multiverseId\': 606289}, \'multiverseid\': 606289}, {\'name\': \'幽霊の将軍\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャー・トークンは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'将軍は死後、三十回以上に及ぶ軍事行動のなかで命を落とした兵士達との再会を果たした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea035f0e-dc0b-4cee-afd6-b3b68d2183fa\', \'multiverseId\': 606405}, \'multiverseid\': 606405}, {\'name\': \'General Fantasma\', \'text\': \'As fichas de criatura que você controla recebem +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Após sua morte, o general reencontrou soldados que tombaram em mais de trinta de suas campanhas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'334fda1e-f1e8-4274-bf3d-b64cb230dd49\', \'multiverseId\': 606521}, \'multiverseid\': 606521}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phyrese-Ausbruch\', \'text\': \'Jeder Gegner erhält eine Giftmarke. Dann erhält jede Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, bis zum Ende des Zuges -1/-1 für jede Giftmarke, die ihr Beherrscher hat.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist amüsant, dass die Fleischlinge glauben, wir seien im Krieg. In Wahrheit sind sie nichts als eine krabbelnde Plage, die ausgelöscht werden muss."\\n—Azax-Azog, der Than der Dämonen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605710&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'636b6a7b-1e39-4408-8fcc-20808179f65a\', \'multiverseId\': 605710}, \'multiverseid\': 605710}, {\'name\': \'Brote de piresis\', \'text\': \'Cada oponente obtiene un contador de veneno. Luego, cada criatura que controlan tus oponentes obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno por cada contador de veneno que tenga su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Es divertido que los carnícolas crean que estamos en guerra. En realidad, no son más que plagas escurridizas que hay que aniquilar".\\n—Azax-Azog, el barón demonio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4674ff13-081d-47da-ae21-b0d6f584c32e\', \'multiverseId\': 605726}, \'multiverseid\': 605726}, {\'name\': \'Flambée de phyrésie\', \'text\': "Chaque adversaire gagne un marqueur « poison ». Puis, chaque créature que vos adversaires contrôlent gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque marqueur « poison » que son contrôleur a.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Il est amusant que les tas de chair croient que nous sommes en guerre. En vérité, ce ne sont que des vermines grouillantes à éradiquer. »\\n—Azax-Azog, thane démon\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605742&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5e41033-e299-4973-9111-4ac8244531bb\', \'multiverseId\': 605742}, \'multiverseid\': 605742}, {\'name\': \'Epidemia di Phyresis\', \'text\': \'Ogni avversario ottiene un segnalino veleno. Poi ogni creatura controllata dai tuoi avversari prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni segnalino veleno che ha il suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"È spassoso che gli esseri di carne credano che siamo in guerra. In verità, non sono altro che parassiti in fuga da estirpare".\\n—Azax-Azog, il Demone Thane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f23b15c4-e342-495d-a745-5dd1fcabf9de\', \'multiverseId\': 605758}, \'multiverseid\': 605758}, {\'name\': \'ファイレクシア病の蔓延\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手はそれぞれ毒カウンター１個を得る。その後、ターン終了時まで、対戦相手がコントロールしている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、それのコントローラーが持っている毒カウンター１個につき－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「肉の抜け殻どもが我々と戦争状態にあるなどと思っているとは、なかなか愉快だ。実のところ、駆除すべき這い回る害虫でしかないというのに。」\\n――悪魔の長、アザックス＝アザグ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1de66498-7160-4bd9-96c5-c7a36d5efacb\', \'multiverseId\': 605774}, \'multiverseid\': 605774}, {\'name\': \'Surto de Phyresis\', \'text\': \'Cada oponente recebe um marcador de veneno. Depois, cada criatura que seus oponentes controlam recebe -1/-1 até o final do turno para cada marcador de veneno que seu controlador tenha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"É incrível que os carnais acreditem que estamos em guerra. Na verdade, eles não são nada além de pragas a serem erradicadas."\\n— Azax-Azog, o Thane Demoníaco\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12ab2401-7e09-4aee-a0a3-23ee3c760343\', \'multiverseId\': 605790}, \'multiverseid\': 605790}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phyrese-Ausbruch\', \'text\': \'Jeder Gegner erhält eine Giftmarke. Dann erhält jede Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, bis zum Ende des Zuges -1/-1 für jede Giftmarke, die ihr Beherrscher hat.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605598&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'567b79c3-eca1-4c2e-a479-37a9fcaa5635\', \'multiverseId\': 605598}, \'multiverseid\': 605598}, {\'name\': \'Flambée de phyrésie\', \'text\': "Chaque adversaire gagne un marqueur « poison ». Puis, chaque créature que vos adversaires contrôlent gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque marqueur « poison » que son contrôleur a.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605614&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3a1c768-d4a9-485b-badf-059f6d77a52d\', \'multiverseId\': 605614}, \'multiverseid\': 605614}, {\'name\': \'ファイレクシア病の蔓延\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手はそれぞれ毒カウンター１個を得る。その後、ターン終了時まで、対戦相手がコントロールしている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、それのコントローラーが持っている毒カウンター１個につき－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eb0e735-7413-4cea-ba1a-a6e265470fad\', \'multiverseId\': 605630}, \'multiverseid\': 605630}, {\'name\': \'猛爆非瑞化\', \'text\': \'每位对手各得到一个中毒指示物。然后对每个由对手操控的生物而言，其操控者每有一个中毒指示物，它便得-1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9667f6f-cbcd-43ad-8ba7-c94c79345952\', \'multiverseId\': 605646}, \'multiverseid\': 605646}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phyrexianische Wiedergeburt\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen und erzeuge dann einen X/X farblosen Phyrexianer-Schrecken-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen ist, die auf diese Weise zerstört wurden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Solange noch ein Tropfen Öl existiert, geht es fröhlich weiter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605942&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'977e8ed0-b2d3-4e6f-8584-fb63eb49baf2\', \'multiverseId\': 605942}, \'multiverseid\': 605942}, {\'name\': \'Renacimiento pirexiano\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas, luego crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Horror Pirexiano incolora X/X, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas destruidas de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras exista una gota de ese aceite, la dichosa labor continúa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46ff901a-f3e2-4bff-bb2d-dcf14f85fa6d\', \'multiverseId\': 606058}, \'multiverseid\': 606058}, {\'name\': \'Renaissance phyrexiane\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures, puis créez un jeton de créature-artefact X/X incolore Phyrexian et Horreur, X étant le nombre de créatures détruites de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Tant qu\'il subsistera une goutte de pétrole, notre mission de joie continuera.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606174&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4cee46d-5ce0-4084-871d-f2800d9e2d62\', \'multiverseId\': 606174}, \'multiverseid\': 606174}, {\'name\': \'Rinascita di Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature, poi crea una pedina creatura artefatto Orrore Phyrexiano X/X incolore, dove X è il numero di creature distrutte in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Finché esiste una goccia dell\'olio, l\'allegro lavoro continua.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ca093c5-2852-41ae-acb9-5e6d2e655e58\', \'multiverseId\': 606290}, \'multiverseid\': 606290}, {\'name\': \'ファイレクシアの再誕\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーを破壊し、その後、無色のＸ/Ｘのファイレクシアン・ホラー・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。Ｘはこれにより破壊されたクリーチャーの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'油が一滴でもあるかぎり、喜びに満ちた業は続く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7ffd57c-2941-42ea-a1bf-df92783db46c\', \'multiverseId\': 606406}, \'multiverseid\': 606406}, {\'name\': \'Renascimento Phyrexiano\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas e, em seguida, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Phyrexiano Horror incolor X/X, sendo X o número de criaturas destruídas dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto ainda houver uma gota do óleo, a obra jubilosa terá continuidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b36557b-2a83-48b1-971f-df7dedae78a7\', \'multiverseId\': 606522}, \'multiverseid\': 606522}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phyrexianischer Schwarmführer\', \'text\': \'Infizieren (Diese Kreatur fügt Schaden in Form von -1/-1-Marken für Kreaturen und von Giftmarken für Spieler zu.)\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erzeugst du für jede Giftmarke, die deine Gegner haben, einen 1/1 grünen Phyrexianer-Insekt-Kreaturenspielstein mit Infizieren.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Insekt, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605967&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3d56b79-c81e-4c93-b25e-f27f36ad3d0b\', \'multiverseId\': 605967}, \'multiverseid\': 605967}, {\'name\': \'Señor de enjambres pirexiano\', \'text\': \'Infectar. (Esta criatura hace daño a las criaturas en forma de contadores -1/-1 y a los jugadores en forma de contadores de veneno.)\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, crea una ficha de criatura Insecto Pirexiano verde 1/1 con la habilidad de infectar por cada contador de veneno que tengan tus oponentes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror insecto pirexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'830698a6-7b27-4f13-9fad-c198197e3d87\', \'multiverseId\': 606083}, \'multiverseid\': 606083}, {\'name\': "Seigneur d\'essaim phyrexian", \'text\': "Infection (Cette créature inflige des blessures aux créatures sous la forme de marqueurs -1/-1 et aux joueurs sous la forme de marqueurs « poison ».)\\nAu début de votre entretien, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Phyrexian et Insecte avec l\'infection pour chaque marqueur « poison » que vos adversaires ont.", \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et insecte et horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606199&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76411c01-47c8-4b0e-9e77-a5be50d997e2\', \'multiverseId\': 606199}, \'multiverseid\': 606199}, {\'name\': \'Signore degli Sciami di Phyrexia\', \'text\': "Infettare (Questa creatura infligge danno alle creature sotto forma di segnalini -1/-1 e ai giocatori sotto forma di segnalini veleno.)\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, crea una pedina creatura Insetto Phyrexiano 1/1 verde con infettare per ogni segnalino veleno che hanno i tuoi avversari.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Insetto Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2016fb58-a803-4bbe-9808-0dbf0f078338\', \'multiverseId\': 606315}, \'multiverseid\': 606315}, {\'name\': \'ファイレクシアの群れの王\', \'text\': \'感染（このクリーチャーはダメージを、クリーチャーには－１/－１カウンターの形で、プレイヤーには毒カウンターの形で与える。）\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手が持つ毒カウンター１個につき１体の、感染を持つ緑の１/１のファイレクシアン・昆虫・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・昆虫・ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6164e0a-9f85-4d3e-b8de-ba78f7e2f3a6\', \'multiverseId\': 606431}, \'multiverseid\': 606431}, {\'name\': \'Senhor de Enxame Phyrexiano\', \'text\': \'Infectar (Esta criatura causa dano a criaturas na forma de marcadores -1/-1 e a jogadores na forma de marcadores de veneno.)\\nNo início de sua manutenção, crie uma ficha de criatura Phyrexiano Inseto verde 1/1 com infectar para cada marcador de veneno que seus oponentes têm.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Phyrexiano Inseto Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1ad1992-a8b0-4e09-84cf-fbcf63aaae1c\', \'multiverseId\': 606547}, \'multiverseid\': 606547}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phyrexias Liebkosung\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht drei Karten, verliert 3 Lebenspunkte und erhält drei Giftmarken.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bin schwach. Mache … mich … perfekt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605948&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3102f4e-26b6-4c30-b23f-4d7660ea750a\', \'multiverseId\': 605948}, \'multiverseid\': 605948}, {\'name\': \'Caricia de Pirexia\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo roba tres cartas, pierde 3 vidas y obtiene tres contadores de veneno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Soy débil. Hazme... perfecto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'beb771e0-f10d-4e9d-a477-09b2f5eabf55\', \'multiverseId\': 606064}, \'multiverseid\': 606064}, {\'name\': \'Caresse de Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'Un joueur ciblé pioche trois cartes, perd 3 points de vie et gagne trois marqueurs « poison ».\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Je suis faible. Donnez-moi... la... perfection. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606180&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a987881-d1ca-479f-82b0-bef302097ec6\', \'multiverseId\': 606180}, \'multiverseid\': 606180}, {\'name\': \'Carezza di Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio pesca tre carte, perde 3 punti vita e ottiene tre segnalini veleno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono debole. Rendi... mi... ideale."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8fa3a40-9396-4422-9847-f6686aef6e90\', \'multiverseId\': 606296}, \'multiverseid\': 606296}, {\'name\': \'ファイレクシアの愛撫\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード３枚を引き、３点のライフを失い、毒カウンター３個を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「私は弱い。私を……理想の……姿に。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'875399b0-54c2-4de5-843b-63f015a0ca69\', \'multiverseId\': 606412}, \'multiverseid\': 606412}, {\'name\': \'Carícia de Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo compra três cards, perde 3 pontos de vida e recebe três marcadores de veneno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu sou fraco. Torne-me ... ideal."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fc00a71-9811-4e8d-8962-80789ef23fec\', \'multiverseId\': 606528}, \'multiverseid\': 606528}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pionierstiefel\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Nichtstandardlandtarnung. (Sie kann nicht geblockt werden, solange der verteidigende Spieler ein Nichtstandardland kontrolliert.)\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist einfacher, die Orte aufzuzählen, an denen sie noch *nicht* waren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606000&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4cb2164-31c3-407a-93b4-f5a9783e4fb9\', \'multiverseId\': 606000}, \'multiverseid\': 606000}, {\'name\': \'Botas del pionero\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene la habilidad de cruzar tierras no básicas. (No puede ser bloqueada mientras el jugador defensor controle una tierra no básica.)\\nEquipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Es mucho más fácil listar los lugares donde no han estado.**\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48c877bb-3d6e-42ff-a589-d7fe20117562\', \'multiverseId\': 606116}, \'multiverseid\': 606116}, {\'name\': \'Bottes de pionnier\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée a la traversée des terrains non-base. (Elle ne peut pas être bloquée tant que le joueur défenseur contrôle au moins un terrain non-base.)\\nÉquipement {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Il est plus facile de faire la liste des endroits où elles n\'ont *pas* été.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606232&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'587530cc-7a20-4c1f-8fec-c9b8cfcc6caa\', \'multiverseId\': 606232}, \'multiverseid\': 606232}, {\'name\': \'Stivali del Pioniere\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha passa-terre non base. (Non può essere bloccata fintanto che il giocatore in difesa controlla una terra non base.)\\nEquipaggiare {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'È molto più semplice elencare i posti in cui *non* sono stati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3603808b-afcd-45ec-a3f1-9526d1a3d320\', \'multiverseId\': 606348}, \'multiverseid\': 606348}, {\'name\': \'先駆者の長靴\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは基本でない土地渡りを持つ。（それは防御プレイヤーが基本でない土地をコントロールしているかぎりブロックされない。）\\n装備{2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'彼らにとっては、行ったことの*ない*場所を並べる方が楽だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5a936de-3870-4b34-a130-b9b3870cd846\', \'multiverseId\': 606464}, \'multiverseid\': 606464}, {\'name\': \'Botas do Desbravador\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem travessia de terreno não básico. (Ela não poderá ser bloqueada enquanto o jogador defensor controlar um terreno não básico.)\\nEquipar {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'É muito mais fácil listar os lugares em que elas *não* estiveram.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cb28fd0-ac99-43e1-9a66-f2881aa8d059\', \'multiverseId\': 606580}, \'multiverseid\': 606580}]', '[{\'name\': \'Prava von der Stahllegion\', \'text\': \'Solange es dein Zug ist, erhalten Kreaturenspielsteine, die du kontrollierst, +1/+4.\\n{3}{W}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nPartner (Du kannst zwei Kommandeure haben, falls beide Partner haben.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Katze, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605943&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d5b1ab9-8244-431d-b5bc-8e491aa27e66\', \'multiverseId\': 605943}, \'multiverseid\': 605943}, {\'name\': \'Prava de la Legión de Acero\', \'text\': \'Mientras sea tu turno, las fichas de criatura que controlas obtienen +1/+4.\\n{3}{W}: Crea una ficha de criatura Soldado blanca 1/1.\\nCamarada. (Puedes tener dos comandantes si ambos tienen camarada.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1457cb5-45b1-4d59-9dd2-eb74c27eb58e\', \'multiverseId\': 606059}, \'multiverseid\': 606059}, {\'name\': "Prava de la Légion d\'acier", \'text\': "Tant que c\'est votre tour, les jetons de créature que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+4.\\n{3}{W} : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat.\\nPartenariat (Vous pouvez avoir deux commandants si les deux ont le partenariat.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : chat et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606175&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b9064ea-847b-406b-b14b-27751d743e14\', \'multiverseId\': 606175}, \'multiverseid\': 606175}, {\'name\': "Prava della Legione d\'Acciaio", \'text\': \'Fintanto che è il tuo turno, le pedine creatura che controlli prendono +1/+4.\\n{3}{W}: Crea una pedina creatura Soldato 1/1 bianca.\\nPartner (Puoi avere due comandanti se entrambi hanno partner.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26b46bb0-7bb9-4135-bc24-da702bda81da\', \'multiverseId\': 606291}, \'multiverseid\': 606291}, {\'name\': \'鋼軍団のプラヴァ\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンであるかぎり、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャー・トークンは＋１/＋４の修整を受ける。\\n{3}{W}：白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n共闘（両方が共闘を持つなら、あなたは２体の統率者を使用できる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 猫・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c6d331c-9910-46fa-856c-d0e02901db67\', \'multiverseId\': 606407}, \'multiverseid\': 606407}, {\'name\': \'Prava da Legião de Aço\', \'text\': \'Enquanto for o seu turno, as fichas de criatura que você controla receberão +1/+4.\\n{3}{W}: Crie uma ficha de criatura Soldado branca 1/1.\\nParceiro (Você pode ter dois comandantes se ambos tiverem parceiro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Felino Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32cc83d6-a969-4d7b-b2a9-705741c7f28a\', \'multiverseId\': 606523}, \'multiverseid\': 606523}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ruft die Kupferjacken\', \'text\': \'Streben — Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {1}{W} mehr.\\nBestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an Gegnern deiner Wahl. Erzeuge X 1/1 weiße Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen ist, die jene Gegner kontrollieren.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Alarmkristalle aufleuchten, machen sich die besten Krieger von Drannith auf den Weg.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605916&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'315f395c-e188-4e9e-8258-9e73890c7bf4\', \'multiverseId\': 605916}, \'multiverseid\': 605916}, {\'name\': \'Llamar a las Capas de Cobre\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Te cuesta {1}{W} más lanzar este hechizo por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nElige cualquier cantidad de oponentes objetivo. Crea X fichas de criatura Soldado Humano blancas 1/1, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas que esos oponentes controlan.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando destellan los cristales de alarma, los mejores de Drannith acuden a la llamada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94e6d348-063c-4755-a9fc-bbb28aff6277\', \'multiverseId\': 606032}, \'multiverseid\': 606032}, {\'name\': \'Appelez les Capes de cuivre !\', \'text\': "Obstination — Ce sort coûte {1}{W} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nChoisissez n\'importe quel nombre d\'adversaires ciblés. Créez X jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat, X étant le nombre de créatures que ces adversaires contrôlent.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Quand les cristaux d\'alerte s\'illuminent, c\'est l\'élite de Drannith qui répond à l\'appel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606148&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8807b264-0039-4440-9310-67b66c811afe\', \'multiverseId\': 606148}, \'multiverseid\': 606148}, {\'name\': \'Convocare le Giubbe Ramate\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — Questa magia costa {1}{W} in più per essere lanciata per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli un qualsiasi numero di avversari bersaglio. Crea X pedine creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianche, dove X è il numero di creature controllate da quegli avversari.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Quando i cristalli d\'allarme si illuminano, i migliori soldati di Drannith rispondono alla chiamata.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'619698c4-84f6-42ee-9f00-eb347ae4c131\', \'multiverseId\': 606264}, \'multiverseid\': 606264}, {\'name\': \'銅纏いの呼集\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{1}{W}多くなる。\\n望む数の対戦相手を対象とする。白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはそれらの対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーの総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'警報水晶が光るとき、ドラニスの警官たちがそれに応える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1a4cabd-5977-4a2c-8fbb-4a1232c37396\', \'multiverseId\': 606380}, \'multiverseid\': 606380}, {\'name\': \'Convocar os Gibões de Cobre\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Esta mágica custa {1}{W} a mais para ser conjurada para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nEscolha qualquer número de oponentes alvo. Crie X fichas de criatura Humano Soldado branca 1/1, sendo X o número de criaturas que aqueles oponentes controlam.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Quando os cristais se acendem em alarme, os melhores de Drannith atendem ao chamado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74b4bd2a-b5d9-461b-8259-0838ddfc82dd\', \'multiverseId\': 606496}, \'multiverseid\': 606496}]', "[{'name': 'Rüstung aus Knäuelgeflecht', 'text': 'Lebende Waffe (Wenn diese Ausrüstung ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 0/0 schwarzen Phyrexianer-Keim-Kreaturenspielstein und lege sie dann an ihn an.)\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +X/+X, wobei X gleich dem höchsten Manabetrag unter deinen Kommandeuren ist.\\nAusrüsten {4}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605464&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15124996-1609-431e-8455-9d4e18c6989f', 'multiverseId': 605464}, 'multiverseid': 605464}, {'name': 'Armadura enmarañada', 'text': 'Arma viviente. (Cuando este Equipo entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Germen Pirexiano negra 0/0 y luego anéxalo a ella.)\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +X/+X, donde X es el mayor valor de maná entre tus comandantes.\\nEquipar {4}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605472&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51663687-e1a5-4fd9-b7e6-af7c32edeb4f', 'multiverseId': 605472}, 'multiverseid': 605472}, {'name': 'Armure de la Filandre', 'text': 'Arme vivante (Quand cet équipement arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Phyrexian et Germe, puis attachez-lui cet équipement.)\\nLa créature équipée gagne +X/+X, X étant la valeur de mana la plus élevée parmi vos commandants.\\nÉquipement {4}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605480&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '805ee01c-b609-4b95-9203-c94a567254bc', 'multiverseId': 605480}, 'multiverseid': 605480}, {'name': 'Armatura Tessigroviglio', 'text': 'Arma vivente (Quando questo Equipaggiamento entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Microbo Phyrexiano 0/0 nera, poi assegnalo ad essa.)\\nLa creatura equipaggiata prende +X/+X, dove X è il valore di mana maggiore tra i tuoi comandanti.\\nEquipaggiare {4}', 'type': 'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605488&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0eac1ad-46af-4e06-8077-0954554cfbb6', 'multiverseId': 605488}, 'multiverseid': 605488}, {'name': '絡み織りの鎧', 'text': '生体武器（この装備品が戦場に出たとき、黒の０/０のファイレクシアン・細菌・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。その後、これをそれにつける。）\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたの統率者の中のマナ総量の最大値に等しい。\\n装備{4}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605496&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '817b4cd0-5ade-4572-ac35-2e5b57483d9d', 'multiverseId': 605496}, 'multiverseid': 605496}, {'name': 'Armadura Emaranhada', 'text': 'Arma viva (Quando este Equipamento entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Germe Phyrexiano preta 0/0 e anexe-o a ela.)\\nA criatura equipada recebe +X/+X, sendo X o maior valor de mana entre seus comandantes.\\nEquipar {4}', 'type': 'Artefato — Equipamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605504&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '386a95a8-96aa-4216-aedd-cdf73ce62a1b', 'multiverseId': 605504}, 'multiverseid': 605504}, {'name': '铬铜林织甲', 'text': '活化武器（当此武具进战场时，派出一个0/0黑色非瑞人／病菌衍生生物，然后将它贴附于其上。）\\n佩带此武具的生物得+X/+X，X为你指挥官中的最大法术力值。\\n佩带{4}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605512&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c987c030-6930-42bb-b11e-b9330cde8ff5', 'multiverseId': 605512}, 'multiverseid': 605512}]", "[{'name': 'Rüstung aus Knäuelgeflecht', 'text': 'Lebende Waffe\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +X/+X, wobei X gleich dem höchsten Manabetrag unter deinen Kommandeuren ist.\\nAusrüsten {4}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605532&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b93af1e-4113-4516-ba3a-bd1898c41d15', 'multiverseId': 605532}, 'multiverseid': 605532}, {'name': 'Armure de la Filandre', 'text': 'Arme vivante\\nLa créature équipée gagne +X/+X, X étant la valeur de mana la plus élevée parmi vos commandants.\\nÉquipement {4}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605544&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a685c089-5ba3-4402-8dc8-2a3015cc2969', 'multiverseId': 605544}, 'multiverseid': 605544}, {'name': '絡み織りの鎧', 'text': '生体武器\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたの統率者の中のマナ総量の最大値に等しい。\\n装備{4}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605556&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '892dddf5-f737-4912-872f-3cc5eec2aeed', 'multiverseId': 605556}, 'multiverseid': 605556}, {'name': '铬铜林织甲', 'text': '活化武器\\n佩带此武具的生物得+X/+X，X为你指挥官中的最大法术力值。\\n佩带{4}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605568&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '67c9d01f-a121-4d77-9a1d-3455fa9125a2', 'multiverseId': 605568}, 'multiverseid': 605568}]", "[{'name': 'Sandsteppenzitadelle', 'text': 'Die Sandsteppenzitadelle kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}, {B} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Was standhaft ist, überlebt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606018&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef60837e-368a-4497-bc4f-bc057cb589a1', 'multiverseId': 606018}, 'multiverseid': 606018}, {'name': 'Ciudadela esteparenosa', 'text': 'La Ciudadela esteparenosa entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}, {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Aquello que resiste, sobrevive.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606134&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08076065-4b80-4253-8d6e-eba42f7c533f', 'multiverseId': 606134}, 'multiverseid': 606134}, {'name': 'Citadelle de la steppe de sable', 'text': 'La Citadelle de la steppe de sable arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}, {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Ce qui perdure survit.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606250&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a52f1d66-3051-40b9-ba50-31d7e81cf8b4', 'multiverseId': 606250}, 'multiverseid': 606250}, {'name': 'Roccaforte delle Steppe Sabbiose', 'text': 'La Roccaforte delle Steppe Sabbiose entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}, {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Ciò che resiste, sopravvive.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606366&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7474c217-9741-41ec-b75e-4c50cab43d8f', 'multiverseId': 606366}, 'multiverseid': 606366}, {'name': '砂草原の城塞', 'text': '砂草原の城塞はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '耐久できるものだけが生き残る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606482&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53776402-a0bd-4469-93f1-3cad2f5cb767', 'multiverseId': 606482}, 'multiverseid': 606482}, {'name': 'Cidadela da Estepe Arenosa', 'text': 'Cidadela da Estepe Arenosa entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}, {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Aquilo que resiste sobrevive.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606598&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5fc00c12-b7e1-4010-b5ef-21f5f95a80da', 'multiverseId': 606598}, 'multiverseid': 606598}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schloss Ardenthal\', \'text\': \'Schloss Ardenthal kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst eine Ebene.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}.\\n{2}{W}{W}, {T}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ohne das Pflichtbewusstsein von Ardenthal würde sich das Reich gierig selbst verschlingen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606005&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01e8834f-0550-423f-9e93-a393a90c39d8\', \'multiverseId\': 606005}, \'multiverseid\': 606005}, {\'name\': \'Castillo del Valle de Arden\', \'text\': \'El Castillo del Valle de Arden entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles una Llanura.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}.\\n{2}{W}{W}, {T}: Crea una ficha de criatura Humano blanca 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Sin la lealtad del Valle de Arden, el reino acabaría devorándose a sí mismo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2817aab8-7842-4154-acd8-1328d93825ff\', \'multiverseId\': 606121}, \'multiverseid\': 606121}, {\'name\': \'Château Ardenval\', \'text\': \'Le Château Ardenval arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez une plaine.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}.\\n{2}{W}{W}, {T} : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Sans la loyauté d\'Ardenval, le royaume se dévorerait lui-même avec avidité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606237&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b727e8a-20c4-4a9d-b0c8-da10630f0fad\', \'multiverseId\': 606237}, \'multiverseid\': 606237}, {\'name\': \'Castello di Ardenvalle\', \'text\': \'Il Castello di Ardenvalle entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli una Pianura.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}.\\n{2}{W}{W}, {T}: Crea una pedina creatura Umano 1/1 bianca.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Senza la lealtà di Ardenvalle, il reame divorerebbe se stesso voracemente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f98704f3-ae3a-4b35-9007-434fc67b7820\', \'multiverseId\': 606353}, \'multiverseid\': 606353}, {\'name\': \'アーデンベイル城\', \'text\': \'あなたが平地をコントロールしていないかぎり、アーデンベイル城はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}を加える。\\n{2}{W}{W}, {T}：白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'アーデンベイルの忠誠がなければ、王国は貪欲に自らを食い潰してしまうだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30394ed2-216e-4e21-82a0-bc09d4dc2ecc\', \'multiverseId\': 606469}, \'multiverseid\': 606469}, {\'name\': \'Castelo do Vale Arden\', \'text\': \'Castelo do Vale Arden entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle uma Planície.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}.\\n{2}{W}{W}, {T}: Crie uma ficha de criatura Humano branca 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Sem a lealdade do Vale Arden, o reino devoraria gananciosamente a si mesmo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94527631-307b-4226-b775-60887b4a5df8\', \'multiverseId\': 606585}, \'multiverseid\': 606585}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schloss Funkenhort\', \'text\': \'Schloss Funkenhort kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst ein Gebirge.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}.\\n{1}{R}{R}, {T}: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ohne den Mut von Funkenhort würde das Reich wanken und fallen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606006&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec0b0ed8-745d-4d04-9bfd-14829478addf\', \'multiverseId\': 606006}, \'multiverseid\': 606006}, {\'name\': \'Castillo de Monteascua\', \'text\': \'El Castillo de Monteascua entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles una Montaña.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}.\\n{1}{R}{R}, {T}: Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Sin la valentía de Monteascua, el reino flaquearía y se derrumbaría.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3022440d-2fbf-4dd6-bded-55bc2254cdf6\', \'multiverseId\': 606122}, \'multiverseid\': 606122}, {\'name\': \'Château Braisereth\', \'text\': "Le Château Braisereth arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez une montagne.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}.\\n{1}{R}{R}, {T} : Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Sans le courage de Braisereth, le royaume fléchirait et tomberait.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606238&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dfdfe1a-2924-4ce2-a86a-49723bbad586\', \'multiverseId\': 606238}, \'multiverseid\': 606238}, {\'name\': \'Castello di Bracerocca\', \'text\': \'Il Castello di Bracerocca entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli una Montagna.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}.\\n{1}{R}{R}, {T}: Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Senza il coraggio di Bracerocca, il reame vacillerebbe e crollerebbe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bad0275-25b7-481a-a312-6b9cdf818847\', \'multiverseId\': 606354}, \'multiverseid\': 606354}, {\'name\': \'エンバレス城\', \'text\': \'あなたが山をコントロールしていないかぎり、エンバレス城はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}を加える。\\n{1}{R}{R}, {T}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'エンバレスの勇気がなければ、王国はよろめき崩れてしまうだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd068953-6a21-415d-9a63-8397f0b05f28\', \'multiverseId\': 606470}, \'multiverseid\': 606470}, {\'name\': \'Castelo de Brasoreth\', \'text\': \'Castelo de Brasoreth entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle uma Montanha.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}.\\n{1}{R}{R}, {T}: As criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Sem a coragem de Brasoreth, o reino fraquejaria e cairia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d36d175f-0f04-4a1d-b4d7-938d057a6619\', \'multiverseId\': 606586}, \'multiverseid\': 606586}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schmerzliche Wahrheit\', \'text\': \'Konvergenz — Du ziehst X Karten und verlierst X Lebenspunkte, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an unterschiedlichen Farben von Mana ist, das ausgegeben wurde, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Eldrazi sich ausbreiteten, scheuten Zendikars Verteidiger auf der Suche nach Geheimnissen, die ihnen einen Vorteil bringen könnten, keine Gefahren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605951&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'814da778-aef3-4164-8bb0-89f7f7badfc7\', \'multiverseId\': 605951}, \'multiverseid\': 605951}, {\'name\': \'Verdades que duelen\', \'text\': \'Converger — Robas X cartas y pierdes X vidas, donde X es la cantidad de colores de maná usados para lanzar este hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'A medida que los Eldrazi avanzaban, se dejó de pensar en los riesgos de cualquier secreto que otorgara ventaja a los defensores de Zendikar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73617e44-8f82-4c57-a9f2-53b676ac4284\', \'multiverseId\': 606067}, \'multiverseid\': 606067}, {\'name\': \'Vérités douloureuses\', \'text\': \'Convergence — Vous piochez X cartes et vous perdez X points de vie, X étant le nombre de couleurs de mana dépensé pour lancer ce sort.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Avec la multiplication des Eldrazi, aucun périple n\'était trop dangereux s\'il permettait de dénicher un secret pouvant avantager les défenseurs de Zendikar.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606183&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eee1a9f9-7080-400c-8dd9-a05fd735f5fc\', \'multiverseId\': 606183}, \'multiverseid\': 606183}, {\'name\': \'Verità Dolorose\', \'text\': \'Convergenza — Peschi X carte e perdi X punti vita, dove X è il numero di colori di mana spesi per lanciare questa magia.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Con l\'avanzata degli Eldrazi, nessun segreto che potesse offrire un vantaggio ai difensori di Zendikar venne considerato troppo pericoloso da perseguire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9b4da5d-c3d0-4298-b9bb-e101736c5fd6\', \'multiverseId\': 606299}, \'multiverseid\': 606299}, {\'name\': \'苦い真理\', \'text\': \'収斂 ― あなたはカードＸ枚を引き、Ｘ点のライフを失う。Ｘはこの呪文を唱えるために支払われたマナの色の種類数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージが増えるにつれ、ゼンディカー防衛隊を有利にする秘密であれば、探すのに命を惜しむ者は少なくなっていった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee14de50-6120-438d-a14b-23435ffdf658\', \'multiverseId\': 606415}, \'multiverseid\': 606415}, {\'name\': \'Verdades Dolorosas\', \'text\': \'Convergir — Você compra X cards e perde X pontos de vida, sendo X o número de cores de mana gasto para conjurar esta mágica.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme os Eldrazi se alastraram, nenhum segredo que pudesse dar alguma vantagem aos defensores de Zendikar foi considerado perigoso demais para ser investigado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bcc711a-687e-4053-8f74-51b1c63c3ceb\', \'multiverseId\': 606531}, \'multiverseid\': 606531}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwerter zu Pflugscharen\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Ihr Beherrscher erhält Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine Klinge hat eine Schneise des Lichts geschlagen, ein Weg, auf dem der Frieden folgen wird."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605945&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f13ab492-bf9c-4415-9399-80d871a82e65\', \'multiverseId\': 605945}, \'multiverseid\': 605945}, {\'name\': \'Espadas en guadañas\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo. Su controlador gana una cantidad de vidas igual a su fuerza.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi filo ha labrado un camino de luz para la paz venidera".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b85bf55b-5755-45d5-a444-c7f9322c4bf2\', \'multiverseId\': 606061}, \'multiverseid\': 606061}, {\'name\': \'Retour au pays\', \'text\': \'Exilez une créature ciblée. Son contrôleur gagne un nombre de points de vie égal à sa force.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Ma lame a tracé un arc de lumière annonçant la paix à venir. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606177&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98b364ca-249d-497b-be38-a048e1fb913d\', \'multiverseId\': 606177}, \'multiverseid\': 606177}, {\'name\': \'Da Spade a Spighe!\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore guadagna punti vita pari alla sua forza.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il fendente della mia lama ha aperto una via di luce per la pace del domani."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aef562b-f53a-4503-899e-5b49f7bead11\', \'multiverseId\': 606293}, \'multiverseid\': 606293}, {\'name\': \'剣を鍬に\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。それのコントローラーは、それのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「我が剣が未来の平和への道を切り開いた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'398c5bac-620a-4e00-8a5a-eee4f0804346\', \'multiverseId\': 606409}, \'multiverseid\': 606409}, {\'name\': \'Espadas em Arados\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura alvo. Seu controlador ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao seu poder.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O arco de minha lâmina esculpiu um caminho de luz para a paz que virá."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce0605ba-6282-469e-8693-14a1b7bf675a\', \'multiverseId\': 606525}, \'multiverseid\': 606525}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sekretklauenmyr\', \'text\': \'Infizieren (Diese Kreatur fügt Schaden in Form von -1/-1-Marken für Kreaturen und von Giftmarken für Spieler zu.)\\nImmer wenn der Sekretklauenmyr geblockt wird, erhält er +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Phyrexianer, Myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605989&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb6a0665-3941-4b1d-bde7-ac308757d74d\', \'multiverseId\': 605989}, \'multiverseid\': 605989}, {\'name\': \'Myr garra icórida\', \'text\': \'Infectar. (Esta criatura hace daño a las criaturas en forma de contadores -1/-1 y a los jugadores en forma de contadores de veneno.)\\nSiempre que el Myr garra icórida sea bloqueado, obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Myr pirexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adb1a544-29eb-43bc-bc21-6977ca3268a9\', \'multiverseId\': 606105}, \'multiverseid\': 606105}, {\'name\': \'Myr sanigriffe\', \'text\': "Infection (Cette créature inflige des blessures aux créatures sous la forme de marqueurs -1/-1 et aux joueurs sous la forme de marqueurs « poison ».)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Myr sanigriffe devient bloqué, il gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : phyrexian et myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606221&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'740ad31e-420d-4d91-8e7b-bd627a973aab\', \'multiverseId\': 606221}, \'multiverseid\': 606221}, {\'name\': "Myr dagli Artigli d\'Icore", \'text\': "Infettare (Questa creatura infligge danno alle creature sotto forma di segnalini -1/-1 e ai giocatori sotto forma di segnalini veleno.)\\nOgniqualvolta il Myr dagli Artigli d\'Icore viene bloccato, prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Myr Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d318269d-df5f-4758-a609-604eecc73d7e\', \'multiverseId\': 606337}, \'multiverseid\': 606337}, {\'name\': \'胆液爪のマイア\', \'text\': \'感染（このクリーチャーはダメージを、クリーチャーには－１/－１カウンターの形で、プレイヤーには毒カウンターの形で与える。）\\n胆液爪のマイアがブロックされた状態になるたび、ターン終了時まで、これは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・マイア\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb6637fc-3063-4dc6-87ab-115438d94209\', \'multiverseId\': 606453}, \'multiverseid\': 606453}, {\'name\': \'Myr da Garra Icorídia\', \'text\': \'Infectar (Esta criatura causa dano a criaturas na forma de marcadores -1/-1 e a jogadores na forma de marcadores de veneno.)\\nToda vez que Myr da Garra Icorídia é bloqueado, ele recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Phyrexiano Myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a61c88d-edb5-4b19-a2c1-c2e9654ed904\', \'multiverseId\': 606569}, \'multiverseid\': 606569}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seuchenmyr\', \'text\': \'Infizieren (Diese Kreatur fügt Schaden in Form von -1/-1-Marken für Kreaturen und von Giftmarken für Spieler zu.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Phyrexianer, Myr\', \'flavor\': \'Sie halten Ausschau nach einem neuen Meister, der noch finsterer ist als sein Vorgänger.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605995&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8f87a7b-a423-449a-aaf5-a3a43559850b\', \'multiverseId\': 605995}, \'multiverseid\': 605995}, {\'name\': \'Myr de la plaga\', \'text\': \'Infectar. (Esta criatura hace daño a las criaturas en forma de contadores -1/-1 y a los jugadores en forma de contadores de veneno.)\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Myr pirexiano\', \'flavor\': \'Buscan un nuevo amo, uno más siniestro que el último.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca1d0694-7775-4eaf-b402-606d52e65269\', \'multiverseId\': 606111}, \'multiverseid\': 606111}, {\'name\': \'Myr de peste\', \'text\': \'Infection (Cette créature inflige des blessures aux créatures sous la forme de marqueurs -1/-1 et aux joueurs sous la forme de marqueurs « poison ».)\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : phyrexian et myr\', \'flavor\': \'Ils cherchent un nouveau maître plus sinistre que le précédent.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606227&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee61b751-fb1f-4d09-afb7-6103d67a43ee\', \'multiverseId\': 606227}, \'multiverseid\': 606227}, {\'name\': \'Myr della Peste\', \'text\': \'Infettare (Questa creatura infligge danno alle creature sotto forma di segnalini -1/-1 e ai giocatori sotto forma di segnalini veleno.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Myr Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': "Cercano un nuovo padrone, uno più funesto dell\'ultimo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ad36650-fa9c-4fdd-98c3-47c26586964c\', \'multiverseId\': 606343}, \'multiverseid\': 606343}, {\'name\': \'疫病のマイア\', \'text\': \'感染（このクリーチャーはダメージを、クリーチャーには－１/－１カウンターの形で、プレイヤーには毒カウンターの形で与える。）\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・マイア\', \'flavor\': \'彼らが探しているのは新たな主、それもかつてよりさらに邪悪な者だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea15d463-0000-41d2-9ca6-239f3b80b48a\', \'multiverseId\': 606459}, \'multiverseid\': 606459}, {\'name\': \'Myr da Praga\', \'text\': \'Infectar (Esta criatura causa dano a criaturas na forma de marcadores -1/-1 e a jogadores na forma de marcadores de veneno.)\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Phyrexiano Myr\', \'flavor\': \'Eles aguardam um novo mestre, um mais sinistro que o último.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a55e1051-0156-4b3f-b2f7-d6a8dfa8166c\', \'multiverseId\': 606575}, \'multiverseid\': 606575}]', "[{'name': 'Seuchenstachler', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nInfizieren (Diese Kreatur fügt Schaden in Form von -1/-1-Marken für Kreaturen und von Giftmarken für Spieler zu.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Insekt, Schrecken', 'flavor': 'Jeder Stich bringt das Opfer seiner Phyrese einen Schritt näher.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605952&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '21939280-ca7d-4627-8d02-bb3f9f6531af', 'multiverseId': 605952}, 'multiverseid': 605952}, {'name': 'Aguijoneador de la plaga', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nInfectar. (Esta criatura hace daño a las criaturas en forma de contadores -1/-1 y a los jugadores en forma de contadores de veneno.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Horror insecto pirexiano', 'flavor': 'Deja a sus víctimas una picadura más cerca de la piresis.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606068&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09594b47-4882-41e1-8217-e798453f9a5c', 'multiverseId': 606068}, 'multiverseid': 606068}, {'name': 'Piqueur de peste', 'text': 'Vol\\nInfection (Cette créature inflige des blessures aux créatures sous la forme de marqueurs -1/-1 et aux joueurs sous la forme de marqueurs « poison ».)', 'type': 'Créature : phyrexian et insecte et horreur', 'flavor': 'À chaque piqûre, il rapproche ses victimes de la phyrésie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606184&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8104ae73-41dc-400f-8219-f80020e827d1', 'multiverseId': 606184}, 'multiverseid': 606184}, {'name': 'Pungiglione Epidemico', 'text': 'Volare\\nInfettare (Questa creatura infligge danno alle creature sotto forma di segnalini -1/-1 e ai giocatori sotto forma di segnalini veleno.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Orrore Insetto Phyrexiano', 'flavor': 'Lascia le sue vittime più vicine di una puntura alla phyresis.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606300&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b15aac9c-aab5-46c4-a6d3-5ba46574b912', 'multiverseId': 606300}, 'multiverseid': 606300}, {'name': '疫病のとげ刺し', 'text': '飛行\\n感染（このクリーチャーはダメージを、クリーチャーには－１/－１カウンターの形で、プレイヤーには毒カウンターの形で与える。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・昆虫・ホラー', 'flavor': 'その犠牲者はとげひと刺し分、ファイレクシア化へと近づく。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606416&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6d5723f-453d-4953-9975-90aa4e9961d8', 'multiverseId': 606416}, 'multiverseid': 606416}, {'name': 'Aguilhoador de Praga', 'text': 'Voar\\nInfectar (Esta criatura causa dano a criaturas na forma de marcadores -1/-1 e a jogadores na forma de marcadores de veneno.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Phyrexiano Inseto Horror', 'flavor': 'Ele deixa as vítimas uma ferroada mais próximas da phyresis.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606532&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3b8b3e1-524e-4c8a-92db-c40b1f99aafc', 'multiverseId': 606532}, 'multiverseid': 606532}]", '[{\'name\': \'Silberschwingen-Schwadron\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\nStärke und Widerstandskraft der Silberschwingen-Schwadron sind gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.\\nImmer wenn die Silberschwingen-Schwadron angreift, erzeuge so viele 2/2 weiße Ritter-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Wachsamkeit, wie du Gegner hast.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605944&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'285b1ed2-14ed-4140-9dc5-9b678fbe6ba4\', \'multiverseId\': 605944}, \'multiverseid\': 605944}, {\'name\': \'Escuadrón alargéntea\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\\nTanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Escuadrón alargéntea son iguales a la cantidad de criaturas que controlas.\\nSiempre que el Escuadrón alargéntea ataque, crea una cantidad de fichas de criatura Caballero blancas 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia igual a la cantidad de oponentes que tienes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aa12b40-d5ed-4695-991a-9c93237af420\', \'multiverseId\': 606060}, \'multiverseid\': 606060}, {\'name\': "Escadron d\'argentailes", \'text\': "Vol, vigilance\\nLa force et l\'endurance de l\'Escadron d\'argentailes sont chacune égales au nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Escadron d\'argentailes attaque, créez un nombre de jetons de créature 2/2 blanche Chevalier avec la vigilance égal au nombre d\'adversaires que vous avez.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606176&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a16d7337-c5dd-4b77-89f4-7f15aed36469\', \'multiverseId\': 606176}, \'multiverseid\': 606176}, {\'name\': \'Squadrone di Alargento\', \'text\': \'Volare, cautela\\nLa forza e la costituzione dello Squadrone di Alargento sono pari al numero di creature che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta lo Squadrone di Alargento attacca, crea un numero di pedine creatura Cavaliere 2/2 bianche con cautela pari al numero di avversari che hai.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffec8557-b6cb-4d6b-be12-dd7b469f8640\', \'multiverseId\': 606292}, \'multiverseid\': 606292}, {\'name\': \'銀翼の戦隊\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\\n銀翼の戦隊のパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの数に等しい。\\n銀翼の戦隊が攻撃するたび、あなたの対戦相手の人数に等しい数の、警戒を持つ白の２/２の騎士・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fe757b1-f130-4d78-92d8-269301192047\', \'multiverseId\': 606408}, \'multiverseid\': 606408}, {\'name\': \'Esquadrão Asa-de-prata\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância\\nO poder e a resistência de Esquadrão Asa-de-prata são ambos iguais ao número de criaturas que você controla.\\nToda vez que Esquadrão Asa-de-prata atacar, crie uma quantidade de fichas de criatura Cavaleiro branca 2/2 com vigilância igual ao número de oponentes que você tem.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6523673d-7cb4-42d0-a087-59a824add3ba\', \'multiverseId\': 606524}, \'multiverseid\': 606524}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnengras-Prärie\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Auf dem Kontinent Otaria sind Frieden und Harmonie selten. Gegenden, in denen man beides findet, sind hochgeschätzt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606022&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a66d3a4-b619-4d0c-bed0-42d6b0c53191\', \'multiverseId\': 606022}, \'multiverseid\': 606022}, {\'name\': \'Pradera Hierbasol\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'En Otaria, la paz y la armonía son raras. Los lugares que proveen ambas son apreciados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6781a6f3-5fb1-40d7-aef7-dc68d3f0a5ab\', \'multiverseId\': 606138}, \'multiverseid\': 606138}, {\'name\': \'Prairie de Solherbe\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Ils sont bien rares et très secrets, en Otaria, les lieux où règnent encore la paix et l\'harmonie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606254&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abcbc5e5-9010-4f35-8c7c-45b25940fedd\', \'multiverseId\': 606254}, \'multiverseid\': 606254}, {\'name\': \'Prateria di Solerba\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "A Otaria la pace e l\'armonia sono rare. E i luoghi in cui è possibile trovare entrambe sono custoditi scrupolosamente.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ac9bfc5-c6f4-48c5-a15f-e9df1c5ba131\', \'multiverseId\': 606370}, \'multiverseid\': 606370}, {\'name\': \'サングラスの大草原\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{G}{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'オタリアでは、平和と調和はまれにしかない。その二つがある場所は大切にされている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85f810df-9a45-419d-8492-9bb8437ecd65\', \'multiverseId\': 606486}, \'multiverseid\': 606486}, {\'name\': \'Pradaria de Capim Solar\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Em Otaria, a paz e a harmonia são raras. Locais que oferecem ambas são tratados com muito zelo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b38728a-86b5-43ee-9b97-2c8231149190\', \'multiverseId\': 606602}, \'multiverseid\': 606602}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenring\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kunst, das Licht eines fernen Sterns in einem Ring aus reinem Gold einzufangen, ist mit der Zeit verlorengegangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605996&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30cb31ec-fbe9-4967-9e22-7f5b68a8ae61\', \'multiverseId\': 605996}, \'multiverseid\': 605996}, {\'name\': \'Anillo solar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Se ha perdido en el tiempo el arte del artífice de atrapar la luz de una estrella distante en un anillo del oro más puro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe8cf1ff-d71a-40f4-9aa4-bf862a0cd07e\', \'multiverseId\': 606112}, \'multiverseid\': 606112}, {\'name\': \'Anneau solaire\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'art de l\'artificier de piéger la lumière d\'un astre lointain dans un anneau d\'or le plus pur est désormais perdu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606228&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdd3eb25-b59c-43b9-9c78-904f4a34fdff\', \'multiverseId\': 606228}, \'multiverseid\': 606228}, {\'name\': \'Anello Solare\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Persa col tempo è l\'arte dell\'artefice di intrappolare la luce di una stella lontana in un anello di oro purissimo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'742e7986-2a8e-49aa-b92c-ca693c356558\', \'multiverseId\': 606344}, \'multiverseid\': 606344}, {\'name\': \'太陽の指輪\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'遥かな星の光を最も純なる黄金の指輪に捕らえる工匠の技は、時の中で失われた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'545984aa-16ca-4d27-b718-42cee40e7479\', \'multiverseId\': 606460}, \'multiverseid\': 606460}, {\'name\': \'Anel Solar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Perdeu-se no tempo a antiga arte dos artífices de capturar a luz de uma estrela distante em um anel do mais puro ouro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff632472-2e8e-4f04-a60b-e61c3b92ece7\', \'multiverseId\': 606576}, \'multiverseid\': 606576}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sphäre des Kommandeurs\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\\nOpfere die Sphäre des Kommandeurs: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Sie ist im Einklang mit der Essenz ihres Meisters.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605984&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ececa51c-9dd3-4000-897e-bbb4bf85f3a7\', \'multiverseId\': 605984}, \'multiverseid\': 605984}, {\'name\': \'Esfera del comandante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\\nSacrificar la Esfera del comandante: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Está en armonía con la esencia de su amo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39351565-7c6b-4dc9-aee4-f1becd84bb1c\', \'multiverseId\': 606100}, \'multiverseid\': 606100}, {\'name\': \'Sphère du commandant\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.\\nSacrifiez la Sphère du commandant : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Elle s\'harmonise avec l\'essence de son maître.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606216&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3af99687-ac62-4184-aada-cf14d77c025b\', \'multiverseId\': 606216}, \'multiverseid\': 606216}, {\'name\': \'Sfera del Comandante\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.\\nSacrifica la Sfera del Comandante: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Si accorda all\'essenza del suo signore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b51bf3f-6a5c-4b16-94c6-2c30f09d7bed\', \'multiverseId\': 606332}, \'multiverseid\': 606332}, {\'name\': \'統率者の宝球\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n統率者の宝球を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それはその主の本質と調和する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07d002ce-ed1b-41db-aa54-39699ea30f19\', \'multiverseId\': 606448}, \'multiverseid\': 606448}, {\'name\': \'Esfera do Comandante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\\nSacrifique Esfera do Comandante: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Ela se harmoniza com a essência de seu mestre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a120a3d0-3987-4854-b418-5c719ea0c7fd\', \'multiverseId\': 606564}, \'multiverseid\': 606564}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spott des Trugbilds\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie einer Artefaktkreatur deiner Wahl ist, die du kontrollierst.\\n• Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie einer Nichtartefaktkreatur deiner Wahl ist, die du kontrollierst.\\nVerflechtung {2}{U} (Bestimme beides, falls du die Verflechtungskosten bezahlst.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605460&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'416cfa01-a62c-496a-abca-bf2edb886211\', \'multiverseId\': 605460}, \'multiverseid\': 605460}, {\'name\': \'Burla ilusoria\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Crea una ficha que es una copia de la criatura artefacto objetivo que controlas.\\n• Crea una ficha que es una copia de la criatura que no sea artefacto objetivo que controlas.\\nEntrelazar {2}{U}. (Si pagas el coste de entrelazar, elige ambas opciones.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf69bccc-dfa0-4d5b-92bb-dc245d75cbdc\', \'multiverseId\': 605468}, \'multiverseid\': 605468}, {\'name\': \'Moquerie mirage\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Créez un jeton qui est une copie d\'une créature-artefact ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\n• Créez un jeton qui est une copie d\'une créature non-artefact ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nUnion {2}{U} (Choisissez les deux si vous payez le coût d\'union.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605476&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d7dfa8b-0371-4233-bc59-d0da6f12962f\', \'multiverseId\': 605476}, \'multiverseid\': 605476}, {\'name\': \'Beffa del Miraggio\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Crea una pedina che è una copia di una creatura artefatto bersaglio che controlli.\\n• Crea una pedina che è una copia di una creatura non artefatto bersaglio che controlli.\\nIntrecciare {2}{U} (Scegli entrambi se paghi il costo di intrecciare.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4428f01a-6ff5-4521-a382-b489bbb28ae4\', \'multiverseId\': 605484}, \'multiverseid\': 605484}, {\'name\': \'嘲る蜃気楼\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。\\n・あなたがコントロールしていてアーティファクトでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。\\n双呪{2}{U}（双呪コストを支払ったなら、両方を選ぶ。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2143996-2e8f-45db-b6b7-312edb9b8e43\', \'multiverseId\': 605492}, \'multiverseid\': 605492}, {\'name\': \'Logro Ilusório\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia da criatura artefato alvo que você controla.\\n• Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia da criatura não artefato alvo que você controla.\\nEntrelaçar {2}{U} (Escolha ambos se pagar o custo de entrelaçar.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8bc7c8f-ceff-425c-8185-fce8da816cb2\', \'multiverseId\': 605500}, \'multiverseid\': 605500}, {\'name\': \'幻影嘲弄\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为目标由你操控的神器生物之复制品。\\n•派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为目标由你操控的非神器生物之复制品。\\n打包{2}{U}（如果你支付打包费用，则两项都选。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70e7d898-d159-49e1-b171-90d1bd8d9601\', \'multiverseId\': 605508}, \'multiverseid\': 605508}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spott des Trugbilds\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie einer Artefaktkreatur deiner Wahl ist, die du kontrollierst.\\n• Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie einer Nichtartefaktkreatur deiner Wahl ist, die du kontrollierst.\\nVerflechtung {2}{U}\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605528&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af520bbc-58f9-4505-82dd-9558670e4d62\', \'multiverseId\': 605528}, \'multiverseid\': 605528}, {\'name\': \'Moquerie mirage\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Créez un jeton qui est une copie d\'une créature-artefact ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\n• Créez un jeton qui est une copie d\'une créature non-artefact ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nUnion {2}{U}", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605540&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5217cb4-16c5-43bb-b8ff-dec9af743bd7\', \'multiverseId\': 605540}, \'multiverseid\': 605540}, {\'name\': \'嘲る蜃気楼\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。\\n・あなたがコントロールしていてアーティファクトでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。\\n双呪{2}{U}\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63f7a7c8-3f15-4bf7-a136-e56bc909b6de\', \'multiverseId\': 605552}, \'multiverseid\': 605552}, {\'name\': \'幻影嘲弄\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为目标由你操控的神器生物之复制品。\\n•派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为目标由你操控的非神器生物之复制品。\\n打包{2}{U}\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4483d9e-74dd-4ff1-a320-8b3685bf439a\', \'multiverseId\': 605564}, \'multiverseid\': 605564}]', "[{'name': 'Stab des Geschichtenerzählers', 'text': 'Wenn der Stab des Geschichtenerzählers ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nImmer wenn du einen oder mehrere Kreaturenspielsteine erzeugst, lege eine Geschichtenmarke auf den Stab des Geschichtenerzählers.\\n{W}, {T}, entferne eine Geschichtenmarke vom Stab des Geschichtenerzählers: Ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605596&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '030d9823-04c5-4403-9b10-ed613ee2d89a', 'multiverseId': 605596}, 'multiverseid': 605596}, {'name': 'Bâton du conteur', 'text': 'Quand le Bâton du conteur arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous créez au moins un jeton de créature, mettez un marqueur « histoire » sur le Bâton du conteur.\\n{W}, {T}, retirez un marqueur « histoire » du Bâton du Conteur : Piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605612&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca55964c-34ff-49b6-9b21-7cca9ecec5a7', 'multiverseId': 605612}, 'multiverseid': 605612}, {'name': '語り部の杖', 'text': '語り部の杖が戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたが１体以上のクリーチャー・トークンを生成するたび、語り部の杖の上に物語カウンター１個を置く。\\n{W}, {T}, 、語り部の杖の上から物語カウンター１個を取り除く：カード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605628&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41dfa867-df1c-4518-b886-e6fbe8345359', 'multiverseId': 605628}, 'multiverseid': 605628}, {'name': '叙事人手杖', 'text': '当叙事人手杖进战场时，派出一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。\\n每当你派出一个或数个衍生生物时，在叙事人手杖上放置一个叙事指示物。\\n{W}，{T}，从叙事人手杖上移去一个叙事指示物：抓一张牌。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605644&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfb711ea-74c2-434e-8fe9-f41d483f20d2', 'multiverseId': 605644}, 'multiverseid': 605644}]", "[{'name': 'Stab des Geschichtenerzählers', 'text': 'Wenn der Stab des Geschichtenerzählers ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nImmer wenn du einen oder mehrere Kreaturenspielsteine erzeugst, lege eine Geschichtenmarke auf den Stab des Geschichtenerzählers.\\n{W}, {T}, entferne eine Geschichtenmarke vom Stab des Geschichtenerzählers: Ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605708&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '675191fe-afd3-42bf-8e09-cd3b4fdd0b05', 'multiverseId': 605708}, 'multiverseid': 605708}, {'name': 'Bastón del cuentacuentos', 'text': 'Cuando el Bastón del cuentacuentos entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Espíritu blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\nSiempre que crees una o más fichas de criatura, pon un contador de historia sobre el Bastón del cuentacuentos.\\n{W}, {T}, remover un contador de historia del Bastón del cuentacuentos: Roba una carta.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605724&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6fc9fa12-3425-4778-9f10-db59cd8f4d7d', 'multiverseId': 605724}, 'multiverseid': 605724}, {'name': 'Bâton du conteur', 'text': 'Quand le Bâton du conteur arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous créez au moins un jeton de créature, mettez un marqueur « histoire » sur le Bâton du conteur.\\n{W}, {T}, retirez un marqueur « histoire » du Bâton du Conteur : Piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605740&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56c12269-8b60-4dd1-a3f1-521e31f16d5a', 'multiverseId': 605740}, 'multiverseid': 605740}, {'name': 'Bastone del Cantastorie', 'text': 'Quando il Bastone del Cantastorie entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Spirito 1/1 bianca con volare.\\nOgniqualvolta crei una o più pedine creatura, metti un segnalino storia sul Bastone del Cantastorie.\\n{W}, {T}, Rimuovi un segnalino storia dal Bastone del Cantastorie: Pesca una carta.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605756&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '32765202-32d9-43ee-9f24-28ffd8ee1fbb', 'multiverseId': 605756}, 'multiverseid': 605756}, {'name': '語り部の杖', 'text': '語り部の杖が戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたが１体以上のクリーチャー・トークンを生成するたび、語り部の杖の上に物語カウンター１個を置く。\\n{W}, {T}, 、語り部の杖の上から物語カウンター１個を取り除く：カード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605772&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '162facc0-976a-4d2a-aeb5-81a874bfcc33', 'multiverseId': 605772}, 'multiverseid': 605772}, {'name': 'Cajado do Contador de Histórias', 'text': 'Quando Cajado do Contador de Histórias entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Espírito branca 1/1 com voar.\\nToda vez que você criar uma ou mais fichas de criatura, coloque um marcador de história em Cajado do Contador de Histórias.\\n{W}, {T}, remova um marcador de história de Cajado do Contador de Histórias: Compre um card.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605788&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f4bd5b4-41ef-472b-8817-d02b6f32105a', 'multiverseId': 605788}, 'multiverseid': 605788}]", '[{\'name\': \'Streitkolben des Recken\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jede Ladungsmarke auf dem Streitkolben des Recken und hat Wachsamkeit.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine Ladungsmarke auf den Streitkolben des Recken.\\nAusrüsten {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605934&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68f37248-761f-408c-8cc4-a06c18fd9a33\', \'multiverseId\': 605934}, \'multiverseid\': 605934}, {\'name\': \'Maza del valiente\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+1 por cada contador de carga sobre la Maza del valiente y tiene la habilidad de vigilancia.\\nSiempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador de carga sobre la Maza del valiente.\\nEquipar {3}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfaebb44-6d1e-455d-bf45-4b7ae0aa7620\', \'multiverseId\': 606050}, \'multiverseid\': 606050}, {\'name\': \'Masse du valeureux\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque marqueur « charge » sur la Masse du valeureux et a la vigilance.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur « charge » sur la Masse du valeureux.\\nÉquipement {3}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606166&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7ad3475-7bcc-47fe-9366-bf3cbd4e2f4a\', \'multiverseId\': 606166}, \'multiverseid\': 606166}, {\'name\': \'Mazza dei Valorosi\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+1 per ogni segnalino carica sulla Mazza dei Valorosi e ha cautela.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino carica sulla Mazza dei Valorosi.\\nEquipaggiare {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4630f7a8-daea-4890-9f9f-26b120b1fb23\', \'multiverseId\': 606282}, \'multiverseid\': 606282}, {\'name\': \'勇敢な者の鎚鉾\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは、勇敢な者の鎚鉾の上に置かれている蓄積カウンター１個につき＋１/＋１の修整を受け警戒を持つ。\\nクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、勇敢な者の鎚鉾の上に蓄積カウンター１個を置く。\\n装備{3}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a51d435-8bac-46bf-b60b-306adf234ed0\', \'multiverseId\': 606398}, \'multiverseid\': 606398}, {\'name\': \'Maça dos Valentes\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +1/+1 para cada marcador de carga em Maça dos Valentes e tem vigilância.\\nToda vez que uma criatura entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque um marcador de carga em Maça dos Valentes.\\nEquipar {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1436142f-28d5-464b-baa6-98349bc800aa\', \'multiverseId\': 606514}, \'multiverseid\': 606514}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stunde der Abrechnung\', \'text\': \'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jeder Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du für {1} oder ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nZerstöre alle Nichtspielsteinkreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Auserwählten hinterfragen nicht. Die Hinterbliebenen klagen nicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605931&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4be1d4a4-1523-4f0e-adc4-999477ec8c6d\', \'multiverseId\': 605931}, \'multiverseid\': 605931}, {\'name\': \'La hora de la verdad\', \'text\': \'Convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nDestruye todas las criaturas que no sean fichas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Quienes son elegidos no dudan. Quienes quedan atrás no se lamentan.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0cb1ed3-35ec-4fbd-a425-f126a9449153\', \'multiverseId\': 606047}, \'multiverseid\': 606047}, {\'name\': \'Heure du Jugement\', \'text\': \'Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nDétruisez toutes les créatures non-jeton.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Ceux qui sont choisis ne doutent pas. Ceux qui restent ne se lamentent pas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606163&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'933fba40-c0fe-43fe-adb1-c5a3998b6e6b\', \'multiverseId\': 606163}, \'multiverseid\': 606163}, {\'name\': "L\'Ora dei Conti", \'text\': \'Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nDistruggi tutte le creature non pedina.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Coloro che vengono scelti non dubitano. Coloro che restano non si lamentano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d81f94c-7292-4217-b6be-464e6ccde2b9\', \'multiverseId\': 606279}, \'multiverseid\': 606279}, {\'name\': \'報いの時\', \'text\': \'召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーはそれぞれ{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\nトークンでないすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'選ばれた者が疑うことはない。残った者が嘆くことはない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3c49811-bca5-4123-87ee-9dffe9219a67\', \'multiverseId\': 606395}, \'multiverseid\': 606395}, {\'name\': \'Hora de Avaliação\', \'text\': \'Convocar (Suas criaturas podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada criatura que você vira ao conjurar esta mágica paga {1} ou um mana da cor daquela criatura.)\\nDestrua todas as criaturas não fichas.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os escolhidos não duvidam. Os que ficam não lamentam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d76ddda4-f877-43cc-9465-07762ae6bb69\', \'multiverseId\': 606511}, \'multiverseid\': 606511}]', '[{\'name\': \'Synthesekapsel\', \'text\': \'({U/P} kann entweder mit {U} oder 2 Lebenspunkten bezahlt werden.)\\n{1}{U/P}, {T}, schicke einen Zauberspruch, den du kontrollierst, ins Exil: Ein Gegner deiner Wahl deckt Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek auf, bis er eine Karte mit Manabetrag gleich 1 plus dem Manabetrag des ins Exil geschickten Zauberspruchs aufdeckt. Schicke die Karte ins Exil, danach mischt jener Spieler. Du kannst jene ins Exil geschickte Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605461&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fe21f07-88c0-46f9-98a1-55bbe51844b5\', \'multiverseId\': 605461}, \'multiverseid\': 605461}, {\'name\': \'Vaina de síntesis\', \'text\': \'(o puede pagarse con {U} o 2 vidas.)\\n{1}{U/P}, {T}, exiliar un hechizo que controlas: El oponente objetivo muestra cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que muestre una carta con valor de maná igual a 1 más el valor de maná del hechizo exiliado. Exilia esa carta, luego ese jugador baraja. Puedes lanzar esa carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94db77c8-4eb3-4d0c-8a21-41edde303566\', \'multiverseId\': 605469}, \'multiverseid\': 605469}, {\'name\': \'Capsule de synthèse\', \'text\': "(o peut être payé au choix avec {U} ou 2 points de vie.)\\n{1}{U/P}, {T}, exilez un sort que vous contrôlez : Un adversaire ciblé révèle les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il révèle une carte avec une valeur de mana égale à 1 plus la valeur de mana du sort exilé. Exilez cette carte, puis ce joueur mélange. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605477&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8efc3172-752b-47bb-89ad-7d84247e1b58\', \'multiverseId\': 605477}, \'multiverseid\': 605477}, {\'name\': \'Capsula di Sintesi\', \'text\': \'(o può essere pagato con {U} o con 2 punti vita.)\\n{1}{U/P}, {T}, Esilia una magia che controlli: Un avversario bersaglio rivela carte dalla cima del suo grimorio finché non rivela una carta con valore di mana pari a 1 più il valore di mana della magia esiliata. Esilia quella carta, poi quel giocatore rimescola. Puoi lanciare quella carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a85c5acc-0084-4cf6-b786-ce4f37ea3cfb\', \'multiverseId\': 605485}, \'multiverseid\': 605485}, {\'name\': \'統合の殻\', \'text\': \'（oは{U}でも２点のライフでも支払うことができる。）\\n{1}{U/P}, {T}, あなたがコントロールしている呪文１つを追放する：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはその追放された呪文のマナ総量に１を足した値に等しいマナ総量を持つカード１枚が公開されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。そのカードを追放する。その後、そのプレイヤーはライブラリーを切り直す。あなたはその追放されたカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3920a69-7e0f-4f60-b855-0711b039f43b\', \'multiverseId\': 605493}, \'multiverseid\': 605493}, {\'name\': \'Casulo de Síntese\', \'text\': \'(o pode ser pago com {U} ou 2 pontos de vida.)\\n{1}{U/P}, {T}, exile uma mágica que você controla: o oponente alvo revela cards do topo do próprio grimório até revelar um card com valor de mana igual a 1 mais o valor de mana da mágica exilada. Exile aquele card; depois, aquele jogador embaralha. Você pode conjurar aquele card exilado sem pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b271aca7-c91b-4652-b077-d20b47ca2424\', \'multiverseId\': 605501}, \'multiverseid\': 605501}, {\'name\': \'聚合荚\', \'text\': \'（{U/P}可用{U}或2点生命来支付。）\\n{1}{U/P}，{T}，放逐一个由你操控的咒语：目标对手从其牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张法术力值为所放逐咒语之法术力值加1的牌。放逐该牌，然后该牌手洗牌。你可以施放所放逐的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3db336e-1361-4521-a3aa-bdd104da3f3b\', \'multiverseId\': 605509}, \'multiverseid\': 605509}]', '[{\'name\': \'Synthesekapsel\', \'text\': \'{1}{U/P}, {T}, schicke einen Zauberspruch, den du kontrollierst, ins Exil: Ein Gegner deiner Wahl deckt Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek auf, bis er eine Karte mit Manabetrag gleich 1 plus dem Manabetrag des ins Exil geschickten Zauberspruchs aufdeckt. Schicke die Karte ins Exil, danach mischt jener Spieler. Du kannst jene ins Exil geschickte Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605529&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1355ee8-c814-4358-b632-9dedf36fd497\', \'multiverseId\': 605529}, \'multiverseid\': 605529}, {\'name\': \'Capsule de synthèse\', \'text\': "{1}{U/P}, {T}, exilez un sort que vous contrôlez : Un adversaire ciblé révèle les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il révèle une carte avec une valeur de mana égale à 1 plus la valeur de mana du sort exilé. Exilez cette carte, puis ce joueur mélange. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605541&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'436e81ce-a249-43d5-9f5c-c174e0efbca2\', \'multiverseId\': 605541}, \'multiverseid\': 605541}, {\'name\': \'統合の殻\', \'text\': \'{1}{U/P}, {T}, あなたがコントロールしている呪文１つを追放する：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはその追放された呪文のマナ総量に１を足した値に等しいマナ総量を持つカード１枚が公開されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。そのカードを追放する。その後、そのプレイヤーはライブラリーを切り直す。あなたはその追放されたカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'223b228b-9076-4568-909f-89187ad5b644\', \'multiverseId\': 605553}, \'multiverseid\': 605553}, {\'name\': \'聚合荚\', \'text\': \'{1}{U/P}，{T}，放逐一个由你操控的咒语：目标对手从其牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张法术力值为所放逐咒语之法术力值加1的牌。放逐该牌，然后该牌手洗牌。你可以施放所放逐的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e83dac5-f41f-486a-afa8-8a8115174a39\', \'multiverseId\': 605565}, \'multiverseid\': 605565}]', '[{\'name\': \'Talisman der Überzeugung\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}. Der Talisman der Überzeugung fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Jeden Morgen verbannt die Sonne die Dunkelheit. Ich werde mich mit der gleichen Selbstsicherheit erheben."\\n—Huatli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605999&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1443f6a7-cfbf-47aa-8721-f776f47f9027\', \'multiverseId\': 605999}, \'multiverseid\': 605999}, {\'name\': \'Talismán de convicción\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}. El Talismán de convicción te hace 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"El sol ahuyenta la oscuridad todas las mañanas. Yo también me alzaré con esa resolución".\\n—Huatli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20a18204-42c4-4ca2-a042-dee3d668d9af\', \'multiverseId\': 606115}, \'multiverseid\': 606115}, {\'name\': \'Talisman de conviction\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}. Le Talisman de conviction vous inflige 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Le soleil bannit les ténèbres chaque matin. Je me lève aussi avec la même certitude. »\\n—Huatli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606231&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce27ffc4-4e12-43de-b667-873fa938cb25\', \'multiverseId\': 606231}, \'multiverseid\': 606231}, {\'name\': \'Talismano della Convinzione\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}. Il Talismano della Convinzione ti infligge 1 danno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Il sole bandisce l\\\'oscurità ogni mattina. Anch\\\'io mi innalzerò con la stessa risolutezza."\\n—Huatli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c7049d6-c0f1-41cd-a48c-f310452118c2\', \'multiverseId\': 606347}, \'multiverseid\': 606347}, {\'name\': \'確信のタリスマン\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。確信のタリスマンはあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「太陽は毎朝闇を追い払う。私もそれぐらい確実に立ち上がる。」\\n――ファートリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1baf694-6393-4438-8a66-5e3eaeaf7862\', \'multiverseId\': 606463}, \'multiverseid\': 606463}, {\'name\': \'Talismã da Convicção\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}. Talismã da Convicção causa 1 ponto de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"O sol bane a escuridão todas as manhãs. E eu também ascenderei com tal firmeza."\\n— Huatli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb518db0-0e03-48b2-8729-54ddce32668c\', \'multiverseId\': 606579}, \'multiverseid\': 606579}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tempel der falschen Göttin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du fünf oder mehr Länder kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn die Götter teilnahmslos werden, beginnen die Leute jeden anzubeten, der sie erhört."\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606028&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71d3dd02-3fa1-42fe-94d4-3d07432e29ca\', \'multiverseId\': 606028}, \'multiverseid\': 606028}, {\'name\': \'Templo de la diosa falsa\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}. Activa esto solo si controlas cinco o más tierras.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando los dioses caen en la apatía, la gente venera a quienquiera que responda a sus plegarias".\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b79258cb-52e0-4a40-a23d-a3513922d22c\', \'multiverseId\': 606144}, \'multiverseid\': 606144}, {\'name\': \'Temple de la fausse divinité\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez au moins cinq terrains.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand les dieux deviennent indifférents, les gens vénèrent quiconque répond à leurs supplications. »\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606260&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a69dcb7a-49e6-462a-903c-7176987ad9b5\', \'multiverseId\': 606260}, \'multiverseid\': 606260}, {\'name\': \'Tempio della Dea Fasulla\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}. Attiva solo se controlli cinque o più terre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando gli dei sprofondano nell\\\'apatia, il popolo inizia a venerare chiunque risponda alle sue preghiere."\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'792ec411-31ab-4fb9-b24a-b84bd24e6449\', \'multiverseId\': 606376}, \'multiverseid\': 606376}, {\'name\': \'邪神の寺院\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。あなたが５つ以上の土地をコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「神々が無関心となった時、人々は自分たちの嘆願を聞き入れてくれる者ならば何でも崇拝するようになるのね。」\\n――キオーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb72cc3f-463f-4ea3-98e9-6efe146fd32b\', \'multiverseId\': 606492}, \'multiverseid\': 606492}, {\'name\': \'Templo do Falso Deus\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}{C}. Ative somente se você controlar cinco ou mais terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando os deuses se tornam apáticos, as pessoas adoram qualquer um que responda a suas súplicas."\\n— Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'410378dd-fc66-4212-b7bc-b3177befb9ff\', \'multiverseId\': 606608}, \'multiverseid\': 606608}]', "[{'name': 'Tempel des Schweigens', 'text': 'Der Tempel des Schweigens kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel des Schweigens ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606027&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eebef4af-3c95-465f-adb3-9dcf454cabec', 'multiverseId': 606027}, 'multiverseid': 606027}, {'name': 'Templo del silencio', 'text': 'El Templo del silencio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo del silencio entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606143&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90fc261f-bd48-492c-be02-079c49a02886', 'multiverseId': 606143}, 'multiverseid': 606143}, {'name': 'Temple du silence', 'text': 'Le Temple du silence arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple du silence arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606259&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5cfb7af1-7197-4d31-ac20-e7fb46dcdc85', 'multiverseId': 606259}, 'multiverseid': 606259}, {'name': 'Tempio del Silenzio', 'text': 'Il Tempio del Silenzio entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio del Silenzio entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606375&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ae94d6b-4c92-440b-a493-83d5930287bc', 'multiverseId': 606375}, 'multiverseid': 606375}, {'name': '静寂の神殿', 'text': '静寂の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n静寂の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606491&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82f13816-8015-420e-b29b-2562ba6e01b9', 'multiverseId': 606491}, 'multiverseid': 606491}, {'name': 'Templo do Silêncio', 'text': 'Templo do Silêncio entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Templo do Silêncio entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 1.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {B}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606607&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ecaf96b6-6515-4f34-9c32-87ae2580b776', 'multiverseId': 606607}, 'multiverseid': 606607}]", "[{'name': 'Tempel des Siechtums', 'text': 'Der Tempel des Siechtums kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel des Siechtums ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606025&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22434c27-2860-4b93-b820-6d244614b14b', 'multiverseId': 606025}, 'multiverseid': 606025}, {'name': 'Templo del padecimiento', 'text': 'El Templo del padecimiento entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo del padecimiento entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606141&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fefbd3b5-ab33-4cb9-8d83-fce55cce3d11', 'multiverseId': 606141}, 'multiverseid': 606141}, {'name': 'Temple de la maladie', 'text': 'Le Temple de la maladie arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple de la maladie arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606257&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e4174b8-5eee-48f4-b627-72191e27cb86', 'multiverseId': 606257}, 'multiverseid': 606257}, {'name': 'Tempio della Malattia', 'text': 'Il Tempio della Malattia entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio della Malattia entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606373&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a6585e3a-0156-4cef-9554-f3c8abd3ee50', 'multiverseId': 606373}, 'multiverseid': 606373}, {'name': '疾病の神殿', 'text': '疾病の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n疾病の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606489&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8855887e-44db-48ce-b431-cf6c901f925f', 'multiverseId': 606489}, 'multiverseid': 606489}, {'name': 'Templo da Enfermidade', 'text': 'Templo da Enfermidade entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Templo da Enfermidade entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 1.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606605&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26fb655f-66b0-4995-b8d0-76a1ba840e6e', 'multiverseId': 606605}, 'multiverseid': 606605}]", "[{'name': 'Tempel des Triumphes', 'text': 'Der Tempel des Triumphes kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel des Triumphes ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606029&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f79723d1-2eaf-4e4d-b65e-a4c426a055e8', 'multiverseId': 606029}, 'multiverseid': 606029}, {'name': 'Templo del triunfo', 'text': 'El Templo del triunfo entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo del triunfo entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606145&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec3c9622-7172-4ad4-85fd-feaf73b16577', 'multiverseId': 606145}, 'multiverseid': 606145}, {'name': 'Temple du triomphe', 'text': 'Le Temple du triomphe arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple du triomphe arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606261&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e9b44201-4468-4c6a-bbb0-ecde3fda7ec0', 'multiverseId': 606261}, 'multiverseid': 606261}, {'name': 'Tempio del Trionfo', 'text': 'Il Tempio del Trionfo entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio del Trionfo entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606377&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c29941ab-3171-44ae-8e9f-5a62c44b86ce', 'multiverseId': 606377}, 'multiverseid': 606377}, {'name': '凱旋の神殿', 'text': '凱旋の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n凱旋の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606493&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3a7b4e9-e710-45ea-825e-2e80998fa11a', 'multiverseId': 606493}, 'multiverseid': 606493}, {'name': 'Templo do Triunfo', 'text': 'Templo do Triunfo entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Templo do Triunfo entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 1.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606609&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d3fd321-c263-413a-94cc-20fa8a7e798f', 'multiverseId': 606609}, 'multiverseid': 606609}]", "[{'name': 'Tempel des Überflusses', 'text': 'Der Tempel des Überflusses kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel des Überflusses ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606026&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '079f7753-4fd6-4899-a8e3-6ae309e2805a', 'multiverseId': 606026}, 'multiverseid': 606026}, {'name': 'Templo de la abundancia', 'text': 'El Templo de la abundancia entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo de la abundancia entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {W}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606142&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22e57ca5-72f6-4d40-b2cf-29ad60ab550b', 'multiverseId': 606142}, 'multiverseid': 606142}, {'name': 'Temple de la profusion', 'text': 'Le Temple de la profusion arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple de la profusion arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606258&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59f4ee4a-9207-40b5-bf55-fcbbfbc4b59b', 'multiverseId': 606258}, 'multiverseid': 606258}, {'name': 'Tempio della Prosperità', 'text': 'Il Tempio della Prosperità entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio della Prosperità entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606374&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ac35d9a-9e2d-42ae-a212-9991f55a8969', 'multiverseId': 606374}, 'multiverseid': 606374}, {'name': '豊潤の神殿', 'text': '豊潤の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n豊潤の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606490&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a15e01f-3889-4df1-bf0d-cfc9191f79c3', 'multiverseId': 606490}, 'multiverseid': 606490}, {'name': 'Templo da Fartura', 'text': 'Templo da Fartura entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Templo da Fartura entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 1.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606606&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6d38023-314b-483e-977e-bdd1d55154b3', 'multiverseId': 606606}, 'multiverseid': 606606}]", '[{\'name\': \'Unangreifbare Tugend\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenspielsteine, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und haben Wachsamkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Im Leben waren sie eine bunte Truppe: Bauern, Fürsten, Diebe oder Priester. Im Tod dienen sie vereint einem einzelnen guten Zweck.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605933&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b10f96f4-a9e7-410e-bfd8-ed349ee5f2ac\', \'multiverseId\': 605933}, \'multiverseid\': 605933}, {\'name\': \'Virtud intangible\', \'text\': \'Las fichas de criatura que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y tienen la habilidad de vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'En vida, eran un grupo muy diverso: granjeros, señores, ladrones, sacerdotes... En la muerte, están unidos por un único y bondadoso propósito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7ccd8bd-97c1-4221-9983-4b95e238ab4c\', \'multiverseId\': 606049}, \'multiverseid\': 606049}, {\'name\': \'Vertu intangible\', \'text\': \'Les jetons de créature que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et ont la vigilance.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "De leur vivant, c\'était un groupe disparate : fermiers, seigneurs, trancheurs de bourse, prêtres. Dans la mort, tous sont unis par un dessein bénéfique unique.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606165&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2bddd91-fa47-4ff4-9ce7-e4baccca8dda\', \'multiverseId\': 606165}, \'multiverseid\': 606165}, {\'name\': \'Virtù Intoccabile\', \'text\': \'Le pedine creatura che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno cautela.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'In vita, erano un gruppo eterogeneo: contadini, nobili, tagliaborse, sacerdoti. Nella morte, sono uniti da un unico scopo benefico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b42c7890-fb39-4363-a8d8-2b85724d2c77\', \'multiverseId\': 606281}, \'multiverseid\': 606281}, {\'name\': \'無形の美徳\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャー・トークンは＋１/＋１の修整を受け、警戒を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'生きていた時は、彼らは農夫や領主や巾着切りや僧侶といった烏合の衆だった。死んでからは、彼らは真義に基づき一つになる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f7fd90b-0f6b-4804-aae8-7c34c47a05ab\', \'multiverseId\': 606397}, \'multiverseid\': 606397}, {\'name\': \'Virtude Intangível\', \'text\': \'As fichas de criatura que você controla recebem +1/+1 e têm vigilância.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Em vida, eles eram um grupo muito variado: fazendeiros, senhores, ladrões e sacerdotes. Na morte, eles se uniram em prol de um único e benevolente propósito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b87c7e14-271a-4f4f-93d4-bf34612bd608\', \'multiverseId\': 606513}, \'multiverseid\': 606513}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ungesunde Wiederbelebung\', \'text\': \'({G/P} kann entweder mit {G} oder 2 Lebenspunkten bezahlt werden.)\\nLege eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof oben auf die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ob tot oder lebendig, meine Kreationen sind stärker als Jin-Gitaxias\\\' fauligee Diener."\\n—Vorinclex, Stimme des Hungers\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605966&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'008a7f9f-d5af-47bc-bf62-c9b3a19b70cc\', \'multiverseId\': 605966}, \'multiverseid\': 605966}, {\'name\': \'Resucitación nociva\', \'text\': \'({G/P} puede pagarse con {G} o 2 vidas.)\\nPon la carta objetivo de un cementerio en la parte superior de la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Vivas o muertas, mis creaciones son más fuertes que los sicarios sépticos de Jin-Gitaxias".\\n—Vórinclex, la Voz del Ansia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'634448f6-0361-4c9e-8ea1-1c5971ac74a4\', \'multiverseId\': 606082}, \'multiverseid\': 606082}, {\'name\': \'Réanimation délétère\', \'text\': \'({G/P} peut être payé au choix avec {G} ou 2 points de vie.)\\nMettez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière au-dessus de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Mortes ou vives, mes créations sont plus puissantes que les serviteurs septiques de Jin Gitaxias. »\\n—Vorinclex, Voix de la Voracité\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606198&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cb1dff5-9250-40d5-8a24-9807283a40ae\', \'multiverseId\': 606198}, \'multiverseid\': 606198}, {\'name\': \'Rinascita Nociva\', \'text\': \'({G/P} può essere pagato con {G} o con 2 punti vita.)\\nMetti una carta bersaglio da un cimitero in cima al grimorio del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Vive o morte, le mie creazioni sono più forti degli scherani settici di Jin-Gitaxias."\\n—Vorinclex, Voce della Fame\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb6d74e9-20b0-432c-ab88-17fae48850bb\', \'multiverseId\': 606314}, \'multiverseid\': 606314}, {\'name\': \'有毒の蘇生\', \'text\': \'（{G/P}は{G}でも２点のライフでも支払うことができる。）\\n墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番上に置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「我が創造物は生きようが死のうが、ジン＝ギタクシアスの腐った下僕などより強力だ。」\\n――飢餓の声、ヴォリンクレックス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b2f2e33-bda6-42ee-a960-7625e1601151\', \'multiverseId\': 606430}, \'multiverseid\': 606430}, {\'name\': \'Renascimento Pernicioso\', \'text\': \'({G/P} pode ser pago com {G} ou 2 pontos de vida.)\\nColoque o card alvo de um cemitério no topo do grimório do seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Vivas ou mortas, minhas criações são mais fortes que os asseclas sépticos de Jin-Gitaxias."\\n— Vorinclex, Voz da Fome\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdd6ffed-486b-4f1b-af74-52ded8cff0ce\', \'multiverseId\': 606546}, \'multiverseid\': 606546}]', '[{\'name\': \'Urtet, Überrest von Memnarch\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Myr-Zauberspruch wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Myr-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug enttappst du jeden Myr, den du kontrollierst.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}: Lege auf jeden Myr, den du kontrollierst, drei +1/+1-Marken. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur während deines Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605466&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0836acf6-20f6-4489-9990-d8ce3be4e1a8\', \'multiverseId\': 605466}, \'multiverseid\': 605466}, {\'name\': \'Urtet, restos de Memnarch\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de Myr, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Myr incolora 1/1.\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, endereza cada Myr que controlas.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}: Pon tres contadores +1/+1 sobre cada Myr que controlas. Activa esto solo durante tu turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75f01d19-3f1b-4f2d-a39e-515b630c56e6\', \'multiverseId\': 605474}, \'multiverseid\': 605474}, {\'name\': \'Urtet, vestige de Memnarch\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de myr, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Myr.\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, dégagez chaque myr que vous contrôlez.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T} : Mettez trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur chaque myr que vous contrôlez. N\'activez que pendant votre tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605482&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79e5a750-ce3f-45ef-83d3-7009cbaa21f1\', \'multiverseId\': 605482}, \'multiverseid\': 605482}, {\'name\': \'Urtet, Residuo di Memnarch\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia Myr, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Myr 1/1 incolore.\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, STAPpa ogni Myr che controlli.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}: Metti tre segnalini +1/+1 su ogni Myr che controlli. Attiva solo durante il tuo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b708cd8b-bf0f-41e0-9a78-e9d26e4d3297\', \'multiverseId\': 605490}, \'multiverseid\': 605490}, {\'name\': \'メムナークの残滓、ウルテト\', \'text\': \'あなたがマイア・呪文を唱えるたび、無色の１/１のマイア・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのマイアをアンタップする。\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしている各マイアの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター３個を置く。あなたのターン中にしか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — マイア\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2dc5a43-df96-4dc1-bd73-7695bef16d7f\', \'multiverseId\': 605498}, \'multiverseid\': 605498}, {\'name\': \'Urtet, Resquício do Memnarca\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de Myr, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Myr incolor 1/1.\\nNo início do combate no seu turno, desvire todos os Myr que você controla.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}: Coloque três marcadores +1/+1 em cada Myr que você controla. Ative apenas durante seu turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato Lendária — Myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'876b7cd1-de63-4043-a7c8-0dfc8db47137\', \'multiverseId\': 605506}, \'multiverseid\': 605506}, {\'name\': \'蒙纳珂孑遗尔铁\', \'text\': \'每当你施放秘耳咒语时，派出一个1/1无色秘耳衍生神器生物。\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，重置所有由你操控的秘耳。\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}，{T}：在每个由你操控的秘耳上各放置三个+1/+1指示物。只能于你的回合中起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器生物 ～秘耳\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c373385e-3037-4d8a-b6ad-7eda87c87d73\', \'multiverseId\': 605514}, \'multiverseid\': 605514}]', '[{\'name\': \'Urtet, Überrest von Memnarch\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Myr-Zauberspruch wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Myr-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug enttappst du jeden Myr, den du kontrollierst.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}: Lege auf jeden Myr, den du kontrollierst, drei +1/+1-Marken. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur während deines Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605538&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e73d3d36-5a65-4621-b877-472e1d24af66\', \'multiverseId\': 605538}, \'multiverseid\': 605538}, {\'name\': \'Urtet, vestige de Memnarch\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de myr, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Myr.\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, dégagez chaque myr que vous contrôlez.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T} : Mettez trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur chaque myr que vous contrôlez. N\'activez que pendant votre tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605550&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a46c0beb-d988-481e-9c25-9a8ae9d2952a\', \'multiverseId\': 605550}, \'multiverseid\': 605550}, {\'name\': \'メムナークの残滓、ウルテト\', \'text\': \'あなたがマイア・呪文を唱えるたび、無色の１/１のマイア・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのマイアをアンタップする。\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしている各マイアの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター３個を置く。あなたのターン中にしか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — マイア\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a61c11f4-f55e-4866-95a4-3036268f43e8\', \'multiverseId\': 605562}, \'multiverseid\': 605562}, {\'name\': \'蒙纳珂孑遗尔铁\', \'text\': \'每当你施放秘耳咒语时，派出一个1/1无色秘耳衍生神器生物。\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，重置所有由你操控的秘耳。\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}，{T}：在每个由你操控的秘耳上各放置三个+1/+1指示物。只能于你的回合中起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器生物 ～秘耳\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb9aeafa-1858-4ddd-9ddb-6f12339be136\', \'multiverseId\': 605574}, \'multiverseid\': 605574}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vereinte Kräfte\', \'text\': \'Eskalieren — Tappe eine ungetappte Kreatur, die du kontrollierst. (Bezahle diese Kosten für jeden gewählten Modus außer dem ersten.)\\nBestimme eines oder mehrere —\\n• Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 4 oder mehr.\\n• Zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n• Lege auf jede Kreatur, die ein Spieler deiner Wahl kontrolliert, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605917&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4506951-0adb-43cb-9b40-21d1194c9775\', \'multiverseId\': 605917}, \'multiverseid\': 605917}, {\'name\': \'Esfuerzo colectivo\', \'text\': \'Expandir—Girar una criatura enderezada que controlas. (Paga este coste por cada modo que elijas además del primero.)\\nElige uno o más:\\n• Destruye la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 4 o más.\\n• Destruye el encantamiento objetivo.\\n• Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controla el jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9de9ae2-cc13-452e-aed2-367fc1e516ee\', \'multiverseId\': 606033}, \'multiverseid\': 606033}, {\'name\': \'Effort collectif\', \'text\': "Intensification — Engagez une créature dégagée que vous contrôlez. (Payez ce coût pour chaque mode choisi après le premier.)\\nChoisissez l\'un ou plus —\\n• Détruisez une créature ciblée de force supérieure ou égale à 4.\\n• Détruisez un enchantement ciblé.\\n• Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature qu\'un joueur ciblé contrôle.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606149&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33ace80a-b538-4f4a-afde-ffc0d80c18d3\', \'multiverseId\': 606149}, \'multiverseid\': 606149}, {\'name\': \'Sforzo Collettivo\', \'text\': \'Incrementare—TAPpa una creatura STAPpata che controlli. (Paga questo costo per ogni modo scelto oltre il primo.)\\nScegli uno o più —\\n• Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o superiore a 4.\\n• Distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio.\\n• Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura controllata da un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c912a689-5a4a-424b-b5ff-8f8a535ebab6\', \'multiverseId\': 606265}, \'multiverseid\': 606265}, {\'name\': \'集団的努力\', \'text\': \'増呪―あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態であるクリーチャー１体をタップする。（２つ目以降に選ぶモード１つにつき１回、このコストを支払う。）\\n以下から１つ以上を選ぶ。\\n・パワーが４以上であるクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n・エンチャント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n・プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b61750f-50bc-4ccf-b6c4-0f6d5e2bca68\', \'multiverseId\': 606381}, \'multiverseid\': 606381}, {\'name\': \'Esforço Coletivo\', \'text\': \'Escalar — Vire uma criatura desvirada que você controla. (Pague este custo para cada modo escolhido além do primeiro.)\\nEscolha um ou mais —\\n• Destrua a criatura alvo com poder igual ou superior a 4.\\n• Destrua o encantamento alvo.\\n• Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que o jogador alvo controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fb5d650-6960-4f7d-8cd2-6ae1f1c349ea\', \'multiverseId\': 606497}, \'multiverseid\': 606497}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verfaulen lassen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Es bzw. sie kann nicht regeneriert werden.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Alle Materie, belebt oder nicht, verrottet irgendwann im Verlauf der Zeit. Wir beschleunigen den Prozess nur ein wenig."\\n—Ezoc, Golgari-Verrottungsfarmer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605979&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c49abcfa-d18a-4a27-87ee-ac2c49ce90f5\', \'multiverseId\': 605979}, \'multiverseid\': 605979}, {\'name\': \'Pudrir\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o criatura objetivo. No puede ser regenerado.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Toda la materia, animada o no, se pudre con el paso del tiempo. Nosotros simplemente aceleramos el proceso".\\n—Ézoc, granjero de podredumbre golgari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5451a62-1521-4cd2-aa5a-dd69df9c2ce3\', \'multiverseId\': 606095}, \'multiverseid\': 606095}, {\'name\': \'Putréfier\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une cible, artefact ou créature. Elle ne peut pas être régénérée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Toute matière, animée ou non, pourrit avec le temps. Nous ne faisons qu\'accélérer les choses. »\\n—Ezoc, putré-fermier golgari", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606211&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a7819a2-df21-4e2b-b8cb-b94ebc8d867b\', \'multiverseId\': 606211}, \'multiverseid\': 606211}, {\'name\': \'Putrificare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o una creatura bersaglio. Non può essere rigenerato.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tutta la materia, animata o inanimata, si decompone quando patisce le ingiurie del tempo. Noi ci limitiamo ad accelerare il processo."\\n—Ezoc, putrificatore Golgari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b2d8a9a-0617-49f1-be2e-adee4dc8998e\', \'multiverseId\': 606327}, \'multiverseid\': 606327}, {\'name\': \'化膿\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやクリーチャーのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。それは再生できない。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「生きてようが何だろうが、時間が経てば腐るんだ。俺らは単にその速度を速めてるだけだ。」\\n――ゴルガリの腐敗農夫、イーゾック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52b10337-c44b-4bb4-a81c-aa84fb07319a\', \'multiverseId\': 606443}, \'multiverseid\': 606443}, {\'name\': \'Putrificar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura ou o artefato alvo. Ele não pode ser regenerado.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Toda a matéria, animada ou não, apodrece quando exposta ao tempo. Nós simplesmente aceleramos o processo."\\n— Ezoc, fazendeiro de podridão Golgari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e037bcb-2bbe-4a8d-a285-305e0413b3f4\', \'multiverseId\': 606559}, \'multiverseid\': 606559}]', "[{'name': 'Vergessene Höhle', 'text': 'Die Vergessene Höhle kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}.\\nUmwandlung {R} ({R}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606009&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2da3a12-d687-4842-a30a-02bff5bf296d', 'multiverseId': 606009}, 'multiverseid': 606009}, {'name': 'Cueva olvidada', 'text': 'La Cueva olvidada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}.\\nCiclo {R}. ({R}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606125&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8fcfc5d7-b461-4991-bf32-3cce39f3d789', 'multiverseId': 606125}, 'multiverseid': 606125}, {'name': 'Caverne oubliée', 'text': 'La Caverne oubliée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}.\\nRecyclage {R} ({R}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606241&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e90d908-77e7-47e6-950f-5a2dd1da7c60', 'multiverseId': 606241}, 'multiverseid': 606241}, {'name': 'Caverna Dimenticata', 'text': 'La Caverna Dimenticata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}.\\nCiclo {R} ({R}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606357&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a45adf70-8899-4138-bf70-3651a8896dae', 'multiverseId': 606357}, 'multiverseid': 606357}, {'name': '忘れられた洞窟', 'text': '忘れられた洞窟はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}を加える。\\nサイクリング{R}（{R},このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606473&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c717c628-f090-4b6c-bdae-83f733359995', 'multiverseId': 606473}, 'multiverseid': 606473}, {'name': 'Caverna Esquecida', 'text': 'Caverna Esquecida entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}.\\nReciclar {R} ({R}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606589&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '13636535-2398-4325-84dd-1b821d2007a7', 'multiverseId': 606589}, 'multiverseid': 606589}]", '[{\'name\': \'Verschüttete Ruinen\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere die Verschütteten Ruinen: Bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Geschichte hat ihre Schätze tief vergraben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606003&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25cb5f7e-fc1b-4147-ac5d-38b200d963df\', \'multiverseId\': 606003}, \'multiverseid\': 606003}, {\'name\': \'Ruina enterrada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar la Ruina enterrada: Regresa la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La historia ha enterrado sus tesoros profundamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'799268c0-9ba5-47f9-8a19-2c7622605e4d\', \'multiverseId\': 606119}, \'multiverseid\': 606119}, {\'name\': \'Ruine ensevelie\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez la Ruine ensevelie : Renvoyez dans votre main une carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "L\'histoire a profondément enfoui ses trésors.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606235&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3db6fb7b-d9eb-4ee0-b0b9-17745ba90720\', \'multiverseId\': 606235}, \'multiverseid\': 606235}, {\'name\': \'Rovine Sepolte\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica le Rovine Sepolte: Riprendi in mano una carta artefatto bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'La storia ha sepolto in profondità i suoi tesori.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3401d4a2-f8dc-46c2-b281-bc5f2adb6f0e\', \'multiverseId\': 606351}, \'multiverseid\': 606351}, {\'name\': \'埋没した廃墟\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2},{T},埋没した廃墟を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にあるアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'歴史は自身の価値を深く埋める。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e4e9490-7cbd-404c-99a3-bc8af1b6826f\', \'multiverseId\': 606467}, \'multiverseid\': 606467}, {\'name\': \'Ruína Enterrada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Ruína Enterrada: Devolva o card de artefato alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'A história enterrou profundamente os próprios tesouros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b65f3947-13cd-4391-94f2-e98436afd7f9\', \'multiverseId\': 606583}, \'multiverseid\': 606583}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verseuchter Forst\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du einen Sumpf kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606024&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a71d20ba-f98e-4c7b-808c-64122b9eac89\', \'multiverseId\': 606024}, \'multiverseid\': 606024}, {\'name\': \'Bosque contaminado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}. Activa esto solo si controlas un Pantano.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3702a45e-5020-4534-a37e-4809b3975e4f\', \'multiverseId\': 606140}, \'multiverseid\': 606140}, {\'name\': \'Bois souillé\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez un marais.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606256&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b6fc610-7930-4a94-aea6-8a1c699da466\', \'multiverseId\': 606256}, \'multiverseid\': 606256}, {\'name\': \'Bosco Contaminato\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}. Attiva solo se controlli una Palude.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'809670b2-d5d1-4492-8938-58f9f58fa6be\', \'multiverseId\': 606372}, \'multiverseid\': 606372}, {\'name\': \'汚れた森\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。あなたが沼をコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c3db4a6-496b-479c-b679-73c3247aec4a\', \'multiverseId\': 606488}, \'multiverseid\': 606488}, {\'name\': \'Floresta Contaminada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}. Ative somente se você controlar um Pântano.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51386893-7d2a-4de9-8c98-103c11458e15\', \'multiverseId\': 606604}, \'multiverseid\': 606604}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verseuchtes Feld\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du einen Sumpf kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606023&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dd0fcc2-55e6-4220-b27d-d86c890d302b\', \'multiverseId\': 606023}, \'multiverseid\': 606023}, {\'name\': \'Campo contaminado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}. Activa esto solo si controlas un Pantano.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0087b526-65a0-420e-88df-be1ebdf7f2da\', \'multiverseId\': 606139}, \'multiverseid\': 606139}, {\'name\': \'Champ souillé\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez un marais.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606255&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43631084-b4e6-4641-9abe-11584be4f2d4\', \'multiverseId\': 606255}, \'multiverseid\': 606255}, {\'name\': \'Campo Contaminato\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B}. Attiva solo se controlli una Palude.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57b21036-3783-4447-9bb5-69b59c5b8bf3\', \'multiverseId\': 606371}, \'multiverseid\': 606371}, {\'name\': \'汚れた原野\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。あなたが沼をコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d79645e3-c6d1-48e7-af04-949a06318477\', \'multiverseId\': 606487}, \'multiverseid\': 606487}, {\'name\': \'Campo Contaminado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {B}. Ative somente se você controlar um Pântano.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80d598d2-fc5d-4183-a0f2-87877edd505d\', \'multiverseId\': 606603}, \'multiverseid\': 606603}]', "[{'name': 'Viridischer Verderber', 'text': 'Infizieren (Diese Kreatur fügt Schaden in Form von -1/-1-Marken für Kreaturen und von Giftmarken für Spieler zu.)\\nWenn der Viridische Verderber ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Elf, Schamane', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605969&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a0608aea-bc4c-4c4f-a315-e1c69bbe8ec9', 'multiverseId': 605969}, 'multiverseid': 605969}, {'name': 'Corruptor viridiano', 'text': 'Infectar. (Esta criatura hace daño a las criaturas en forma de contadores -1/-1 y a los jugadores en forma de contadores de veneno.)\\nCuando el Corruptor viridiano entre al campo de batalla, destruye el artefacto objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Chamán elfo pirexiano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606085&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c04203d0-e5e5-4972-bb8f-e84ab2dab94f', 'multiverseId': 606085}, 'multiverseid': 606085}, {'name': 'Corrupteur viridian', 'text': 'Infection (Cette créature inflige des blessures aux créatures sous la forme de marqueurs -1/-1 et aux joueurs sous la forme de marqueurs « poison ».)\\nQuand le Corrupteur viridian arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez un artefact ciblé.', 'type': 'Créature : phyrexian et elfe et shamane', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606201&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e9e61d3-a877-4b69-aac7-f1a315828cb0', 'multiverseId': 606201}, 'multiverseid': 606201}, {'name': 'Corruttore Viridiano', 'text': 'Infettare (Questa creatura infligge danno alle creature sotto forma di segnalini -1/-1 e ai giocatori sotto forma di segnalini veleno.)\\nQuando il Corruttore Viridiano entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo Phyrexiano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606317&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e58cf9c-e5d1-4bc8-b11e-0856f46ff2bb', 'multiverseId': 606317}, 'multiverseid': 606317}, {'name': 'ヴィリジアンの堕落者', 'text': '感染（このクリーチャーはダメージを、クリーチャーには－１/－１カウンターの形で、プレイヤーには毒カウンターの形で与える。）\\nヴィリジアンの堕落者が戦場に出たとき、アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・エルフ・シャーマン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606433&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c17b3b8e-5ea3-4fe7-835c-333f9f43c1e4', 'multiverseId': 606433}, 'multiverseid': 606433}, {'name': 'Corruptor Viridiano', 'text': 'Infectar (Esta criatura causa dano a criaturas na forma de marcadores -1/-1 e a jogadores na forma de marcadores de veneno.)\\nQuando Corruptor Viridiano entrar no campo de batalha, destrua o artefato alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Phyrexiano Elfo Xamã', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606549&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b09f92c-b1ba-41ab-aad6-a1fa8eea05ab', 'multiverseId': 606549}, 'multiverseid': 606549}]", '[{\'name\': \'Vishgraz die Schwarmbringerin\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich, Toxisch 1 (Spieler, denen von dieser Kreatur Kampfschaden zugefügt wird, erhalten außerdem eine Giftmarke.)\\nWenn Vishgraz die Schwarmbringerin ins Spiel kommt, erzeugst du drei 1/1 farblose Phyrexianer-Milbe-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine mit Toxisch 1 und „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken."\\nVishgraz erhält +1/+1 für jede Giftmarke, die deine Gegner haben.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Insekt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605674&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10a21b0d-611d-452e-9705-c5f2cffcb858\', \'multiverseId\': 605674}, \'multiverseid\': 605674}, {\'name\': \'Vishgraz, la Colmena de la Muerte\', \'text\': \'Amenaza, tóxico 1. (Los jugadores que reciben daño de combate de esta criatura también obtienen un contador de veneno.)\\nCuando Vishgraz, la Colmena de la Muerte entre al campo de batalla, crea tres fichas de criatura artefacto Ácaro Pirexiano incoloras 1/1 con la habilidad de tóxico 1 y "Esta criatura no puede bloquear".\\nVishgraz obtiene +1/+1 por cada contador de veneno que tengan tus oponentes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Insecto pirexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'979340ab-4793-4412-a876-e831abb0039a\', \'multiverseId\': 605676}, \'multiverseid\': 605676}, {\'name\': "Vishgraz, l\'essaim de la mort", \'text\': "Menace, toxique 1 (Les joueurs qui subissent des blessures de combat de cette créature gagnent aussi un marqueur « poison ».)\\nQuand Vishgraz, l\'essaim de la mort arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez trois jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Phyrexian et Puce avec toxique 1 et « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer ».\\nVishgraz gagne +1/+1 pour chaque marqueur « poison » que vos adversaires ont.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : phyrexian et insecte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605678&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18e1bfba-e383-4b73-aed8-f6b3d4e887b2\', \'multiverseId\': 605678}, \'multiverseid\': 605678}, {\'name\': "Vishgraz, l\'Alveare della Rovina", \'text\': \'Minacciare, tossico 1(I giocatori a cui viene inflitto danno da combattimento da questa creatura ottengono anche un segnalino veleno.)\\nQuando Vishgraz, l\\\'Alveare della Rovina entra nel campo di battaglia, crea tre pedine creatura artefatto Acaro Phyrexiano 1/1 incolori con tossico 1 e "Questa creatura non può bloccare".\\nVishgraz prende +1/+1 per ogni segnalino veleno che hanno i tuoi avversari.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Insetto Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef2545f2-b28b-4f95-9dd8-88efaef6b5c0\', \'multiverseId\': 605680}, \'multiverseid\': 605680}, {\'name\': \'破滅の巣、ヴィシュグラズ\', \'text\': \'威迫、毒性１（このクリーチャーに戦闘ダメージを受けたプレイヤーは追加で毒カウンター１個を得る。）\\n破滅の巣、ヴィシュグラズが戦場に出たとき、毒性１と「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ無色の１/１のファイレクシアン・ダニ・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン３体を生成する。\\n破滅の巣、ヴィシュグラズは、対戦相手が持っている毒カウンター１個につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67313022-ab86-4b3c-9b7e-ff03559cbcd7\', \'multiverseId\': 605682}, \'multiverseid\': 605682}, {\'name\': \'Vishgraz, a Colmeia da Perdição\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar, tóxico 1 (Os jogadores que sofrem dano de combate desta criatura também recebem um marcador de veneno.)\\nQuando Vishgraz, a Colmeia da Perdição, entrar no campo de batalha, crie três fichas de criatura artefato Phyrexiano Ácaro incolor 1/1 com tóxico 1 e "Esta criatura não pode bloquear".\\nVishgraz recebe +1/+1 para cada marcador de veneno que seus oponentes têm.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Phyrexiano Inseto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05005fef-3cc3-4fb9-8e0b-635c44b9b05a\', \'multiverseId\': 605684}, \'multiverseid\': 605684}, {\'name\': \'末日繁生威袭瑰\', \'text\': \'威慑，下毒1（受此生物战斗伤害的牌手还会得到一个中毒指示物。）\\n当末日繁生威袭瑰进战场时，派出三个1/1无色非瑞人／虫械衍生神器生物，且具有下毒1与「此生物不能进行阻挡。」\\n你的所有对手每有一个中毒指示物，威袭瑰便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～非瑞人／昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2f71ccc-dd82-43e8-ab71-9089bdad57b3\', \'multiverseId\': 605686}, \'multiverseid\': 605686}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vishgraz die Schwarmbringerin\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich, Toxisch 1\\nWenn Vishgraz die Schwarmbringerin ins Spiel kommt, erzeugst du drei 1/1 farblose Phyrexianer-Milbe-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine mit Toxisch 1 und „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken."\\nVishgraz erhält +1/+1 für jede Giftmarke, die deine Gegner haben.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Insekt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605536&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9d6b91d-31be-4bc9-9172-0ef468ccaeca\', \'multiverseId\': 605536}, \'multiverseid\': 605536}, {\'name\': "Vishgraz, l\'essaim de la mort", \'text\': "Menace, toxique 1\\nQuand Vishgraz, l\'essaim de la mort arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez trois jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Phyrexian et Puce avec toxique 1 et « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer ».\\nVishgraz gagne +1/+1 pour chaque marqueur « poison » que vos adversaires ont.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : phyrexian et insecte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605548&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e7ab1ce-35c8-4c8e-b4a4-857034c03fd8\', \'multiverseId\': 605548}, \'multiverseid\': 605548}, {\'name\': \'破滅の巣、ヴィシュグラズ\', \'text\': \'威迫、毒性１\\n破滅の巣、ヴィシュグラズが戦場に出たとき、毒性１と「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ無色の１/１のファイレクシアン・ダニ・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン３体を生成する。\\n破滅の巣、ヴィシュグラズは、対戦相手が持っている毒カウンター１個につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f50ccd8a-0759-46dc-9998-27d345a9aa7c\', \'multiverseId\': 605560}, \'multiverseid\': 605560}, {\'name\': \'末日繁生威袭瑰\', \'text\': \'威慑，下毒1\\n当末日繁生威袭瑰进战场时，派出三个1/1无色非瑞人／虫械衍生神器生物，且具有下毒1与「此生物不能进行阻挡。」\\n你的所有对手每有一个中毒指示物，威袭瑰便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～非瑞人／昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'438483a4-9e4b-493d-bd38-9b2acd394437\', \'multiverseId\': 605572}, \'multiverseid\': 605572}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vulshokfabrik\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {R}. Lege eine Ladungsmarke auf die Vulshokfabrik.\\n{2}{R}, {T}, opfere die Vulshokfabrik: Erzeuge einen X/X farblosen Golem-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Eile, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Ladungsmarken auf der Vulshokfabrik ist. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605602&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd2007a3-e5c5-4a98-b20e-f814b7227d85\', \'multiverseId\': 605602}, \'multiverseid\': 605602}, {\'name\': \'Usine vulshoke\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {R}. Mettez un marqueur « charge » sur l\'Usine vulshoke.\\n{2}{R}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Usine vulshoke : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact X/X incolore Golem avec la célérité, X étant le nombre de marqueurs « charge » sur l\'Usine vulshoke. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605618&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b13c5fd-063f-453a-b5ca-f5410607a8ee\', \'multiverseId\': 605618}, \'multiverseid\': 605618}, {\'name\': \'ヴァルショク工場\', \'text\': \'{T}：{R}を加える。ヴァルショク工場の上に蓄積カウンター１個を置く。\\n{2}{R}, {T}, ヴァルショク工場を生け贄に捧げる：速攻を持つ無色のＸ/Ｘのゴーレム・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。Ｘはヴァルショク工場の上にある蓄積カウンターの個数に等しい。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f47cbb8f-fdb0-4def-b55e-7ca609687d71\', \'multiverseId\': 605634}, \'multiverseid\': 605634}, {\'name\': \'瓦许克工厂\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{R}。在瓦许克工厂上放置一个充电指示物。\\n{2}{R}，{T}，牺牲瓦许克工厂：派出一个X/X无色，具敏捷异能的魔像衍生神器生物，X为瓦许克工厂上充电指示物的数量。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7adff8eb-8282-4237-9f5f-5d0679aaa10e\', \'multiverseId\': 605650}, \'multiverseid\': 605650}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vulshokfabrik\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {R}. Lege eine Ladungsmarke auf die Vulshokfabrik.\\n{2}{R}, {T}, opfere die Vulshokfabrik: Erzeuge einen X/X farblosen Golem-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Eile, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Ladungsmarken auf der Vulshokfabrik ist. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605714&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95db5430-b6ad-4e3e-bef8-067a03ab71b6\', \'multiverseId\': 605714}, \'multiverseid\': 605714}, {\'name\': \'Fábrica vúlshok\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {R}. Pon un contador de carga sobre la Fábrica vúlshok.\\n{2}{R}, {T}, sacrificar la Fábrica vúlshok: Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Gólem incolora X/X con la habilidad de prisa, donde X es la cantidad de contadores de carga sobre la Fábrica vúlshok. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'152eefb5-5f08-4b8f-9a00-5820a7edb713\', \'multiverseId\': 605730}, \'multiverseid\': 605730}, {\'name\': \'Usine vulshoke\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {R}. Mettez un marqueur « charge » sur l\'Usine vulshoke.\\n{2}{R}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Usine vulshoke : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact X/X incolore Golem avec la célérité, X étant le nombre de marqueurs « charge » sur l\'Usine vulshoke. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605746&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23aeb6cf-ccca-4ef1-8c95-001cbffac1cf\', \'multiverseId\': 605746}, \'multiverseid\': 605746}, {\'name\': \'Fabbrica Vulshok\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {R}. Metti un segnalino carica sulla Fabbrica Vulshok.\\n{2}{R}, {T}, Sacrifica la Fabbrica Vulshok: Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Golem X/X incolore con rapidità, dove X è il numero di segnalini carica sulla Fabbrica Vulshok. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aac6494b-c8f1-4648-87a3-ec795845a559\', \'multiverseId\': 605762}, \'multiverseid\': 605762}, {\'name\': \'ヴァルショク工場\', \'text\': \'{T}：{R}を加える。ヴァルショク工場の上に蓄積カウンター１個を置く。\\n{2}{R}, {T}, ヴァルショク工場を生け贄に捧げる：速攻を持つ無色のＸ/Ｘのゴーレム・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。Ｘはヴァルショク工場の上にある蓄積カウンターの個数に等しい。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd9f226e-1af5-45dd-93c6-ef559bbdddc5\', \'multiverseId\': 605778}, \'multiverseid\': 605778}, {\'name\': \'Fábrica Vulshoque\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {R}. Coloque um marcador de carga em Fábrica Vulshoque.\\n{2}{R}, {T}, sacrifique Fábrica Vulshoque: Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Golem incolor X/X com ímpeto, sendo X o número de marcadores de carga em Fábrica Vulshoque. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'283989ec-f872-4866-b5e2-ba120e94a649\', \'multiverseId\': 605794}, \'multiverseid\': 605794}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weg ins Exil\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Ihr Beherrscher kann seine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605940&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74855c92-7344-4f18-b828-d4e3b97a092a\', \'multiverseId\': 605940}, \'multiverseid\': 605940}, {\'name\': \'Camino al exilio\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo. Su controlador puede buscar en su biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, poner esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c622e9dd-f34f-40e5-9132-6c44d380b738\', \'multiverseId\': 606056}, \'multiverseid\': 606056}, {\'name\': "Chemin vers l\'exil", \'text\': \'Exilez une créature ciblée. Son contrôleur peut chercher dans sa bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606172&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5c3ffe7-c215-43c2-b0db-83b2a0ac7f19\', \'multiverseId\': 606172}, \'multiverseid\': 606172}, {\'name\': "Sentiero dell\'Esilio", \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore può passare in rassegna il proprio grimorio per una carta terra base, mettere quella carta sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5ab1d83-8974-40ff-99ad-4a028e2cd2f9\', \'multiverseId\': 606288}, \'multiverseid\': 606288}, {\'name\': \'流刑への道\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。それのコントローラーは「自分のライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e77f209f-580d-4af3-9460-7d63767468d6\', \'multiverseId\': 606404}, \'multiverseid\': 606404}, {\'name\': \'Caminho para o Exílio\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura alvo. Seu controlador pode procurar no próprio grimório um card de terreno básico, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd4d00aa-afe7-4adb-8bff-84949916c121\', \'multiverseId\': 606520}, \'multiverseid\': 606520}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weiser Evolutionskundler\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, führe Wucherung durch. (Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern und gib ihnen dann von jeder Sorte Marke, die dort bereits liegt, eine weitere Marke.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Kultiviere die Welt, um für dich selbst zu sorgen. Kultiviere dich selbst, um für die Welt zu sorgen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605964&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'264cacbb-a36c-4409-a512-51ee43095965\', \'multiverseId\': 605964}, \'multiverseid\': 605964}, {\'name\': \'Sabio de la evolución\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, prolifera. (Elige cualquier cantidad de permanentes y/o jugadores, luego pon sobre cada uno un contador de cada tipo que ya tenga.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Para cuidar de ti, cultiva el mundo. Para cuidar del mundo, cultívate a ti mismo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c6e7780-9d85-4f62-b441-975270d14765\', \'multiverseId\': 606080}, \'multiverseid\': 606080}, {\'name\': "Sage de l\'évolution", \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, proliférez. (Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents et/ou de joueurs, puis donnez-leur à chacun un autre marqueur de chaque sorte déjà présente.)", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Pour prendre soin de toi, cultive le monde. Pour prendre soin du monde, cultive-toi. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606196&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d8e62ac-4858-4f4b-9b08-c4132e4749e8\', \'multiverseId\': 606196}, \'multiverseid\': 606196}, {\'name\': "Saggio dell\'Evoluzione", \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, prolifera. (Scegli un qualsiasi numero di permanenti e/o giocatori, poi metti su ognuno un altro segnalino di ogni tipo già presente.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Per prenderti cura di te, coltiva il mondo. Per prenderti cura del mondo, coltiva te stesso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cf85de6-b1eb-45fc-aa7c-40cba8ae75da\', \'multiverseId\': 606312}, \'multiverseid\': 606312}, {\'name\': \'進化の賢者\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、増殖を行う。（望む数のパーマネントやプレイヤーを選び、その後、すでにそこにあるカウンター１種類につき、そのカウンターもう１個を与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「自分が大切なら、世界を育むことだ。世界が大切なら、自分を育むことだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ebcbcc6-5087-4ab3-9533-bcd61b115bcd\', \'multiverseId\': 606428}, \'multiverseid\': 606428}, {\'name\': \'Sábio da Evolução\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, prolifere. (Escolha qualquer número de permanentes e/ou jogadores. Em seguida, dê a cada um deles outro marcador de cada tipo que eles já tenham.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Para cuidar de si, cultive o mundo. Para cuidar do mundo, cultive-se."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bc36076-f350-4396-9a02-a74447fc774e\', \'multiverseId\': 606544}, \'multiverseid\': 606544}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wundsekret-Ratten\', \'text\': \'Infizieren (Diese Kreatur fügt Schaden in Form von -1/-1-Marken für Kreaturen und von Giftmarken für Spieler zu.)\\nWenn die Wundsekret-Ratten ins Spiel kommen, erhält jeder Spieler eine Giftmarke.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Ratte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605949&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a45cd36f-56f0-4130-9a13-4a9a21443d6a\', \'multiverseId\': 605949}, \'multiverseid\': 605949}, {\'name\': \'Ratas icóridas\', \'text\': \'Infectar. (Esta criatura hace daño a las criaturas en forma de contadores -1/-1 y a los jugadores en forma de contadores de veneno.)\\nCuando las Ratas icóridas entren al campo de batalla, cada jugador obtiene un contador de veneno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rata pirexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62113b83-02c1-418b-8727-e37524aedbeb\', \'multiverseId\': 606065}, \'multiverseid\': 606065}, {\'name\': \'Rats de sanie\', \'text\': \'Infection (Cette créature inflige des blessures aux créatures sous la forme de marqueurs -1/-1 et aux joueurs sous la forme de marqueurs « poison ».)\\nQuand les Rats de sanie arrivent sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur gagne un marqueur « poison ».\', \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et rat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606181&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a291bce1-e4fd-4174-bab6-6498d26c7c45\', \'multiverseId\': 606181}, \'multiverseid\': 606181}, {\'name\': "Ratti dell\'Icore", \'text\': "Infettare (Questa creatura infligge danno alle creature sotto forma di segnalini -1/-1 e ai giocatori sotto forma di segnalini veleno.)\\nQuando i Ratti dell\'Icore entrano nel campo di battaglia, ogni giocatore ottiene un segnalino veleno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Ratto Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c233700-33f4-47e2-941f-2638f93772f9\', \'multiverseId\': 606297}, \'multiverseid\': 606297}, {\'name\': \'胆液の鼠\', \'text\': \'感染（このクリーチャーはダメージを、クリーチャーには－１/－１カウンターの形で、プレイヤーには毒カウンターの形で与える。）\\n胆液の鼠が戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ毒カウンター１個を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・ネズミ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca239eb2-7049-4f4f-a36c-00c6873c57ea\', \'multiverseId\': 606413}, \'multiverseid\': 606413}, {\'name\': \'Ratos Icorídios\', \'text\': \'Infectar (Esta criatura causa dano a criaturas na forma de marcadores -1/-1 e a jogadores na forma de marcadores de veneno.)\\nQuando Ratos Icorídios entra no campo de batalha, cada jogador recebe um marcador de veneno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Phyrexiano Rato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4eb5f54-64ef-4fcc-ab6f-ed1e12ef5e9c\', \'multiverseId\': 606529}, \'multiverseid\': 606529}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wurmbeben\', \'text\': \'Verdorben — Erzeuge einen X/X grünen Phyrexianer-Wurm-Kreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht und Toxisch 1 hat, wobei X gleich der Menge Mana ist, die ausgegeben wurde, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Dann erzeugst du für jeden Gegner mit drei oder mehr Giftmarken einen weiteren solchen Spielstein.\\nRückblende {8}{G}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605717&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f800eba-b319-45d9-b385-71c32ff92578\', \'multiverseId\': 605717}, \'multiverseid\': 605717}, {\'name\': \'Sierpemoto\', \'text\': \'Corrupto — Crea una ficha de criatura Sierpe Pirexiano verde X/X con las habilidades de arrollar y tóxico 1, donde X es la cantidad de maná usado para lanzar este hechizo. Luego, por cada oponente con tres o más contadores de veneno, creas otra ficha igual.\\nRetrospectiva {8}{G}{G}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7c37841-c792-47ad-bd74-6ad44d8a48c2\', \'multiverseId\': 605733}, \'multiverseid\': 605733}, {\'name\': \'Tremblement de guivre\', \'text\': \'Corrompu — Créez un jeton de créature X/X verte Phyrexian et Guivre avec le piétinement et toxique 1, X étant la quantité de mana dépensée pour lancer ce sort. Puis, pour chaque adversaire avec au moins trois marqueurs « poison », vous créez un autre de ces jetons.\\nFlashback {8}{G}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605749&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c54e074-3663-41c3-a95a-52426fcbc2b5\', \'multiverseId\': 605749}, \'multiverseid\': 605749}, {\'name\': \'Sisma dei Wurm\', \'text\': "Corrotto — Crea una pedina creatura Wurm Phyrexiano X/X verde con travolgere e tossico 1, dove X è pari al mana speso per lanciare questa magia. Poi, per ogni avversario con tre o più segnalini veleno, crei un\'altra di quelle pedine.\\nFlashback {8}{G}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7934288d-0e1f-4e4d-b6c5-d0fa1b46dabe\', \'multiverseId\': 605765}, \'multiverseid\': 605765}, {\'name\': \'ワーム地震\', \'text\': \'堕落 — トランプルと毒性１を持つ緑のＸ/Ｘのファイレクシアン・ワーム・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。Ｘはこの呪文を唱えるために支払われたマナの点数に等しい。その後、３個以上の毒カウンターを持つ対戦相手１人につき１体のそのトークンを生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{8}{G}{G}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8412154c-b9a2-4ee4-8edf-825ff54a675c\', \'multiverseId\': 605781}, \'multiverseid\': 605781}, {\'name\': \'Vormemoto\', \'text\': \'Corrompido — Crie uma ficha de criatura Phyrexiano Vorme verde X/X com atropelar e tóxico 1, sendo X a quantidade de mana gasto para conjurar esta mágica. Depois, para cada oponente com três ou mais marcadores de veneno, você cria mais uma dessas fichas.\\nRecapitular {8}{G}{G} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f850da86-8e3a-4eae-921e-bfad3706acc5\', \'multiverseId\': 605797}, \'multiverseid\': 605797}]', "[{'name': 'Wurmbeben', 'text': 'Verdorben — Erzeuge einen X/X grünen Phyrexianer-Wurm-Kreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht und Toxisch 1 hat, wobei X gleich der Menge Mana ist, die ausgegeben wurde, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Dann erzeugst du für jeden Gegner mit drei oder mehr Giftmarken einen weiteren solchen Spielstein.\\nRückblende {8}{G}{G}', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605605&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d50630a-33be-4515-8d59-6578d2b9b93e', 'multiverseId': 605605}, 'multiverseid': 605605}, {'name': 'Tremblement de guivre', 'text': 'Corrompu — Créez un jeton de créature X/X verte Phyrexian et Guivre avec le piétinement et toxique 1, X étant la quantité de mana dépensée pour lancer ce sort. Puis, pour chaque adversaire avec au moins trois marqueurs « poison », vous créez un autre de ces jetons.\\nFlashback {8}{G}{G}', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605621&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29e0401e-306d-448a-b2b4-f4542f8cb9c7', 'multiverseId': 605621}, 'multiverseid': 605621}, {'name': 'ワーム地震', 'text': '堕落 — トランプルと毒性１を持つ緑のＸ/Ｘのファイレクシアン・ワーム・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。Ｘはこの呪文を唱えるために支払われたマナの点数に等しい。その後、３個以上の毒カウンターを持つ対戦相手１人につき１体のそのトークンを生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{8}{G}{G}', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605637&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82223b43-d3a1-48d2-955b-3569df4189aa', 'multiverseId': 605637}, 'multiverseid': 605637}, {'name': '亚龙暴震', 'text': '腐化～派出一个X/X绿色，具践踏与下毒1的非瑞人／亚龙衍生生物，X为施放此咒语时支付的法术力数量。然后每有一位具有三个或更多中毒指示物的对手，你便再派出一个前述衍生物。\\n返照{8}{G}{G}', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605653&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d67a313-c609-42e5-9fd7-559da40789bc', 'multiverseId': 605653}, 'multiverseid': 605653}]", "[{'name': 'Zenit der Weißen Sonne', 'text': 'Erzeuge X 2/2 weiße Katze-Kreaturenspielsteine. Mische den Zenit der Weißen Sonne in die Bibliothek seines Besitzers.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Nach der Schlacht am Lietfeld stand die Weiße Sonne direkt über Taj-Nar und brachten all denen Hoffnung, die das Gemetzel überlebt hatten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605946&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '354d21a3-cd71-48bf-af9a-393ff6cb6f02', 'multiverseId': 605946}, 'multiverseid': 605946}, {'name': 'Cenit del sol blanco', 'text': 'Crea X fichas de criatura Felino blancas 2/2. Baraja el Cenit del sol blanco en la biblioteca de su propietario.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Después de la Batalla del Campo Liet, el sol blanco se alzó sobre Taj-Nar, llevando esperanza a todos los que sobrevivieron a la masacre.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606062&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb8d28dd-788e-425f-aa0e-8097551939c5', 'multiverseId': 606062}, 'multiverseid': 606062}, {'name': 'Zénith de Blancsoleil', 'text': 'Créez X jetons de créature 2/2 blanche Chat. Mélangez le Zénith de Blancsoleil dans la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Après la Bataille du Champ de Liet, Blancsoleil illumina Taj-Nar, apportant espoir à tous les survivants du carnage.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606178&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a1a2e7e-9788-4a84-b65f-00f51ac7b80e', 'multiverseId': 606178}, 'multiverseid': 606178}, {'name': 'Zenit del Sole Bianco', 'text': 'Crea X pedine creatura Felino 2/2 bianche. Rimescola lo Zenit del Sole Bianco nel grimorio del suo proprietario.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Dopo la Battaglia del Campo Liet, il sole bianco si levò su Taj-Nar, portando speranza a tutti i sopravvissuti alla carneficina.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606294&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb8fcab6-42b9-4e05-b8fa-b9f1b71fa7bd', 'multiverseId': 606294}, 'multiverseid': 606294}, {'name': '白の太陽の頂点', 'text': '白の２/２の猫・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。白の太陽の頂点をオーナーのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'リエット平原での戦いの後、白の太陽はタージ＝ナールの上空高くに輝き、この殺戮を生き残ったすべてのものに希望をもたらした。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606410&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8098f12-d52e-4cef-bd92-a562eea4465e', 'multiverseId': 606410}, 'multiverseid': 606410}, {'name': 'Zênite do Sol Branco', 'text': 'Crie X fichas de criatura Felino branca 2/2. Embaralhe Zênite do Sol Branco no grimório de seu dono.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Após a Batalha dos Campos de Liet, o sol branco brilhou sobre Taj-Nar, trazendo esperança a todos os sobreviventes da carnificina.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606526&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f14291f0-925d-4275-b5a2-f0666bee8443', 'multiverseId': 606526}, 'multiverseid': 606526}]", '[{\'name\': \'Zornesruh-Knoten\', \'text\': \'Sowie der Zornesruh-Knoten ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Gebirge- oder Ebene-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt der Zornesruh-Knoten getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ein kochender Sammelpunkt ehrfürchtigen Zorns.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606011&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0db0875-daa8-4f87-9345-9b14312ccc36\', \'multiverseId\': 606011}, \'multiverseid\': 606011}, {\'name\': \'Maraña calmafuriosa\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Maraña calmafuriosa entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Montaña o de Llanura de tu mano. Si no lo haces, la Maraña calmafuriosa entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'El epicentro iracundo de una furia reverencial.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'415063b8-2690-41a6-b096-43e9adc57624\', \'multiverseId\': 606127}, \'multiverseid\': 606127}, {\'name\': \'Lacis calmerage\', \'text\': \'Au moment où le Lacis calmerage arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de montagne ou de plaine de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Lacis calmerage arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Un lacis calmant de rage révérende.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606243&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eab03edd-33aa-4905-942d-8f461527a8a0\', \'multiverseId\': 606243}, \'multiverseid\': 606243}, {\'name\': \'Intreccio Furiacalma\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Intreccio Furiacalma entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Montagna o Pianura dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, l\'Intreccio Furiacalma entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Un furioso fulcro di rabbia riverente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a37f9b4-2609-462a-a023-fbb04408dadd\', \'multiverseId\': 606359}, \'multiverseid\': 606359}, {\'name\': \'怒静の交錯\', \'text\': \'怒静の交錯が戦場に出るに際し、あなたの手札にあり山や平地であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、怒静の交錯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'恭しき怒りが逆巻く座。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'518b6495-6606-4ee8-b66e-6dec08933393\', \'multiverseId\': 606475}, \'multiverseid\': 606475}, {\'name\': \'Liame da Calmafuriosa\', \'text\': \'Conforme Liame da Calmafuriosa entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Montanha ou Planície de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Liame da Calmafuriosa entrará no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Um epicentro fervilhante de fúria reverente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f64e35b-dedb-4d88-ac44-b7e6a4c3c080\', \'multiverseId\': 606591}, \'multiverseid\': 606591}]', "[{'name': 'Zunehmende Hingabe', 'text': 'Erzeuge fünf 1/1 weiße Mensch-Kreaturenspielsteine. Falls dieser Zauberspruch aus einem Friedhof gewirkt wurde, erzeuge stattdessen zehn solcher Spielsteine.\\nRückblende {7}{W}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=605932&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee30ab07-92ed-447f-af30-f46e1fa95ed8', 'multiverseId': 605932}, 'multiverseid': 605932}, {'name': 'Aumentar la devoción', 'text': 'Crea cinco fichas de criatura Humano blancas 1/1. Si este hechizo fue lanzado desde un cementerio, en vez de eso, crea diez de esas fichas.\\nRetrospectiva {7}{W}{W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606048&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '819e975b-2d62-457a-b54c-8cd59b56ada0', 'multiverseId': 606048}, 'multiverseid': 606048}, {'name': 'Dévotion grandissante', 'text': 'Créez cinq jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Humain. Si ce sort a été lancé depuis un cimetière, créez dix de ces jetons à la place.\\nFlashback {7}{W}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606164&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10706e66-3442-44c4-8381-94a088768638', 'multiverseId': 606164}, 'multiverseid': 606164}, {'name': 'Devozione Crescente', 'text': 'Crea cinque pedine creatura Umano 1/1 bianche. Se questa magia è stata lanciata da un cimitero, crea invece dieci di quelle pedine.\\nFlashback {7}{W}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606280&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '656e4f68-b254-442c-907c-854bd15549fb', 'multiverseId': 606280}, 'multiverseid': 606280}, {'name': '高まる献身', 'text': '白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークン５体を生成する。この呪文が墓地から唱えられていたなら、代わりに、そのトークン10体を生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{7}{W}{W}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606396&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0cfbdb0-c9e3-400b-8b17-169851722744', 'multiverseId': 606396}, 'multiverseid': 606396}, {'name': 'Devoção Crescente', 'text': 'Crie cinco fichas de criatura Humano branca 1/1. Se esta mágica foi conjurada de um cemitério, em vez disso, crie dez dessas fichas.\\nRecapitular {7}{W}{W} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=606512&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce255b36-e26c-4917-a090-2ea0453c7929', 'multiverseId': 606512}, 'multiverseid': 606512}]"]
printings: ['10E', '2ED', '2X2', '2XM', '30A', '3ED', '40K', '4BB', '4ED', '5DN', '5ED', '9ED', 'A25', 'AFC', 'ANB', 'ARC', 'ATH', 'AVR', 'BBD', 'BFZ', 'BNG', 'BRB', 'BRC', 'BRR', 'C13', 'C14', 'C15', 'C16', 'C17', 'C18', 'C19', 'C20', 'C21', 'CC1', 'CC2', 'CED', 'CEI', 'CHK', 'CLB', 'CLU', 'CM1', 'CM2', 'CMA', 'CMD', 'CMM', 'CMR', 'CN2', 'CNS', 'CON', 'CP3', 'CST', 'DD1', 'DD2', 'DDC', 'DDF', 'DDG', 'DDI', 'DDJ', 'DDK', 'DDL', 'DDM', 'DDO', 'DDP', 'DDQ', 'DDT', 'DDU', 'DGM', 'DKA', 'DMC', 'DMR', 'DOM', 'DPA', 'DRK', 'DVD', 'E01', 'E02', 'EA3', 'ELD', 'EMA', 'EMN', 'EVG', 'EXP', 'F01', 'F10', 'F11', 'F15', 'FBB', 'G05', 'GK1', 'GN3', 'GNT', 'GPT', 'GRN', 'GTC', 'H1R', 'HA1', 'HA2', 'HA5', 'HOP', 'ICE', 'IMA', 'ISD', 'J12', 'J13', 'J18', 'J21', 'J22', 'JMP', 'JOU', 'JUD', 'JVC', 'KHC', 'KLD', 'KLR', 'KTK', 'LCC', 'LEA', 'LEB', 'LGN', 'LRW', 'LTC', 'LTR', 'M10', 'M11', 'M12', 'M14', 'M19', 'M20', 'M21', 'MBS', 'MD1', 'ME2', 'ME3', 'ME4', 'MH1', 'MIC', 'MKC', 'MM2', 'MM3', 'MMA', 'MOC', 'MPS', 'MRD', 'NCC', 'NEC', 'NPH', 'ODY', 'OLEP', 'ONC', 'ONS', 'OTC', 'OTP', 'P06', 'P07', 'P30A', 'P30M', 'PBFZ', 'PC2', 'PCA', 'PDCI', 'PDOM', 'PDP14', 'PELD', 'PEMN', 'PF19', 'PF20', 'PGRN', 'PIP', 'PKLD', 'PLG21', 'PLG22', 'PLST', 'PM19', 'PM20', 'PM21', 'PRM', 'PRNA', 'PS11', 'PSOI', 'PSS1', 'PSTX', 'PSVC', 'PTC', 'PTHB', 'PW21', 'PW23', 'PW24', 'PWAR', 'PZ1', 'PZ2', 'PZNR', 'RAV', 'REN', 'REX', 'RNA', 'RTR', 'RVR', 'SCD', 'SCG', 'SCH', 'SIR', 'SLD', 'SLP', 'SOI', 'SOM', 'SPG', 'SS2', 'STA', 'STX', 'SUM', 'TD0', 'TD2', 'THB', 'THS', 'TOR', 'TSP', 'TSR', 'V10', 'V12', 'V13', 'V14', 'VMA', 'VOC', 'WAR', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WHO', 'WOC', 'WOE', 'WOT', 'WTH', 'WWK', 'ZEN', 'ZNC', 'ZNR']
original_text: ["(o can be paid with either {U} or 2 life.)\\n{1}{PU}, {T}, Exile a spell you control: Target opponent reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a card with mana value equal to 1 plus the exiled spell's mana value. Exile that card, then that player shuffles. You may cast that exiled card without paying its mana cost.", "({PG} can be paid with either {G} or 2 life.)\\nPut target card from a graveyard on top of its owner's library.", "({PW} can be paid with either {W} or 2 life.)\\nCreatures can't attack you or planeswalkers you control unless their controller pays {PW} for each of those creatures.", '({T}: Add {G} or {W}.)\\nCanopy Vista enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', '+2: You gain 1 life for each creature you control.\\n−2: Create three 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens.\\n−5: Destroy all other permanents except for lands and tokens.', 'Affinity for Equipment (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each Equipment you control.)\\nCreate five 2/2 red Rebel creature tokens. They gain haste until end of turn. For each of those tokens, you may attach an Equipment you control to it.', 'Affinity for Equipment\\nCreate five 2/2 red Rebel creature tokens. They gain haste until end of turn. For each of those tokens, you may attach an Equipment you control to it.', 'Affinity for artifacts (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)\\nFlying, haste\\nWhenever Chiss-Goria, Forge Tyrant attacks, exile the top five cards of your library. You may cast an artifact spell from among them this turn. If you do, it has affinity for artifacts.', 'Affinity for artifacts\\nFlying, haste\\nWhenever Chiss-Goria, Forge Tyrant attacks, exile the top five cards of your library. You may cast an artifact spell from among them this turn. If you do, it has affinity for artifacts.', "As Fortified Village enters the battlefield, you may reveal a Forest or Plains card from your hand. If you don't, Fortified Village enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.", "As Furycalm Snarl enters the battlefield, you may reveal a Mountain or Plains card from your hand. If you don't, Furycalm Snarl enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}.", "As Necroblossom Snarl enters the battlefield, you may reveal a Swamp or Forest card from your hand. If you don't, Necroblossom Snarl enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}.", "As Shineshadow Snarl enters the battlefield, you may reveal a Plains or Swamp card from your hand. If you don't, Shineshadow Snarl enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}.", "As long as it's your turn, creature tokens you control get +1/+4.\\n{3}{W}: Create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token.\\nPartner (You can have two commanders if both have partner.)", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control six or more lands, create a 5/5 red Dragon creature token with flying.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, put a muster counter on Assemble the Legion. Then create a 1/1 red and white Soldier creature token with haste for each muster counter on Assemble the Legion.', 'Attacking tokens you control have double strike.\\nWhenever one or more tokens you control attack a player, exile the top card of your library. During any turn you attacked with a token, you may play that card.', "Bojuka Bog enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Bojuka Bog enters the battlefield, exile target player's graveyard.\\n{T}: Add {B}.", "Boros Garrison enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Boros Garrison enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {R}{W}.", 'Castle Ardenvale enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Plains.\\n{T}: Add {W}.\\n{2}{W}{W}, {T}: Create a 1/1 white Human creature token.', 'Castle Embereth enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Mountain.\\n{T}: Add {R}.\\n{1}{R}{R}, {T}: Creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Chain Reaction deals X damage to each creature, where X is the number of creatures on the battlefield.', 'Choose one —\\n• Boros Charm deals 4 damage to target player or planeswalker.\\n• Permanents you control gain indestructible until end of turn.\\n• Target creature gains double strike until end of turn.', "Choose one —\\n• Create a token that's a copy of target artifact creature you control.\\n• Create a token that's a copy of target nonartifact creature you control.\\nEntwine {2}{U}", "Choose one —\\n• Create a token that's a copy of target artifact creature you control.\\n• Create a token that's a copy of target nonartifact creature you control.\\nEntwine {2}{U} (Choose both if you pay the entwine cost.)", 'Choose one —\\n• Exile all artifacts.\\n• Exile all creatures.\\n• Exile all enchantments.\\n• Exile all planeswalkers.', 'Choose one —\\n• Rip Apart deals 3 damage to target creature or planeswalker.\\n• Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "Choose up to two target creatures you don't control. For each of those creatures, create a token that's a copy of that creature. Those tokens gain haste. Exile them at the beginning of the next end step.", 'Converge — You draw X cards and you lose X life, where X is the number of colors of mana spent to cast this spell.', "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nAny number of target nonland permanents you control phase out. (Treat them and anything attached to them as though they don't exist until your next turn.)", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nDestroy all nontoken creatures.", 'Convoke\\nAny number of target nonland permanents you control phase out.', 'Corrupted — Create an X/X green Phyrexian Wurm creature token with trample and toxic 1, where X is the amount of mana spent to cast this spell. Then for each opponent with three or more poison counters, you create another one of those tokens.\\nFlashback {8}{G}{G}', 'Corrupted — Create an X/X green Phyrexian Wurm creature token with trample and toxic 1, where X is the amount of mana spent to cast this spell. Then for each opponent with three or more poison counters, you create another one of those tokens.\\nFlashback {8}{G}{G} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Create X 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens. If X is 5 or more, destroy all other creatures.', "Create X 2/2 white Cat creature tokens. Shuffle White Sun's Zenith into its owner's library.", 'Create X 2/2 white Soldier creature tokens with vigilance. If X is 10 or more, also create X 4/4 white Angel creature tokens with flying and vigilance.', 'Create five 1/1 white Human creature tokens. If this spell was cast from a graveyard, create ten of those tokens instead.\\nFlashback {7}{W}{W} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Create three 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Create two 1/1 green Phyrexian Insect creature tokens with infect. (They deal damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)', 'Create two 1/1 white Bird creature tokens with flying.\\nFlashback—\\nTap three untapped white creatures you control. (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Create two 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens. Until end of turn, creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain haste.', 'Create two 1/1 white Spirit creature tokens with flying.', 'Creature tokens you control get +1/+1 and have vigilance.', 'Creature tokens you control get +1/+1.', 'Creature tokens you control have haste.\\nWhenever one or more creatures attack, you may pay {1}{R}. If you do, creatures attacking your opponents and/or planeswalkers they control get +2/+0 until end of turn.', "Creatures can't attack you unless their controller pays {2} for each creature they control that's attacking you.", 'Destroy all creatures, then create an X/X colorless Phyrexian Horror artifact creature token, where X is the number of creatures destroyed this way.', 'Destroy all creatures. You gain 1 life for each creature destroyed this way.', 'Destroy each nonland permanent with mana value 2 or less. Add {B} or {G} for each permanent destroyed this way.', "Destroy target artifact or creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target creature or enchantment.', 'Destroy target permanent. Its controller creates a 3/3 green Beast creature token.', 'Destroy target permanent. Its controller creates a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.', 'Each opponent draws a card, then you draw a card for each opponent who drew a card this way.', 'Each opponent gets a poison counter. Then each creature your opponents control gets -1/-1 until end of turn for each poison counter its controller has.', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+1 for each charge counter on Mace of the Valiant and has vigilance.\\nWhenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, put a charge counter on Mace of the Valiant.\\nEquip {3}', 'Equipped creature gets +2/+2 and has infect. (It deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\\nWhenever Grafted Exoskeleton becomes unattached from a permanent, sacrifice that permanent.\\nEquip {2}', 'Equipped creature gets +3/+0 and has trample and lifelink.\\nEquip {3}', "Equipped creature has nonbasic landwalk. (It can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a nonbasic land.)\\nEquip {2}", 'Escalate—\\nTap an untapped creature you control. (Pay this cost for each mode chosen beyond the first.)\\nChoose one or more —\\n• Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater.\\n• Destroy target enchantment.\\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on each creature target player controls.', 'Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.', 'Exile target creature. Its controller may search their library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'First strike\\nMetalcraft — Creatures you control get +3/+0 as long as you control three or more artifacts.', 'Flying, first strike\\nWhenever a commander you control enters the battlefield or attacks, proliferate.', 'Flying, first strike\\nWhenever a commander you control enters the battlefield or attacks, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', "Flying, lifelink, haste\\nWhenever Otharri, Suns' Glory attacks, you get an experience counter. Then create a 2/2 red Rebel creature token that's tapped and attacking for each experience counter you have.\\n{2}{R}{W}, Tap an untapped Rebel you control: Return Otharri from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.", 'Flying, melee\\nLieutenant — As long as you control your commander, other creatures you control have melee.', 'Flying, vigilance, toxic 2\\nCorrupted — At the beginning of your end step, each opponent who has three or more poison counters exiles the top card of their library face down. You may look at and play those cards for as long as they remain exiled, and you may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to cast those spells.', "Flying, vigilance\\nSilverwing Squadron's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you control.\\nWhenever Silverwing Squadron attacks, create a number of 2/2 white Knight creature tokens with vigilance equal to the number of opponents you have.", "Flying\\nCreatures can't attack you unless their controller pays {2} for each creature they control that's attacking you.", 'Flying\\nInfect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)', 'Flying\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may create a 1/1 white Bird creature token with flying.', 'Flying\\nMelee (Whenever this creature attacks, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each opponent you attacked this combat.)\\nLieutenant — As long as you control your commander, other creatures you control have melee.', 'Flying\\nNon-Archon creatures have base power and toughness 3/3.\\nWhen Harmonious Archon enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 white Human creature tokens.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Grateful Apparition deals combat damage to a player or planeswalker, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'For Mirrodin (When this Equipment enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 red Rebel creature token, then attach this to it.)\\nEquipped creature gets +1/+1 for each creature you control.\\nEquip {2}{W}', "For Mirrodin (When this Equipment enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 red Rebel creature token, then attach this to it.)\\nEquipped creature gets +2/+2.\\nWhenever equipped creature attacks, if it's the first combat phase of the turn, untap each attacking creature. After this phase, there is an additional combat phase.\\nEquip {3}{R}", 'For Mirrodin (When this Equipment enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 red Rebel creature token, then attach this to it.)\\nWhenever equipped creature and at least one other creature attack, draw a card.\\nEquip {1}{W}', 'For Mirrodin\\nEquipped creature gets +1/+1 for each creature you control.\\nEquip {2}{W}', "For Mirrodin\\nEquipped creature gets +2/+2.\\nWhenever equipped creature attacks, if it's the first combat phase of the turn, untap each attacking creature. After this phase, there is an additional combat phase.\\nEquip {3}{R}", 'For Mirrodin\\nWhenever equipped creature and at least one other creature attack, draw a card.\\nEquip {1}{W}', 'Forgotten Cave enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R}.\\nCycling {R} ({R}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Glistening Sphere enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Glistening Sphere enters the battlefield, proliferate.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\nCorrupted — {T}: Add three mana of any one color. Activate only if an opponent has three or more poison counters.', "Haste, toxic 3 (Players dealt combat damage by this creature also get three poison counters.)\\nGlissa's Retriever can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less.\\nCorrupted — When Glissa's Retriever dies, exile it. When you do, return up to X target cards from your graveyard to your hand, where X is the number of opponents who have three or more poison counters.", "Haste, toxic 3\\nGlissa's Retriever can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less.\\nCorrupted — When Glissa's Retriever dies, exile it. When you do, return up to X target cards from your graveyard to your hand, where X is the number of opponents who have three or more poison counters.", 'Haste\\nLieutenant — At the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control your commander, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying. That token gains haste until end of turn.', 'Hideaway 4 (When this land enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library, exile one face down, then put the rest on the bottom in a random order.)\\nWindbrisk Heights enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W}.\\n{W}, {T}: You may play the exiled card without paying its mana cost if you attacked with three or more creatures this turn.', 'If you control a commander, you may cast this spell without paying its mana cost.\\nCreatures you control gain indestructible until end of turn.', 'Infect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, create a 1/1 green Phyrexian Insect creature token with infect for each poison counter your opponents have.', 'Infect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\\nWhen Ichor Rats enters the battlefield, each player gets a poison counter.', 'Infect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\\nWhen Viridian Corrupter enters the battlefield, destroy target artifact.', 'Infect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\\nWhenever Ichorclaw Myr becomes blocked, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Infect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\\n{1}{G}: Regenerate Blight Mamba. (The next time this creature would be destroyed, instead tap it, remove it from combat, and heal all damage on it.)', 'Infect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'Krosan Verge enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Krosan Verge: Search your library for a Forest card and a Plains card, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, choose one —\\n• Create a 2/2 white Cat Beast creature token.\\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control. Those creatures gain vigilance until end of turn.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'Lands you control have "{T}: Add one mana of any color."\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Living weapon (When this Equipment enters the battlefield, create a 0/0 black Phyrexian Germ creature token, then attach this to it.)\\nEquipped creature gets +X/+X, where X is the greatest mana value among your commanders.\\nEquip {4}', 'Living weapon\\nEquipped creature gets +X/+X, where X is the greatest mana value among your commanders.\\nEquip {4}', 'Melee (Whenever this creature attacks, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each opponent you attacked this combat.)\\nOther creatures you control have melee. (If a creature has multiple instances of melee, each triggers separately.)', 'Menace, toxic 1 (Players dealt combat damage by this creature also get a poison counter.)\\nWhen Vishgraz, the Doomhive enters the battlefield, create three 1/1 colorless Phyrexian Mite artifact creature tokens with toxic 1 and "This creature can\'t block."\\nVishgraz gets +1/+1 for each poison counter your opponents have.', 'Menace, toxic 1\\nWhen Vishgraz, the Doomhive enters the battlefield, create three 1/1 colorless Phyrexian Mite artifact creature tokens with toxic 1 and "This creature can\'t block."\\nVishgraz gets +1/+1 for each poison counter your opponents have.', 'Mentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)\\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, create a 1/1 red Goblin creature token. That token gains haste until end of turn and attacks this combat if able.', 'Mycosynth Fiend gets +1/+1 for each poison counter your opponents have.', 'Myriad Landscape enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Myriad Landscape: Search your library for up to two basic land cards that share a land type, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "Path of Ancestry enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity. When that mana is spent to cast a creature spell that shares a creature type with your commander, scry 1.", "Return up to one target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\nCorrupted — For each opponent who has three or more poison counters as you cast this spell, put up to one target creature card from that player's graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.", 'Sandsteppe Citadel enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W}, {B}, or {G}.', 'Search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal those cards, put one onto the battlefield tapped and the other into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Secluded Steppe enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W}.\\nCycling {W} ({W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Strive — This spell costs {1}{W} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nChoose any number of target opponents. Create X 1/1 white Human Soldier creature tokens, where X is the number of creatures those opponents control.', 'Target player draws X cards and loses X life, where X is the number of artifacts you control.', 'Target player draws three cards, loses 3 life, and gets three poison counters.', 'Temple of Malady enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Temple of Malady enters the battlefield, scry 1.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}.', 'Temple of Plenty enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Temple of Plenty enters the battlefield, scry 1.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', 'Temple of Silence enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Temple of Silence enters the battlefield, scry 1.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}.', 'Temple of Triumph enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Temple of Triumph enters the battlefield, scry 1.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}.', 'Trample, toxic 1\\nWhenever one or more creatures you control deal combat damage to one or more players, proliferate.\\nCorrupted — At the beginning of your end step, if an opponent has three or more poison counters, draw a card, then you may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield.', 'When Contagion Clasp enters the battlefield, put a -1/-1 counter on target creature.\\n{4}, {T}: Proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', "When Court of Grace enters the battlefield, you become the monarch.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying. If you're the monarch, create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying instead.", 'When Maul of the Skyclaves enters the battlefield, attach it to target creature you control.\\nEquipped creature gets +2/+2 and has flying and first strike.\\nEquip {2}{W}{W}', "When Myr Battlesphere enters the battlefield, create four 1/1 colorless Myr artifact creature tokens.\\nWhenever Myr Battlesphere attacks, you may tap X untapped Myr you control. If you do, Myr Battlesphere gets +X/+0 until end of turn and deals X damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.", 'When Siege-Gang Commander enters the battlefield, create three 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.\\n{1}{R}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Siege-Gang Commander deals 2 damage to any target.', 'When Solemn Simulacrum enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\nWhen Solemn Simulacrum dies, you may draw a card.', "When Soul-Guide Lantern enters the battlefield, exile target card from a graveyard.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Soul-Guide Lantern: Exile each opponent's graveyard.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Soul-Guide Lantern: Draw a card.", 'When Staff of the Storyteller enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.\\nWhenever you create one or more creature tokens, put a story counter on Staff of the Storyteller.\\n{W}, {T}, Remove a story counter from Staff of the Storyteller: Draw a card.', 'Whenever a creature you control dies, you gain 1 life and draw a card.', 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever another creature with power 2 or less enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {1}. If you do, draw a card.', 'Whenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, you may draw two cards. If you do, discard a card.\\nEquip {1}', 'Whenever one or more creatures an opponent controls deal combat damage to you, that opponent gets a poison counter.\\nWhenever a player attacks, if one or more players being attacked are poisoned, the attacking player draws a card.', 'Whenever you cast a Myr spell, create a 1/1 colorless Myr artifact creature token.\\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, untap each Myr you control.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}: Put three +1/+1 counters on each Myr you control. Activate only during your turn.', 'Whenever you cast an artifact creature spell, it gains sunburst. (It enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if there are thirty or more counters among artifacts and creatures you control, Lux Artillery deals 10 damage to each opponent.', 'Whenever you cast an artifact creature spell, it gains sunburst.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if there are thirty or more counters among artifacts and creatures you control, Lux Artillery deals 10 damage to each opponent.', 'You draw two cards and you lose 2 life.', '{1}, {T}: Add {B}{G}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {G}{W}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {R}{W}.', "{1}{PU}, {T}, Exile a spell you control: Target opponent reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a card with mana value equal to 1 plus the exiled spell's mana value. Exile that card, then that player shuffles. You may cast that exiled card without paying its mana cost.", '{G}: Exile target card from a graveyard. If it was a creature card, put a +1/+1 counter on Scavenging Ooze and you gain 1 life.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.", "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.\\nSacrifice Commander's Sphere: Draw a card.", '{T}: Add one mana of any color that a land an opponent controls could produce.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Mind Stone: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Create a 0/1 red Kobold creature token named Kobolds of Kher Keep.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Buried Ruin: Return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{R}{W}, {T}: Target creature gets +2/+0 and gains vigilance and haste until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}. Activate only if you control a Swamp.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}. Talisman of Conviction deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}. Activate only if you control a Swamp.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Activate only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Add {R}. Put a charge counter on Vulshok Factory.\\n{2}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice Vulshok Factory: Create an X/X colorless Golem artifact creature token with haste, where X is the number of charge counters on Vulshok Factory. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{T}: Draw a card. Activate only if you created a token this turn.\\n{8}, {T}, Sacrifice Idol of Oblivion: Create a 10/10 colorless Eldrazi creature token.']
